window.__LITE_PARTS__=window.__LITE_PARTS__||[];window.__LITE_PARTS__.push([{"t":"非平衡量子湖模拟制备的捷径","b":"Author(s): Nik O. Gjonbalaj, Rahul Sahay, and Susanne F. YelinThe dynamical preparation of exotic many-body quantum states is a persistent goal of analog quantum simulation, often limited by experimental coherence times. Recently, it was shown that fast, nonadiabatic Hamiltonian parameter sweeps can create finite-size “lakes” of quantum order in certain settin…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 090802] Published Fri Aug 28, 2026","d":"2026-08-28","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/7bc2-6cgy","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子模拟","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":7.0,"d":6.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"as":"作者Nik O. Gjonbalaj、Rahul Sahay和Susanne F. Yelin研究新奇多体量子态的动力学制备，这是模拟量子模拟的持续目标，但常受实验相干时间限制。近期研究表明，快速非绝热哈密顿量参数扫描可在某些条件下创建有限尺寸的量子序‘湖’。该工作提出了制备这类非平衡量子湖的模拟捷径方法。发表于Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 090802（2026年8月28日）。","kp":["态制备方法[非平衡量子湖模拟]: 快速非绝热哈密顿参数扫描 shortcut 方法，突破实验相干时间限制"]},{"t":"利用 LUX-ZEPLIN (LZ) 实验寻找光暗物质和太阳中微子相干弹性中微子核散射的证据","b":"Author(s): D. S. Akerib et al. (LZ Collaboration)The LZ collaboration reports strong evidence (4.5σ) for coherent elastic scattering of 8B solar neutrinos.[Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 091806] Published Fri Aug 28, 2026","d":"2026-08-28","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/jvqf-njpj","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"暗物质探测","sc":8.3,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":4.0,"r":8.0,"d":7.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"as":"LUX-ZEPLIN（LZ）合作组报告了8B太阳中微子相干弹性中微子-核散射的强有力证据，显著性达4.5σ。该结果同时用于寻找轻暗物质和太阳中微子信号。发表于Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 091806（2026年8月28日）。","kp":["探测显著性[LZ实验CEvNS]: 4.5σ 8B太阳中微子相干弹性散射证据"]},{"t":"用 XENONnT 探测太阳 $^{8}\\mathrm{B}$ 中微子雾","b":"Author(s): E. Aprile et al. (XENON Collaboration)We report a $3.3σ$ measurement of coherent elastic neutrino-nucleus scattering from solar $^{8}\\mathrm{B}$ neutrinos using a $6.77\\text{ }\\text{ }\\mathrm{t}×\\mathrm{yr}$ exposure from the XENONnT experiment, inferring a solar $^{8}\\mathrm{B}$ neutrino flux of $({5}_{−2}^{+3})×{10}^{6}\\text{ }\\text{ …[Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 091807] Published Fri Aug 28, 2026","d":"2026-08-28","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/xvpn-w3q9","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"中微子探测","sc":8.4,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":8.0,"d":8.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"as":"XENON合作组利用XENONnT实验6.77吨·年的曝光量，报告了对太阳8B中微子相干弹性中微子-核散射的3.3σ测量，由此推断太阳8B中微子通量为约(5+3/−2)×10^6每平方厘米每秒量级。这是对太阳中微子雾现象的探测。发表于Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 091807（2026年8月28日）。","kp":["探测显著性[XENONnT]: 3.3σ 8B太阳中微子CEvNS测量","曝光量[XENONnT]: 6.77 t·yr","中微子通量[太阳8B]: (5_{−2}^{+3})×10⁶ cm⁻²s⁻¹"]},{"t":"柯尔莫哥洛夫乘子的微扰反常指数","b":"Author(s): Alexei A. Mailybaev and Simon ThalabardA perturbative framework for anomalous scaling in turbulence, built on the statistics of Kolmogorov multipliers rather than correlation-function hierarchies, establishes a new analytical route to intermittency that complements traditional zero-mode methods.[Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 094002] Published Fri Aug 28, 2026","d":"2026-08-28","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/6qrr-3646","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"电荷有序 Kagome 金属中的应变调谐节点超导 ${\\mathrm{CsV}}_{3}{\\mathrm{Sb}}_{5}$","b":"Author(s): Yusuke Takeuchi, Akito Kobayashi, Saki Uchida, Takumi Nagao, Seigo Ogawa, Rui Zhou, Shinji Kawasaki, Fei Song, Hao Ni, Yong Zhao, and Guo-qing ZhengThe ground state of CsV3Sb5 is not a single superconducting state but two degenerate states.[Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 096003] Published Fri Aug 28, 2026","d":"2026-08-28","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/mzgp-2lzb","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"连续体中反常无电荷束缚态的观察","b":"Author(s): Jue Li, Haoye Qin, Wenjing Lv, Yuzhi Shi, Bo Li, and Qinghua SongBound states in the continuum (BICs) are nonradiative modes embedded in the radiation continuum, offering powerful opportunities for wave manipulation in open systems. Although BICs themselves cannot be assigned a well-defined polarization state in the far field, the surrounding polarization field e…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 096202] Published Fri Aug 28, 2026","d":"2026-08-28","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/wylv-cc97","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"长冈铁磁体的不良金属行为和 Lifshitz 转变","b":"Author(s): Jonas Arnold, Peter Kopietz, and Andreas RückriegelUsing an extension of the fermionic functional renormalization group for systems where strong correlations give rise to projected Hilbert spaces, we calculate the phase diagram and the electronic spectral function of the Hubbard model at infinite on-site repulsion. For a square lattice with nearest-…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 096506] Published Fri Aug 28, 2026","d":"2026-08-28","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/py7g-jz2x","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"全壳混合纳米线不存在准马约拉纳误报","b":"Author(s): Carlos Payá, César Robles, Pablo San-Jose, and Elsa PradaTunneling spectroscopy cannot be used as an unambiguous detection tool for Majorana zero modes (MZMs) in conventional partial-shell nanowires. The presence of smooth confinement at the end of the hybrid wire (among other sources of disorder) can create exponentially pinned zero-energy states, called…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 096606] Published Fri Aug 28, 2026","d":"2026-08-28","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/w9tp-3bbq","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"马约拉纳零模","sc":7.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":7.5,"d":6.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"as":"作者Carlos Payá等人指出，隧穿谱学不能作为常规半壳纳米线中马约拉纳零模（MZMs）的明确检测工具。混合线末端的光滑限制（以及其他无序来源）会产生指数钉扎的零能态，称为准马约拉纳态，导致误报。该工作研究了全壳混合纳米线，表明其中不存在准马约拉纳误报问题。发表于Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 096606（2026年8月28日）。"},{"t":"激活铁电聚合物中应力诱导的偶极子旋转","b":"Author(s): Cenling Huang, Feihong Du, Shengtao Zhu, Xiaoxu Wang, Yezhan Lin, Fang Wang, Xueqi Wang, Tiannan Yang, Xiaoshi Qian, and Xin ChenThe concept of morphotropic phase boundary has recently been employed to enhance the piezoelectric response in polymeric ferroelectrics, substantially improving the ${d}_{33}$ coefficient through engineered phase boundaries between $β$ and $3/1$-helical phases in polyvinylidene fluoride-based system…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 096801] Published Fri Aug 28, 2026","d":"2026-08-28","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/qcg4-y7br","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"铁电聚合物","sc":8.1,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":7.5,"d":7.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"as":"作者团队在聚偏氟乙烯基铁电聚合物体系中，利用同质异形相界概念，通过工程化β相与3/1螺旋相之间的相界大幅提升压电响应和d33系数。研究揭示了铁电聚合物中应力诱导的偶极子旋转机制，为高性能聚合物压电材料设计提供了新途径。发表于Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 096801（2026年8月28日）。","kp":["压电增强机制[PVDF基铁电聚合物]: 通过β相与3/1螺旋相之间同质异晶相界工程提升d33系数","关键效应[铁电聚合物]: 应力诱导偶极子旋转"]},{"t":"固体圆二色性的完全最小耦合 GW-Bethe-Salpeter-方程框架：在手性二维钙钛矿中的应用","b":"Author(s): Xian Xu and Diana Y. QiuCircular dichroism (CD) and other chiroptical responses are key probes of both chirality and momentum-space geometry in solids, but first-principles calculations are still challenging in periodic systems with strong exciton effects. Here, we develop a gauge-invariant first-principles framework for C…[Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 096901] Published Fri Aug 28, 2026","d":"2026-08-28","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/mdr9-tzws","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. Lett.","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"手性钙钛矿","sc":7.9,"scd":{"b":8.5,"i":2.0,"r":7.5,"d":7.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"as":"圆二色性（CD）等手性光学响应是探测固体中手性和动量空间几何的关键手段，但在具有强激子效应的周期性体系中第一性原理计算仍具挑战性。作者Xian Xu和Diana Y. Qiu为固体圆二色性发展了完全最小耦合的规范不变第一性原理GW-Bethe-Salpeter方程框架，并将其应用于手性二维钙钛矿材料。发表于Phys. Rev. Lett. 137, 096901（2026年8月28日）。","kp":["计算框架[手性二维钙钛矿圆二色性]: 规范不变的第一性原理完全最小耦合GW-BSE框架"]},{"t":"来自守恒电荷涨落的重子夸克-双夸克结构的证据","b":"Author(s): Michał Marczenko and Krzysztof RedlichWe study fluctuations and correlations of conserved charges in QCD using a string-based description of the hadronic mass spectrum. Mesons and baryons are modeled as open relativistic strings with quark-antiquark and quark-diquark endpoints, respectively, leading to an exponential Hagedorn growth of …[Phys. Rev. C 114, 025205] Published Fri Aug 28, 2026","d":"2026-08-28","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/yb26-gj61","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"飞秒镜和氘核形成中的相对论效应","b":"Author(s): Stanisław MrówczyńskiFor a long time, studies of femtoscopic correlations have provided information about space-time characteristics of particle sources in high-energy collisions. Recently, the correlation functions have also been used to determine interaction parameters of correlated particles, which is especially impo…[Phys. Rev. C 114, 025206] Published Fri Aug 28, 2026","d":"2026-08-28","u":"http://link.aps.org/doi/10.1103/xp4n-hlr5","c":"不相关","a":"Recent Articles in Phys. Rev. C","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"基于多尺度物理信息神经网络的真实车辆电池系统温度建模和预测","b":"","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926014054?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电池温度","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":"提出基于多尺度物理信息神经网络的方法，对真实车辆电池系统进行温度建模与预测。","kp":["温度建模方法[真实车辆电池系统]: 多尺度物理信息神经网络"]},{"t":"考虑时间分辨率的质子交换膜水电解槽动态电化学阻抗谱萃取方法","b":"Electrochemical impedance spectroscopy (EIS) is an efficient in-operando characterization tool for analyzing the internal processes of proton exchange membrane water electrolyzers (PEMWE). However, conventional EIS requires the system to operate under steady-state conditions, which limits its applicability in real-world systems. Dynamic EIS (DEIS) provides a potential approach to capture the variation of internal physical states caused by changes in operating conditions over time. However, existing impedance calculation methods, such as fast Fourier transform and wavelet transform-based approaches, are limited in their ability to analyse nonstationary signals across the entire frequency range. To address these limitations, this paper proposes a hybrid method that combines the advantages of several existing time–frequency and instantaneous feature extraction techniques to accurately obtain DEIS under dynamic conditions. This study segments the perturbation signals based on operating variations and applies adaptive processing to ensure accurate impedance extraction. Simulation and experimental verification under different input power profiles to a PEMWE are conducted in this work. The results demonstrate that the proposed hybrid method achieves a DEIS accuracy exceeding 96%, verifying its effectiveness for PEMWE applications and potential for other electrochemical devices.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926013036?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电解槽阻抗","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.5,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该研究针对质子交换膜水电解槽（PEMWE）的动态电化学阻抗谱（DEIS）提出一种新的萃取方法。传统EIS要求系统稳态运行，限制了实际应用；DEIS可捕捉运行条件变化引起的内部物理状态变化，但现有基于快速傅里叶变换和小波变换的阻抗计算方法在全频率范围内分析非平稳信号的能力有限。为此，论文提出一种结合多种方法优势的混合方法，兼顾时间分辨率，用于分析PEMWE内部过程。","kp":["[PEMWE动态阻抗谱]: DEIS可捕获运行条件变化引起的内部物理状态随时间变化，突破常规EIS需稳态条件的限制"]},{"t":"电池存储和变频空调机组的舒适感知大脑情感学习协调，用于微电网频率调节","b":"","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926013796?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/其它电网技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"微网调频","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.5,"t":5.0},"as":"利用电池储能和变频空调的舒适感知情感学习协调机制，实现微电网频率调节。","kp":["[微电网频率调节]: 电池储能与变频空调的舒适感知大脑情感学习协调机制"]},{"t":"使用参数高效的大语言模型进行推理增强的概率电价预测","b":"","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926013681?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"电价预测","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.5,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":"采用参数高效微调的大语言模型结合推理增强，进行概率化电价预测。","kp":["[概率电价预测]: 参数高效微调的大语言模型结合推理增强"]},{"t":"不确定性下能源系统规划中基于多参数优化的决策方法","b":"Energy infrastructure planning confronts a fundamental temporal asymmetry in which capacity decisions must be committed before uncertainty materializes and yet must remain robust across all future operational scenarios. Traditional approaches either adopt worst-case hedging or ignore operational uncertainty. We address this through a Robust Optimization framework integrating data-driven uncertainty quantification with multiparametric programming, enabling design strategies as explicit functions of realized uncertainty without iterative re-optimization. We quantify forecasting errors via probabilistic deep learning technique to inform uncertainty bounds. Rather than worst-case designs, we model it as bilevel problem solved multiparametrically, deriving \"wait-and-see\" operations as piecewise affine functions of \"here-and-now\" decisions and uncertainty realizations.Applied to a multi-source, multi-sink energy system (wind, nuclear, natural gas, battery, electricity and hydrogen demands) under joint supply-demand uncertainty, the framework reveals a strategic shift in technology prioritization as uncertainty quantiles increase, optimal designs preferentially allocate capacity to expensive-but-reliable dispatchables even though economical renewables remain available. The complete parametric solution enables upfront cost-robustness trade-off exploration, providing a tractable and generalizable tool for risk-aware capacity expansion, supporting strategic investment decisions in uncertain and rapidly evolving energy landscape.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S030626192601370X?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/其它电网技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"能源规划","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.5,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究针对能源基础设施规划中'容量决策须在不确定性显现前做出且需对未来所有运行情景保持稳健'的时间不对称难题，提出鲁棒优化框架，将数据驱动的不确定性量化与多参数规划相结合，使设计策略成为已实现不确定性的显式函数，无需迭代重新优化。研究利用概率深度学习技术量化预测误差以确定不确定性边界，将问题建模为双层优化并以多参数方法求解，推导出'等待观察'式的分段运行策略，避免了传统最坏情况对冲设计。","kp":["[不确定性下能源系统规划]: 鲁棒优化框架集成数据驱动不确定性量化与多参数规划，设计策略以显式函数形式表达"]},{"t":"通过综合预测和风险倾向，优化​​电力市场中光伏系统的风险意识竞价策略","b":"","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926013838?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光伏竞价","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.5,"t":5.0},"as":"通过综合预测和风险倾向分析，优化电力市场中光伏系统的风险感知竞价策略。","kp":["[光伏竞价策略]: 综合预测与风险倾向的风险感知竞价优化"]},{"t":"多利益相关者互动下考虑电动出租车车队影响的配电网协调运行","b":"","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926013917?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/配电和电力交易","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"配网运行","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":3.0,"r":4.5,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究多利益相关者互动场景下，电动出租车车队对配电网协调运行的影响。","kp":["[配电网协调运行]: 多利益相关者互动下考虑电动出租车车队影响"]},{"t":"非线性热泵部分负荷效率建模以实现最佳投资规划","b":"","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926013772?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/供热技术/热泵","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"热泵效率建模","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":"建立热泵部分负荷非线性效率模型，用于能源系统投资规划优化。","kp":["[热泵投资规划]: 部分负荷非线性效率模型"]},{"t":"光伏发电斜坡预测的光谱间歇正则化","b":"","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0306261926012821?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Applied Energy","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光伏功率预测","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":4.5,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":"提出光谱间歇正则化方法，提升光伏发电功率斜坡预测精度。","kp":["[光伏功率斜坡预测]: 光谱间歇正则化方法提升预测精度"]},{"t":"可再生能源的崛起：它如何塑造欧盟的依赖性、多样性和地缘政治风险","b":"","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S0301421526005045?dgcid=rss_sd_all","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/其他发电技术","a":"ScienceDirect Publication: Energy Policy","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"观点评论","tp":"可再生能源地缘","sc":3.9,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"分析可再生能源发展对欧盟能源依赖性、多样性及地缘政治风险的影响。"},{"t":"古地磁学的生活：丽莎·托克斯访谈","b":"Lisa introduced the field of paleomagnetism, shared several fascinating research stories, and recounted the challenges and setbacks, as well as the heartwarming moments, that she has experienced throughout her own scientific career.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag554/8774590?rss=1","c":"不相关","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"可扩展原子电子断层扫描的深度学习","b":"","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag561/8774596?rss=1","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"原子断层扫描","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"开发深度学习方法，实现可扩展的原子电子断层扫描重建技术。","kp":["[原子电子断层扫描]: 深度学习实现可扩展的三维重建"]},{"t":"随着排放强度下降，全球稻米甲烷排放量在过去六年中增加了两倍","b":"Rice paddies are among the largest anthropogenic sources of methane (CH4), yet substantial uncertainties persist in the long-term magnitude and spatiotemporal dynamics of the emissions. Here we show a spatially explicit global estimate of rice CH4 emissions from 1961 to 2020, leveraging a new high-resolution dataset and two Tier 3 modeling approaches (process-based and machine-learning-based). We find that global emissions have more than tripled over the past six decades, reaching a record high of 38.8 Tg CH4 yr−1 in 2020 based on the mean of the two Tier 3 estimates, both the rate and magnitude are substantially higher than conventional emission-factor-based inventories. Traditional rice-producing regions (e.g. Asia) dominated the increase due to expanded cultivation and intensified organic inputs, while Africa emerged as a rapidly growing source. Beyond trends in absolute emissions, the CH4 emission intensity (per unit of rice yield) declined across 70% of the global paddy area, mainly reflecting yield-driven efficiency gains. Notably, 44% of global rice production in the 2010 s occurs in countries with below-average emission intensity, with China being the largest contributor. By resolving long-term spatial heterogeneity with new data and models, this study provides a robust reassessment of the global rice methane budget and highlights pathways to reconcile food production with climate mitigation.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag555/8774597?rss=1","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"稻米甲烷排放","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":8.0,"d":9.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究利用新的高分辨率数据集和两种三级方法（基于过程模型和基于机器学习）对1961-2020年全球稻米甲烷排放进行了空间显性估算。结果显示全球排放在过去六十年中增长超过两倍，2020年达到创纪录的38.8 Tg CH4/年（两种三级估算的均值），其增速和总量均显著高于传统排放因子法清单。亚洲等传统稻米产区因种植面积扩大和有机集约化而主导了排放增长。","kp":["全球稻米甲烷排放量[1961-2020]: 过去六十年增长超过三倍，达历史新高"]},{"t":"前脑室下区成体神经干细胞胚胎起源的综合分析","b":"In the mammalian brain, adult neural stem cells (NSCs) located in ventricular-subventricular zone (V-SVZ) of lateral ventricles and dentate gyrus continuously generate new neurons and glia throughout life. The adult NSCs in V-SVZ are derived from ventricular radial glial cells (RGCs) which become quiescent during embryonic development. However, the origin and establishment of this adult NSC pool remain elusive, primarily due to the challenge of tracing the lineage from embryonic RGCs to their quiescent adult successors. Here, by leveraging Vcam1—a marker continuously expressed from embryonic RGCs to adult NSCs—we unravel the dynamic process and regulatory mechanism underlying the fate bifurcation that gives rise to quiescent seed cells. We demonstrate that Vcam1+ embryonic RGCs directly contribute to the adult NSC pool. A subpopulation of quiescent Vcam1+ RGCs emerges early and is maintained throughout development, while a parallel population of proliferative Vcam1+ progenitors actively replenishes this quiescent reservoir. Through the combinatory analysis of single-cell multi-omics and clonal lineage tracing of Vcam1+ cells, we identified the TGF-β/Smad3 pathway as a critical regulator of quiescence. Our work thus provides a mechanistic dissection of how the foundational adult NSC pool is established through precisely regulated fate decisions during embryogenesis, offering new insights into the principles of lifelong neurogenesis.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag516/8774603?rss=1","c":"不相关","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"超高分辨率量子点发光二极管","b":"Next-generation near-eye augmented reality (AR)/virtual reality (VR) display hardware puts forward growing requirements for high-performance, high-resolution luminous sources. Benefiting from outstanding luminous efficiency, tunable emission wavelength and convenient fabrication procedures, quantum dot light-emitting diodes (QLEDs) have gained extensive application prospects. However, achieving ultrahigh resolution without compromising device performance requires a balance between them, which is a major challenge for practical applications. In this Perspective, we introduce advanced patterning techniques for ultrahigh-resolution QLEDs, elaborate on the latest advancements in display technology, and summarize the key challenges and prospective research trends.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://academic.oup.com/nsr/advance-article/doi/10.1093/nsr/nwag549/8774606?rss=1","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"National Science Review Advance Access","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"量子点显示","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"该展望文章介绍了面向超高分辨率量子点发光二极管（QLED）的先进图案化技术。近眼增强现实/虚拟现实显示对高性能、高分辨率光源需求日益增长，QLED凭借优异的发光效率、可调发射波长和便捷制备工艺具有广阔应用前景，但在不牺牲器件性能的前提下实现超高分辨率需要平衡二者关系，这是实际应用的重大挑战。文章阐述了显示技术的最新进展，并总结了关键挑战和未来研究方向。","kp":["分辨率与性能[超高分辨率QLED]: 需在不牺牲器件性能前提下实现超高分辨率，需平衡二者关系"]},{"t":"受体介导的内溶酶体回收嵌合体能够催化 TNF-α 降解，从而持续治疗粘膜炎症","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Mucosal inflammatory disorders such as dry eye disease (DED) and inflammatory bowel disease (IBD), driven by TNF‐α‐mediated immune‐epithelial crosstalk, remain therapeutically challenging. Conventional inhibitors often suffer from poor mucosal permeability and transient efficacy with 1:1 binding. Although extracellular protein degradation (eTPD) technologies can eliminate pathogenic proteins, most of them operate stoichiometrically, limiting dosage efficiency and durability. Here, we report a receptor‐mediated endolysosomal recycling chimera (RECYC) platform that enables catalytic, recyclable degradation of TNF‐α with multiple turnovers, achieving sustained suppression of mucosal inflammation. RECYC integrates a pH‐responsive peptide that binds TNF‐α at physiological pH and releases it in acidic endosomes, with a CI‐M6PR‐targeting aptamer that remains pH‐stable to drive continuous recycling. The anti‐TNF‐α RECYC achieved efficient uptake and recyclable clearance of extracellular TNF‐α across conjunctival and colonic epithelial cells and macrophages, achieving superstoichiometric TNF‐α clearance with up to 7.5 catalytic turnovers. The ∼30 kDa RECYC exhibited superior tissue penetration in murine cornea and colon compared to inhibitory antibodies. In murine DED and IBD models, RECYC restored ocular surface homeostasis and reduced colon inflammation with low‐dose, infrequent administration. Human corneal limbus organoids further confirmed prolonged anti‐inflammatory activity. Together, RECYC establishes a modular, recyclable eTPD platform for sustained treatment of TNF‐α‐driven mucosal inflammation.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74818?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文"},{"t":"室温下具有本征铁磁性的晶圆级超多孔石墨烯网络","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    We report a wafer‐scale hyper‐porous graphene network (HGN) with room‐temperature intrinsic magnetism, which was revealed by both XMCD spectra at C K‐edge and M‐H curve, corresponding to a magnetic moment density of ∼0.06 μ\n                    B\n                    /atom, 1000 times higher than in defected HOPG. The impurity effects on magnetism were excluded by XMCD and ICP‐MS measurements. Atomic‐resolution observations unveiled that the magnetism originate from dangling zigzag edges within HGN pores apart over 1.4 nm, which was proved by annealing treatment and DFT calculations. This work confirms that intrinsic carbon ferromagnetism with the same physical mechanism as in the microscale can be obtained in bulk carbon systems. It provides a novel platform to further explore the spintronic and magnetic applications of carbon allotropes.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74568?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"多孔石墨烯磁性","sc":8.4,"scd":{"b":9.0,"i":4.0,"r":8.0,"d":8.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究报道了具有室温本征磁性的晶圆级超多孔石墨烯网络（HGN）。C K边X射线磁圆二色谱和磁滞回线显示其磁矩密度约0.06 μB/原子，比缺陷HOPG高1000倍；XMCD和ICP-MS测量排除了杂质影响。原子分辨率观察表明磁性源于孔内间距超过1.4 nm的悬挂锯齿形边缘，并经退火处理和DFT计算证实。该工作确认了与微尺度相同物理机制的本征碳铁磁性可在块体碳体系中获得。","kp":["磁矩密度[室温本征铁磁性晶圆级超多孔石墨烯网络]: ~0.06 μB/atom","磁矩密度提升倍数[对比缺陷HOPG]: 高1000倍","磁性验证手段[排除杂质效应]: XMCD光谱与ICP-MS测量"]},{"t":"用于高性能神经形态计算的具有碳主链的烯烃连接离子共价有机框架","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Olefin‐linked covalent organic frameworks (\n                    cc\n                    COFs) have shown great advantages in the community since discovery. However, the synthesis of ccCOFs highly relies on unsaturated heteroatom‐involved segments (uSHS) to activate C─H bond to produce carbanion and to further condense with aldehydes. Such electron‐withdrawing uSHS have long hindered the wide applications of ccCOFs in optoelectronic devices due to the strong electron‐withdrawing effect. In this work, we report a carbenium‐involved synthesis of\n                    cc\n                    COFs without uSHS’ participating. As‐synthesized ionic\n                    cc\n                    COFs show good crystallinity and ultra‐narrow bandgap down to 1.03 eV without introducing complicated donor‐acceptor building blocks. Such\n                    cc\n                    COFs can also be directly synthesized as uniform films on different substrates, for example, glass, silicon wafer, Au, and so on. Most impressively, the device Au/2DPPPV‐102/Al exhibits 32 distinct conductance states under low‐voltage sweeps and each conductance state demonstrated excellent non‐volatility and could be maintained stably for over 5000 s, which are typical features of memristor. A convolutional neural network was implemented using a 32‐conductance‐state memristor array and applied to image recognition, yielding recognition accuracies exceeding 90% for five randomly selected images.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74807?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"有机框架材料","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该工作报道了一种无需不饱和杂原子链段（uSHS）参与的碳正离子参与的烯烃连接共价有机框架合成方法。传统ccCOFs合成依赖吸电子的uSHS活化C-H键产生碳负离子再与醛缩合，但强吸电子效应阻碍其在光电器件中的应用。新方法合成的离子型ccCOFs表现出良好的结晶性和低至1 eV左右的超窄带隙，具有碳主链结构，适用于高性能神经形态计算。","kp":["ccCOF合成依赖[传统工艺]: 依赖含不饱和杂原子的链段活化C─H键产生碳负离子并与醛缩合","应用瓶颈[光电器件]: 吸电子uSHS阻碍ccCOF在光电器件中的广泛应用"]},{"t":"通过电介质嵌入式 II 型 PbS/PbSe 量子点实现突触前光学调制，实现近红外神经形态视觉","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    In nighttime perception and near‐infrared (NIR) neuromorphic vision, a central challenge lies in encoding weak optical inputs into stable and controllable temporal states at the sensor front end. In nocturnal mammalian retinas, AII amacrine cells achieve this function by relying on stable chemical intermediate states, presynaptic modulation, and subthreshold temporal integration. Functionally inspired by selected information‐processing principles of this mechanism, we propose and demonstrate a bio‐inspired device design strategy. Through a chemical‐structural codesign approach, type‐II PbS/PbSe core–shell quantum dots (QDs) are used for the first time and embedded into the dielectric layer of flexible carbon‐nanotube (CNT) synaptic transistors, forming stable yet decaying photo‐generated intermediate states. These states modulate the CNT channel conductance via photogating, realizing a presynaptic, nonconductive modulation. The synaptic device exhibits NIR perception covering 395–808 nm and operates with an energy consumption of 0.325 fJ per synaptic event. An 8 × 8 synaptic array enables history‐dependent temporal processing, generating 32 distinguishable output states under five‐bit optical inputs. Based on these properties, a reservoir computing (RC) framework is validated on a dataset exceeding 10\n                    5\n                    samples, achieving 94.6% accuracy in nighttime human action recognition tasks. These results establish a bio‐inspired material‐device‐system pathway for NIR near‐sensor temporal perception and computation.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74345?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"近红外视觉传感","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究受夜行哺乳动物视网膜中AII无长突细胞依赖稳定化学中间态、突触前调制和阈下时间整合机制的启发，通过化学-结构协同设计，首次将II型PbS/PbSe核壳量子点嵌入柔性碳纳米管突触晶体管的介电层中，实现突触前光学调制，将弱光学输入编码为稳定可控的时序状态，用于夜间感知和近红外神经形态视觉传感器前端。","kp":["突触前光学调制[近红外神经形态视觉]: 基于电介质嵌入式II型PbS/PbSe量子点实现弱光信号编码为稳定可控时间状态"]},{"t":"荧光纳米金刚石的离子浓度和电压成像","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The nitrogen‐vacancy (NV) center in diamond exists in different charge states with distinct photoluminescence properties, which are sensitive to the nanoscale electrochemical environment. Hence, the NV charge state is emerging as a powerful all‐optical platform for nanoscale sensing and imaging. Although significant progress has been made in engineering near‐surface NV centers in bulk diamond, controlling the NV charge state in fluorescent nanodiamonds (FNDs) has proven challenging, limiting the sensitivity and reliability of FND‐based charge state sensing. Here, we demonstrate reliable, reversible switching between the fluorescent NV\n                    0\n                    and a dark state, likely NV\n                    +\n                    , in sub‐30 nm FNDs via surface oxidation and hydrogenation, respectively, for single particles and particle powder. In aqueous electrochemical cells, we demonstrate voltage and ion concentration imaging based on the NV charge state in self‐assembled FND layers on transparent substrates. Applied voltages reliably modulate the FND PL with a sensitivity of up to 16 mV Hz\n                    −1/2\n                    . FND PL is also modulated by local changes in salt concentration with a sensitivity of up to 1.8% per millimolar NaCl, enabling all‐optical imaging of ion concentration gradients at the microscale. Our results represent a significant step toward realizing fast, stable, and scalable nanoscale charge‐ and voltage‐imaging technologies with sub‐micrometer spatial resolution.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74728?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米金刚石成像","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究展示了荧光纳米金刚石中NV0荧光态与暗态（可能为NV+）之间可靠、可逆的切换。金刚石中氮空位（NV）中心以不同电荷态存在，具有对纳米级电化学环境敏感的不同光致发光特性，可作为纳米级传感和成像的全光学平台。尽管块体金刚石近表面NV中心工程已取得进展，但荧光纳米金刚石中NV电荷态的控制一直颇具挑战，限制了基于电荷态传感的灵敏度和可靠性。","kp":["NV电荷态[荧光纳米金刚石]: 作为纳米尺度传感与成像的全光学平台，对纳米级电化学环境敏感"]},{"t":"不断生长的光纤传感器能够连续体内监测植物激素","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Plant stress during growth, caused by extreme environments and biotic attacks, threatens global biodiversity and crop production, necessitating urgent elucidation of plant adaptation mechanisms. Endogenous hormones of plant growth serve as master regulators and earliest indicators of stress adaptation, making it crucial to monitor their dynamics continuously. However, existing methods, including chromatography and electrochemical probes, fail because of their mismatch with the irreversible and plastic nature of plant growth. Here, we unexpectedly find a growing fiber sensor based on an electrode consisting of a dynamic polymer network infiltrated with liquid metal, termed metalgel. The sensor undergoes irreversible elongation ∼up to 10 times its original length under just 3.2 kPa tensile stress, at least 2 orders of magnitude lower than existing electronic conductive systems, thus achieving synchronous deformation with plant growth without inducing mechanical damage or hormonal disturbances. Hormone dynamics and relevant signaling pathways during plant growth in response to pathogen infection, salt stress, and even extreme ultraviolet radiation are thus revealed by the sensor. This work provides quantitative insights into plant stress resilience mechanisms and offers a feasible route to alleviate the food and ecological crises.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74856?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光纤植物传感","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":7.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究意外发现一种基于液态金属浸润动态聚合物网络电极（称为metalgel）的可生长光纤传感器，可随植物生长发生高达约10倍原始长度的不可逆伸长，实现植物激素的连续体内监测。极端环境和生物侵害引发的植物生长胁迫威胁全球生物多样性和作物生产，内源激素是胁迫适应的主调节因子和最早指标，但现有色谱和电化学探针方法因与植物生长的不可逆性和可塑性不匹配而无法实现动态连续监测。","kp":["连续监测能力[植物激素体内检测]: 不断生长的光纤传感器实现植物激素动态连续监测","现有方法局限[色谱与电化学探针]: 因与需求不匹配而无法实现连续监测"]},{"t":"层状卤化物钙钛矿纳米片中超空间结构驱动的能量漏斗","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Layered hybrid perovskites offer a versatile platform for tailoring light‐matter interactions, where alternative stacking of inorganic and organic layers creates complex couplings that disrupt the conventional crystal symmetry. Standard crystallographic models fall short of capturing the temperature‐dependent stacking disorder and multiplet excitonic features in these systems. Here, we introduce a four‐dimensional superspace framework, employing a phenomenological atomic modulation function, to describe the symmetry‐breaking interactions in Ruddlesden–Popper L\n                    2\n                    FA\n                    \n                      n\n                    \n                    ‐1\n                    [Sn\n                    0.022\n                    Pb\n                    0.978\n                    ]\n                    \n                      n\n                    \n                    I\n                    3\n                    \n                      n\n                    \n                    +1\n                    (L: oleylamine,\n                    n\n                    ≥ 2) nanoplatelet superlattices. Temperature‐tunable optical spectra reveal microcavity‐like excitonic confinement, while ultrafast transient absorption spectroscopy uncovers sub‐picosecond energy funneling through modulated quantum wells, facilitating a measurable and stable self‐powered photoresponse across a broad spectral range at room temperature. A rare coexistence of negative thermal expansion and quenching arises from anisotropic octahedral distortions and electron–phonon interactions. These findings establish a new structure‐function paradigm for designing thermally reconfigurable optoelectronic materials via engineered lattice modulation in hybrid perovskite superstructures.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74826?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿纳米片","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究引入四维超空间框架，采用唯象原子调制函数描述Ruddlesden-Pper型层状杂化钙钛矿中的对称性破缺相互作用。层状杂化钙钛矿中无机与有机层的交替堆叠形成复杂耦合、破坏常规晶体对称性，标准晶体学模型无法捕捉系统中温度依赖的堆叠无序和多重激子特征。该框架用于描述纳米片中超空间结构驱动的能量漏斗过程。","kp":["分析框架[层状杂化钙钛矿]: 引入四维超空间框架描述温度依赖堆叠无序与多重激子特征"]},{"t":"升级棒状微凝胶的制造：一种将逐步乳化与并行微通道中连续液滴限制相结合的微流体方法","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Anisometric rod‐shaped microgels are an emerging material class holding potential for tissue engineering. Their anisotropic shape has proven advantageous in the fabrication of granular hydrogels and microporous annealed particle scaffolds (MAPs), featuring larger pore sizes in comparison to their spherical counterparts. However, to enable the use of rod‐shaped microgels as building blocks for high‐throughput tissue models, a robust and scalable production method is needed. Here, we report a microfluidic fabrication method to produce rod‐shaped microgels by combining step‐emulsification (SE) and droplet confinement. We highlight the development of the microfluidic chip design, and characterize the properties of the microgel rods produced via on‐chip gelation, using two light‐induced polymerization chemistries. Compared to single‐channel microfluidic techniques, rod‐shaped microgels are generated in eight parallelized microchannels in a relevant size range for tissue engineering applications, holding potential for further upscaling.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74822?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"微凝胶制造","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":4.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"该研究报道了一种结合逐步乳化和并行微通道中连续液滴限制的微流控制造方法，用于生产棒状微凝胶。各向异性棒状微凝胶在构建颗粒水凝胶和微孔退火颗粒支架方面相比球形微凝胶具有更大孔径的优势，是组织工程的新兴材料，但作为高通量组织模型的构建单元需要稳健可扩展的生产方法。研究重点介绍了微流控芯片设计开发，并对芯片上凝胶化制备的微凝胶棒性能进行了表征。","kp":["棒状微凝胶优势[对比球形微凝胶]: 各向异性形状使粒状水凝胶和MAPs支架具有更大孔径","制造方法[棒状微凝胶规模化]: 将逐步乳化与并行微通道连续液滴限制相结合的微流体方法"]},{"t":"利用近红外发光金属卤化物对植物水分含量进行非破坏性高保真传感","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Real‐time, accurate water monitoring is a crucial technical foundation for industrial, environmental, and biological research. However, traditional detection methods typically include destructive processes and suffer from response delays. Near‐infrared (NIR) luminescent metal halides offer a novel solution to this challenge, but they still face issues such as ultraviolet excitation and low photoelectric conversion efficiency. Herein, a luminescent material was synthesized based on the blue‐light‐excited lead‐free perovskite Cs\n                    2\n                    HfCl\n                    6\n                    :Te\n                    4+\n                    /Mo\n                    4+\n                    , in which energy transfer (ET) from Te\n                    4+\n                    to Mo\n                    4+\n                    enables highly efficient NIR luminescence in the 800–1200 nm wavelength range. Upon encapsulation with a commercial blue light chip, the fabricated NIR light‐emitting diode device achieved a photoelectric conversion efficiency of up to 16.1%. By utilizing the absorption characteristics of water molecules in the NIR spectrum and receiving signals via a sensor. An interactive learning process based on a neural network machine learning algorithm was employed, achieving an estimation accuracy of up to 98.6% for plant water content. This non‐destructive and precise NIR detection module provides a new solution for the real‐time monitoring of crop physiological status and holds broad application prospects in the fields of precision agriculture and plant science.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74821?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"金属卤化物传感","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究合成了一种基于蓝光激发的无铅钙钛矿Cs2HfCl6:Te4+/Mo4+的近红外发光材料用于植物水分含量的非破坏性高保真传感，其中涉及能量转移过程。实时准确的水分监测是工业、环境和生物研究的重要技术基础，但传统检测方法通常包含破坏性过程且存在响应延迟；近红外发光金属卤化物虽提供了新方案，但此前面临紫外激发和光电转换效率低的问题。","kp":["传感特性[近红外发光金属卤化物]: 非破坏性、高保真植物水分含量监测","现有问题[近红外发光金属卤化物]: 紫外激发与低光电转换效率"]},{"t":"双功能催化驱动高效的乙醇生产水性 Zn-CO2 电池","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Bifunctional electrocatalysts that simultaneously drive CO\n                    2\n                    reduction (CO\n                    2\n                    RR) and oxygen evolution (OER) in neutral electrolytes are essential for aqueous Zn‐CO\n                    2\n                    batteries (AZCBs), but conventional designs prioritize CO\n                    2\n                    RR and are often incompatible with OER, resulting in low energy efficiency, poor reversibility, and rapid degradation of batteries. Here, we introduce a unified catalyst architecture integrating Cu and Ni single atoms with boron‐, nitrogen‐co‐doped carbon (CuNi@BNC‐T). Heteroatom co‐doping stabilizes high single‐atom loadings, enhances metal‐support interactions, and suppresses carbon corrosion, while N‐coordinated Cu\n                    +\n                    and Ni\n                    3+\n                    sites cooperatively boost CO\n                    2\n                    RR‐OER, enabling ethanol formation and low‐overpotential OER. This strategy achieves a 0.7 V voltage gap at 5 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    , 522 h cycling at 20 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    , and first ethanol production via AZCBs with energy efficiency of 88% (flow‐cell). By elucidating previously unresolved degradation pathways, this work also correlates catalyst dynamics with battery failure, establishing design principles for durable bifunctional catalysts in aqueous Zn‐CO\n                    2\n                    systems.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74846?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锌碳电池催化","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究提出了一种将Cu和Ni单原子与硼、氮共掺杂碳集成的统一催化剂架构（CuNi@BNC-T），用于水性Zn-CO2电池中的双功能催化。中性电解质中同时驱动CO2还原和析氧的双功能电催化剂对水系Zn-CO2电池至关重要，但常规设计优先考虑CO2还原且常与析氧反应不兼容，导致能量效率低、可逆性差和电池快速衰减。杂原子共掺杂稳定了高单原子负载并增强了金属-载体相互作用，实现高效乙醇生产。","kp":["双功能催化剂[水系Zn-CO2电池/中性电解液]: 同时驱动CO2RR与OER，解决常规设计OER兼容性差的问题"]},{"t":"将π共轭氨基酸纳入多功能无定形材料","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  The controlled fabrication of amorphous materials from small organic molecules and their translation into high‐performance functional materials remain long‐standing challenges. Here, we introduce a multicomponent assembly strategy to developed amorphous materials from π‐conjugated amino acids, offering a versatile platform for high‐performance adhesive and optical applications. The incorporation of proline‐based building blocks into multicomponent networks bypasses the crystallization‐induced self‐assembly that otherwise dominates in solution, thereby driving liquid‐liquid phase separation‐like pathways to yield amorphous aggregates. These aggregates exhibit exceptional thermoreversible adhesion to iron‐based substrates, with their densely packed architecture facilitating rarely observed excimer emission of fluorene. Furthermore, enhanced charge‐transfer interactions with 1,2,4,5‐tetracyanobenzene shift the photoluminescence from indigo to green, increase the quantum yield by orders of magnitude, and transition the emission from short‐lived prompt fluorescence to long‐lived thermally activated delayed fluorescence. Through supercooling, amorphous glasses with high hardness and optical transparency were successfully fabricated, wherein increasing the number of components enables systematic tuning of surface roughness, wettability, quantum yield, emission wavelength, and excited‐state lifetime. This work establishes a novel paradigm for synthesizing amorphous materials within multicomponent high‐entropy systems, positioning amino acid and short peptide derivatives as a versatile class of biomolecular building blocks for advanced adhesive and photonic applications.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74865?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"氨基酸无定形材料","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"该研究提出多组分组装策略，由π共轭氨基酸制备无定形材料，为高性能粘附和光学应用提供多功能平台。将脯氨酸基结构单元纳入多组分网络可绕过溶液中占主导的结晶诱导自组装，驱动类似液-液相分离的路径形成无定形聚集体。这些聚集体对铁基基底表现出优异的热可逆粘附性，其致密堆积结构有利于相关功能特性，解决了小分子无定形材料的可控构筑及其向高性能功能材料转化的长期挑战。","kp":["组装策略[π共轭氨基酸无定形材料]: 多组分组装，纳入脯氨酸基结构单元构建网络"]},{"t":"用于远程 X 射线检测的稳定杂配混合玻璃闪烁光纤","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Long‐distance and flexible optical fiber scintillators are essential under extreme operating conditions including interventional radiology and remote nuclear reactor monitoring, etc. Organic–inorganic hybrid glass fibers offer a promising solution, yet transforming cluster glasses into stable photonic architectures remains challenging. Here we report a heteroleptic strategy that exploits steric hindrance effects to precisely modulate the thermodynamic properties of hybrid Cu\n                    4\n                    I\n                    4\n                    cluster glass, further enabling ultralong, fracture‐free, and perturbation‐free TPP\n                    2\n                    MDP\n                    2\n                    Cu\n                    4\n                    I\n                    4\n                    (TPP = Triphenylphosphine; MDP = Methyldiphenylphosphine) glass fibers. The heteroleptic TPP\n                    2\n                    MDP\n                    2\n                    Cu\n                    4\n                    I\n                    4\n                    core glass not only overcomes the stability limitations of hybrid systems, but also exhibits a notable light yield of 38598 photons MeV\n                    −1\n                    and a low detection limit of 62.2 nGy s\n                    −1\n                    . We assemble these fibers into a flexible scintillation fiber array capable of imaging internal defects in confined spaces. This heteroleptic design principle in cluster glass platform can be extended to other hybrid glass fibers for emerging photonic applications.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74844?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"玻璃闪烁光纤","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究报道了一种杂配体策略，利用空间位阻效应精确调控杂化Cu4I4簇玻璃的热力学性质，制备出超长、无断裂、无扰动的TPP2MDP2Cu基混合玻璃闪烁光纤，用于介入放射学和远程核反应堆监测等极端工况下的远程X射线检测。有机-无机杂化玻璃光纤是长距离柔性光纤闪烁体的有前景方案，但将簇玻璃转化为稳定光子架构一直颇具挑战。","kp":["杂配策略[混合玻璃闪烁光纤]: 利用空间位阻效应调控热力学，实现稳定光子结构"]},{"t":"交变磁场诱导电子重构制备高磁化率纳米 FeS2","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Magnetic materials, such as\n                    Ferumoxytol\n                    and Gd‐DTPA, have played an important role in biomedical areas. The relentless pursuit of novel magnetic materials that are clinically applicable is an eternal theme in biomedical engineering. Pyrite (FeS\n                    2\n                    ) is a mineral drug in China that has been used for a long history. Besides the inherent biocompatibility proved in the human body as well as the donor of H\n                    2\n                    S, pyrite also belongs to the family of transition metal dichalcogenides, which endows it with flexible functional tunability of magnetism to be a promising candidate for novel magnetic nanodrug. However, the nano‐FeS\n                    2\n                    synthesized by common coprecipitation often shows poor magnetic susceptibility, so its application has greatly been limited. Herein, we reported an innovative strategy to prepare nano‐FeS\n                    2\n                    with high magnetic susceptibility (HS‐nano‐FeS\n                    2\n                    ) via alternating magnetic field‐assisted coprecipitation. AMF treatment effectively regulated electronic reconstruction of Fe\n                    2+\n                    in nano‐FeS\n                    2\n                    without foreign‐element doping, and super‐exchange interaction is proposed as the dominant factor for the optimized magnetic susceptibility toward a favorable spin‐polarized configuration. The HS‐nano‐FeS\n                    2\n                    is suitable for long‐term MR angiography imaging with excellent biosafety. We believe HS‐nano‐FeS\n                    2\n                    provides a novel magnetic candidate for clinical translation and demonstrates an innovative strategy at the electronic level.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74842?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"纳米磁材制备","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"该研究利用交变磁场诱导电子重构制备高磁化率纳米FeS2。黄铁矿（FeS2）是中国的矿物药物，具有长期使用历史，已被证明在人体内具有固有生物相容性，可作为H2S供体；同时它属于过渡金属二硫化物家族，具有灵活的磁性功能可调性，是新型磁性纳米药物的候选者，有望补充Ferumoxytol和Gd-DTPA等现有生物医学磁性材料。","kp":["纳米FeS2[交变磁场诱导电子重构]: 高磁化率，具有天然生物相容性的矿物药物"]},{"t":"激光定义的反应拓扑实现了可扩展钙钛矿光伏的可控固态转变","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Controlling reaction pathways in solids is critical for scalable semiconductor fabrication, yet remains fundamentally challenging in solution‐processed systems due to constrained mass transport and diffusion‐limited conversion. In perovskite photovoltaics, the widely adopted sequential two‐step deposition method is particularly limited by dense PbI\n                    2\n                    precursor layers, which impede ion diffusion and lead to incomplete conversion and defect formation. Here we report a photonic strategy to spatially regulate solid‐state reaction pathways by engineering micro‐ and nanoscale channels within PbI\n                    2\n                    layers. Laser‐induced structures act as deterministic diffusion pathways, enabling controlled ion transport and spatially guided infiltration of organic salts, thereby transforming a diffusion‐limited process into a spatially coordinated reaction. Mechanistic investigations reveal that photonic structuring redistributes the local electronic environment and lowers the activation barrier for phase transformation, resulting in accelerated conversion, enhanced crystallinity, and reduced defect density. The resulting perovskite films exhibit improved carrier dynamics. Perovskite solar modules with an aperture area of 22.95  cm\n                    2\n                    achieve a record power conversion efficiency of 22.83%, retaining over 90% of their initial performance after 1,500 h under maximum power point tracking. This work establishes photonic control of reaction pathways as a general framework for controlled solid‐state transformations.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74828?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿光伏","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究提出一种光子策略，通过在PbI2前驱层中构筑微米和纳米级通道，利用激光诱导结构作为确定性扩散路径，空间调控固态反应路径，解决钙钛矿光伏两步沉积法中致密PbI2层阻碍离子扩散、转化不完全和缺陷形成的问题，实现可控固态转变与可扩展钙钛矿光伏制备。","kp":["激光定义反应拓扑[钙钛矿光伏两步沉积]: 可控固态转变，缓解致密PbI2前驱层阻碍离子扩散的问题"]},{"t":"用于高性能机械发光结构的多功能牺牲模具辅助 3D 打印，以实现冲击保护和可视化监控","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Mechanoluminescence (ML) materials exhibit significant potential for visual sensing and structural monitoring owing to their self‐powered operation and capability for real‐time stress mapping. However, the fabrication of complex and high‐aspect‐ratio 3D ML geometries remains challenging, primarily constrained by poor rheological control in direct ink writing and the limited adaptability of conventional demolding. Herein, this study proposes an indirect 3D printing strategy based on sacrificial molds to fabricate complex ZnS:Cu/polydimethylsiloxane (PDMS) structures with exceptional structural fidelity. By integrating digital image correlation (DIC) technology, a quantitative correlation between strain fields and ML intensity fields is successfully established. Furthermore, a 3D negative Poisson's ratio ML structure (NPR‐ML/PDMS) filled with silicone is designed for complex service scenarios, enabling the synergistic integration of impact protection and real‐time visualized impact sensing. NPR‐ML/PDMS reduces peak impact force by 60% and enhances ML intensity by 89%, demonstrating its potential for intelligent protective systems. Finally, this sacrificial mold method is successfully extended to ZnS/CaZnOS:Mn\n                    2\n                    +\n                    /epoxy resin and CaZnOS:Pr, Li‐based composite systems to achieve stress visualization in rigid load‐bearing structures, validating its broad universality across various polymer matrices. This work provides valuable guidance for the development and application of complex, high‑performance ML structures in impact protection and visualization monitoring fields.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74840?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"机械发光3D打印","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究提出基于牺牲模具的间接3D打印策略，制备结构保真度优异的复杂ZnS:Cu/聚二甲基硅氧烷(PDMS)机械发光结构，克服直写成型流变控制差和传统脱模适应性有限的问题。结合数字图像相关(DIC)技术，建立了应变场与ML强度场之间的定量关联，实现自供电实时应力映射，用于冲击保护和可视化结构监控。","kp":["牺牲模具辅助3D打印[机械发光结构]: 间接打印方式，可制造复杂高深宽比3D几何结构用于冲击保护与可视化监控"]},{"t":"具有金属扰动配体内电荷转移态的 Pd(II)-TADF 配合物：高效红色 OLED 的发射体和敏化剂","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    The metal‐perturbed intraligand charge transfer (MPICT) excited state has proven to be a viable design strategy for thermally activated delayed fluorescence (TADF) complexes featuring a metal–donor–acceptor configuration. However, the structure‐photophysics correlation and the applications of such complexes for organic light‐emitting diodes (OLEDs) remain largely unexplored. Herein, we report a series of Pd(II) complexes (\n                    Pd3\n                    –\n                    Pd6\n                    ) having dibenzo[\n                    a\n                    ,\n                    c\n                    ]phenazine (DBPZ)‐substituted carbazolyl ligands with varied torsion angles. The energy gap between the lowest singlet and triplet excited states is tuned from 0.05 eV to 0.26 eV, which governs the emission mechanism and radiative decay rate. Complex\n                    Pd3\n                    exhibits strong red TADF with a photoluminescence quantum yield of 82% and a lifetime of 1.13 µs. In bottom‐emitting OLEDs,\n                    Pd3\n                    affords red electroluminescence with a peak at 617 nm, a maximum external quantum efficiency (EQE\n                    max\n                    ) of 30.15%, and a small efficiency roll‐off of 2.32% at 1000 cd m\n                    −2\n                    . In top‐emitting ITO‐free OLEDs,\n                    Pd3\n                    shows pure‐red emission with CIE\n                    x\n                    &gt; 0.68 and an EQE\n                    max\n                    of 38.68%.\n                    Pd3\n                    is also demonstrated as an efficient sensitizer for a red‐emitting multi‐resonance emitter, enabling hyperfluorescence OLEDs with an EQE\n                    max\n                    of 27.06% and suppressed efficiency roll‐off. These results highlight the potential of MPICT‐type Pd(II) complexes for high‐performance OLED displays.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74823?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"OLED发光材料","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"金属扰动配体内电荷转移(MPICT)激发态是构建金属-给体-受体构型热激活延迟荧光(TADF)配合物的可行设计策略。研究报道了一系列Pd(II)配合物(Pd3–Pd6)，采用具有不同扭转角的二苯并[a,c]吩嗪(DBPZ)取代咔唑基配体，探讨最低单重态与三重态间能隙等结构-光物理关联，并将其应用于高效红色OLED的发射体和敏化剂。","kp":["发射体/敏化剂[高效红色OLED]: Pd(II)-TADF配合物，基于金属扰动配体内电荷转移(MPICT)激发态"]},{"t":"哈·阮","b":"\"I advise my students to keep asking themselves \"why\" and to strive for excellence in everything they do… The most exciting thing about my research is sharing my passion for science with students and watching them become excited about their own work…\" Find out more about Ha L. Nguyen in his Introducing… Profile.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7114284?af=R","c":"不相关","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"观点评论"},{"t":"DogMask：用于条件蛋白质缀合的基因编码开关","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Protein conjugation enables the modular assembly of functional proteins but is largely incompatible with stimulus‐responsive platforms due to spontaneous reactivity. Here, we present DogMask, a genetically encoded platform that achieves input‐triggered protein conjugation by autoinhibiting a spontaneous conjugation platform, DogCatcher, with a competitive inhibitor mask. DogMask exhibits no detectable background conjugation and rapid activation in response to distinct inputs—including clinically relevant proteases and a photocleavable non‐standard amino acid variant achieving 70% cleavage efficiency, exceeding prior benchmarks—properties enabling robust intracellular control of transcription, RNA editing, and enzyme reconstitution, with both substantially reduced background and enhanced response relative to inducible dimerization systems.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5004113?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/合成生物学","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"蛋白质缀合开关","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":7.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"aip":1,"as":"DogMask是一种基因编码平台，通过竞争性抑制剂掩蔽物自抑制自发蛋白质缀合平台DogCatcher，实现输入触发的蛋白质缀合。该平台无检测背景缀合，可对多种输入快速激活，包括临床相关蛋白酶及可光切割非标准氨基酸变体（切割效率达70%，超越以往基准）。该特性可实现对转录、RNA编辑和酶重构的稳健胞内控制，并显著降低背景。","kp":["DogMask[基因编码蛋白质缀合]: 自抑制平台，无可检测背景缀合，可被多种输入快速激活"]},{"t":"通过脉冲电解和界面工程的时空耦合实现乙二醇氧化中接近统一的乙醛酸选择性","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Electrochemical cascade reactions suffer from suboptimal selectivity toward high‐value intermediates due to the uncontrollable sequential conversion inherent in conventional steady‐state electrolysis. To transcend the intrinsic limitations of one‐dimensional control, we propose a spatiotemporal synergy strategy for precision electrocatalysis. In this framework, the temporal dimension is governed by pulsed electrolysis, facilitating the rhythmic generation and rapid liberation of target intermediates. Simultaneously, the spatial dimension is engineered via molecular steric modifiers (\n                    p\n                    ‐toluidine) to create a persistent hydrophobic interface that effectively suppresses deleterious hydration‐driven overoxidation pathways. Synergistically, this dual‐dimensional orchestration achieves unprecedented precision, as evidenced by a dramatic leap in glyoxylate selectivity from 25.5% to &gt;99.0%. This work demonstrates a promising and transferable design principle for precision electrocatalysis in complex reaction networks. The spatiotemporal decoupling strategy, integrating temporal pulsed electrolysis for intermediate release and spatial interface engineering for overconsumption suppression, is demonstrated here for ethylene glycol oxidation and provides a rational basis for addressing similar selectivity challenges in other electrocatalytic systems.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3451661?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"乙二醇电氧化","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":4.0,"r":7.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"aip":1,"as":"针对常规稳态电解中连续转化不可控导致级联电化学反应对高价值中间体选择性不佳的问题，研究提出时空协同的精密电催化策略：时间维度采用脉冲电解，促进目标中间体的节律性生成与快速释放；空间维度利用分子空间位阻修饰剂（对甲苯胺）构筑持久疏水界面，抑制有害的水合驱动过度氧化，在乙二醇氧化中实现接近统一的乙醛酸选择性。","kp":["乙醛酸选择性[乙二醇氧化/脉冲电解+界面工程]: 接近100%（接近统一选择性）"]},{"t":"打破热力学疏水性-活性权衡以促进 CO2 电还原为甲酸盐的双齿螯合策略","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Achieving industrially relevant electrochemical CO\n                    2\n                    reduction (CO\n                    2\n                    RR) to formic acid requires catalyst that simultaneously exhibits high intrinsic activity and surface hydrophobicity. However, high intrinsic activity is considered thermodynamically contradictory on a hydrophobic surface since high hydrophobicity corresponds to low surface energy, thereby leading to low intrinsic activity. Here we overcome this hydrophobicity‐activity trade‐off via a bidentate chelation strategy that grafts carboxylic acid molecules with tunable alkyl chain lengths on Bi\n                    2\n                    O\n                    2\n                    CO\n                    3\n                    (XC‐BOC, where X denotes the carbon number). The obtained 10C‐BOC sustains high hydrophobicity without sacrificing activity. This hydrophobicity‐activity balance is achieved by restructuring the interfacial hydrogen‐bond (HB) network to suppress the undesired hydrogen evolution reaction (HER) and ensure the timely hydrogenation rate for the key *OCHO intermediate, in conjunction with modulating the Bi site electronic structure via the carboxyl‐O/Bi bidentate chelation to guarantee the high intrinsic activity. Consequently, 10C‐BOC achieves ampere‐level performance with FE\n                    HCOO‐\n                    &gt; 90% from 100–1000 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    , with an optimal FE\n                    HCOO‐\n                    of 97.7% at 600 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    (vs. 83.2% for bare BOC), and maintains FE\n                    HCOO‐\n                    &gt; 93% at 200 mA cm\n                    −2\n                    for 200 h. This work offers a general strategy to decouple hydrophobicity from intrinsic activity for advanced CO\n                    2\n                    RR electrocatalysts.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.9439653?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"CO2还原甲酸","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"aip":1,"as":"电化学CO2还原制甲酸需要催化剂兼具高本征活性和表面疏水性，但疏水表面对应低表面能，与高活性存在热力学矛盾。研究通过双齿螯合策略，在Bi2O2CO3上接枝具有可调烷基链长的羧酸分子，打破疏水性-活性权衡，实现CO2电还原高效生成甲酸盐。","kp":["双齿螯合策略[CO2电还原制甲酸盐]: 打破热力学疏水性-活性权衡，兼具高本征活性与表面疏水性"]},{"t":"由分子马达定制的神经工程，具有自我报告功能，可用于神经元激活和抑郁症治疗","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  The discovery of mechanical regulation to neuronal behavior offers a novel perspective for understanding nervous system function and advancing neural engineering. A key challenge lies in achieving precise mechanical control of neurons while simultaneously monitoring their activity in real time. Here, we engineered a novel molecular machine equipped with self‐reporting capability, MM‐VSD1, enabling stable anchoring into the plasma membrane. This integrated molecular tool comprises a light‐driven rotary molecular motor (MM), which delivers localized mechanical force to neuronal membranes. Concurrently, a tethered near‐infrared voltage‐sensitive dye (VSD1) module provides real‐time fluorescent feedback on changes in membrane potentials with millisecond temporal and subcellular spatial resolution. Utilizing this bifunctional molecular device, we demonstrate that MM‐VSD1 effectively activates mechanosensitive TRPV1 ion channels in hippocampal neurons, triggering calcium influx and action potential (AP) firing. This mechanical modulation induced by MM‐VSD1 is persistent and can be evoked in vivo up to one week, providing the potential of MM‐VSD1 for alleviating depression‐like behaviors in mice. By bridging mechanical manipulation with functional readouts at high spatiotemporal resolution, our work opens an avenue for mechano‐based therapeutic interventions in neurological disorders.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.2883647?af=R","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/脑机接口","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"神经工程分子马达","sc":6.9,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":7.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"aip":1,"as":"研究设计了一种具有自我报告功能的新型分子机器MM-VSD1，可稳定锚定于细胞质膜。该工具集成光驱动旋转分子马达(MM)，向神经元膜施加局部机械力；同时通过偶联的近红外电压敏感染料(VSD1)模块，以毫秒级时间分辨率实时荧光反馈膜电位变化，实现对神经元激活的精确机械控制与同步监测，用于抑郁症治疗等神经工程应用。","kp":["分子机器[神经元机械调控]: MM-VSD1，具备自我报告功能，可稳定锚定于细胞质膜"]},{"t":"用于功能导向离电极电合成的多孔固体电解质反应器","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Electrosynthesis offers an attractive route to sustainable chemical manufacturing when coupled with renewable electricity. As electrosynthesis capability advances towards high‐purity products, the traditional proximity of reaction products to the electrode surface, where the reaction happens, increasingly becomes a limiting factor. In addition, the formation and transport of reactive species are confined in the same chamber, resulting in electrolyte contamination of the product. Porous solid electrolyte (PSE) reactors address this spatial constraint by introducing an additional ion‐conductive middle layer between the cathode and anode, enabling a versatile off‐electrode space for product formation and transportation. Here, we frame PSE reactors as function‐oriented platforms for off‐electrode electrosynthesis, in which the PSE middle layer serves as a functional reaction space that enables ionic recombination, reaction‐environment regulation, and improved management of reactive intermediates. By linking the underlying ionic‐species transport mechanisms and reactor design principles, we establish a structure‐transport‐function framework for understanding how PSE reactors extend electrosynthesis beyond the electrode surface confinement and guide the rational design of scalable electrosynthesis reactors as on‐site chemical manufacturing platforms.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5622879?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/有机电合成","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"离电极电合成","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"aip":1,"as":"多孔固体电解质(PSE)反应器通过在阴极与阳极之间引入额外的离子导电中间层，为产物生成与传输提供多功能'离电极'空间，解决了传统电解合成中反应产物邻近电极表面及活性物种形成与传输共处一室导致电解质污染产物的空间限制问题，推动与可再生电力耦合的电合成向高纯产品方向发展。","kp":["多孔固体电解质反应器[离电极电合成]: 实现产物与电极表面分离，避免电解液污染"]},{"t":"镁保留辅助合成高性能 Zintl 热电材料","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    For decades, performance optimization of Mg\n                    3\n                    (Bi, Sb)\n                    2\n                    ‐based thermoelectric materials has mainly relied on doping and alloying strategies, while the influence of synthesis‐process innovation on thermoelectric mechanisms and properties has remained largely unexplored. Here, we develop a magnesium‐retention assisted synthesis (MRAS) strategy that stabilizes Mg through a sacrificial Mg reservoir and an inert‐gas‐regulated melting environment, effectively suppressing Mg volatilization and chemical instability during high‐temperature synthesis. MRAS enables scalable fabrication of phase‐pure, compositionally uniform Mg‐based alloys without costly tantalum encapsulation. The resulting Mg‐rich Mg\n                    3.15\n                    Bi\n                    1.5\n                    Sb\n                    0.49\n                    Te\n                    0.01\n                    features interconnected Mg‐rich regions and multiscale defects that synergistically promote electrical transport and suppress lattice thermal conductivity, delivering an ultrahigh power factor of 41.7 µW cm\n                    −1\n                    K\n                    −2\n                    , a\n                    ZT\n                    of 1.2 ± 0.1 at 323 K, and a peak\n                    ZT\n                    of 1.8 ± 0.1 at 523 K. MRAS is also compatible with conventional compositional engineering: Ba doping at the Mg site further reduces thermal conductivity through point‐defect scattering while largely preserving the power factor, yielding a\n                    ZT\n                    around 1.9 ± 0.1 at 523 K in Mg\n                    3.144\n                    Ba\n                    0.006\n                    Bi\n                    1.5\n                    Sb\n                    0.49\n                    Te\n                    0.01\n                    . Moreover, successful extension to MgCu\n                    2\n                    and MgAgSb highlights the broad applicability of MRAS as a scalable synthesis platform for high‐performance Mg‐based materials.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.9935383?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/耐热材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"热电材料","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"针对Mg3(Bi,Sb)2基热电材料性能优化长期依赖掺杂和合金化的问题，研究开发镁保留辅助合成(MRAS)策略，通过牺牲镁储库和惰性气体调控熔融环境，有效抑制高温合成过程中的镁挥发和化学不稳定性，无需昂贵钽封装即可规模化制备相纯、成分均匀的镁基合金，实现高性能Zintl热电材料。","kp":["Mg3(Bi,Sb)2热电材料[镁保留辅助合成MRAS]: 通过稳定Mg实现合成工艺创新，提升热电性能"]},{"t":"芳香族单铵的奇偶烷基链对 Ruddlesden-Popper 二维钙钛矿层间结构和稳定性的影响","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Ruddlesden–Popper (RP) 2D perovskites with organic bilayers attract great interest for optoelectronics owing to their high stability and tunable functionality. However, the relationship between the interlayer architecture, molecular configuration of aromatic cations, and resulting stability remains poorly understood. Herein, we systematically investigate phenyl alkylammonium‐based RP 2D perovskites with varying alkyl chain lengths (─(CH\n                    2\n                    )\n                    m\n                    NH\n                    3\n                    +\n                    with m = 1–4) of organic cations. We find that odd‐carbon cations (m = 1, 3) preferentially form type‐I 2D perovskites featuring interdigitated organic cations, which induces substantial inorganic distortion and lower octahedral symmetry to the\n                    C\n                    1\n                    point group. Even‐carbon cations (m = 2, 4) favor type‐II 2D perovskites with well‐defined interlayer gaps, wherein the alkylammonium groups rotate to optimize registry with the inorganic sublattice, minimizing distortion and yielding higher‐symmetry\n                    \n                      D\n                      2\n                    \n                    h\n                    octahedra. Furthermore, we demonstrate that intrinsic structural stability of RP 2D perovskites is primarily governed by π–π packing within the organic layer, whereas air stability of the thin films is determined by surface hydrophobicity. The type‐II films exhibit higher hydrophobicity, conferring enhanced stability under ambient conditions compared to type‐I films. These findings establish odd‐even alkyl chain parity as a design principle for tailoring structurally diverse yet stable RP 2D perovskites.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6772439?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/光伏","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钙钛矿稳定","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究系统考察了苯基烷基铵阳离子烷基链长(─(CH2)mNH3+，m=1-4)对Ruddlesden-Popper二维钙钛矿层间结构与稳定性的影响。发现奇数碳阳离子(m=1,3)优先形成具有交错排列有机阳离子的I型二维钙钛矿，阐明了层间构型、芳香阳离子分子构型与稳定性之间的关联。","kp":["RP二维钙钛矿[苯基烷基铵间隔阳离子]: 烷基链奇偶性调控层间结构与稳定性"]},{"t":"突破表面：浮力金属-聚合物开孔混合晶格超材料","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Metallic lattice metamaterials have demonstrated transformative potential across biomedical, aerospace, defense, and thermal engineering. Yet their application in buoyant marine structures has remained elusive, as their open‐cell architectures inherently prevent flotation, even at densities below that of water. Here, we present the first buoyant metal–polymer open‐cell hybrid lattice metamaterial. The design is guided by a novel skeletal density framework, built around an environment‐independent buoyancy parameter that excludes externally accessible porosity. The resulting hybrid architecture combines Ti‐6Al‐4V hollow‐strut lattices (HSLs)—fabricated by laser‐based powder bed fusion (PBF‐LB)—with expandable polyurethane (PU) foam injected into the internal channels of each strut. This architecture retains external open‐cell permeability while achieving skeletal densities below 1.0 g/cm\n                    3\n                    , enabling reliable buoyancy prediction and control. Real‐world applicability is demonstrated using a Ti‑6Al‑4V+PU hybrid buoy that floats stably in natural seawater. This hybrid architecture exhibits higher specific strength than conventional marine materials such as high‑density polyethylene (HDPE) and 316L stainless steel (SS316L). Seawater immersion tests further demonstrate corrosion resistance and water‑exclusion capability. Finite‑element simulations elucidate fracture initiation and predict failure modes consistent with experimental observations. Importantly, these hybrid buoyant architectures preserve flotation even after severe structural damage. This work introduces a new class of buoyant metamaterials and establishes skeletal density as a general design principle for open‑cell structures in targeted liquid media.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74641?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"晶格超材料","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究报道首个浮力金属-聚合物开孔混合晶格超材料。设计基于新型骨架密度框架，采用与环境无关的浮力参数（排除外部可达孔隙度）。混合架构将由激光粉末床熔融(PBF-LB)制备的Ti-6Al-4V空心支柱晶格与注入的可膨胀聚氨酯(PU)泡沫结合，突破开孔结构本质上无法漂浮的限制，可用于浮力海洋结构。","kp":["金属-聚合物开孔混合晶格超材料[海上浮力结构]: 首个可实现漂浮的开孔金属晶格超材料，由骨架密度函数设计指导"]},{"t":"钛催化合成带有季碳中心的多取代戊二酰亚胺——范围、机制和生物活性研究","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Glutarimides possess prominent pharmacological activities. Nevertheless, general and facile synthetic approaches toward multisubstituted glutarimides remain scarce, particularly for analogues with α, α‐disubstituted structures and substitutions at diverse sites of the imide core. In this work, we developed a radical alkylation/cyclization cascade of α‐tertiary haloamides and acrylates using earth‐abundant titanium as the catalyst. This transformation provides a practical route to glutarimides featuring quaternary carbon centers and multi‐functionalized imide skeletons. Both\n                    N\n                    ‐unsubstituted glutarimides and derivatives with tunable\n                    N\n                    ‐substituents can be readily accessed, including analogues derived from bioactive and pharmaceutical scaffolds. Furthermore, the antiproliferative potency of these newly synthesized glutarimides was assessed using HeLa and glioblastoma U87 cell lines.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.6119479?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钛催化合成","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"研究开发了一种以地壳丰度高的钛为催化剂的自由基烷基化/环化级联反应，以α-叔代卤代酰胺与丙烯酸酯为原料，合成含季碳中心和多功能化酰亚胺骨架的多取代戊二酰亚胺。该方法可便捷制备N-未取代戊二酰亚胺及N-取代基可调的衍生物，弥补了此类药物活性分子合成方法稀缺的问题，并研究了反应范围、机制和生物活性。","kp":["催化剂[多取代戊二酰亚胺合成]: 地球丰产钛，催化α-叔卤代酰胺与丙烯酸酯的自由基烷基化/环化级联反应，构建季碳中心"]},{"t":"用于海水光催化的一维共价有机框架中的共轭控制离子响应","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Photocatalytic hydrogen evolution from seawater offers a sustainable route for energy production, yet the role of dissolved ions in modulating carrier dynamics remains poorly understood. Herein, we demonstrate conjugation‐controlled ion responses that regulate charge separation in one‐dimensional covalent organic frameworks (1D COFs) through ion‐induced polarization for seawater photocatalysis. Two COFs featuring localized (DHP‐COF) and extended (DHPD‐COF) conjugation are constructed. In natural seawater, DHP‐COF achieves 246.9 mmol g\n                    −1\n                    h\n                    −1\n                    for hydrogen evolution, 5.03‐fold higher than in pure water (49.1 mmol g\n                    −1\n                    h\n                    −1\n                    ), whereas DHPD‐COF shows only 2.48‐fold enhancement (from 38.9 to 96.5 mmol g\n                    −1\n                    h\n                    −1\n                    ), revealing markedly stronger ion‐responsive sensitivity in the locally conjugated framework. Mechanistic investigations reveal that localized conjugation preserves spatially inhomogeneous polar domains arising from segmented π‐electron distribution, enabling strong coupling with seawater ions and thereby amplifying local dipoles to generate enhanced internal electric fields for efficient charge separation. In contrast, extended π‐delocalization leads to electronic homogenization that attenuates ion‐induced polarization. Beyond hydrogen production, this system simultaneously achieves chemoselective hydrogenation of\n                    α\n                    ,\n                    β\n                    ‐unsaturated carbonyl compounds to high‐value pharmaceutical intermediates in natural seawater/CH\n                    3\n                    OH. These findings establish conjugation‐controlled ion response as a key design principle for charge separation in saline photocatalysis and provide general guidelines for environment‐adaptive catalysts.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7279758?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/化学能/氢基能源","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化产氢","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究构建了具有局域共轭(DHP-COF)和扩展共轭(DHPD-COF)的一维共价有机框架，展示共轭控制的离子响应通过离子诱导极化调控电荷分离，用于海水光催化。在天然海水中，DHP-COF产氢速率达246.9 mmol g⁻¹ h⁻¹，是纯水中(49.1 mmol g⁻¹ h⁻¹)的5.03倍。","kp":["一维共价有机框架[海水光催化产氢]: 通过共轭控制离子响应实现离子诱导极化调控电荷分离"]},{"t":"等离子体S型异质结实现光辅助Li─O2电池的宽带响应和超低过电势","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Li─O\n                    2\n                    batteries (LOBs) offer an ultrahigh theoretical energy density but suffer from a large overpotential. Photocathodes can lower this overpotential, but most of them cannot achieve efficient charge separation, sufficient redox capability, and broadband photoresponse at the same time. Here, a plasmonic S‐scheme heterojunction photocathode (W\n                    18\n                    O\n                    49\n                    /\n                    g\n                    ‐C\n                    3\n                    N\n                    4\n                    , WOCN) is constructed. W\n                    18\n                    O\n                    49\n                    serves as the oxidation semiconductor of the heterojunction and a noble‐metal‐free plasmonic absorber, forming a continuous plasmonic heterointerface with\n                    g\n                    ‐C\n                    3\n                    N\n                    4\n                    . The intrinsic localized surface plasmon resonance (LSPR) of W\n                    18\n                    O\n                    49\n                    originates from periodically arranged lattice‐localized electrons in W\n                    5+\n                    clusters. Photogenerated carriers with strong redox capability and LSPR‐generated hot electrons are separated by the S‐scheme carrier transfer pathway. Under AM 1.5G illumination, the WOCN‐based LOBs exhibit an ultralow overpotential of 0.04 V and a round‐trip efficiency of 98.75%. Even under NIR illumination, an overpotential of 0.34 V and a round‐trip efficiency of 90.12% are achieved, demonstrating an effective NIR response in photo‐assisted LOBs for the first time. This work opens a new avenue for designing plasmonic S‐scheme heterojunctions toward next‐generation energy storage systems with full solar spectrum utilization.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.2006350?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"锂氧电池","sc":6.0,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"针对Li-O2电池过电势大、多数光阴极难以同时实现高效电荷分离、足够氧化还原能力和宽带光响应的问题，研究构建了等离子体S型异质结光阴极W18O49/g-C3N4(WOCN)，其中W18O49作为氧化半导体，实现光辅助Li-O2电池的宽带响应和超低过电势。","kp":["Li-O2电池[等离子体S型异质结光电阴极]: W18O49基，实现宽带光响应与超低过电势"]},{"t":"ALDH 抑制引发的光催化破坏癌症干性可塑性","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Light‐driven photoredox catalysis can shift intracellular NADH/NAD\n                    +\n                    balance by oxidizing NADH, but intracellular NADH pools are dynamically replenished through enzyme‐coupled redox metabolism. We show that ALDH‐mediated restoration of NADH/NAD\n                    +\n                    balance can buffer photoredox‐induced NADH depletion, providing a design rationale for coupling enzyme inhibition with photoredox catalysis. To counteract this redox‐buffering process, we introduce an enzymatic–photocatalytic strategy, termed E–PC, that integrates ALDH inhibition with NIR‐driven photocatalytic NADH oxidation within a single molecular construct. A small‐molecule conjugate,\n                    DE‐Et\n                    , was constructed by covalently linking DEAB, which can inhibit ALDH, to a near‐infrared (NIR)–active Nile Blue Sulfide–derived photocatalyst (NBS) through a ROS‐cleavable thioacetal linker. Upon NIR irradiation,\n                    DE‐Et\n                    releases DEAB while catalytically oxidizing intracellular NADH through single‐electron transfer, thereby attenuating ALDH‐mediated redox restoration and sustaining NADH/NAD\n                    +\n                    imbalance. This dual action compromises mitochondrial ATP production and activates caspase‐3/GSDME‐dependent pyroptosis. In stemness‐enriched tumor models,\n                    DE‐Et\n                    suppresses ALDH activity, clonogenic growth, spheroid integrity, and tumor growth in vivo. Local photoactivation further promotes systemic antitumor immune responses, consistent with immunogenic pyroptotic cell death. E–PC thus establishes a chemical strategy for light‐activated co‐delivery of photoredox catalysis and inhibition of a tumor‐overexpressed enzyme, converting an adaptive enzymatic buffer into a therapeutic vulnerability.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5856873?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化抗癌","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":1.5,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"研究发现ALDH酶介导的NADH/NAD+平衡恢复可缓冲光氧化还原催化引起的胞内NADH损耗，据此提出酶-光催化(E-PC)策略，将ALDH抑制与近红外驱动的光催化NADH氧化整合于单一分子构建中，通过小分子偶联物DE-Et破坏癌细胞干性可塑性，为酶抑制与光催化耦合提供设计依据。","kp":["光催化抗癌策略[癌症干性破坏]: ALDH酶抑制耦合光氧化还原催化，阻断NADH/NAD+平衡的酶促恢复"]},{"t":"环丁烷β-氨基醇的模块化和立体选择性合成","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Cyclobutane\n                    β\n                    ‐amino alcohols are valuable structural motifs, yet their development has lagged behind that of five‐ and six‐membered analogs due to limited synthetic accessibility. In this work, we report a general and modular strategy for the synthesis of diversely substituted cyclobutane\n                    β\n                    ‐amino alcohols. The electronic structure of 1,2‐azaborines is leveraged to achieve regioselective mono‐ and difunctionalization at all four carbon positions. The installed functionalities are subsequently translated into cyclobutane\n                    β\n                    ‐amino alcohol frameworks through a tandem photoisomerization–hydrogenation–oxidation sequence. This strategy provides access to eight distinct substitution patterns with high levels of modularity and diastereoselectivity.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1530338?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"环丁烷合成","sc":4.5,"scd":{"b":5.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"研究报道了一种通用、模块化的环丁烷β-氨基醇合成策略：利用1,2-氮硼烷的电子结构实现全部四个碳位点的区域选择性单/双官能化，随后通过光异构化-加氢-氧化串联序列将官能团转化为环丁烷β-氨基醇骨架，实现多样化取代的立体选择性合成，弥补四元环类似物合成方法滞后于五、六元环类似物的不足。","kp":["环丁烷β-氨基醇[立体选择性合成]: 利用1,2-氮硼杂环的电子结构实现模块化、立体选择性合成策略"]},{"t":"用于高盐度离子热电材料的富羰基非离子共价有机框架纳米通道","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    High‐salinity electrolytes coupled with low‐grade heat offer an attractive opportunity for ionic thermoelectric conversion, yet conventional fixed‐charge membranes rapidly lose ion permselectivity in concentrated media because Donnan exclusion is strongly screened. Here, we report an isoreticular series of nonionic covalent organic framework membranes with comparable one‐dimensional nanochannels but systematically varied pore‐wall oxygen chemistry. Hydroxyl‐substitution‐regulated hydrazone‐to‐β‐ketoenamine tautomerism generates carbonyl‐enriched BthTb‐3OH nanochannels, which preferentially partition and transport cations while suppressing anion migration without relying on covalently anchored charges. Across diverse electrolytes, BthTb‐3OH exhibits broadly cation‐favored transport, with particularly strong cation/anion mobility contrasts in sulfate‐ and phosphate‐containing media. Experiments and molecular dynamics simulations further reveal that the carbonyl‐rich channels couple high K\n                    +\n                    permselectivity with rapid K\n                    +\n                    conduction under concentrated‐salt conditions. K\n                    3\n                    PO\n                    4\n                    preconditioning reorganizes the confined transport landscape through retained phosphate/K\n                    +\n                    species within the carbonyl‐rich nanochannels, facilitating K\n                    +\n                    transport and amplifying thermodiffusive cation/anion contrast in sulfate media. Consequently, the conditioned membrane delivers a peak power density of 224.2 W m\n                    −2\n                    in saturated K\n                    2\n                    SO\n                    4\n                    under a 50 K temperature difference, establishing nonionic COF nanochannels as a charge‐screening‐resistant platform for high‐salinity ionic thermoelectrics.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.4046032?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"离子热电","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"针对高盐度下固定电荷膜因Donnan排斥被强屏蔽而迅速丧失离子选择性的问题，研究报道一系列具有可比一维纳米通道但孔壁氧化学系统变化的非离子共价有机框架膜。羟基取代调控的腙-β-酮烯胺互变异构生成富羰基的BthTb-3OH纳米通道，无需共价锚定电荷即可优先分配和传输阳离子并抑制阴离子迁移，适用于高盐度离子热电转换。","kp":["膜材料[高盐度离子热电转换]: 非离子共价有机框架膜","失效机制[传统固定电荷膜在高盐电解质]: Donnan排斥被强屏蔽导致离子选择性快速丧失"]},{"t":"正交光化学限制结晶可实现机械稳健、可打印的形状可编程聚合物","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Shape‐programmable polymers are promising for soft robotics, minimally invasive medicine, and deployable structures. However, integrating high mechanical robustness, versatile shape programmability, and excellent printability into a single material system remains challenging. Here, an orthogonal photochemistry‐confined crystallization strategy is developed to fabricate mechanically robust, printable shape‐programmable polymers. This approach utilizes a rationally designed photochemical process to trigger radical polymerization and phenol coupling synchronously yet orthogonally, enabling one‐step formation of a covalent double‐network that efficiently confines polymer crystallization during solvent evaporation. The resulting homogeneous, refined crystalline domains greatly enhance stretchability (1891%) and toughness (41 MJ m\n                    −\n                    3\n                    ) by up to 63‐ and 103‐fold, respectively, compared to counterparts lacking network confinement, while also maintaining fatigue resistance over 1500 stretching cycles. The synergy between confined crystallization and double‐network confinement further confers shape reconfiguration and shape‑memory morphing, affording robust shape programmability under thermal stimuli. Moreover, the efficient photo‑mediated gelation, coupled with solvent evaporation, enables rapid and controllable solidification fully compatible with additive manufacturing. Leveraging these capabilities, and as a proof‐of‐concept, the developed polymers are printed and assembled into bioinspired soft actuators capable of integrated active actuation and precise sensing. This work provides new insight into the photochemical design of high‐performance shape‐programmable polymers and advanced soft devices.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7052006?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"形状编程聚合物","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"研究开发正交光化学限制结晶策略，制备机械稳健、可打印的形状可编程聚合物：合理设计的光化学过程同步且正交地触发自由基聚合与酚偶联，一步形成共价双网络，在溶剂蒸发过程中有效限制聚合物结晶。所得均匀、细化的材料兼具高机械强度、多样形状可编程性和优异打印性，适用于软机器人、微创医学和可展开结构。","kp":["制造策略[形状可编程聚合物]: 正交光化学限制结晶","材料特性[形状可编程聚合物]: 机械稳健、可打印、形状可编程一体化"]},{"t":"LOXL2 在单链与三螺旋中的赖氨酸氧化：对胶原相关疾病的影响","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Collagen cross‐linking is essential for the structural integrity of the extracellular matrix. In several pathological conditions, the triple‐helical core of collagen is disrupted, and proline‐rich single strands occur. Lysyl oxidases (LOXs), enzymes that initiate cross‐linking by catalyzing the oxidative deamination of lysine to allysine residues, are upregulated in disease. Surprisingly little is known about the selectivity of LOXs. LOX‐initiated cross‐linking is believed to occur exclusively in the unstructured terminal domains of collagen, the telopeptides. But is this really the case? Herein, we show, with a combination of tailored chemical probes, enzymatic assays, CD and NMR spectroscopic analyses, that LOXL2 oxidizes Lys in proline‐rich single strands but not in triple helices. A comparison of Lys‐containing collagen model peptides (CMPs) with Lys‐containing telopeptides revealed comparable or higher oxidation rates in proline‐rich segments. The data suggest that LOXL2‐initiated cross‐linking occurs in pathologically disrupted triple‐helical domains, offering insights into aberrant extracellular matrix stiffening.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.1329257?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"胶原氧化交联","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"赖氨酰氧化酶(LOXs)通过催化赖氨酸氧化脱氨为醛赖氨酸起始胶原交联，通常认为LOX引发的交联仅发生在胶原端肽的非结构化末端区域。研究利用定制化学探针、酶学测定、圆二色和NMR光谱分析表明，LOXL2可在富含脯氨酸的单链中氧化赖氨酸，而在三螺旋中不行，对胶原相关疾病中三螺旋核心破坏后富含脯氨酸单链出现的病理状况具有重要意义。","kp":["催化反应[赖氨酰氧化酶]: 催化赖氨酸氧化脱氨生成醛赖氨酸残基","酶活性[胶原相关疾病]: LOX上调表达"]},{"t":"通过氧氧化还原活化构建耐用 O3 型层状过渡金属氧化物的应变缓冲层状/岩盐异质结构","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Harnessing anionic oxygen redox is pivotal for boosting the capacity of O3‐type layered transition metal oxides for sodium ion batteries (SIBs), yet it often triggers severe lattice distortion and irreversible oxygen release. Herein, we propose an in situ electrochemical surface reconstruction strategy to stabilize the O3‐type NaNi\n                    1/3\n                    Fe\n                    1/3\n                    Mn\n                    1/3\n                    O\n                    2\n                    (NFM) cathode. By strictly controlling the initial anionic redox reactions at an ultra‐high potential of 4.6 V, a robust heterostructure comprising an ordered layered core and a disordered rocksalt shell is constructed. This unique surface architecture serves as an isotropic strain buffer that effectively mitigates particle cracking and provides dense surface passivation to suppress interfacial side reactions. Furthermore, the induced rocksalt phase stabilizes the surface TM‐O coordination, thereby preventing lattice oxygen loss during subsequent cycling. Consequently, when cycled within 2.0–4.0 V, the electrochemically pretreated cathode (DRS(4.6)@NFM) exhibits significantly reduced lattice distortion and superior electrochemical durability (capacity retention ratio of 90.77% after 300 cycles) with negligible voltage decay (retaining 98.56% of the initial voltage). Even when cycled up to 4.2 V, a capacity retention ratio of 87.4% after 300 cycles is still maintained. This work elucidates the interplay between electrochemical pretreatment and structural evolution, providing a decisive foundation for designing high‐voltage and durable sodium‐ion cathodes.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.7544135?af=R","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/钠电池","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"钠电正极材料","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.5,"t":4.5},"aip":1,"as":"钠离子电池O3型层状氧化物正极利用阴离子氧氧化还原可提升容量，但会引发严重晶格畸变和不可逆氧释放。该研究提出原位电化学表面重构策略稳定O3型NaNi1/3Fe1/3Mn1/3O2正极：在4.6V超高电位下严格控制初始阴离子氧化还原反应，构建由有序层状核心和无序岩盐壳层组成的稳健异质结构，以此缓解结构退化，提升材料耐用性。","kp":["电极材料[钠离子电池]: O3型NaNi1/3Fe1/3Mn1/3层状过渡金属氧化物","稳定化策略[抑制氧氧化还原所致晶格畸变与氧释放]: 原位电化学表面重构构建层状/岩盐异质结构应变缓冲层","容量提升机制[O3型层状氧化物]: 阴离子氧氧化还原活化"]},{"t":"通过腈捕获的异铬烯鎓中间体和 CO-to-CN 开关合成异喹啉","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Isochromenylium ions have emerged as versatile intermediates for the rapid construction of molecular complexity through cascade reactions. However, their application in catalytic annulation processes with nitriles to form isoquinolines remains largely unexplored, despite the prevalence of nitrile motifs and isoquinoline frameworks in bioactive molecules and functional materials. Here we report a catalytic cascade strategy for the efficient synthesis of isoquinolines, including enantioenriched variants, from readily available substrates. The reaction includes palladium‐catalyzed cyclization of\n                    ortho‐\n                    alkynylaryl aldehydes to generate an isochromenylium palladium species, which is captured by indium‐promoted 1,2‐addition of nitriles. Subsequent water‐assisted ring opening furnishes a Zincke‐type intermediate, followed by intramolecular condensation to deliver the isoquinoline products. This cascade process achieves a net conversion of a carbonyl (CO) unit into a nitrile‐derived carbon‐nitrogen (CN) linkage at an intermediate‐stage in a single operation. Notably, the use of malononitrile‐tethered substrates enables the synthesis of enantioenriched isoquinolines with high enantioselectivity. Mechanistic studies indicate a cooperative role of palladium and indium in promoting the 1,2‐addition of isochromenylium palladium species to the nitrile. The method exhibits excellent atom economy, good functional group tolerance, and scalability, highlighting its potential application for heterocycle synthesis.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5898322?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"异喹啉合成","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"异铬烯鎓离子是通过级联反应快速构建分子复杂性的多功能中间体，但其与腈的催化成环形成异喹啉的应用尚未被充分探索。该研究报道了一种催化级联策略，从易得底物高效合成异喹啉（包括对映富集产物）：钯催化邻炔基芳基醛环化生成异铬烯鎓钯物种，随后被铟促进的腈捕获，经CO-to-CN开关过程实现成环，为生物活性分子和功能材料中的异喹啉骨架合成提供新途径。","kp":["合成策略[异喹啉]: 催化级联反应经异铬烯鎓中间体腈捕获及CO-to-CN开关"]},{"t":"用于纳米颗粒和表面可见光功能化的 TADF 活性四唑发光体","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Thermally activated delayed fluorescence (TADF) materials have found broad use in technologies spanning displays, bioimaging, and photocatalysis. In parallel, tetrazoles have become powerful “click” reagents for light‐activated, bioorthogonal ligations, yet remain unexplored in reagents with delayed emission lifetimes. Here we report the design and synthesis of TADF‐active tetrazole luminophores with photochemical reactivity for the rapid functionalization of nanoparticles and surfaces. The combination of electron‐rich phenoxazine donors with electron‐deficient tetrazole acceptors yields luminophores with bright emission and tunable TADF lifetimes, governed by the 1,3‐dipolar cycloaddition partner. Cycloaddition with alkene dipolarophiles affords saturated dihydropyrazoles that undergo photoinduced aerobic aromatization to generate pyrazole products exhibiting pronounced turn‐on TADF behavior. Leveraging their charge‐transfer character, we also demonstrate a gold surface modified with TADF luminophores, wherein we propose the first example of reversible visible light‐induced surface adsorption. Furthermore, we demonstrate the surface functionalization of organic nanoparticles using TADF‐active materials. This work introduces a class of functional materials that combine photochemical reactivity with TADF properties, introducing a light‐driven platform for surface functionalization using TADF materials.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.9410589?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"TADF发光材料","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":2.5,"r":6.5,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"热激活延迟荧光（TADF）材料广泛用于显示、生物成像和光催化，而四唑是光激活生物正交连接的强力点击试剂，但在延迟发射寿命试剂中尚未被探索。该研究设计合成了具有光化学反应活性的TADF四唑发光体，可快速功能化纳米颗粒和表面。富电子吩噁嗪给体与缺电子四唑受体的组合产生明亮发射和可调TADF寿命，寿命由1,3-偶极环加成 partner 决定，与烯烃双极亲核体环加合可得到饱和产物。","kp":["发光材料[纳米颗粒和表面可见光功能化]: TADF活性四唑发光体","功能特性[四唑发光体]: 延迟发射寿命与光化学反应性兼具"]},{"t":"单分子分辨率鉴定衰老相关 β-半乳糖苷酶","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  The majority of human senescent cells exhibit overexpression of senescence‐associated β‐galactosidase (SA‐β‐gal), rendering this enzyme the most extensively utilized biomarker of senescence and a key prodrug target for intervening in aging. However, strategies for the authentic in situ identification of SA‐β‐gal with single‐molecule resolution have not been established, limiting the accuracy of senescence targeting. Here we present an unprecedented molecular approach to identify SA‐β‐gal in a manner that avoids dissociation from the target enzyme, which integrates the atomic hybridization of SA‐β‐gal substrates with protein‐environment‐sensitive fluorescence technology. Using this design principle, we created nine fluorescent probes with distinct working modes for the single‐molecule (target enzyme)‐resolved identification of SA‐β‐gal. Five of them formed crystal complexes with the wild‐type β‐galactosidase by binding at the active site, clearly evidencing their single‐molecule resolution capability. Our strategy, capable of both identifying and locating SA‐β‐gal, facilitated its application in dynamic single‐molecule localization microscopic imaging, achieving the in situ tracking of SA‐β‐gal in living cells at the nanoscale. Significantly, the probing of SA‐β‐gal with high fidelity enabled the precise evaluation of the aging degree in mice. As such, our research provides a promising method for the authentic in situ identification of this senescence‐associated protein with single‐molecule resolution.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.5443283?af=R","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"单分子酶检测","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":3.0,"r":7.0,"d":5.5,"t":4.5},"as":"大多数人类衰老细胞过表达衰老相关β-半乳糖苷酶（SA-β-gal），该酶是最广泛使用的衰老生物标志物和干预衰老的前药靶点。但此前缺乏单分子分辨率的真实原位鉴定SA-β-gal的策略，限制了衰老靶向的准确性。该研究提出分子方法，将SA-β-gal底物的原子杂化与蛋白质环境敏感荧光技术相结合，实现不与靶酶解离的鉴定，并据此创建了九种具有不同工作模式的荧光探针。","kp":["检测目标[衰老细胞]: 衰老相关β-半乳糖苷酶（SA-β-gal）为最广泛使用的衰老生物标志物","技术突破[SA-β-gal检测]: 实现单分子分辨率的原位鉴定"]},{"t":"用于圆形 3D 打印的可见光介导的光点击和热可逆呋喃二硫缩醛化学","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Photoclick chemistry has become essential for photocurable 3D printing due to its rapid, selective, and spatiotemporally controlled bond formation. Advancing toward circular manufacturing, however, requires photoclick systems that also enable thermally reversible bond cleavage for material recycling. To meet this requirement, we report a furanic dithioacetal‐based photoclick platform that integrates visible‐light‐induced polymerization with intrinsic thermal reversibility. The monomers, derived from bio‐based furanic aldehydes and thiols, are solvent‐free liquids, ensuring homogeneous formulations well‐suited for 3D printing. To address the spectral mismatch of conventional photocatalysts, a thioxanthone‐based photoacid system is investigated, enabling efficient bond formation under visible light compatible with commercial digital light processing (DLP) printing. The resulting polymer networks exhibit tunable crosslinking densities, allowing precise control over mechanical properties. Crucially, the dynamic furanic dithioacetal linkages enable depolymerization of the printed materials into re‐printable oligomers, with no loss of performance over multiple recycling cycles. This work establishes a chemically integrated strategy that unifies visible‐light processability, solvent‐free formulation, bio‐based origin, and closed‐loop recyclability, thus establishing a robust foundation for circular photopolymer platforms.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/anie.3093462?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Angewandte Chemie International Edition: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光固化3D打印","sc":5.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":4.0},"as":"光点击化学因快速、选择性、时空可控的成键而成为光固化3D打印的核心，但实现循环制造还需要热可逆断键以回收材料。该研究报道基于呋喃二硫缩醛的光点击平台，集可见光诱导聚合与固有热可逆性于一体。单体源自生物基呋喃醛和硫醇，为无溶剂液体，保证配方均质适用于3D打印。针对传统光催化剂的光谱失配问题，研究了基于噻吨酮的光酸体系以实现高效聚合。","kp":["材料体系[圆形3D打印]: 呋喃二硫缩醛光点击平台","功能特性[该光点击体系]: 可见光诱导聚合与内在热可逆性结合，实现材料回收"]},{"t":"软刚性液态金属-SiC混合填料可实现复合电介质的优异非线性电导率和电场调节","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Nonlinear dielectrics with superior electric field regulation capabilities are essential for advanced power equipment. However, traditional nonlinear dielectric materials depend on an electrical percolation mechanism, requiring high concentrations of nonlinear conductive filler that degrade insulation and mechanical properties. Herein, we propose a synergistic strategy using a hybrid filler of soft liquid metal and rigid silicon carbide particles (LM‐SiCp) to develop insulating nonlinear composite dielectrics. The unique LM‐SiCp structure enables a favorable network of potential barriers at low fields and steep exponential current growth at high fields, yielding an excellent “low onset, high gain” nonlinear behavior. The resulting composites exhibit an impressive nonlinear coefficient of ∼7.55 and a markedly reduced threshold field strength from 4.81 to 3.41 kV/mm. It also achieves improved toughness (2.29 MJ/m\n                    3\n                    ), thermal conductivity (0.36 W/mK), high breakdown strength (∼33.4 kV/mm), and low dielectric loss (&lt;0.03), which ensure the stable performance of the composite dielectric under practical engineering conditions. This strategy offers a novel design concept for high‐performance composite dielectrics capable of effective electric field modulation in power equipment.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74306?af=R","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/电网技术/其它电网技术","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"非线性电介质","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":4.5},"as":"先进电力设备需要具有优异电场调节能力的非线性电介质，但传统材料依赖电渗流机制，需高浓度非线性导电填料，损害绝缘和机械性能。该研究提出软性液态金属与刚性碳化硅颗粒（LM-SiCp）混合填料的协同策略：独特的LM-SiCp结构在低场下形成有利势垒网络，高场下产生陡峭指数电流增长，实现'低起始、高增益'的非线性行为，开发出绝缘性非线性复合电介质。","kp":["复合填料[非线性电介质]: 软性液态金属与刚性碳化硅混合填料","传统缺陷[传统非线性电介质]: 依赖电渗透机制需高浓度非线性导电填料，损害绝缘与机械性能"]},{"t":"原位衍生的 La​​-Ni 基钙钛矿上的叶绿体模拟界面，用于太阳能驱动的 CO2 还原为 CH4","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    Artificial photosynthesis technology holds great promise for sustainable energy conversion and value‐added chemical synthesis, yet integrating efficient light absorption with high product selectivity remains a major challenge. This study constructs an Ni‐La\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    /La\n                    2\n                    NiO\n                    4\n                    catalyst through in situ perovskite derivation that mechanistically and functionally mimics the chloroplast for artificial photosynthesis by coupling photo and photothermal catalysis with the integration of broad‐spectrum light harvesting, directional charge transfer, as well as CO\n                    2\n                    adsorption and hydrogenation. Three functional interfaces are formed: La\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    ‐La\n                    2\n                    NiO\n                    4\n                    (Z‐scheme), Ni‐La\n                    2\n                    NiO\n                    4\n                    (Schottky junction), and La\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    (adsorption)‐Ni(activation). The two heterojunctions facilitate electron transfer to metallic Ni nanoparticles, which activates H\n                    +\n                    to form an NADPH‐like surface Ni‐H species by enabling the collection of photo and photothermal generated electrons. Meanwhile, the Lewis‐basic La\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    captures CO\n                    2\n                    and promotes its activation at the La\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    ‐Ni interface. In CO\n                    2\n                    ‐to‐CH\n                    4\n                    conversion, Ni‐La\n                    2\n                    O\n                    3\n                    /La\n                    2\n                    NiO\n                    4\n                    demonstrates an exceptional CH\n                    4\n                    production rate of 9.96 µmol h\n                    −1\n                    g\n                    −1\n                    and a selectivity of 92.5% under natural conditions (i.e., AM 1.5 irradiation, ambient temperature, and atmospheric pressure) without external assistance, which outperforms pure La\n                    2\n                    NiO\n                    4\n                    by 10.2 and 4.6 times, respectively. This work advances a new strategy for efficient solar‐to‐fuel conversion.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74829?af=R","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/电化学过程/CO2RR","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"光催化还原","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":4.5},"as":"人工光合技术在可持续能源转换和高附加值化学品合成方面前景广阔，但将高效光吸收与高产物选择性结合仍是重大挑战。该研究通过钙钛矿原位衍生构建Ni-La2O3/La2NiO4催化剂，从机制和功能上模拟叶绿体：耦合光催化与光热催化，集成宽谱光吸收、定向电荷转移以及CO2活化，实现太阳能驱动CO2还原为CH4。","kp":["催化剂[太阳能驱动CO2还原制CH4]: Ni-La2O3/La2NiO4原位衍生La-Ni基钙钛矿","设计理念[该催化剂]: 叶绿体模拟界面集成高效光吸收与高产物选择性"]},{"t":"活性聚合物软物质的自主折叠","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Origami provides a versatile framework for shape‐morphing, yet existing systems are limited to transitions between an initial state and a predetermined folding outcome, offering little tunability after fabrication. Here we introduce a dynamic “living” polymer that continuously remodels its main‐chain network through a growth process, enabling post‐fabrication control over size, mechanical properties, and geometry. Incorporated as active crease layers, these polymers drive autonomous folding when supplied with “nutrient solutions” containing monomers, crosslinkers and catalysts. The associated dihedral angles are determined by growth kinetics and crease composition. Iterative regrowth reprograms folding pathways and increases mechanical stiffness up to 50 times. We demonstrate rigid (Miura) and non‐rigid patterns (square‐twist) that can be repeatedly reconfigured. Through this work, we establish a foundation for adaptive structures with unlimited re‐programmability, opening avenues for applications in biomedical wearable devices and multifunctional deployable systems.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74348?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"活性聚合物折叠","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":4.5,"t":4.0},"as":"现有折纸形变系统仅限于初始状态与预定折叠结果之间的转变，制成后可调性有限。该研究引入动态'活性'聚合物，通过生长过程持续重塑主链网络，实现制造后对尺寸、机械性能和几何形状的控制。作为活性折痕层，这些聚合物在供给含单体、交联剂和催化剂的'营养液'后驱动自主折叠，二面角由生长动力学和折痕组成决定。迭代再生可重编程折叠路径，并将机械刚度提高至50倍。","kp":["活性聚合物[自主折叠软物质]: 通过生长过程持续重塑主链网络，实现制造后对尺寸、力学性能和几何形状的调控"]},{"t":"通过操纵尖晶石四面体和八面体位点活性来切换过一硫酸盐氧化还原路线，用于多场景废水处理","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  \n                    For diverse wastewater treatment scenarios, achieving controllable switching of reactive oxygen species within a unified catalytic system remains a major challenge. Here, an inert cation substitution strategy is proposed to regulate tetrahedral and octahedral Co activity in Co\n                    3\n                    O\n                    4\n                    , enabling controllable switching between radical and nonradical pathways. Octahedral‐Co‐enriched ZnCo\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    (ZCO) selectively directs peroxymonosulfate (PMS) activation toward the\n                    1\n                    O\n                    2\n                    pathway (95.8% contribution), whereas tetrahedral‐Co‐dominated CoAl\n                    2\n                    O\n                    4\n                    (CAO) favors radical oxidation, with •OH (76.4%) and SO\n                    4\n                    •−\n                    (21.7%) dominating. This polyhedral‐dependent pathway control leads to distinct oxidation behaviors. Notably, the ZCO/PMS system achieved nearly 100% o‐nitrophenol (ONP) degradation within 4 min, with a\n                    k\n                    ‐value of 71.81 min\n                    −1\n                    M\n                    −1\n                    , 32.2 times that of Co\n                    3\n                    O\n                    4\n                    . Multiple lines of evidence reveal that polyhedral‐site engineering governs PMS adsorption geometry, interfacial charge redistribution, and O─O bond activation, thereby determining pathway selection. These differentiated functions were further translated into bench‐scale municipal wastewater treatment, with ZCO/PMS increasing the effluent Biochemical oxygen demand/chemical oxygen demand (BOD/COD) ratio from below 0.3 to consistently above 0.5 over 80 h and CAO/PMS decreasing the effluent TOC from ∼25 mg L\n                    −1\n                    to below 12 mg L\n                    −1\n                    over 60 h. Both systems exhibited low biotoxicity and favorable sustainability, offering a practical route toward selective energy‐efficient advanced oxidation.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74854?af=R","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"废水催化氧化","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":3.5,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":4.5},"as":"在多种废水处理场景下，统一催化体系中实现活性氧物种的可控切换是重大挑战。该研究提出惰性阳离子取代策略调控Co3O4中四面体和八面体Co活性，实现自由基与非自由基路径的可控切换：八面体Co富集的ZnCo2O4（ZCO）选择性引导过一硫酸盐（PMS）活化走向单线态氧（1O2）路径，贡献率达95.8%，而四面体Co则导向其他路径，适用于多场景废水处理。","kp":["催化路线切换[Co3O4尖晶石]: 通过惰性阳离子取代调控四面体与八面体Co位点活性，实现自由基与非自由基路径可控切换","应用场景[过一硫酸盐氧化]: 多场景废水处理"]},{"t":"用于脑肿瘤生物制剂输送的先进材料","b":"ABSTRACT\n                  Brain cancer remains a major global health challenge due to its high morbidity and mortality. Current standard therapies are often limited by incomplete tumor resection, systemic toxicity, and the inability to effectively penetrate the blood‐brain barrier (BBB), which restricts drug delivery to the tumor site. These challenges underscore the urgent need for innovative therapeutic strategies that can overcome these barriers and improve treatment outcomes. Biological materials encompass a diverse range of molecules, from small peptides to monoclonal antibodies, either derived from living organisms or synthetically synthesized. Unlike traditional therapies, biologics provide a more targeted approach, including specific tumor targeting, immune system modulation, and regenerating damaged cells. Although biologics offer significant promise for brain cancer treatment, major challenges associated with blood–brain and tumour barriers continue to limit their translation, and comprehensive reviews bridging therapeutic advances with delivery technologies remain scarce. While individual biologic classes have been extensively studied, a unified assessment of these modalities and their delivery optimization is still needed. This review addresses the current gap by critically examining recent advances in biologic therapies and evaluating emerging invasive and non‐invasive delivery strategies to enhance their therapeutic efficacy in brain cancer.","d":"2026-08-29","u":"https://advanced.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1002/adma.74760?af=R","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"Wiley: Advanced Materials: Table of Contents","i":"l","source":"news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","sr":"literature/news_with_abstract_2026-08-30.csv","tg":"研究论文","tp":"脑药递材料","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":3.0},"as":"脑癌因高发病率和高死亡率仍是全球重大健康挑战。现有标准疗法常受限于肿瘤切除不完全、全身毒性以及无法有效穿透血脑屏障（BBB），导致药物难以到达肿瘤部位。生物制剂涵盖从小分子肽到单克隆抗体的多种分子，可源自生物体或化学合成。与传统疗法不同，生物制剂提供更具针对性的策略，包括特异性肿瘤靶向、免疫系统调节等，为克服上述屏障、改善治疗效果提供了创新途径。","kp":["递送挑战[脑肿瘤生物制剂]: 血脑屏障限制药物输送至肿瘤部位，现有疗法受限于切除不完全和全身毒性"]},{"t":"中国港口拥堵导致供应链运营问题","b":"Congested Chinese Ports Cause Supply Chain Operation Issues\nPrioritise Us\non Google\nShanghai and Ningbo-Zhoushan have suspended operations for the third time in as many months (Image source: Getty Images/YoungNH)\nPressure on Chinese ports continues, with typhoons and bad weather conditions further contributing to shutdowns across some of region’s largest ports\nWith Shanghai and Ningbo, two of the world’s largest ports, closing due to Typhoon Saudel, supply chains will likely soon feel the effects of this operational blockage.\nTyphoon Saudel, which made landfall on China's eastern coast on 28 August, forced the ports of Shanghai and Ningbo-Zhoushan to suspend operations for the third time in as many months. As a consequence, global container port congestion is being pushed to a record high.\nThe Port of Ningbo-Zhoushan halted empty container operations from 4pm local time, followed by a full terminal shutdown at 8pm. Shanghai's Yangshan and Waigaoqiao terminals suspended operations shortly after, with ocean carrier Hapag-Lloyd warning both ports were expected to remain closed through the weekend.\nThe port congestion crisis in numbers:\n4.3 million TEU of global containership capacity is currently stranded, equivalent to 12.6% of the world's container fleet, according to shipping analyst Linerlytica.\nNorth Asia accounts for roughly half of that total, with around 2.2 million TEU tied up around Chinese ports.\nShanghai recorded a 70% drop in port-call movements as Saudel approached, according to MarineTraffic data.\nShips waited an average of 3.6 days for a berth in early August due to typhoon disruption, according to Drewry.\nGlobal average ship waiting times have nearly doubled between 2019 and 2026, per Drewry's Ports and Terminals Insight.\nA pattern, not an isolated storm\nimpact climate change is likely to have on supply chains\nof the future is significant. Saudel is now the third named storm to disrupt China's east coast ports since July alone.\nTyphoon Bavi shut terminals in mid-July, followed by Typhoon Dolphin in early August, which left more than 2.4 million TEU stranded and pushed berth waiting times at some Yangshan terminals to as much as 12 days.\nThe risk of port congestion is increasing. However, terminal operators in most regions are not failing to invest and will continue to invest in port capacity, although ultimately they cannot finance “buffer capacity” on their own. The container shipping ecosystem is currently built to optimise cost – not resilience.\nAnalyst opinion from Drewry’s Ports and Terminals Insight Report\nZhejiang, home to Ningbo, has now recorded three typhoon landfalls this year, equalling a provincial record last set in 2004. Each storm has arrived before the backlog from the previous one had fully cleared, compounding supply chain delays rather than resolving them between events.\nWhy this is a structural problem, not just weather\nShipping consultancy Drewry argues the recurring congestion is not solely due to storms or terminal operators failing to invest in capacity. Its analysis found terminal operators in China and Europe have, in the main, continued investing, but have raised capacity more slowly than cargo volumes have grown, favouring higher asset utilisation over spare capacity.\n“The container shipping ecosystem is currently built to optimise cost, not resilience”, Drewry's analysts wrote in a recent note, adding that terminal operators cannot finance buffer capacity on their own.\nThat framing matters for supply chain leaders assessing why\ndisruption at Chinese ports\nkeeps recurring rather than easing after each individual storm passes.\nA system with limited spare capacity absorbs shocks poorly, meaning even a routine seasonal typhoon can generate weeks of knock-on delay across dependent trade lanes.\nWhere the pressure is spreading\nIt is not China alone that is experiencing congestion. Freight platform Freightos has reported carriers omitting Shanghai port calls entirely due to severe congestion, with multi-day delays also affecting Shenzhen and Hong Kong.\nAnalysts have separately flagged mounting pressure on transit slots at the Panama Canal and equipment-related congestion at South Africa's Durban port, suggesting capacity strain is building across more than one global chokepoint all at once.\nFor shippers and logistics teams navigating global trade, the practical risk extends beyond delayed vessels. Vessel bunching after each closure increases the likelihood of blanked sailings, rolled cargo and containers being bumped from bookings altogether. This disruption can ripple through inland transport networks long after a port itself reopens.\nIt is a realistic near-term risk that Shanghai and Ningbo could be hit with yet further disruption in the coming months (Image source: Lloyd's List)\nWhat supply chain leaders should watch\nWith typhoon season in the region typically running into October, it is a realistic near-term risk that Shanghai and Ningbo could be hit with yet further disruption in the coming months.\nDrewry's underlying argument suggests the more durable question is not when the current backlog clears, but whether the industry's cost-optimised capacity model can absorb repeat shocks without each one compounding the last.\nKey partners cited:\nDrewry is a global maritime research and consulting firm providing analysis on shipping, ports and terminals, including its regular Ports and Terminals Insight service. The firm tracks vessel waiting times, congestion trends and terminal capacity investment across major global gateways.\nLinerlytica\nA specialised container shipping market intelligence and analytics firm. Linerlytica provides real-time data on global fleet deployment, monitoring metrics such as stranded vessel capacity, idle fleet tonnage, and regional container ship bottlenecks across North Asia and major trade lanes.\nFreightos\nA digital ocean and air freight booking platform and logistics data provider. Freightos aggregates ocean carrier schedule changes, spot rate movements, and operational alerts, providing real-time intelligence on port omissions, multi-day delays, and regional cargo congestion across key gateways like Shanghai, Shenzhen, and Hong Kong.\nKuehne+Nagel\nOne of the world’s largest global logistics and freight forwarding companies. Kuehne+Nagel delivers live operational updates and disruption advisories through its Seaexplorer platform, tracking global port congestion indicators, container movement delays, and regional supply chain bottlenecks.\nHapag-Lloyd\nOne of the world’s top global ocean container carriers, operating an extensive liner network. Hapag-Lloyd issues primary operational advisories, customer updates, and schedule notifications regarding terminal shutdowns, vessel rerouting, and berth availability at major Chinese gateways.\nMarineTraffic\nA global vessel tracking and maritime intelligence platform powered by real-time Automated Identification System (AIS) data. MarineTraffic monitors global ship positions, port arrival/departure volumes, and vessel traffic density, providing precise data on drops in port-call movements during\nsevere weather disruptions\nCompany portals\nFreightos\nHapag-Lloyd\nKuehne + Nagel\nLinerlytica","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://supplychaindigital.com/news/congested-chinese-ports-cause-supply-chain-operation-issues","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/水路运输","a":"Supply Chain Digital","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察","tp":"港口拥堵","sc":4.1,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":5.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":"台风Saudel于8月28日登陆中国东部沿海，导致上海港和宁波舟山港在三个月内第三次暂停运营。这两个全球最大港口的关闭使全球集装箱港口拥堵被推至创纪录高位，供应链将很快受到这一运营阻断的影响。台风和恶劣天气进一步加剧了该地区主要港口的停摆，对中国港口的压力持续存在。","kp":["中国港口运营[台风Saudel影响]: 上海港与宁波舟山港三个月内第三次停运"]},{"t":"Slate will offer a high roof cargo version of its compact pickup – and you can buy it!","b":"Commercial EVs\nelectric trucks\nJo Borrás\n| Aug 30 2026 - 6:38 am PT\nHigh-roof Slate Auto cargo; made w/ AI.\n-backed Slate Auto is serious about the commercial truck market, and the company’s Fleet Business Development team shared some of the most detailed information about the rumored high roof cargo kit yet at the brand’s ongoing Portland ride-along event.\nInstagram account\nslateautomods\nreported that Christian Kreipke,\nSlate Auto’s Fleet Business Development and Government Sales Lead\n, confirmed that a high-roof cargo topper conceptually similar to the brand’s existing SUV kit would be made available to buyers of the minimalistic, $25,000 “\naffordable\n” truck.\nThe best part? The new cargo kit isn’t just for fleet buyers:\nthe Slate high roof cargo topper will be available to anyone who wants one\nView this post on Instagram\nA post shared by Slate Auto Mods (@slateautomods)\nIn case the embedded post vanishes, Slate Auto Mods claims the cargo kit will be available as both a “standard square back” and in the new high-roof version rendered, above. That version includes a spoiler cap replacing the top of the cab for a consistent roofline, and both versions will be available in white and black for a starting price of around $3,000.\nAdditionally, the post claims Kreipke said that, “companies and municipalities are already dreaming up creative uses including refrigeration units, slide outs, and even mobile vending machines.” The executive also claimed that the next-generation of the Slate would maintain the same basic design dimensions, a move that, if true,\nwould give third party upfitters and aftermarket manufacturers additional confidence to build equipment around the Slate without worrying about redesigns making their products obsolete overnight\n– something he noted had been a consistent problem with Ford.\nSlate Auto continues to reveal the final shape of its go to market strategy as we inch towards the brand’s first deliveries\n, and it remains to be seen how successful the brand will ultimately be. One thing that is certain, however, is that the compact pickup is back.\nIf you’re considering going solar, it’s always a good idea to get quotes from a few installers. To make sure you find a trusted, reliable solar installer near you that offers competitive pricing, check out\nEnergySage\n, a free service that makes it easy for you to go solar. It has hundreds of pre-vetted solar installers competing for your business, ensuring you get high-quality solutions and save 20-30% compared to going it alone. Plus, it’s free to use, and you won’t get sales calls until you select an installer and share your phone number with them.\nYour personalized solar quotes are easy to compare online and you’ll get access to unbiased Energy Advisors to help you every step of the way.\nGet started here\nFeatured\nSubscribe to Electrek on YouTube for exclusive videos\nand subscribe to the\nComments\nI’ve been involved in the electric vehicle transition in one way or another since 1997, and have covered the industry as a journalist since 2008. You can catch more of my work on Quick Charge and The Heavy Equipment Podcast with Mike Switzer.\nNOTE: any opinions expressed here are solely my own and do not necessarily reflect those of the Federal government, the State of Illinois, Electrek, or anyone else. Nothing here should be interpreted as a statement of official policy, legal guidance, or an endorsement unless expressly labeled as such.\nJo Borrás's favorite gear\nENERGYSAGE\nFind a reliable home solar and battery installer and save 20-30% compared to going it alone.\nQmerit makes electrification easy — connecting you with trusted pros who get it done right.","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://electrek.co/2026/08/30/report-slate-will-offer-a-high-roof-cargo-version-of-its-compact-pickup/","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"Electrek","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"产业进展","tp":"电动皮卡","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":6.0},"as":"亚马逊支持的Slate Auto在波特兰试驾活动上披露了高顶货箱版本的详细信息。公司车队业务发展与政府销售负责人Christian Kreipke证实，将为这款售价2.5万美元的极简皮卡推出高顶货箱，概念上类似其现有的SUV套件。值得注意的是，该货箱套件不仅面向车队买家，任何有意购买者均可获得。这表明Slate Auto对商用车市场的重视。","kp":["Slate Auto高顶货舱套件[紧凑型皮卡商业市场]: 已获公司车队业务开发团队证实将上市"]},{"t":"E-quipment highlight: Tiger electric baggage tug hauls 30 TONS [video]","b":"Commercial EVs\naviation\nJo Borrás\n| Aug 30 2026 - 6:00 am PT\nThe Tiger Li-Ion electric baggage tug is quietly revolutionizing the airport ground handling and ground support equipment (GSE) market with silent, emission-free running, massive fuel savings, and a 60,000 lb. (!) payload capacity.\nDespite their fun, approachable appearance, airport baggage tugs are seriously capable machines, geared down to produce the sort of immense torque necessary to haul literal tons of luggage (\nor airplanes\n) from terminal to tarmac hundreds of times a day on duty cycles that would trash your neighbor’s “tough guy” pickup in under a month.\nThat amount of work requires huge amounts of energy and, as a consequence, huge amounts of fuel. But, while diesel prices are surging unpredictably,\nelectric fuel\nhas proven to be significantly less expensive and more predictable, leading Tiger’s parent company,\nto claim that its electric Li-Ion tug will save fleet operators more than $19,000 per year in fuel alone\nTiger math\nElectric vs. ICE GSE costs; via Tiger.\nThe electric tug will also save more than 3.5 tons of carbon emissions per year – a big swing at airports that employ dozens or hundreds of these things. For their part, Waev executives absolutely get it.\nThe future of GSE is electric\n,” explained Waev president and CEO Keith Simon, at the Tiger Li-Ion’s launch in 2022. “Electric makes sense – for the work, for safety, and for the environment. As airports and operators are prioritizing sustainability, carbon-neutral, and net-zero solutions like never before, we are bringing high performance, trusted solutions that enable this.”\nThe Tiger Li-Ion tow tractor offers up to 60 miles of range from its 48 kWh battery pack. That’s more than enough to cover a day of operation at all but the biggest and busiest airports, and when the batteries run low, Tiger’s tugs keep charging simple by designing the tug to work with a facility’s existing 120V electrical infrastructure, or on a 240V, 50-amp L2 charger where available.\nTiger’s electric baggage tug ships with a number of industry-standard safety features, including anti-rollover technology that automatically reduces speed through tight turns, programmable speed controls that can be set to 10, 12, or 15 mph, and an automatic brake interlock to prevent unintended acceleration. An operator sensor cuts drive power if the driver leaves the seat, while high-visibility LED lighting ensures tractor stays visible in low-light scenarios.\nYou can check out Tiger’s recently released Li-Ion overview video, below, then let us know what you think of the ongoing electrification of America’s airports in the comments.\nTiger Li-Ion tractor overview\nIf you’re considering going solar, it’s always a good idea to get quotes from a few installers. To make sure you find a trusted, reliable solar installer near you that offers competitive pricing, check out\nEnergySage\n, a free service that makes it easy for you to go solar. It has hundreds of pre-vetted solar installers competing for your business, ensuring you get high-quality solutions and save 20-30% compared to going it alone. Plus, it’s free to use, and you won’t get sales calls until you select an installer and share your phone number with them.\nYour personalized solar quotes are easy to compare online and you’ll get access to unbiased Energy Advisors to help you every step of the way.\nGet started here\nFeatured\nSubscribe to Electrek on YouTube for exclusive videos\nand subscribe to the\nComments\nI’ve been involved in the electric vehicle transition in one way or another since 1997, and have covered the industry as a journalist since 2008. You can catch more of my work on Quick Charge and The Heavy Equipment Podcast with Mike Switzer.\nNOTE: any opinions expressed here are solely my own and do not necessarily reflect those of the Federal government, the State of Illinois, Electrek, or anyone else. Nothing here should be interpreted as a statement of official policy, legal guidance, or an endorsement unless expressly labeled as such.\nJo Borrás's favorite gear\nENERGYSAGE\nFind a reliable home solar and battery installer and save 20-30% compared to going it alone.\nQmerit makes electrification easy — connecting you with trusted pros who get it done right.","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://electrek.co/2026/08/30/e-quipment-highlight-tiger-electric-baggage-tug-hauls-30-tons-video/","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/航空","a":"Electrek","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"产业进展","tp":"电动拖车","sc":5.5,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":7.0,"r":4.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"Tiger锂电电动行李牵引车正在革新机场地面处理和地面支持设备（GSE）市场，具备静音、零排放运行和大幅节省燃油的特点，牵引能力达60,000磅（约30吨）。机场行李牵引车需要巨大扭矩，每天数百次在航站楼与停机坪之间拖运数吨行李甚至飞机，工作量巨大。在柴油价格剧烈波动的背景下，电动方案提供了能源成本优势。","kp":["载荷能力[Tiger锂电池电动行李牵引车]: 60,000磅(约30吨)","运行特性[机场地面保障设备]: 静音、零排放、大幅节省燃料"]},{"t":"4D 打印解释：它与 3D 打印有何不同以及下一步的发展方向","b":"Imagine printing an object that does not remain exactly as it came out of the printer. Expose it to heat, water, light, or another trigger, and it could bend, fold, expand, or otherwise change its shape. That is the basic idea behind 4D printing . It builds on 3D printing by adding something unusual to the finished object: the ability to respond to its surroundings and change over time. The concept was popularized by architect and computer scientist Skylar Tibbits in 2013. More than a decade later, researchers are developing increasingly sophisticated materials and printing techniques that could turn the idea into useful engineering systems. So, what exactly is 4D printing? Traditional 3D printing creates a physical object by depositing or solidifying material layer by layer according to a digital design. Once printed, the object generally has a fixed geometry and performs its intended function without fundamentally changing shape. 4D printing uses a similar additive-manufacturing foundation, but the printed structure contains programmable, stimulus-responsive materials. These materials can be engineered to respond to triggers such as temperature, moisture, light, pH changes, magnetic fields, or electrical stimulation. The response can be designed into the material and the way its structure is printed, allowing a flat or compact object to transform into a predetermined configuration. Importantly, the “fourth dimension” is time. It does not mean that engineers are printing objects with an additional spatial dimension. 3D vs 4D printing: What’s the difference? The simplest distinction is that 3D printing creates the structure, while 4D printing can create a structure that changes after fabrication. A conventional 3D-printed component might be designed to maintain its shape throughout its service life. A 4D-printed component could instead be programmed to transform when it encounters a particular environmental condition. The two technologies can even use similar printing hardware. The major difference lies in the materials, structural design, and programming of the object’s response. That makes 4D printing less about inventing an entirely new type of printer and more about combining additive manufacturing with smart materials and carefully engineered structures. What materials make 4D printing possible? Researchers are experimenting with several classes of responsive materials. Shape-memory polymers can be programmed to return to a particular shape after exposure to a stimulus, often heat. Hydrogels can swell or contract in response to water and other environmental conditions. Researchers are also investigating liquid-crystal elastomers and self-healing polymers, along with composite materials that combine multiple properties. The printing process can also control how different materials are arranged, allowing different sections of an object to respond differently. This creates the possibility of programmed bending, folding, or more complex movements. Where could 4D printing be used? The technology has attracted interest across several engineering fields. In medicine, researchers are investigating 4D-printed structures for drug delivery , tissue engineering, diagnostic devices, and implants that could respond to conditions inside the body. In soft robotics , printed structures could potentially act as lightweight actuators that change shape without conventional motors. Aerospace is another intriguing application. Adaptive structures could potentially change configuration in response to environmental conditions, while lightweight deployable components could be printed in compact forms and transform when activated. Researchers are also exploring applications in electronics, smart textiles, automotive components and construction, where materials that respond to their surroundings could offer capabilities conventional static components cannot. Is 4D printing ready for mass production? Not yet. Research has advanced considerably, but much of 4D printing remains at the laboratory and proof-of-concept stage. A 2025 Chemical Reviews assessment highlighted challenges involving materials, fabrication complexity and the need for further development before widespread adoption. Researchers also need better control over transformation speed, durability, repeatability and operating conditions. Scaling responsive materials into large, reliable industrial components is another major challenge. The future of 4D printing therefore may not be about replacing conventional 3D printing . Instead, the two could increasingly complement each other. 3D printing gives engineers extraordinary control over where material goes. 4D printing adds another question: what should that material do after it has been printed? That shift, from manufacturing static objects to manufacturing objects capable of adapting, could ultimately make 4D printing one of the more interesting directions in the evolution of additive manufacturing.","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://interestingengineering.com/science/4d-printing-explained-how-it-differs-from-3d-printing","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"interesting engineering","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察","tp":"4D打印","sc":4.0,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":3.0},"as":"4D打印是在3D打印基础上发展出的技术，其核心特点是打印出的物体在受到热、水、光等外部触发后，能够弯曲、折叠、膨胀或改变形状，即具备随时间响应环境变化的能力。该概念由建筑师兼计算机科学家Skylar Tibbits于2013年提出推广。十余年来，研究人员正在开发越来越复杂的材料和打印技术，以将这一理念转化为实用的工程系统。传统3D打印则是逐层沉积或固化材料构建物理物体。","kp":["4D打印[响应热/水/光等触发条件]: 打印物体可随时间弯曲、折叠、膨胀并改变形状","概念提出[Skylar Tibbits]: 2013年"]},{"t":"美国支持的阿拉斯加锑中心朝着 2027 年产量迈出重要一步","b":"Nova Minerals (Nova) reports it is close to producing antimony from its Alaskan mining project thanks to a $43.4 million Defense Production Act Title III program with the U.S. government. Key refining equipment is now on its way to the company’s Port MacKenzie plant site. For reference, antimony is a relatively scarce metal/mineral used in things like flame retardants, batteries, electronics, and defense applications. At present, the U.S. is heavily dependent on foreign antimony supply, particularly China, so Washington wants domestic sources and processing capacity. This is something the U.S. government is particularly concerned with, hence its willingness to help grease the wheels for Nova. Once installed, Nova’s new plant will enable it to establish what it calls “a fully secure, vertically integrated antimony supply chain in Alaska.” Nova currently has an exploration and mining project called Estelle in Alaska, which contains something called stibnite (Sb₂S₃), an important antimony-bearing ore. To attempt to refine this, Nova has bought a decommissioned existing plant plus other equipment. Putting U.S. antimony supply on the map This includes equipment like crushers to break down the ore and ore sorters to “filter” out promising mineral-bearing chunks. Equipment also includes mills to grind ore into finer pieces, and flotation equipment to separate the stibnite. The new plant will also feature refining equipment to convert the ore into a more useful form of antimony for sale. All-in, the equipment weighs almost 500 tonnes and comprises more than 40 shipping containers and several oversized loads. According to Nova, the shipment of equipment left Seattle by barge on August 26 and should arrive at Port MacKenzie, Alaska, in early September. This is seen as a major milestone for the company’s ambitions in the region. As it stands, Nova plans to mine stibnite from its Estelle project and transfer the raw material to its new Port MacKenzie site for processing. There, Nova will focus on the production of something called antimony trisulfide. This is a high-purity form of antimony which has defense uses, particularly in primers, ammunition and pyrotechnic compositions. According to the company, it later hopes to produce other forms of antimony products, including antimony metal and antimony trioxide (Sb₂O₃). The former has important applications in alloys and batteries, while the latter is another major commercial antimony product, particularly for flame-retardant systems. Interestingly, the press release also makes mention of the new facility being a “toll-treatment facility. A major milestone for Nova That means the plant might not be restricted to the use of Nova’s own ore only. Other mining companies could, in theory, send their antimony-bearing materials to the plant for processing too. If realized, this could make the plant something of an Alaskan antimony processing hub, not just a Nova-exclusive plant. “The shipment of this equipment marks an important milestone as Nova advances from exploration and development toward antimony production at Estelle,” Nova Minerals CEO, Mr Christopher Gerteisen, said in a press release . “A key part of our strategy has been to acquire existing, modern processing equipment and mobilize it to Alaska, rather than build new equipment from scratch. That decision allowed us to move faster and more cost-effectively as we construct our processing plant at Port MacKenzie and work toward first antimony production in 2027,” he added.","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://interestingengineering.com/science/antimony-hub-in-alaska-production","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/开采技术","a":"interesting engineering","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"产业进展","tp":"锑矿开采","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"as":"Nova Minerals报告称，凭借与美国政府4340万美元的《国防生产法》第三章项目支持，其阿拉斯加采矿项目即将产出锑，关键精炼设备正在运往该公司Port MacKenzie工厂。锑是用于阻燃剂、电池、电子和国防领域的稀缺金属，目前美国严重依赖中国等外国供应。新工厂建成后，Nova将建立其所称的完全安全、垂直整合的本土锑供应体系，以实现华盛顿追求的国内供应和加工能力。","kp":["资助金额[美国国防生产法第三章项目]: 4340万美元","投产目标[Nova Minerals阿拉斯加锑项目]: 2027年实现锑生产"]},{"t":"随着中国热解技术的规模化发展，塑料废物将转化为可持续的航空燃料","b":"A prominent energy company has signed a deal with Chinese pyrolysis technology provider Niutech to install an industrial-scale system that will convert waste plastic into feedstock for sustainable aviation fuel (SAF). The project will upgrade an existing refinery and connect waste plastic processing with the production of hydrotreated SAF , creating an end-to-end pathway from discarded plastics to aviation fuel. The agreement is Niutech’s first equipment supply contract with the unnamed energy company and represents a move toward larger-scale commercial use of waste plastic as an alternative feedstock for lower-carbon fuels. The company says its continuous pyrolysis technology can process several types of plastic, including mixed waste streams, without extensive washing, sorting or drying before processing. Turning plastic waste into fuel feedstock Niutech’s system uses continuous pyrolysis to heat waste plastic in an oxygen-limited environment, breaking the material down into hydrocarbon products, including pyrolysis oil. That oil can then undergo further processing and hydrotreatment to produce SAF. The planned production line will have a single-unit capacity ranging from 10,000 to 50,000 metric tons per year. Niutech explained the technology can process polypropylene, polyethylene , polystyrene, acrylonitrile butadiene styrene and nylon, either separately or in mixed streams. Avoiding extensive pretreatment could be particularly important for commercial operations because waste plastic often contains different polymers and contaminants. Niutech claims its process can accept low-value plastic waste without requiring the complex washing, sorting and drying processes commonly associated with recycling . The company has already deployed its continuous pyrolysis systems in several markets, including the UK, South Korea, Denmark, Thailand, Vietnam and China. It says multiple projects with annual capacities of around 10,000 metric tons have already been delivered. SAF demand creates new market for pyrolysis The deal comes as airlines and fuel producers look for additional ways to increase SAF production. European regulations are already creating a growing market, with the EU’s ReFuelEU Aviation rules requiring SAF to account for 2% of aviation fuel supplied at EU airports in 2025, increasing to 6% in 2030 and 70% by 2050. Used cooking oil and other waste oils are among the established SAF feedstocks, but their availability is limited. Waste plastic could provide another source of hydrocarbons for fuel production, particularly as governments and industry look for ways to deal with both plastic waste and aviation emissions. The project will also test whether waste plastic pyrolysis can be integrated into a large refinery environment at industrial scale. Continuous operation is particularly important for large facilities, where interruptions can significantly affect production economics and throughput. Niutech said its nearly four decades of experience in pyrolysis technology and previous large-scale deployments were key factors supporting the agreement. The company described the deal as validation of its continuous processing technology and its ability to support refinery-scale projects. The next milestone will be moving beyond individual production lines and demonstrating that waste plastic-to-SAF systems can operate reliably, economically and at a scale to become a meaningful source of aviation fuel.","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://interestingengineering.com/energy/plastic-waste-turned-into-jet-fuel","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/热化学过程/石油化工","a":"interesting engineering","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"产业进展","tp":"塑料制航油","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":7.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"一家知名能源公司与中国热解技术提供商Niutech（尼特科技）签署协议，将安装工业规模系统把废塑料转化为可持续航空燃料（SAF）原料。该项目将升级现有炼油厂，将废塑料加工与加氢处理SAF生产连接，形成从废弃塑料到航空燃料的端到端路径。这是Niutech与该未具名能源公司的首个设备供应合同，标志着废塑料作为低碳燃料替代原料走向更大规模商业化。该公司称其连续热解技术可处理包括混合废物流在内的多种塑料，无需大量清洗、分拣或干燥。","kp":["热解技术[Niutech工业规模废塑料处理]: 将废塑料转化为可持续航空燃料(SAF)原料，与加氢处理SAF生产形成端到端路径"]},{"t":"美国核聚变公司测试 100,000 个大气压等离子体脉冲以推进 Texatron 发动机","b":"A new portable vacuum vessel has arrived at American Fusion’s assembly site, clearing the way for a fresh round of plasma experiments. The hardware will support the testing programme for the company’s Texatron Fusion Engine, which explores an alternative path to nuclear fusion. The Texatron platform is being developed as a family of modular systems with planned configurations ranging from approximately 1 megawatt (MW) to 500 MW, according to the company. The team is testing the extreme physics needed for deuterium–helium-3 (D–³He) reactions. Unlike mainstream fusion projects such as tokamaks, the Texatron does not rely on giant superconducting magnets to hold a thin gas in place for long periods. Instead, it uses short, intense bursts of electromagnetic energy to compress a dense column of plasma in microsecond pulses. Recent trials showed that the device could repeatedly squeeze plasma to internal pressures of 100,000 atmospheres. In magnetic terms, holding that much pressure at a plasma beta of one equals a field strength of roughly 160 Tesla. The Texatron produces this powerful field dynamically during the pulse itself, avoiding the need for massive static coils. Modeling two different chamber sizes To understand how the hardware might scale up, engineers modeled two different chamber sizes under identical test conditions. Both setups were calculated using a target temperature of 700 million Kelvin (60 keV), a pressure of 100,000 atmospheres, and a confinement time of one microsecond. The smaller prototype uses an 11-inch chamber with a 25.4-millimetre plasma column, designed for a 500-kilowatt unit. This setup holds an active plasma volume of 445 cubic centimetres and roughly 1.88 × 10²⁰ fuel ions. Under these conditions, the model projects about 1.3 × 10¹⁵ fusion reactions per pulse. That equates to 3.9 kilojoules of gross thermal energy, or an instantaneous burst of 3.9 gigawatts during the single microsecond. The larger design expands the chamber to 23 inches with a 50.8-millimetre plasma column, planned for a 5-megawatt device. The larger dimensions increase the plasma volume more than eightfold to 3,720 cubic centimetres, accommodating 1.57 × 10²¹ fuel ions. Because fusion output scales directly with volume under equal conditions, the calculated yield jumps to 1.1 × 10¹⁶ reactions per pulse. This larger reaction releases an estimated 32.6 kilojoules of gross energy, generating a peak power rate of 32.6 gigawatts during the pulse window. To test plasma behavior across temperature range American Fusion points out that these numbers are theoretical models of gross energy, not evidence of net electricity production . True net power requires meeting the Lawson criterion. The plasma’s combined density, temperature, and confinement time must reach a tipping point where self-heating overcomes major losses, such as bremsstrahlung radiation. “Fusion is ultimately determined by the complete plasma condition — not by any single measurement — and that is exactly why our testing program is progressing methodically from one milestone to the next,” said Dr. John E. Brandenburg, Chief Technology Officer of American Fusion, who led the team. The team will use the newly installed vacuum system to test plasma behavior across temperatures ranging from 50 to 200 keV. These upcoming trials will measure whether pulsed magnetic compression can remain stable enough to approach self-sustaining fusion conditions. “Achieving repeatable high-pressure pulsed plasma conditions is an important part of the path we have laid out for the Texatron,” concluded Dr. Brandenburg.","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://interestingengineering.com/energy/american-fusion-atmosphere-plasma-pulses-texatron","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/核电","a":"interesting engineering","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"技术突破","tp":"聚变测试","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"American Fusion公司组装基地迎来新的便携式真空容器，为其Texatron聚变发动机测试计划铺路。Texatron平台被开发为模块化系统系列，计划配置从约1兆瓦到500兆瓦不等。团队正在测试氘-氦-3反应所需的极端物理条件。与托卡马克等主流聚变项目不同，Texatron不依赖巨型超导磁体长时间约束稀薄气体，而是使用短促而强烈的电磁能量脉冲压缩致密等离子体柱。","kp":["等离子体脉冲测试[Texatron聚变发动机]: 100,000个大气压","模块化功率配置[Texatron平台]: 约1兆瓦至500兆瓦"]},{"t":"下一代电源芯片电压突破 3,400 伏，未来电动汽车电压跃升 5 倍","b":"The tiny chargers that power our phones have a secret weapon known as gallium nitride (GaN). This material lets them handle electricity efficiently without needing bulky components. However, ask the same material to handle much higher voltages, and it runs into a problem that has kept GaN from challenging silicon in some of the most demanding power systems. Now, researchers at EPFL have found a way to make GaN handle more than 3.4 kilovolts by turning one of the material’s natural properties into a built-in defense against electrical breakdown. The idea sounds almost counterintuitive. Rather than adding special chemicals to control how electric charge moves through the device, the researchers engineered the GaN layers so they naturally produce matching sheets of positive and negative charge. This prevents electricity from piling up in one vulnerable spot when the transistor switches off, allowing the electric field to spread more evenly. The result is an unusually high-voltage GaN device that could help bring smaller, more efficient power electronics to electric vehicles, renewable-energy systems and energy-hungry AI data centers. Letting GaN balance its own charge Researchers at EPFL’s POWERlab tackled the problem by exploiting something GaN naturally does. Because of spontaneous and piezoelectric polarization in its crystal structure, GaN heterostructures can naturally induce extremely thin sheets of mobile electrons and holes. In conventional GaN electronics, one of these sheets contains mobile electrons, forming a two-dimensional electron gas, or 2DEG. The researchers engineered an additional GaN layer that naturally creates a second sheet containing mobile holes, called a two-dimensional hole gas, or 2DHG. The crucial step was making the two charge sheets nearly equal. By adjusting the thickness of the GaN cap layer, the researchers could tune the amount of positive charge until it closely matched the negative charge carried by the electron sheet. In their devices, the 2DEG contained about 1.03 × 10¹³ electrons per square centimeter, while the 2DHG contained about 1.05 × 10¹³ holes per square centimeter—a difference of less than 2%. This balance prevents the charge pile-up that normally creates a dangerous electric-field spike when the transistor turns off. Instead, the positive and negative charges compensate for each other, allowing the electric field to spread more evenly through the device. “We achieve this by exploiting a natural polarization effect that is unique to GaN. Our work could enable robust, efficient, high-voltage power electronics at much more compact scales,” Elison Matioli, a professor at EPFL and director of POWERlab, said . The approach also removes the need for intentional doping to create the balancing charge. This could be important because doped charge-balancing structures can behave differently as temperatures change. “Doping-based charge balancing in GaN can be highly temperature sensitive. Our doping-free design is key to the robustness of our device,” Yuan Zong, one of the lead researchers and a PhD student at EPFL, said From balanced charges to kilovolts The idea worked in physical devices built from layers of GaN on a relatively inexpensive silicon substrate. The team first demonstrated Schottky barrier diodes with breakdown voltages above 3.9 kV while maintaining a specific on-resistance as low as 4.7 mΩ cm². The charge balance was critical to that result. A control device with mismatched electron and hole concentrations broke down below 1 kV, while the charge-balanced device reached 3.9 kV. The transistor versions sustained 3.5 kV in normally-on operation and 3.4 kV in normally-off operation. That is more than five times the voltage rating of many commercial GaN power devices. The performance also held up under heat. The diodes maintained breakdown voltages above 3.3 kV at temperatures up to 125°C. During repeated high-voltage operation, their dynamic on-resistance increased by less than 15% at up to 3 kV. The transistor’s dynamic on-resistance was separately tested only up to 650 V, however, the researchers’ measurement setup introduced parasitic effects at higher switching voltages. This combination matters because a transistor that survives high voltage but wastes large amounts of energy through resistance would still be of limited use. The new design aims to address both problems at once. “Our device can hold high voltage across a wide temperature range, making it suitable for EVs or industrial power systems, where electronics must operate reliably under high temperatures and electrical stress,” Luca Mazzone, first author of the study, said. A bigger role for GaN The advance could eventually benefit electric vehicles, renewable-energy systems and the power infrastructure used by energy-hungry AI data centers , where smaller and more efficient power converters could reduce both hardware size and heat losses. However, the devices are still laboratory demonstrations, and their substrate imposes a limit. The GaN-on-silicon structure used by the team restricted the maximum breakdown voltage, meaning different substrates could potentially allow the devices to go even higher. The researchers are also looking beyond voltage alone. In complementary work, the POWERlab developed multi-channel GaN devices that spread current across several conduction paths, lowering resistance and reducing overheating. The next step “is to combine these two approaches to address the twin challenges facing next-generation power electronics: handling very high voltages safely, while minimizing electrical resistance and the resulting energy loss,” Matioli said.","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://interestingengineering.com/science/new-gan-transistor-can-handle-3-4-kv","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"interesting engineering","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"技术突破","tp":"氮化镓芯片","sc":7.8,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":4.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"as":"瑞士洛桑联邦理工学院（EPFL）研究人员找到使氮化镓（GaN）承受超过3.4千伏电压的方法，方法是将材料的一种天然特性转化为内置的抗击穿防御机制。研究人员没有通过添加特殊化学物质来控制电荷在器件中的移动，而是对GaN层进行工程改造，使其自然产生匹配的正负电荷片，利用材料自身结构抵御电击穿。这一突破使GaN有望在最高要求的电力系统中挑战硅，未来电动汽车电压有望提升5倍。","kp":["耐压能力[EPFL氮化镓功率芯片]: 突破3,400伏(3.4千伏)"]},{"t":"Quantum tech could keep planes flying without GPS","b":"GPS jamming and spoofing have become growing threats to aviation, shipping, as well as other critical systems. But Q-CTRL Chief Scientist Michael Hush believes that quantum technology could offer a reliable alternative when GPS fails.\nHush first became interested in quantum navigation during his studies at the Australian National University (ANU). He later pursued a PhD in theoretical and mathematical physics, becoming one of the first researchers to focus specifically on engineering quantum systems. After spending several years in academia, he moved into industry to bring quantum technology into the real world.","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://interestingengineering.com/interviews/quantum-navigation-keep-planes-flying-when-gps-goes-dark","c":"AI与智能科技/其它智能科技/量子信息","a":"interesting engineering","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察","tp":"量子导航","sc":4.9,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"as":"GPS干扰和欺骗已成为航空、航运及其他关键系统日益严重的威胁。量子技术公司Q-CTRL首席科学家Michael Hush认为，量子技术可在GPS失效时提供可靠的替代导航方案。Hush在澳大利亚国立大学学习期间首次对量子导航产生兴趣，随后获理论与数学物理博士学位，是最早专注于量子系统工程的研究人员之一。在学术界多年工作后，他转入产业界，致力于将量子技术推向实际应用。","kp":["量子导航技术[GPS干扰/欺骗环境下的航空与航运]: 可作为GPS失效时的可靠替代方案"]},{"t":"China’s 40,000-ton ‘drone carrier’ begins final trials as GJ-21 stealth aircraft reappears","b":"According to Chinese media, China’s new GJ-21 stealth drone has been spotted in the wild once again. This time, however, the spotting has occurred at the same time that China’s new Type 076 amphibious assault ship entered its final sea trials. Called the Sichuan , this new ship, in terms of size, sits roughly in between a traditional amphibious assault ship and a small aircraft carrier. According to known details, the ship displaces around 40,000 tonnes. It is likely that the Type 076 will be used to carry troops, landing craft, armored vehicles and helicopters for an amphibious invasion. However, what makes Sichuan different is its alleged use of an electromagnetic aircraft-launch system. Normal amphibious assault ships generally operate helicopters and vertical/short-takeoff aircraft such as the F-35B. Sichuan , on the other hand, has a catapult embedded in the flight deck, similar in concept to the EMALS system on the US Navy’s Ford-class carriers. That means it could potentially launch conventional fixed-wing aircraft that cannot take off vertically, like drones. If true, it might be more accurate to call the ship a “drone carrier.” New toys for the PLAN As the South China Morning Post (SCMP) reports, China appears to be designing it around large unmanned combat aircraft such as the GJ-21, rather than simply filling the deck with small quadcopters or reconnaissance drones. For reference, this is the naval variant of China’s GJ-11 stealth attack drone. It was first unveiled during China’s Victory Day parade in September last year . As for the drone, new sightings saw it fly over a highway service in the northeastern Chinese city of Huludao in Liaoning province. Another sighting on August 19 showed the drone flying over the same service center, SCMP reports. A third video, released Thursday (August 27), showed the drone in the same location as the first, except at a different angle. According to the SCMP , satellite imagery was also released the same day showing the Sichuan alongside two Type 052 destroyers and three Type 054 frigates. All six ships appear to have been located off Qingdao naval base, the headquarters of the People’s Liberation Army (PLA) Northern Theatre Command navy. This image also appears to show China’s first-ever aircraft carrier, the Liaoning, moored nearby. What this all means is up for interpretation, but it could mean the PLA is starting to test how it operates as part of a naval task group. Though this is just speculation at this point. Would it carry the GJ-21 drone? The presence of Liaoning makes things more intriguing. In principle, China could eventually operate groups where a conventional carrier provides fighters while ships like Sichuan provide drones, helicopters, troops, and landing craft. But, again, we cannot be sure. That said, if true, such a ship would prove very useful for amphibious assaults, especially for a potential conflict with Taiwan. Under such a scenario, the ship could carry troops, vehicles and landing craft close to the island. Troops could be transported to the coast using helicopters, all the while having drones in the air for reconnaissance and air strikes. It could also provide airborne surveillance or electronic warfare, and potentially operate some crewed fixed-wing aircraft as well. Whatever the outcome of its trials, China is clearly experimenting with a new kind of hybrid warship. What remains to be seen is how effective that concept will prove in operational service.","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://interestingengineering.com/innovation/chinas-40000-ton-drone-carrier-begins-trials","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/水路运输","a":"interesting engineering","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察","tp":"无人机航母","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":8.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"as":"据中国媒体报道，中国新型GJ-21隐形无人机再次被发现，此次现身恰逢076型两栖攻击舰四川舰进入最终海试。该舰排水量约4万吨，尺寸介于传统两栖攻击舰和小型航母之间，可能用于运送部队、登陆艇、装甲车辆和直升机。四川舰的独特之处在于据称配备了电磁弹射系统，而普通两栖攻击舰通常只能操作直升机和垂直/短距起降飞机。","kp":["排水量[076型两栖攻击舰四川舰]: 约40,000吨","试验状态[076型]: 进入最终海试","GJ-21隐身无人机[中国新型]: 再次被目击现身"]},{"t":"交付给美国陆军的20kW高能激光系统可快速炸毁敌方无人机","b":"Two powerful high energy laser systems have been delivered to the U.S. Army. Developed by  AeroVironment, the mobile counter-unmanned aircraft system is called Laser Weapon Systems (LWS). The advanced weapon features AV’s 20kW-class LOCUST LWS integrated on the General Motors Defense Infantry Squad Vehicle (ISV) platform–a significant advancement in mobile, frontline C-UAS capabilities. The system has been delivered to the U.S. Army Rapid Capabilities and Critical Technologies Office (RCCTO) as part of the first increment of the Army Multi-Purpose High Energy Laser (AMP-HEL) prototyping effort. Extensively validated laser system “This milestone marks a major step forward in the Army’s pursuit of fieldable directed energy capabilities,” said Mary Clum, Senior Vice President for AV’s Space & Directed Energy Group. “Through the AMP-HEL program, AV is delivering our extensively validated LOCUST laser system–a technically sophisticated solution that has demonstrated reliability and operational readiness for the C-UAS fight. We are honored to support the U.S. Army RCCTO and, together, accelerate warfighter access to these critical capabilities.” Following integration at AV’s Directed Energy (DE) manufacturing facility in Albuquerque, New Mexico, the AMP-HEL prototypes underwent rigorous government acceptance testing at Yuma Proving Ground in Arizona to validate performance, mobility, safety, and lethality. Subsequently, Army units performed new equipment training at Fort Sill, Oklahoma to prepare for potential employment of DE capabilities. Soldier feedback from the event is shaping ongoing enhancements to ensure warfighter readiness and operational relevance in dynamic threat environments, according to a press release. Precision tracking and targeting technology “The need for these systems from real world events is clear: the time is now for directed energy to get into the hands of warfighters everywhere and we are confident that LOCUST meets that need,” said John Garrity, Vice President of Directed Energy Systems for AV. “AV is committed to supporting the Army’s modernization and modularity priorities. We stand ready to meet the mission need through full-scale manufacturing of our LOCUST laser systems , including AMP-HEL and other mobile and fixed-site platforms, to increase lethality and continue to build on our extensively validated reliability and precision tracking and targeting technology to address the evolving threats.” Integration of laser systems on the lightweight, highly mobile ISV platform The AMP-HEL prototyping effort is part of the Army’s broader modernization initiative to rapidly develop and field DE solutions to defeat a range of threats, including drones and other airborne systems. The integration of laser systems on the lightweight, highly mobile ISV platform reflects a commitment to scalable, adaptable, and expeditionary force protection solutions. Next month, AV is set to deliver the second increment of AMP-HEL–two Joint Light Tactical Vehicles with a 20kW class LOCUST LWS, radar, and command-and-control systems, as per the release.","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://interestingengineering.com/military/high-energy-laser-systems-fry-drones","c":"未分类","a":"interesting engineering","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察","tp":"军用激光系统","sc":7.0,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":7.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"两套强力高能激光系统已交付美国陆军。该移动反无人机系统称为激光武器系统（LWS），由AeroVironment开发，将AV的20千瓦级LOCUST激光系统集成在通用汽车国防步兵班用车辆（ISV）平台上，是移动式前线反无人机能力的重大进步。该系统作为陆军多用途高能激光（AMP-HEL）原型工作第一增量的一部分，交付给陆军快速 capabilities与关键技术办公室（RCCTO）。AV太空领域高级副总裁Mary Clum表示，这一里程碑是陆军可部署定向能量能力追求的重要一步。"},{"t":"5 台先进机器人支持患者从手术到康复","b":"For decades, the idea of a robot working inside an operating room belonged more to science fiction than medicine. That has changed quietly, with robots now performing important roles in operating rooms, hospital wards, rehabilitation centers, and corridors around the world.Some help surgeons operate with greater precision, while others disinfect rooms, transport supplies, assist patients during rehabilitation, or provide comfort to people who are distressed. Here are five robots already making a difference in healthcare.1. da Vinci Surgical SystemMade by Intuitive Surgical, the da Vinci Surgical System is the most widely adopted surgical robot in the world. The system has been approved by the United States Food and Drug Administration since 2000 and is now used across several medical specialties.During an operation, a surgeon controls robotic arms fitted with small instruments while viewing the surgical area through a three-dimensional vision system. The instruments can move with greater flexibility than the human hand, while the system filters out natural hand tremors that could affect delicate movements.Doctors use da Vinci for procedures in urology, gynecology, cardiothoracic surgery, colorectal surgery, and general surgery. 2. Xenex LightStrikeInfections acquired inside hospitals remain a serious problem, especially when harmful germs survive on surfaces after a patient leaves a room. The Xenex LightStrike robot was developed to give hospitals another way to deal with this threat.The portable machine uses pulses of full-spectrum ultraviolet light to kill infectious germs inside hospital rooms. It can disinfect an entire room within minutes and does not use chemical cleaning agents during the process.LightStrike has been included in infection control programs at major healthcare facilities, including the Mayo Clinic. Its purpose is to support efforts to reduce hospital-acquired infections and protect both patients and medical staff. Unlike a surgical robot, its work usually takes place away from the patient, but its role can still have a direct effect on patient safety.3. TUGHospitals are large facilities in which medications, meals, linens, supplies, and other materials must constantly move between departments. Transporting these items is repetitive and physically demanding work that can take nurses and other employees away from clinical responsibilities.The TUG robot takes over part of this workload by travelling through hospital corridors and delivering goods. It is a self-driving service robot that can navigate the hospital without requiring a person to guide it along every route.Its contribution may appear less dramatic than that of a robot assisting during surgery, but it addresses an important operational problem. 4. Cyberdyne HALRegaining the ability to walk after a stroke or spinal injury can involve a long and demanding rehabilitation process. Patients may struggle to perform the movements required during physical therapy, which can limit how much they are able to practise.The Cyberdyne Hybrid Assistive Limb, commonly called HAL, is a robotic exoskeleton designed to support patients during rehabilitation.This support can help patients practise walking as part of a structured rehabilitation program. Instead of simply moving the body without the patient’s involvement, HAL responds to the person’s own intention to move.5. PAROPARO demonstrates that a medical robot does not need to perform surgery or transport equipment to support patient care. Designed as a therapeutic companion, the robot resembles a baby seal and uses soft fur, gentle movements, and responsive sounds to create the calming presence of a living pet.The robot can engage patients who may not respond easily to human interaction. Its movements and squeaks change in response to the person interacting with it, giving caregivers another way to reduce distress and encourage engagement.PARO supplements clinical care rather than replacing human contact. It offers a non-pharmacological option for calming patients without immediately turning to sedation or restraint. A growing role in healthcareTogether, these five machines reveal how widely robots are already being used in medicine. Their roles range from precise surgery and infection control to hospital logistics, physical rehabilitation, and therapeutic companionship.The field is continuing to develop. In July 2026, humanoid robots performed live laparoscopic gallbladder removals on a patient for the first time. Medical robots are most valuable when they handle repetitive, precise, or dangerous work while doctors and nurses provide judgment, empathy, and human connection. The question is no longer whether robots will enter healthcare, because they are already there. The real question is how much more they will be able to help.","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://interestingengineering.com/lists/the-rise-of-the-medical-robot-5-machines-already-saving-lives","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"interesting engineering","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"产业进展","tp":"医疗机器人应用","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":4.0},"as":"机器人在手术室、病房、康复中心和医院走廊中已发挥重要作用，有的协助外科医生更精准地手术，有的消毒房间、运输物资、协助患者康复或安抚情绪。文章介绍五款医疗机器人，其中第一款是直观外科公司制造的达芬奇手术系统，它是全球应用最广泛的手术机器人，自2000年获美国FDA批准，现已用于多个医学专科。其他机器人涵盖康复辅助、物资运输、消毒和陪伴等领域，贯穿从手术到康复的患者流程。","kp":["[医疗机器人应用]: 机器人在手术室、病房、康复中心承担手术辅助、消毒、物资运输、康复协助等职能"]},{"t":"报告：到2035年中国可能大幅缩小先进芯片供应缺口","b":"China could reduce its advanced-chip supply deficit over the next decade as domestic production expands, but lithography is a major obstacle to semiconductor self-sufficiency, according to a Goldman Sachs analysis reported by a Chinese media outlet.The domestic supply shortfall for wafers manufactured using advanced processes of 7 nanometres (nm) and below is projected to fall from 92% in 2025 to 34% by 2035, according to the investment bank. Goldman expects China’s advanced-node wafer supply to reach 410,000 wafers per month by 2035, compared with monthly demand of 619,000 wafers.Domestic advanced-wafer supply is projected to grow at a compound annual rate of 46% between 2025 and 2035, while demand is expected to increase by 17 percent, as per the Chinese media report.SMIC expansion could drive advanced chip productionMuch of the projected increase in supply is expected to come from Semiconductor Manufacturing International Corp (SMIC), China’s largest contract chipmaker, as it expands production capacity and improves yields.Goldman’s model assumes SMIC will add between 30,000 and 50,000 advanced-node wafers in monthly capacity each year from 2026 through 2031. It then assumes the company will add another 20,000 wafers per month annually through 2035.Production yields are projected to increase from 23% in 2026 to 50% in 2030 before reaching 75% in 2035.For comparison, Taiwan Semiconductor Manufacturing Company (TSMC), the world’s largest foundry, began mass-producing 7nm chips in 2018 and can achieve yields exceeding 90%, depending on factors including chip design and die size.China accelerated its domestic chipmaking efforts after Washington tightened restrictions on Huawei Technologies in 2020, cutting the company off from TSMC.Despite subsequent US-led restrictions on exports of advanced semiconductor manufacturing equipment, SMIC produced a 7nm chip for Huawei in 2023.China’s chip self-sufficiency rate reached roughly 70% by production volume in June, compared with 38% in January 2010, according to Goldman. However, the report noted that the gap remains substantially wider when measured by value.Semiconductor investment expected to climbChina’s semiconductor capital expenditure is expected to continue growing at double-digit annual rates through the end of the decade, reaching $82 billion in 2030, according to Goldman. That projection is 79% higher than the bank’s estimate from a year earlier.“We remain positive on growing semis capex ahead,” Goldman analysts wrote, citing increasing artificial intelligence demand, development of China’s domestic semiconductor ecosystem and a move toward more advanced chips, packaging and memory products.Goldman expects China’s wafer fabrication equipment market to reach $53 billion in 2027. Domestic suppliers are projected to capture 38% of the market by value in 2028, compared with 26% last year.Chinese manufacturers have expanded from areas including etching and deposition into ion implantation, inspection and metrology, according to Goldman.Lithography, however, is still a significant gap.China continues to rely on Dutch manufacturer ASML for nearly all of its cutting-edge deep ultraviolet (DUV) lithography machines, while some DUV systems encounter US export restrictions. China is also blocked from accessing ASML’s most advanced extreme ultraviolet (EUV) machines.Shanghai Micro Electronics Equipment Group, the state-owned company developing domestic advanced lithography systems, remains behind its international competitors, according to the report.","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://interestingengineering.com/ai-robotics/china-could-slash-chip-supply-gap","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"interesting engineering","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察","tp":"芯片供应缺口","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":4.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"据高盛分析报告，随着国内产能扩张，中国可能在2035年前大幅缩小先进芯片供应缺口，但光刻技术仍是半导体自给的主要障碍。7纳米及以下先进制程晶圆的国内供应缺口预计将从2025年的92%降至2035年的34%；高盛预计到2035年中国先进制程晶圆月供应量达41万片，而月需求为61.9万片。2025至2035年间，国内先进晶圆供应预计以46%的复合年增长率增长，需求增速为17%。中芯国际的扩张也被提及。","kp":["先进芯片供应缺口[7nm及以下制程]: 2025年92%，预计2035年降至34%","[半导体自主化瓶颈]: 光刻技术是主要障碍"]},{"t":"China develops high-tech system to identify unknown vessels’ intentions","b":"A new AI system developed by Chinese researchers has reduced the simulated risk of a Chinese coastguard vessel using weapons during disputed-water encounters from 0.3% to zero. The system was designed to help commanders distinguish between routine maritime activity and deliberate probing or harassment, a difficult task in the so-called “grey zone” between peace and open conflict. In simulations, the AI correctly identified vessel intentions 89.6% of the time, compared with 68.5% for a conventional rule-based system. Researchers claim the technology could help reduce accidental escalation by recommending measured responses such as using water cannons instead of lethal force. Teaching AI to read vessels’ intentionsThe research was conducted by a team led by Sun Shengzhi, a professor at the China Coast Guard Academy, and published earlier this month in the Chinese journal Command Control & Simulation.The researchers built a computer war game around a scenario involving a Chinese coastguard vessel protecting fishing boats from simulated foreign vessels carrying out low-intensity harassment and reconnaissance. The scenario is constructed around the type of encounters that frequently occur in disputed waters, where vessels can operate aggressively without crossing the threshold into conventional military conflict, the South China Morning Post reported.The simulated vessels were required to maintain a minimum separation of 0.5 nautical miles, or about 3,000 feet, while following restrictions governing the use of weapons. Under the existing rule-based command system, the simulated coastguard vessel used lethal weapons in 0.3% of scenarios. While that figure was low, the researchers argued that even a small risk of unintended weapons use could be unacceptable in sensitive maritime confrontations. Instead, the AI system continuously calculated the probability of different vessel intentions, including harmless transit, fishing activity and coordinated probing.From radar tracks to tactical decisionsThe system combines radar and other sensor information with a causal model designed to determine why a vessel might be manoeuvring in a particular way. In one simulation, the AI initially assigned a 72% probability that a nearby vessel was simply passing through. When three vessels formed a wedge and began approaching from different directions, the system raised the probability of coordinated probing to 68%.Rather than escalating immediately, it ordered the use of a water cannon to deter the vessels.The researchers said the AI never triggered a weapons-use violation across the simulated scenarios. It also reduced other rule violations, such as vessels moving too close to one another, from 1.2% to 0.8%.The technology was also tested against deceptive behaviour, an in a different scenario, fishing boats appeared to retreat while vessels from another direction accelerated toward the coastguard ship. The AI interpreted the manoeuvre as a potential deception and maintained its position rather than reacting to the apparent retreat.Researchers point out that this ability could make maritime simulations more realistic while helping identify weaknesses in operational plans. While the system is not intended to completely remove human commanders from the decision-making process, the researchers envision AI supporting human operators by combining intention recognition, constrained decision-making and adaptive simulations.","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://interestingengineering.com/military/china-high-tech-system-vessels-intentions","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/水路运输","a":"interesting engineering","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"技术突破","tp":"船只意图识别","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"中国研究人员开发的新AI系统在模拟中将海警船在争议水域遭遇中使用武器的风险从0.3%降至零。该系统旨在帮助指挥官区分常规海上活动与蓄意试探或骚扰，这在和平与公开冲突之间的'灰色地带'中是难题。模拟中AI识别船只意图的准确率达89.6%，而传统规则系统仅为68.5%。研究人员称该技术可通过建议使用水炮而非致命武力等审慎应对措施，帮助减少意外升级。研究由孙圣志教授领导的团队完成。","kp":["意图识别准确率[模拟环境中]: AI系统89.6%，常规方法68.5%","动武风险[争议海域海警对峙模拟]: 从0.3%降至0%"]},{"t":"令人惊讶的抗衰老研究显示磁性细菌可将寿命延长 43%","b":"A magnetic bacterium produced a striking longevity effect in worms. Researchers traced the benefit to reduced iron accumulation and lipid damage linked to ferroptosis. Credit: Shutterstock\nA magnetotactic bacterium extended lifespan in worms by 43.39% and appeared to do so by suppressing ferroptosis.\nA bacterium best known for producing microscopic magnetic structures may have an unexpected effect on aging. In experiments with\nCaenorhabditis elegans\n, the magnetotactic bacterium\nMagnetospirillum magneticum\nAMB-1 extended average lifespan by 43.39% while helping preserve neurological function and intestinal integrity in older worms.\nResearchers led by Prof. An Xu at the\nHefei Institutes of Physical Science of the Chinese Academy of Sciences\ntraced the effect to suppression of ferroptosis, an iron-dependent form of cell death driven by damaging lipid oxidation. The findings, published in\nFree Radical Biology and Medicine\n, point to an unusual connection between a microbe’s magnetic machinery and biological processes involved in aging.\nMagnetotactic bacteria produce intracellular structures called magnetosomes, which contain magnetic minerals and help the microbes orient themselves along magnetic fields.\nTheir unusual properties and biocompatibility have already attracted interest for drug delivery, imaging, and cancer-related applications, but their potential influence on aging has received little attention. The new study suggests that these magnetic microbes could offer another way to investigate, and potentially influence, the cellular damage that accumulates with age.\nA magnetic bacterium extended worm lifespan\nC. elegans\nas an aging model, the researchers tested how the MTB strain AMB-1 affected lifespan and age-related functions. Worms treated with AMB-1 lived an average of 43.39% longer, while aged animals also showed improved neurological function and better preservation of intestinal integrity.\nAMB-1 significantly extended the healthy lifespan of C. elegans by inhibiting ferroptosis. Credit: Yun Liu\nFerroptosis inhibition explained the longevity effect\nThe ability of AMB-1 to produce magnetosomes proved important to the lifespan effect. Wild-type AMB-1 produced stronger benefits than reversibly non-magnetotactic RNM-AMB-1, while the non-magnetotactic strain NM-AMB-1 did not extend lifespan.\nThe researchers then identified changes connected to ferroptosis. AMB-1 lowered iron accumulation and lipid peroxidation in the worms, suppressing aging-related ferroptosis. Genetic experiments further implicated ferroptosis-related pathways involving\nin the lifespan effects associated with AMB-1.\nAccording to the researchers, the results establish a new microbial strategy for intervening in aging and provide foundational evidence for extending the potential applications of magnetotactic bacteria into geriatric medicine.\nReference: “A novel role for magnetotactic bacterium: Magnetospirillum magneticum AMB-1 prolonged healthy lifespan of Caenorhabditis elegans via regulating ferroptosis” by Yuting Ding, Xinyao Huang, Yanan Zhao, Ruoyun Dong, Chenxi Zhou, Yuanyuan Wu, Hua Du, Juan Wan, Yun Liu and An Xu, 26 June 2026,\nFree Radical Biology and Medicine\nDOI: 10.1016/j.freeradbiomed.2026.06.050\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nGoogle News\nBacteria\nChinese Academy of Sciences\nLongevity\nMicrobiology\nArticles\nYour Gut Bacteria Might Hold the Secret to a Longer, Healthier Life\nScientists Develop New Gene Therapy Strategy to Delay Aging and Extend Lifespan\nResearchers Can Accurately Estimate Your Age Based on the Microbes Living on Your Body\nEating Yogurt May Help Lessen the Risk of Breast Cancer – Here’s Why\nDrinking 1% vs 2% Milk Associated With a Significant Difference in Aging\nBacteria Can ‘Outsmart’ Programmed Cell Death Overriding an Immune System Defense Mechanism\nProtein Levels in People’s Blood Accurately Predicts Their Age – Aging Isn’t Smooth Continuous Process\nWarning: Deadly Superbugs Lurking in More Than 90% of Make-Up Bags\nCopper Hospital Beds Are Real Killers, but That’s a Good Thing","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/magnetic-bacterium-extends-lifespan-by-43-in-surprising-anti-aging-study/","c":"未分类","a":"scitechdaily","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察","tp":"磁性菌延寿","sc":6.7,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":2.0,"r":7.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"趋磁细菌Magnetospirillum magneticum AMB-1在秀丽隐杆线虫实验中将平均寿命延长43.39%，同时有助于保持老龄线虫的神经功能和肠道完整性。中国科学院合肥物质科学研究院安徐教授领导的研究团队将这一效果归结为对铁死亡的抑制，其机制与减少铁积累和脂质损伤有关。这种以产生微观磁性结构著称的细菌展现出意想不到的抗衰老作用。"},{"t":"八万年前的箭头可能改写人类如何到达欧洲的故事","b":"Obi-Rakhmat rock shelter in Uzbekistan, micro-point hafting and main game hunted around the site 80,000 years ago. Credit: Artwork courtesy of Malvina Baumann\nMicrolithic projectile points from Uzbekistan may link Central Asia to a revised story of Homo sapiens’ early expansion into Europe.\nResearchers have identified tiny triangular projectile points at the Obi Rakhmat site in Uzbekistan by studying the marks left when they struck targets. Found in the site’s oldest occupation layers, the points date back 80,000 years.\nTheir small size matches what would be expected for arrowheads, and they closely resemble points made by Homo sapiens during a later movement into Neanderthal territory in the Rhône Valley 25,000 years afterward. Published in the journal\nPLOS One\n, the study offers evidence that could change the story of how Homo sapiens first settled in Europe.\nThe chronological, cultural, and anthropological models used to understand prehistory were first developed in Western Europe, especially France, during the second half of the 19th century. Early versions of those models were linear and Eurocentric. Cro Magnons (European early modern humans), thought at the time to descend from Neanderthals, were used to support ideas of civilizational superiority in that part of the world.\nView from the Obi-Rakhmat rock shelter on the end of the Tien Shan. Credit: Hugues Plisson\nOnly about a century later did scholars widely recognize the African origin of\nHomo sapiens\nand the technological and social traits that defined the Western Upper Paleolithic (symbolic productions, long-distance networks, and diversified lithic and bone tools and weapons).\nThe oldest evidence for Homo sapiens in Australia, dating to about 65,000 years ago, is roughly 10,000 years older than the earliest evidence from Europe. Meanwhile, the route and timing of the first Homo sapiens colonization of Western Eurasia more than 45,000 years ago remain debated. The earliest Upper Paleolithic sites in Europe do not align neatly in time with those in the Levant, even though Levantine sites are often considered the closest match in tool types and technology.\nThis may be because the Levantine evidence comes from older excavations or because it does not fit the expected direct line of development. Although the Levant lies close to Africa, the origins of the Initial Upper Paleolithic there are still unclear. For that reason, the Central Asian origin proposed by archaeologist Ludovic Slimak in 2023 deserves serious attention.\nElements of lithic industry from layer 21 at Obi-Rakhmat: unretouched blades (1-2), large retouched blade (3), pointed retouched blades (4-5), impacted retouched points (6-8), unretouched Levallois micro-point (9), unretouched impacted micro-points (10-11). Credit: Hugues Plisson\nA site in Central Asia\nDepending on climatic conditions, Central Asia has served as a corridor facilitating movement between the western and eastern parts of the continent or as a refuge zone. The archaeological record in this region is limited but includes several significant Paleolithic sites.\nAmong them is the Obi-Rakhmat rock shelter in Uzbekistan, discovered in 1962, whose latest excavation campaigns were led by Andrei Krivoshapkin. At the south-western end of the Talassky Alatau range of the Tien Shan mountains, at an altitude of 1,250 meters, the settlement provides a remarkably consistent lithic industry, comprising points, large blades, and bladelets across a stratigraphic sequence spanning over 10 meters, dating from approximately 80,000 to 40,000 years ago.\nTwo unretouched micro-points recovered from layer 21 of Obi-Rakhmat. One is intact, while the other is broken and shows scratches resulting from use as a projectile head. The matchstick illustrates their small size. Credit: Hugues Plisson\nThis industry was initially classified as part of the Initial Upper Paleolithic, but it appears to derive from the Levantine Early Middle Paleolithic. The early Middle Paleolithic, associated with archaic\nHomo sapiens\nMisliya cave\n, disappeared from the Near East around 100,000 years ago. At Obi-Rakhmat, the skull remains of a child found in a layer dating back ~70,000 years show features considered to be Neanderthal and others to be anatomically modern, a combination that could be the result of hybridization.\nMassive blades but microlithic points\nIn this context, our international multidisciplinary team has identified tiny, unretouched, triangular projectile points within the lithic debris of the oldest stratigraphic layers. These points were distinguished based on their macroscopic and microscopic impact marks, which were compared to experimental reference data.\nDue to their small size (less than 2 cm in width and weighing only a few grams) and brittleness, they would have been unsuitable for mounting on heavy shafts. The width of their cutting edges corresponds to the diameter of arrow shafts\ndocumented ethnographically\nfor low-poundage bows, consistent with transcultural invariants rooted in physical and ballistic constraints.\n3D copy of an intact micro-point from Obi-Rakhmat fixed to a modern arrow shaft using a mixture of bitumen and ash. Credit: Hugues Plisson\nA question of ballistics\nThrown piercing weapons are complex systems whose components are not interchangeable from one type of weapon to another, as they meet different requirements in terms of intensity and nature of stress.\nThe significant impact force of spears held or thrown by hand makes the robustness of the weapon an essential parameter, both in terms of effectiveness and the hunter’s survival, with mass ensuring robustness, impact force, and penetration. In contrast, the penetration of light projectiles shot from a long distance depends on their sharpness, because their kinetic energy, which is much lower, comes mainly from their speed, which, unlike mass, decreases very rapidly along the trajectory and in the target.\nAs this speed cannot be achieved by the extension of the human arm alone, it necessarily depends on the use of a throwing instrument. Arrowheads and spearheads or javelin heads are therefore not designed according to the same criteria and cannot be mounted on the same shafts, the dimensions and degree of elasticity of which are also essential in terms of ballistics. Thus, as in paleontology, where the shape of a tooth reveals the type of diet and suggests the mode of locomotion, the characteristics of a point provide clues as to the type of weapon of which it is the wounding element.\nLevallois points from the Um El Tlel site in Syria, from the Late Middle Paleolithic period in the Levant attributed to Neanderthals. From left to right: graphic reconstruction based on a fragment found embedded in a donkey vertebra, plant knife blade, butcher knife blade. These multipurpose points are 2 to 3 times wider than the micro-points from Obi-Rakhmat. Credit: Hugues Plisson\nWeaponry specific to ‘Sapiens’?\nThe tiny size of Obi-Rakhmat’s points cannot be regarded as a default choice, not only because there is no shortage of good-quality lithic raw material on site from which large blades were made, but microscopic examination of traces of use also shows that within this same assemblage there are also much more robust retouched points, 15 to 20 times heavier and 3 to 4 times thicker (the size of spearheads or javelin heads), similarly impacted by use as axial projectile points.\nReturning to the bibliography and\nour own work on Middle Paleolithic tools\n, we found that the presence in the same assemblage of various types of projectile points and inserts, some of which were microlithic and produced for this purpose, is only known at\nHomo sapiens\nsites. The oldest documented occurrences are in South Africa in the Pre-Still Bay (more than 77,000 years old) and later cultural layers of the\nSibudu cave\nMorphological and functional similarity between the micro-points of Obi-Rakhmat and Mandrin, broken by their use as projectile head. The location and extent of their fracture (highlighted in red and blue and macroscopic detail) are indicative of axial impact. Credit: Hugues Plisson\nIn contrast, lithic points damaged by use as projectile heads are rare in the Neanderthal record. When present, they tend to be large and do not notably differ in size, manufacture, or type from points used for activities other than hunting, such as gathering plants, or butchery. This difference in the design of tools and weapons takes on anthropological significance.\nGiven their respective dates, the distance between South Africa and Central Asia (14,000 km) and the difference in the manufacture of the Obi-Rakhmat and Sibudu weapon heads (unretouched knapped stone points vs. shaped stone points or retouched inserts, shaped bone points), the hypothesis of independent centers of invention is the most likely.\nThe micro-points from Obi-Rakhmat have no known equivalents in the Eurasian Middle Paleolithic, except for identical projectile points identified by\nTraceology expert Laure Metz\nat the Mandrin site, in the Rhône Valley, France, in a layer dating to approximately 54,000 years ago – some ten thousand years before the disappearance of local Neanderthals. Notably,\nHomo sapiens\nmilk tooth was also recovered from this layer\n. The similarity between the micro-points from Obi-Rakhmat and Mandrin, despite being separated by more than 6,000 km and 25 millennia, is such that they could be interchanged without any detail other than the stone betraying the substitution.\nOn either side of the Persian plateau (orange box), genetically identified as a refuge area for the concentration and demographic development of first Homo sapiens who left Africa, Obi-Rakhmat and Mandrin share the same micro-projectile points, 25,000 years and 6,000 km apart. Credit: Hugues Plisson\nRecent work published by paleogeneticists\nLeonardo Vallini\nStéphane Mazières\ndefines the Persian Plateau, on the north-eastern edge of which Obi-Rakhmat is located, as a population hub where the ancestors of all present-day non-Africans lived between the early phases of expansion out of Africa – long before the Upper Paleolithic – and the wider colonization of Eurasia. This resource-rich environment may have provided a refuge conducive to demographic regeneration after the genetic bottleneck of the exit from Africa, interaction between groups and, consequently, technical innovations.\nObi-Rakhmat and Mandrin may represent two geographical and temporal milestones within the same process of dispersal,\nas suggested by Ludovic Slimak\n, characterized by the dissemination of a key technological innovation unique to\nHomo sapiens\n. So far unnoticed because they are unretouched, tiny, and fragmentary, it is likely that the micro-projectile points for which recognition criteria have now been defined will begin to appear at sites between Central Asia and the western Mediterranean.\nPremises for a new scenario of the western peopling by ‘Homo sapiens’\nThis discovery is stimulating in several ways.\nIt validates the consistency of the research conducted at the Mandrin site, which came to the conclusion that\narmed with bows made a brief incursion into Neanderthal territory.\nSeveral elements of this study had been criticized\n, which is, however, normal in science when a new proposal deviates too far from established knowledge – but its predictive dimension had not been considered at the time.\nThe similarity between Mandrin and Obi-Rakhmat’s micro-points cannot be a mere coincidence. It is not only their shape that is similar, but also the way they are made, which requires real expertise, as evidenced by the meticulous preparation of their striking platform and their function. One could debate the appropriate instrument for shooting arrows armed with such tiny tips, the bow being in filigree, or whether it is preferable to remain cautious and speak only of shooting, but this already contrasts with what we know about Neanderthal hunting weapons and their design.\nAnother remarkable aspect, which is still relatively uncommon, is the convergence and complementarity of data from material culture and from our genetic memory, which did not influence each other given the dates of the respective studies and publications. Together, they sketch out a rewriting of the scenario of\nHomo sapiens\n’ arrival in Europe: it was thought that he came directly from Africa by the shortest route 45,000 years ago, but we now discover that he had been established in the heart of the Eurasian continent for a long time, well before expanding in search of more territories.\nReference: “Arrow heads at Obi-Rakhmat (Uzbekistan) 80 ka ago?” by Hugues Plisson, Alena V. Kharevich, Vladimir M. Kharevich, Pavel V. Chistiakov, Lydia V. Zotkina, Malvina Baumann, Eric Pubert, Ksenya A. Kolobova, Farhod A. Maksudov and Andrei I. Krivoshapkin, 11 August 2025,\nPLOS ONE\nDOI: 10.1371/journal.pone.0328390\nAdapted from an article originally published in\nThe Conversation\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nGoogle News\nAnthropology\nArchaeology\nEvolutionary Anthropology\nHomo Sapiens\nThe Conversation\nArticles\nAncient Mysteries: Five Enigmatic Artifacts That Still Baffle Modern Archaeologists\nTracing Footprints: Humans Got to America 7,000 Years Earlier Than Thought\nAncient Tooth From Young Girl Discovered in Cave Unlocks Mystery of Denisovans, a Sister Species of Modern Humans\nWar in the Time of Neanderthals: How Our Species Battled for Supremacy for Over 100,000 Years\n“Meat Made Us Human” Evolutionary Narrative Starts To Unravel\nScientists Reveal the Complex Story Behind the Beaker Phenomenon\nAnthropologists Shed New Light on Prehistoric Human Migration\nResearchers Discover Oldest Images to Date of Dogs on Leashes\n400,000 Year Old Fossil Helps Shed New Light on Human Evolution","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/80000-year-old-arrowheads-could-rewrite-the-story-of-how-humans-reached-europe/","c":"不相关","a":"scitechdaily","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"考古学家发现现代资本主义 3200 年前“品牌”的证据","b":"Ancient “brand” Qurayyah Painted Ware QPW 4, formerly known as ‘Midianite Pottery’. Credit: Marta Luciani, Qurayyah Joint Archaeological Project CCBY 4.0\nResearchers found that brands existed long before modern capitalism.\nLong before modern corporations and capitalism, craftspeople may already have been producing goods with a recognizable identity that traveled far beyond their place of origin. An international team led by Marta Luciani of the University of Vienna has found evidence that distinctive painted pottery made in Northwestern Arabia about 3,200 years ago functioned in many ways like a modern brand.\nThe findings come from the oasis of Qurayyah, where researchers investigated the production of a distinctive two-color painted pottery. Their analysis suggests the vessels were visually recognizable, desirable, and traded widely enough to meet criteria the researchers associate with branding. The results were published in\nPLOS One\n. The research included scientists from M.I.T., the Harvard Museum of the Ancient Near East, OeAI/OeAW, TU Wien, and the University of Sydney, with support from the Heritage Commission of the Saudi Ministry of Culture.\nDrone photo of the oasis of Qurayyah. Credit: Marta Luciani, Qurayyah Joint Archaeological Project CCBY 4.0\nQurayyah was the production center\nLuciani worked with Pamela Fragnoli (OeAI/OeAW) and Johannes H. Sterba (TU Wien) to analyze several dozen Bronze Age ceramic vessels from Qurayyah. Their results challenge earlier ideas about the famous ‘Midianite Pottery’ and provide evidence that the ceramics were actually produced in the Qurayyah oasis.\n“Our discovery sheds light on how even in the arid environment of desert oases, where essential resources such as clay, water and fuel were scarce, local communities already in the Bronze Age were far from marginal but participated in wider networks of technological know-how shared with neighboring regions, such as the Southern Levant and Syria. Oasis-dwellers were resourceful and inventive enough to create their own ceramic repertoire: to cherish at home and eventually export abroad,” says study lead Marta Luciani from the Department of Prehistoric and Historical Archaeology of the University of Vienna.\nArcheological excavations in Area R: funerary and cultic complex with hundreds of QPW 4 painted vessels. Credit: Marta Luciani, Qurayyah Joint Archaeological Project CCBY 4.0\nThe pottery functioned like a brand\nTo determine whether the pottery could reasonably be described as a brand, the researchers established a set of criteria that included visual identity, material consistency, technological continuity, centralized production, export circulation, local imitation, intentional commercial scope, and cultural reputation.\n“Thus our study’s implications stretch beyond archaeology and the long-term relationship between humans and natural resources in climatically extreme regions into fields such as the economic mechanisms mediating producer-consumer relationships across time and space”, adds Luciani, archaeologist and team leader at the Human Evolution and Archaeological Science (HEAS) network at the University of Vienna.\nQurayyah Painted Ware QPW 3. Credit: Marta Luciani, Qurayyah Joint Archaeological Project CCBY 4.0\nThe team relied on several complementary methods to establish where and how the ceramics were made.\n“Decisive for this first-time discovery was our interdisciplinary and multi-scalar approach, combining examination of stratified material, vessel-shaping technology, and petrographic analysis of ceramic thin sections under the polarizing microscope,” explains Pamela Fragnoli, Head of the Ceramic Lab of the Austrian Archaeological Institute at the Austrian Academy of Science (OeAI/OeAW),\n“We cross-checked with chemical fingerprinting of the vessels’ composition, down to their trace elements obtained via Neutron Activation Analysis,” adds Johannes H. Sterba, Head of the Center for Labeling and Isotope Production at the TU Wien.\nThe pottery tradition itself stretched across a remarkably long period. Doralice Klainscek, PhD candidate at the University of Vienna and study co-author, specifies: “The first set of Qurayyah Painted Ware was produced 3,600 years ago. Our most striking discovery was ascertaining that painted pottery production continued, by constantly evolving (Fig. 2). Four centuries on, ca. 3,200 years ago they manufactured a flourishing repertoire of painted animals and human rituals (Fig. 3): this became the brand that was exported over hundreds of kilometers north to the Southern Levant, to sites like Tell el-Kheleifeh and even the Timna sanctuary of the Egyptian goddess Hathor, and south to North Arabia. But Qurayyah’s potting tradition did not stop and continued to be based in the oasis for another thousand years, well into the final Iron Age.”\nReference: “Creating a brand. Genesis, transformation and diffusion of Qurayyah Painted Ware” by Marta Luciani, Pamela Fragnoli, William D. Gilstrap, Johannes H. Sterba, Doralice Klainscek, Joseph A. Greene, Stephen Bourke and Paul Donnelly, 19 August 2026,\nPLOS ONE\nDOI: 10.1371/journal.pone.0351296\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nGoogle News\nAnthropology\nArchaeology\nSaudi Arabia\nUniversity of Vienna\nArticles\nMedieval Injuries: Inequality in Cambridge Was “Recorded on the Bones” of Its Residents\nWhen Good Governments Go Bad: History Shows That Societies Collapse When Leaders Undermine Social Contracts\nDefining Moment in Human Evolution: Turbulent Era Sparked Leap in Human Behavior, Technology 320,000 Years Ago\nVast Stone Monuments Discovered in Saudi Arabia Were Constructed in 7,000 Years Ago\nGrape Seeds Reveal Collapse of Ancient Economy in the Grip of Plague and Climate Change\n29,000 Years of Aboriginal History: Uncovering New Layers of River Murray Occupation\nHidden Murray River Rockshelter Reveals Aboriginal Art, Frontier Conflict and a Swastika\nMigrations Reconstructed Through Ancient DNA: Each Mediterranean Island Has Its Own Genetic Pattern\nHow Ancient Poop Debunked Myth of Native American Lost Civilization","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/archaeologists-discover-evidence-of-brands-3200-years-before-modern-capitalism/","c":"不相关","a":"scitechdaily","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"“僵尸”细胞揭示了慢性炎症的令人惊讶的新驱动因素","b":"Senescent cells may rely on more than immune signaling to sustain age-related inflammation. A mitochondrial pathway that alters how inflammatory genes are accessed could offer a new target for quieting these harmful cells without destroying them. Credit: Shutterstock\nDysfunctional mitochondria may drive age-related inflammation by helping switch on inflammatory genes, and blocking SLC25A1 reduced that activity.\nAs people age, senescent cells accumulate in the body. These so-called “zombie” cells have stopped dividing but remain metabolically active, releasing inflammatory molecules that can contribute to persistent inflammation associated with frailty, cardiovascular disease, cancer, neurodegeneration, and other disorders of aging.\nResearchers have now identified a previously unknown mechanism that helps explain how these aging cells switch inflammatory genes into a highly active state. The findings connect dysfunctional mitochondria — the structures that produce cellular energy — with epigenetic machinery that controls gene activity, revealing a potential new way to reduce harmful inflammation without eliminating the senescent cells themselves.\nThe study, published in\n, builds on years of research into the senescence-associated secretory phenotype, or SASP, the mixture of inflammatory molecules released by senescent cells. The work was conducted by Mayo Clinic researchers in collaboration with Sanford Burnham Prebys Medical Discovery Institute.\n“For years, the field has focused on getting rid of senescent cells,” says João Passos, Ph.D., a Mayo Clinic researcher and senior author of the study conducted in collaboration with Sanford Burnham Prebys Medical Discovery Institute. “Our strategy has been different. Instead of killing the cells, we asked whether we could switch off the inflammation that makes them harmful.”\nMitochondria send two inflammatory signals\nEarlier research from the Passos laboratory showed that damaged mitochondria\nleak mitochondrial DNA and RNA\ninto the cell. Those misplaced genetic molecules activate immune pathways that promote inflammation. The new study reveals that this inflammatory alarm is only part of the process.\n“We found that inflammatory signaling alone isn’t enough,” says Helene Martini, Pharm.D., Ph.D., a Mayo Clinic researcher and first author of the study. “The cells also need a metabolic signal from mitochondria that changes how inflammatory genes are turned on.”\nMicroscopy image of the mitochondrial network and staining of the histone acetylation. Credit: Mayo Clinic\nThat second signal involves acetyl-CoA, a molecule produced through mitochondrial metabolism. The researchers found that senescent cells make more acetyl-CoA, which supports epigenetic modifications — chemical changes that influence whether genes are active without changing the underlying DNA sequence.\nThose modifications make inflammatory genes more accessible to the cellular machinery that reads them, allowing the genes to be expressed more strongly. In this two-part process, leaked mitochondrial DNA and RNA trigger the inflammatory signal, while mitochondrial metabolism supplies the molecular “permission” needed for inflammatory genes to become fully active.\n“This is a completely new pathway,” says Dr. Martini. “We found that dysfunctional mitochondria can promote inflammation by controlling epigenetic switches that turn inflammatory genes on.”\nBlocking one transporter reduced inflammation\nThe researchers also identified a possible point for therapeutic intervention. They focused on SLC25A1, a mitochondrial citrate transporter involved in supplying the acetyl-CoA needed for these epigenetic changes.\nBlocking SLC25A1 reduced the available acetyl-CoA and limited activation of inflammatory genes, even though the original immune signals were still present. The finding identifies a previously unrecognized control point in the inflammatory process and suggests that targeting this pathway could potentially promote healthier aging without requiring senescent cells to be destroyed.\nReference: “Mitochondrial metabolism and epigenetic crosstalk drive SASP” by Hélène Martini, Jodie Birch, Francisco D. M. Marques, Stella Victorelli, Anthony B. Lagnado, Nicholas Pirius, Ana Catarina Franco, Gung Lee, Yeaeun Han, Jennifer L. Rowsey, Wazim Mohammed Ismail, Amelia Mazzone, Tianna M. Espe, Taro Hitosugi, Ya Li, Alexander M. Washington, Aaron Havas, Rabi Murad, Xue Lei, Rebecca A. Porritt, Oliver D. K. Maddocks, Jair Machado Espindola-Netto, Dominik Saul, Sundeep Khosla, Diana Jurk, Enis Kostallari, Alexandre Gaspar-Maia, Peter D. Adams and João F. Passos, 29 July 2026,\nDOI: 10.1038/s41586-026-10791-2\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nGoogle News\nEpigenetics\nInflammation\nMayo Clinic\nMetabolism\nArticles\nNew Research Shows Vitamin B12 May Hold the Key to Healthy Aging\nAs Our Gut Ages, Key Genes Fall Silent. Scientists Now Know Why\nChemical Compound Promotes Healthy Aging – Add Muscle, Strength and Energy While Losing Fat\nSurprising Findings Show the Unexpected Ways Metabolism Changes With Age\nEating Whole Grains May Protect Against Heart Disease\nMayo Clinic: CBD Products & Hemp Oil May Be Helpful but More Research Is Needed\nScientists Discover Surprise Link Between Metabolism and Immunity\nIntermittent Fasting and Manipulating Mitochondrial Networks May Increase Lifespan\nUCLA Study Shows That Obesity Accelerates Aging of the Liver","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/zombie-cells-reveal-a-surprising-new-driver-of-chronic-inflammation/","c":"未分类","a":"scitechdaily","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察","tp":"慢性炎症机制","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":2.0,"r":7.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"随年龄增长，衰老细胞（'僵尸'细胞）在体内积累，这些细胞停止分裂但代谢活跃，释放炎症分子，与虚弱、心血管疾病、癌症、神经退行性变等衰老相关疾病有关的持续炎症相关。研究人员发现了一个此前未知的机制：功能异常的线粒体可能通过改变炎症基因的可及性来驱动年龄相关炎症，而阻断SLC25A1可降低该活动。这一线粒体通路为在不消灭这些有害细胞的情况下使其沉默提供了新靶点。"},{"t":"您应该了解的 Ozempic 和 Wegovy 的罕见视力副作用","b":"GLP-1 drugs mimic hormones involved in blood sugar control, appetite, and digestion, and are widely used for Type 2 diabetes and weight management. Examples include semaglutide (Ozempic, Wegovy), tirzepatide (Mounjaro, Zepbound), liraglutide (Victoza, Saxenda), dulaglutide (Trulicity), and exenatide (Byetta, Bydureon). Credit: Shutterstock\nRutgers researchers say the risk is low, but patients should still be aware of the possible association.\nGLP-1 medications have become widely used for Type 2 diabetes and obesity, with drugs such as semaglutide, sold as Ozempic and Wegovy, and tirzepatide, sold as Mounjaro and Zepbound, among the best-known examples. The drugs can also reduce cardiovascular and kidney disease risks, but their growing use has increased interest in identifying uncommon side effects.\nIn a study published in\nAnnals of Internal Medicine\nresearchers analyzed a large database of U.S. adults ages 18 to 65 with Type 2 diabetes who had started medications for the disease. They found that patients taking GLP-1 drugs had a slightly higher risk of ischemic optic neuropathy, a rare condition caused by reduced blood flow to the optic nerve that can lead to sudden vision loss.\nThe overall risk remained low\nThe increase was small, amounting to approximately three to four additional cases per 10,000 patients treated with GLP-1s over 18 months.\n“Although ischemic optic neuropathy was rare, it is clinically important because it can involve sudden vision loss,” said Chintan Dave, a core faculty member of the Center for Pharmacoepidemiology and Treatment Science at Rutgers Institute for Health, Health Care Policy and Aging Research. “The increase in risk was small – approximately three to four additional cases per 10,000 patients treated with GLP-1s over 18 months, but clinicians and patients should be aware of this potential association.”\nBecause GLP-1 medications are increasingly used by people both with and without Type 2 diabetes, the researchers said continued attention to their safety is important even when potential risks are uncommon.\nSudden vision changes warrant prompt attention\n“Most patients in our study who had ischemic optic neuropathy were either men or men and women aged 50 to 65,” said Dave, an associate professor at the Ernest Mario School of Pharmacy and the lead author of the study. “Because ischemic optic neuropathy can present with sudden vision loss, which may be permanent, early recognition of symptoms and prompt ophthalmologic evaluation may be especially important for patients at higher baseline risk.”\nMore than four out of five cases of ischemic optic neuropathy are estimated to involve the non-arteritic anterior form. Dave said the resulting vision loss is usually permanent, although about one third of patients may regain some vision, generally during the first six months. Some impairment often remains even after improvement. Rather than causing total blindness or complete darkness, the condition typically produces blurring, dimming, or loss of part of the visual field in one eye.\nThe researchers cautioned that the association may be influenced by underlying health differences among patients rather than a direct effect of GLP-1 medications. Additional research will be needed to determine whether the drugs actually cause the increased risk.\nReference: “Glucagon-Like Peptide-1 Receptor Agonists and Risk for Ischemic Optic Neuropathy” by Kamika R. Reynolds, Kimberly M. O’Malley, Jason A. Roy and Chintan V. Dave, 13 July 2026,\nAnnals of Internal Medicine\nDOI: 10.7326/ANNALS-25-00860\nFunding: National Institutes of Health\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nGoogle News\nDiabetes\nOphthalmology\nRutgers University\nSemaglutide\nArticles\nCan Ozempic Treat Kidney Damage? Groundbreaking Study Uncovers Powerful New Benefits\nStudy Debunks Popular Diabetes Drugs’ Link to Thyroid Cancer\nRevolutionary Weight Loss: Largest Ever Obesity Study Showcases Semaglutide’s Promise\nAlarming Trend – Young Adults’ Use of Popular Weight Loss Drugs Wegovy and Ozempic Skyrockets by 594%\nRevolutionary Obesity Treatment: Tirzepatide Shows Groundbreaking 21.1% Weight Loss\nCutting Alcohol Consumption in Half – Scientists Discover Surprising Side Effect of Obesity Drug Semaglutide\nNew Game-Changing Obesity Drug Dramatically Reduces Risk of Type 2 Diabetes\nWeight Loss of 15% or More Should Be Central Focus of Type 2 Diabetes Management\nDiabetes Medication Semaglutide Reduces Excess Body Fat in People With Obesity","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/the-rare-vision-side-effect-of-ozempic-and-wegovy-you-should-know-about/","c":"未分类","a":"scitechdaily","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察","tp":"GLP-1视力","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":5.0},"as":"GLP-1药物模拟参与血糖控制、食欲和消化的激素，广泛用于2型糖尿病和体重管理，代表药物包括司美格鲁肽（Ozempic、Wegovy）、替尔泊肽（Mounjaro、Zepbound）、利拉鲁肽、度拉糖肽和艾塞那肽等。罗格斯大学研究人员指出，这类药物存在罕见的视力副作用风险，虽然风险较低，但患者仍应知晓这种可能的关联。此类药物还可降低心血管和肾脏疾病风险，随着使用增多，识别其罕见副作用日益受到关注。"},{"t":"美国宇航局的新型太空望远镜可以用类似哈勃望远镜的细节绘制整个天空","b":"NASA’s Roman Space Telescope will survey enormous regions of the sky with Hubble-like sensitivity, helping scientists study everything from dark energy to distant exoplanets. Credit: NASA\nNASA’s Roman Space Telescope will combine a panoramic view of the cosmos with powerful tools for probing dark energy and hidden worlds.\nNASA’s Nancy Grace Roman Space Telescope is just one day from launch, and it is built to see the universe in a way no major space telescope has before.\nRoman will combine Hubble-like sharpness with a field of view 100 times larger, allowing it to sweep across enormous regions of the sky far faster than\never could. It will hunt for distant\ngalaxies\ndark matter\ndark energy\ndying stars\nhidden in the glare of other suns.\nSeveral University of Arizona faculty members and students will be at Cape Canaveral for the launch of NASA’s next flagship astrophysics mission after the\nJames Webb Space Telescope\n. Roman’s science operations are expected to begin in January 2027.\nNASA’s Nancy Grace Roman Space Telescope is photographed after encapsulation inside its payload fairing in the Payload Hazardous Servicing Facility at NASA’s Kennedy Space Center in Florida on Monday, August 24, 2026, ahead of mating to a SpaceX Falcon Heavy rocket. Credit: NASA/Sydney Rohde (Rocz)\nA Much Wider View Than Hubble\nWebb was designed to look deeply into relatively small regions of space. Roman’s strength will be breadth.\nBoth telescopes can observe infrared light, which means astronomers will be able to compare and combine their observations. Together, Roman and Webb could provide a more complete picture of the universe than either mission could produce alone.\nRoman’s primary mirror measures 7.9 feet across, the same size as the Hubble Space Telescope’s mirror. But one of Roman’s instruments will give it a dramatically wider view.\nThe Wide Field Instrument is designed to match the sensitivity of Hubble’s cameras while imaging an area 100 times larger.\nHubble has observed roughly 0.1% of the night sky during more than 30 years in space. Roman has the potential to cover the entire sky at the same resolution.\nThat sweeping view should make Roman especially good at finding rare objects. Scientists expect it to capture everything from dying stars and new worlds to massive galaxy clusters.\nUniversity of Arizona researchers will help turn those observations into new discoveries.\nNASA’s Nancy Grace Roman Space Telescope’s three main observing programs, highlighted in this infographic, can enable astronomers to view the universe as never before, revealing billions of cosmic objects strewn across enormous swaths of space-time. Credit: NASA’s Goddard Space Flight Center\nProbing Dark Matter and Dark Energy\nAmong Roman’s biggest targets are two of the deepest mysteries in cosmology: dark matter and dark energy.\nDark matter does not give off light, but its gravity affects galaxies and other structures throughout the universe. Dark energy is the name scientists give to the mysterious influence associated with the accelerating expansion of the cosmos.\nTogether, these invisible components make up nearly all of the universe.\nNASA selected the U of A’s Arizona Cosmology Lab to support two investigations aimed at understanding their nature, one involving a wide-field science team and another involving project infrastructure.\nElisabeth Krause, professor of astronomy and physics, leads the wide-field science team “Kinematic Lensing with the Roman Space Telescope.”\nThe team received $2 million to develop a cosmological measurement method called kinematic lensing.\nTurning Millions of Galaxies Into Cosmology\nAnother U of A group will take a leading role in the multi-institutional project infrastructure team “Maximizing Cosmological Science with the Roman High Latitude Imaging Survey.”\nTim Eifler, professor of astronomy and physics, leads the working group that will interpret Roman’s cosmological data.\nRoman will detect galaxies both nearby and extremely far away. Astronomers will determine where those galaxies are located and measure their properties to build enormous catalogs.\nResearchers will then use computer models to translate those catalogs into information about the underlying physics of the universe.\nThat requires substantial computing power.\nThe NASA Roman Project awarded Eifler’s lab $800,000 to purchase computing resources that will become part of a new university-wide high-performance computing system expected to arrive this fall.\nThe lab will receive another $2.4 million over five years to carry out the research.\n“This infrastructure will take us from catalogs to cosmological interpretation,” Eifler said. “We’ll be able to do things like determine how much dark energy and dark matter are in the universe.”\nEifler also serves as co-chair of the cosmology group, which brings together more than 1,000 scientists from around the world.\n“It’s fantastic to rally the community and to organize us around this science case,” he said. “This really is a dream job.”\nHunting Planets Hidden in Starlight\nRoman will not only map the large-scale universe. It will also test powerful new ways to directly image planets around other stars.\nIts Coronagraphic Instrument uses masks, prisms, detectors, filters, and self-flexing mirrors to suppress a star’s overwhelming light.\nOnce that glare is reduced, astronomers can try to see the much fainter planets and disks surrounding the star.\nNearly all known exoplanets have been discovered indirectly. One common method, for example, measures the tiny drop in starlight that occurs when a planet crosses in front of its star.\nRoman’s coronagraph takes a different approach by attempting to reveal the planet itself.\nThe instrument is expected to detect planets that are 100 million times fainter than their host stars. That represents an improvement of 100 to 1,000 times over existing space-based coronagraphs.\n“It will be a crucial pathfinder for a future Habitable Worlds Observatory,” a recommended telescope that would be specifically designed to search for signs of life in other solar systems, said Schuyler Wolff, an associate research professor of astronomy leading the observation planning working group for the Coronagraph Instrument.\nPreparing To Study Alien Worlds\nSeveral other University of Arizona researchers helped develop Roman’s Coronagraph Instrument and will participate in future observations.\nThey include Lunar and Planetary Laboratory director Mark Marley, associate professor of astronomy Ewan S. Douglas, Steward Observatory assistant research professor Ramya Anche, and astronomy postdoctoral research associate Justin Hom.\nMarley, along with LPL associate professor Ty Robinson and LPL postdoctoral research associate Zarah Brown, plans to use coronagraph data to investigate the atmospheres of worlds beyond our solar system.\nBrown has been modeling the climates and spectra of self-luminous giant planets. These planets are generally so young and hot that they produce their own thermal infrared light.\nHer models predict atmospheric temperature, composition and clouds, as well as the infrared spectrum each planet should emit.\nThose forecasts matter because many of these objects have never been studied at these wavelengths.\n“That predicted spectrum is critical for planning,” Brown said. “Roman’s coronagraph is working with extremely faint, high-contrast targets, so the team has to schedule enough observing time to detect a candidate without burning more of the mission’s limited time than necessary.”\nAnche’s team is studying the structures of extrasolar systems.\nHom, meanwhile, is leading efforts to identify the best stars for calibrating the Coronagraph Instrument. He also leads precursor observing programs using ground-based telescopes, which will help confirm targets for future Roman investigations.\nScience Operations Begin in January 2027\nOnce Roman begins science operations in January, its observations will be made available to researchers across the scientific community.\nThe U of A will lead nine NASA-approved investigations using Roman data, bringing in more than $2 million.\nThose projects will extend well beyond dark energy and exoplanets. Researchers will also investigate supermassive black holes, gravitational lenses, galaxy formation, reionization and cosmic dust.\nWith its combination of Hubble-like detail and a vastly wider view, Roman is designed to find what other telescopes can easily miss, and to show astronomers how those discoveries fit into the bigger cosmic picture.\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nGoogle News\nAstronomy\nAstrophysics\nRoman Space Telescope\nUniversity of Arizona\nArticles\nNASA’s Powerful New Roman Space Telescope Is Cleared for Launch\nNASA’s Roman Telescope Will Search 100 Million Stars for New Worlds\nNASA’s Roman Space Telescope Could Finally Find the Milky Way’s Missing Neutron Stars\nNASA’s Roman Telescope Set to Map Billions of Galaxies and Hunt Rogue Planets\nJames Webb Uncovers the Whirling Origins of Planetary Systems\nNASA’s Roman Space Telescope Gets Cosmic “Sneak Peek” From Supercomputers\nEchoes of Creation: The Roman Telescope’s Quest for Primordial Black Holes\nAstronomers Discover a Planet in a Triple Star System","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/nasas-new-space-telescope-could-map-the-entire-sky-with-hubble-like-detail/","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/航天","a":"scitechdaily","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"技术突破","tp":"罗马巡天望远镜","sc":7.1,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":7.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"as":"NASA的南希·格蕾丝·罗曼太空望远镜即将发射，其设计结合了类似哈勃的分辨率与100倍大的视场，能以空前速度扫掠大范围天空，以类似哈勃的细节绘制整个天空。该望远镜将用于探索暗能量、暗物质、遥远星系、垂死恒星以及隐藏在其他太阳光芒中的系外行星。亚利桑那大学的多名教员和学生参与了相关研究工作。","kp":["观测灵敏度[罗曼太空望远镜]: 达到哈勃级灵敏度，可对大范围天空进行巡天观测"]},{"t":"科学家发现隐藏在火星深处的巨大岩浆系统的证据","b":"Seismic evidence suggests Mars may have developed vast, long-lived magmatic systems that repeatedly reshaped its crust despite lacking plate tectonics. Credit: Shutterstock\nMars may have built a surprisingly complex crust through large magmatic systems without the plate tectonics long thought necessary.\nMars has no moving tectonic plates, yet deep beneath its surface may lie evidence of the kind of vast, interconnected magmatic systems once thought to require them. Researchers from the University of Oxford have found signs that molten rock once evolved and recycled itself through the Martian crust, creating geological complexity with striking parallels to processes on Earth. The findings were published in\nNature Astronomy\nMars is considered a ‘stagnant lid’ planet because, unlike Earth, its outer surface is not divided into moving tectonic plates. On our planet, plate tectonics drives volcanism, material recycling, and continent–building, leading many researchers to assume that Mars could not have developed similarly complex crust. The new evidence suggests that extensive internal recycling may have allowed it to do so without Earth-like tectonics.\nA buried boundary revealed complex crust\nThe key clue came from seismic measurements collected by NASA’s InSight mission, which recorded waves generated by meteoroid impacts and marsquakes, the Martian equivalent of earthquakes. Researchers in Oxford’s Departments of Earth Sciences and Statistics focused on an unexplained boundary about 24 kilometers below the surface. Earlier studies had detected it, but its geological meaning remained uncertain.\nTo determine whether the boundary separated distinct rock types, the researchers used thermodynamic modeling and statistical methods to compare the seismic observations with hundreds of possible rock compositions.\nOnly ‘ultramafic’ (rich in iron and magnesium, but low in silica) rocks consistently reproduced the physical properties below the 24-km boundary. Above it, the observations were better explained by ‘mafic’ (containing a higher proportion of silica) rocks.\nThe researchers propose that the deeper layer formed when molten rock accumulated far underground and gradually separated into different components. Dense crystals would have remained near the bottom of the crust while lighter, more evolved melts moved upward. Similar processes occur beneath volcanic arcs on Earth and are associated with continent formation.\nSome of the research team at Oxford University’s Department of Earth Sciences behind the study. From left to right: Professor Mike Kendall, Dr Tobermory Mackay-Champion and Professor Jon Wade. Credit: Charlie Rex\nLead author Dr Tobermory Mackay-Champion (Department of Earth Sciences, University of Oxford at the time of the study, now University of Bristol) said: “We’ve traditionally assumed that volcanism on Mars was relatively simple compared to that on Earth. But this discovery suggests Mars could sustain large, long-lived systems where molten rock evolved and reprocessed itself throughout the entire crust. It raises exciting possibilities for how common such systems might be on rocky planets beyond our solar system.”\nMars may not need plate tectonics\nThe buried layer may stretch horizontally for hundreds or even thousands of kilometers across Mars’ northern hemisphere. If so, the planet once contained enormous connected magmatic systems rather than a collection of simple, isolated volcanoes. This process, known as ‘transcrustal magmatism,’ had previously been thought unique to Earth.\nThat distinction matters because geological recycling is closely tied to the development of atmospheres, oceans, and potentially habitable environments. On Earth, recycling within the planet helps regulate climate and supports the long-term movement of water and other volatile elements. Plate tectonics has often been considered essential to maintaining those processes.\nThe Martian evidence suggests that rocky planets may be able to develop complex crusts and some of the geological conditions associated with habitability without Earth-style plate tectonics.\nHabitability may emerge on more worlds\nCo-author Professor Jon Wade (Department of Earth Sciences, University of Oxford) said: “One of the big questions in planetary science is whether Earth is unique. If Mars could develop this kind of complex crust without plate tectonics, then maybe the conditions needed for habitability can emerge on more planets than we realized, including those previously dismissed based on size or their apparent lack of tectonic activity.”\nThe findings build on observations from NASA’s InSight mission, which placed the first seismometer on Mars in 2018 and gave researchers an unprecedented view of the planet’s interior.\nReference: “Seismic evidence for a melt-depleted lower crust and transcrustal magmatism on Mars” by T. Mackay-Champion, M. Anderson Loake, R. Palin, J. Wade and J.-M. Kendall, 26 June 2026,\nNature Astronomy\nDOI: 10.1038/s41550-026-02907-5\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nGoogle News\nPlanetary Science\nSeismology\nUniversity of Oxford\nArticles\nNew Study Reveals How Rain Reshaped the Surface of Mars\nCuriosity Reveals Clues About Past Water, Climate, and Habitability on Mars\nNASA’s Mars Reconnaissance Orbiter Confirms Evidence That Liquid Water Flows on Mars\nCuriosity Rover Reveals Evidence of Ancient Top-of-Atmosphere Loss\nMars Reconnaissance Orbiter Detects Impact Glass on Mars\nMartian Slopes of Arsia Mons May Have Been Home to a Habitable Environment\nMartian Meteorites Yield Clues to the Planet’s Early Atmosphere\nASU Research Shows Gusev Crater on Mars Once Held a Lake\nData Suggests Mars Had An Oxygen-Rich Atmosphere","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/hidden-deep-beneath-mars-scientists-find-evidence-of-a-vast-magmatic-system/","c":"未分类","a":"scitechdaily","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察","tp":"火星岩浆系统","as":"牛津大学研究人员发现火星可能存在巨大且长期活动的岩浆系统证据。火星没有板块构造，被视作'停滞盖层'行星，但地震学数据显示火星壳下或有曾经被认为必须依赖板块运动才能形成的互联岩浆系统，熔融岩石曾在火星壳中演化并自我循环，形成与地球过程惊人相似的地质复杂性。成果发表于《自然·天文学》。这表明火星可能在没有板块构造的情况下，通过大型岩浆系统构建出复杂的地壳结构。"},{"t":"RNA 中微小的化学差异可能有助于解释生命的起源","b":"Researchers found that RNA droplets can shift from fluid structures into more rigid, gel-like networks. That behavior could have helped primitive molecules persist in the harsh environments of early Earth. Credit: Shutterstock\nA tiny chemical difference makes RNA better than DNA at forming liquid-like droplets under high temperatures and acidic conditions.\nOne of the biggest puzzles in origin of life research comes before the first cells even existed: How could RNA molecules gather in one place, interact, and help produce early life without cellular compartments to hold them together?\nWithout those boundaries, fragile RNA molecules would have struggled to encounter one another often enough in the primordial soup, while also surviving the hot and acidic conditions thought to characterize early Earth.\nOne possible solution is RNA’s ability to collect into liquid-like droplets known as condensates. These structures have no membrane, but they could have concentrated RNA molecules in small spaces, giving them more opportunities to interact while potentially offering some protection from harsh surroundings.\nResearch led by the University at Buffalo is now helping explain why RNA is especially capable of forming these droplets. Published in\nNature Communications\n, the study found that a very small chemical distinction between RNA and DNA helps RNA assemble into droplets more readily as temperatures increase. That same difference also makes the droplets more likely to develop into rigid, gel-like networks.\n“These findings reveal, for the first time, how remarkably small changes in molecular chemistry can control the emergence of much larger, self-organized biomolecular structures like RNA condensates,” says lead corresponding author Priya R. Banerjee, PhD, Twentieth Century Club Professor in the UB Department of Physics. “They could allow us to eventually address even deeper questions, like whether these condensates helped bridge the gap between simple molecules and the earliest forms of life.”\nThe research was conducted with Jerelle Joseph, PhD, assistant professor of chemical and biological engineering at Princeton University, and received support from the National Institutes of Health, the National Science Foundation, and Hypothesis Fund.\nRNA droplets could solve a prebiotic problem\nThe study is part of Banerjee’s broader work on RNA world theory, which proposes that RNA was central to the emergence of life on Earth. Because RNA can both store genetic information and catalyze chemical reactions, it may have been capable of carrying out chemistry that eventually contributed to the emergence of DNA, proteins, and the first cells.\nA major challenge for the theory is explaining how relatively unstable RNA could have endured harsh prebiotic environments and how enough molecules could have accumulated together to interact before cellular compartments existed.\nHeat transforms clusters of RNA into liquid-like droplets. The study found that temperature can alter the physical properties of RNA condensates, allowing a more networked structure to relax into rounded droplets. Credit: Priya Banerjee/University at Buffalo\nRNA condensates may offer part of the explanation. In a 2023 study, Banerjee and colleagues showed that RNA naturally tends to organize into liquid-like droplets at high temperatures.\nThe researchers built on that finding by directly comparing RNA with single-stranded DNA containing essentially the same sequences.\nTheir experiments showed that RNA started forming droplets at temperatures about 10 degrees Celsius lower than comparable DNA, indicating that RNA has a stronger tendency to condense. RNA also formed interconnected networks within the droplets more easily, shifting the material from a fluid state toward a more gel-like structure that could offer greater protection under harsh environmental conditions.\nOne oxygen atom changes condensation\nThe difference appears to stem partly from a remarkably small chemical distinction. RNA and DNA differ by only one oxygen atom on each sugar unit. RNA contains a chemical group called a 2′-hydroxyl (2′-OH), which DNA lacks.\nUsing temperature-controlled microscopy, small-angle X-ray scattering, and molecular dynamics simulations carried out by the Joseph group, the researchers found that the 2′-OH appears to strengthen RNA’s interactions with magnesium ions while reducing the number of water molecules surrounding its backbone compared with DNA. Together, those properties make it easier for RNA molecules to gather as temperature rises.\nTo test whether the 2′-OH was responsible, the researchers chemically altered it to 2′-Ome, a modification similar to those present in many naturally occurring RNA molecules. The change reduced RNA’s tendency to condense and affected whether the resulting droplets stayed fluid or developed into gel-like material.\n“This single oxygen-containing group on RNA’s sugar has a surprisingly powerful effect on whether these molecules come together, remain dynamic or become arrested into a gel-like material,” says first author Gable Wadsworth, PhD, a postdoc in Banerjee’s lab who will join the University of Texas at El Paso as an assistant professor this fall.\nResearchers are building cell-sized RNA compartments\nBanerjee’s laboratory is now trying to engineer RNA droplets capable of performing some basic cellular functions, including biochemical reactions. The researchers hope to program them as active, dynamic, cell-sized compartments that could eventually provide a foundation for creating synthetic cells made entirely from RNA.\n“These kinds of self-organizing RNA compartments were possibly a step along the way to single-cell organisms,” Banerjee says.\nReference: “The role of the 2’-OH group in phase separation and percolation transitions of RNA” by Gable M. Wadsworth, Dilimulati Aierken, George M. Thurston, Jerelle A. Joseph and Priya R. Banerjee, 31 July 2026,\nNature Communications\nDOI: 10.1038/s41467-026-75961-2\nNever miss a breakthrough:\nJoin the SciTechDaily newsletter.\nFollow us on\nGoogle News\nBiochemistry\nEvolutionary Biology\nMolecular Biology\nUniversity at Buffalo\nArticles\nDNAzymes – How Active DNA Biocatalysts That Destroy Unwanted RNA Molecules Work\nThe Future of Medicine: New Invention Yields More, Purer RNA at Fraction of the Cost\nA Molecule That Shouldn’t Exist – “The Biggest Scientific Shock of My Life”\nScientists Can Now Scoop Molecular Contents of Individual Cells for Study\nNew Repair Mechanism for Alcohol-Induced DNA Damage Discovered\nScientists Demonstrate How Primordial Life on Earth Replicated\nNew Findings Challenge Assumptions about the Origins of Life\nKey Differences in Seemingly Synonymous Parts of the Genetic Code\nDNA Could Predate Existence of Life As We Know It\nComments","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://scitechdaily.com/one-tiny-chemical-difference-in-rna-could-help-explain-the-origins-of-life/","c":"未分类","a":"scitechdaily","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察","tp":"RNA液滴","as":"生命起源研究发现，RNA与DNA之间的微小化学差异使RNA在高温和酸性条件下更易形成液状液滴，且RNA液滴可从流体结构转变为更刚性的凝胶状网络，这种行为有助于原始分子在早期地球恶劣环境中存续。该研究回应了生命起源领域的关键难题：在细胞出现之前，脆弱的RNA分子如何在没有细胞区室的情况下聚集一处、相互作用并推动早期生命产生。在原始汤的热酸环境中，RNA液滴特性帮助其克服分散和存活难题。"},{"t":"Salesforce 如何彻底改变 AI 收费方式","b":"As software firms sell more AI, they are shifting from subscription fees to charging based on how much customers use it and whether it actually helps their business. Salesforce shows how complicated this transition may be. A provider of software for managing customer relationships and other tasks, Salesforce is starting to let businesses choose how they want to pay for its Agentforce AI. That includes negotiating custom contracts that charge businesses based on how much the AI either grows revenue by helping salespeople close more deals or cuts costs by automating more customer service interactions. “Customers want to buy and want to price in different ways. This is something I’ve learned really aggressively recently,” CEO Marc Benioff said in a call with investors Wednesday. Benioff’s comments show the uncertainty hovering over software pricing in the age of AI. Software firms are at odds over that question, and many have been under pressure because the AI tools they’ve launched haven’t accelerated overall revenue growth. Salesforce and its ilk are also reacting to competition from startups that have launched “outcome-based” pricing in which customers only pay when the AI works. In one previously unreported example, OpenAI in recent months has started giving some major customers the option of paying only when its AI completes tasks like handling customer support interactions, according to a person with direct knowledge of the matter. (An OpenAI spokesperson declined to comment.) Customer management startups Sierra and Fin—which Salesforce is in the process of acquiring for $3.6 billion—similarly charge customers only when the AI completes tasks without human intervention. Coding assistant Cognition, meanwhile, is promising enterprise customers up to $10 million in credits if it fails to deliver engineering results worth at least what customers pay for it. And some older software firms, including Adobe Systems, HubSpot and Zendesk, have already moved in the direction of charging for AI only when it works. Pricing Quandaries These firms are figuring out how to make money from AI products that can be costly to provide to customers. That can be a challenge, as customers’ IT budgets have already been strained by a plethora of competitive AI tools, such as Anthropic’s Claude. The rise of Anthropic, which sells such AI agents, presents Salesforce with even more pricing quandaries. As companies use advanced AI agents like Claude to handle more complex tasks involving software applications such as Salesforce’s, workers are less likely to interact with the apps themselves, which could reduce the influence of enterprise incumbents. For now, Salesforce is leaning into the new paradigm: Last week it announced Claudeforce, which provides a way for customers to use Claude to access or do lots of tasks involving Salesforce apps without using those apps directly. Salesforce is likely to give customers various ways to pay for Claudeforce, which is tied to an initiative to make money anytime AI from other providers taps data in Salesforce apps. Customers will need to pay for a higher subscription tier to enable this, according to a person with knowledge of the sales strategy. Mirroring Palantir Salesforce’s move to charge for AI based on whether it boosts sales or saves costs mirrors pricing long offered by software firm Palantir , which negotiates highly customized deals with its enterprise clients to unify their data and develop applications. It charges a combination of flat fees and usage- and outcome-based pricing. According to Benioff, the flexible approach to AI pricing allowed the company “to sign very large transactions” with customers. Salesforce said last week that growth in the sales of Agentforce and a data management service more than tripled year over year. While that growth didn’t boost overall revenue much, investors were pleased, sending the stock up about 23% since then. “We’re moving to not just kind of outcome-based pricing, which is [like,] ‘We completed this many phone calls, therefore, give us $2,’” Benioff said. “We want to be able to say, ‘No, we improve revenue by this much, so give us $2 because we made you $20 or we made you $40.’” He noted software suppliers can “get huge prices for their products” with this model. That’s certainly true for Palantir, which uses this method with some customers and whose revenues have skyrocketed over the past year. Benioff has a unique understanding of how pricing models can be a competitive advantage. More than a quarter century ago, Salesforce led an industry shift away from customers buying business applications outright to renting them via recurring subscriptions based on the number of employees they had. This spared smaller firms the up-front expense of buying software and made it simple to increase their usage as they added more employees. As an additional benefit, Salesforce handled all of the application upgrades on its end, saving customers from a traditionally expensive and time-consuming process. The changes ushered a two-decade bonanza for firms that followed this software-as-a-service mode. It wasn’t always easy: Revenue at Splunk, which makes software for monitoring computer systems, temporarily fell as that company transitioned to a subscription business model from licensing software. Attribution Disputes? But AI has turned the subscription model on its head, and Salesforce now finds itself following others’ lead in how to price software. The results of this period of experimentation will determine whether older enterprise software companies like Salesforce can survive the upheaval triggered by AI. As outcome-based pricing gains steam, the process of determining when a cost savings results from the enterprise customer’s own efforts or from the software could get messy. Perhaps anticipating future disputes between customers and vendors, payment provider Stripe has published guidelines for outcome-based pricing. > A sales conversion of other successful outcomes “could stem from product tweaks, marketing campaigns or seasonality” rather than the software, Stripe said. “Unless attribution rules are explicit, customers could argue over whether the outcome belongs to you,” meaning the software provider.","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/articles/salesforce-overhauling-way-charges-ai","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/工程改进/AGENT","a":"the information","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"产业进展","tp":"AI收费变革","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"as":"软件公司销售AI的方式正从订阅费转向基于使用量和实际业务效果收费，Salesforce的实践展示了这一转型的复杂性。Salesforce开始让企业客户自选Agentforce AI的付费方式，包括协商定制合同，按AI帮助销售人员达成更多交易带来的收入增长，或通过自动化客服互动降低的成本来计费。CEO Marc Benioff在投资者电话会上表示，客户希望以不同方式购买和定价，他近期对此认识深刻。这一案例反映了AI商业模式的演变方向。","kp":["[AI收费模式转变]: Salesforce Agentforce从订阅制转向基于使用量和业务效果（收入增长）的定制化合同计费"]},{"t":"How Apple Stumbled Into AI Hardware Success With the Mac","b":"The hottest products at Apple right now are not the iPhone, the iPad or a buzzy new show on the company’s streaming service. They are two of the lowliest members of Apple’s venerable Mac product line: its boxy Mac mini and Mac Studio computers, which come without monitors, keyboards or mice and are designed for professional users. The products are currently flying off the shelves, because it turns out that the machines are well suited to running agents—AI software that handles multistep tasks, from editing and testing code to automating email inbox organization and summarizing documents. And they’re also a hit with AI developers who want to save on cloud computing bills by training and running their models locally. In the most recent June quarter, Mac sales grew nearly 29% annually to $10.4 billion, faster than any other product segment at the company. One sign of the unlikely star status for the products occurred on June 23, when Apple held an unusual event on its Cupertino, Calif., campus, known as Apple Park. Normally, Apple is hyperfocused on selling its hardware and services to consumers, but it devoted the June event—called Business at the Park—to enterprise customers. Executives from Walt Disney Co. and Ford Motor were there, as was Anthropic co-founder Jared Kaplan. Tim Cook and John Ternus—Apple’s outgoing and incoming CEOs, respectively—showed up too. One of Apple’s loudest messages to the attendees was that its hardware is ideal for handling AI chores locally rather than in the data centers of pricey cloud services. And according to one attendee, Apple’s Mac mini was the “darling” of the event. For AI developers, Mac minis and Mac Studios have become favorites because Apple loads them with more powerful versions of its M-series computer chips and more memory. Unlike a thin MacBook, which can quickly heat up and throttle chip performance, the boxy Macs have cooling systems that can handle long, complex AI tasks. And while Apple’s in-house silicon chips aren’t as powerful overall as Nvidia’s graphics processing units—which dominate the AI chip market—their single shared pool of memory gives them performance advantages for AI workloads. Some AI labs like OpenAI have bought tens of thousands of Mac minis and Mac Studios for the task of reinforcement learning, a technique where the AI learns through trial and error, said people familiar with OpenAI. OpenAI is using these Macs for training computer-use agents and is desperate to acquire more of them, the people said. Anthropic also rents Mac minis from Amazon’s cloud service, Amazon Web Services, people familiar with Anthropic’s efforts said. Some startups are even building out Mac-only cloud services, in anticipation of a future where demand for Apple hardware grows so much that some AI developers will want to run on Macs in data centers rather than locally. One such startup is a new Apple hardware–based neocloud company, Mount Thor, founded by Peter Voell, a former OpenAI compute infrastructure employee. Though it is still mostly operating in stealth mode, Mount Thor’s minimal website describes its offerings as “AI execution environments on Apple hardware.” Apple promotes open-source software from EXO Labs that enables people to cluster Macs together to run trillion-parameter AI models locally. The Mac’s popularity for local AI has attracted the attention of Nvidia. While most AI training and inference chores are likely to remain in the cloud, demand for local AI has been on the rise, and Nvidia sees Apple as its biggest competitor in local AI, according to a person who has discussed the competitive threat with Nvidia executives. Nvidia has even come up with new products to get a bigger piece of that market. Late last year, the chipmaker released DGX Spark, an AI desktop computer with a compact squared-off design similar to that of the Mac mini. Unfortunately for Apple, the exploding popularity of Macs has come at a time when it and other device makers are suffering from severe supply-chain woes. They are wrestling with a historic shortage of memory chips caused by AI data centers’ voracious need for them. The most advanced models of Mac minis and Mac Studios, which have the chips and memory configurations most appealing to AI developers, have been out of stock for months. “The memory shortage is impacting Apple, and if enterprises are unable to get their Macs, they’ll migrate to different hardware choices,” said David Stout, CEO of webAI, a startup selling AI tools to enterprises that use Apple hardware. That’s already started to happen. Some businesses have started to look at alternatives to Apple’s hardware because of the supply limitations for Macs over the past year, said Todd Dailey, a former enterprise marketing manager for Apple’s AI products. Companies and AI developers consistently bring up Nvidia’s DGX Spark as an option and is readily available now, said Dailey, who left Apple in April and is now an independent AI consultant. Because Mac demand has been so hot, Apple earlier this week announced new Mac mini and Mac Studio models with more powerful chips. It was an unusual time for the company to come out with the products: Apple typically does its end-of-the-year Mac refresh in October or November. In its announcement, it bragged about how the new Mac Studios can be clustered together to make a more powerful system for running giant frontier models. According to Dailey, the soaring demand for Macs among business customers has been accidental rather than something the company had planned for: Apple doesn’t have a dedicated engineering team for business customers, nor does it have any employees focused on developer relations. “The idea that any team at Apple has an actual plan for embracing enterprise AI is a joke,” Dailey said. Over the years, Apple has tried selling various enterprise server products, but support for these products has been inconsistent and spotty. The company sold Xserve, an Apple-made server product with Intel processing chips, between 2002 and 2011. It also released a server operating system based on Mac but discontinued that product in 2022. Apple has recently begun building its own servers using Mac chips. However, they’re strictly for internal use with Private Cloud Compute, the company’s server system for processing heavy-duty AI tasks that exceed the processing capabilities of the iPhone or Mac. Some business customers have asked if Apple can sell them access to these servers, but it has turned them down so far. Instead, the company is hoping partners like webAI and Mount Thor can help push its hardware deeper into the business world, people familiar with Apple’s enterprise strategy said.","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/articles/apple-stumbled-ai-hardware-success-mac","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/芯片","a":"the information","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察","tp":"Mac与AI代理","sc":5.6,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":8.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":6.0},"as":"苹果当前最热销的产品是Mac产品线中的Mac mini和Mac Studio两款面向专业用户的台式主机（不含显示器、键盘和鼠标）。这两款产品畅销的原因是其适合运行AI智能体软件，可处理多步骤任务，如编辑测试代码、自动整理邮件收件箱和总结文档；同时也受到AI开发者欢迎，他们希望通过本地训练和运行模型来节省云计算费用。最新6月季度，Mac销售额同比增长近29%，达到100亿美元以上。苹果意外在AI硬件领域取得成功。","kp":["[AI硬件需求趋势]: Mac mini和Mac Studio因适合运行多步骤任务AI智能体而热销"]},{"t":"独家：SpaceX 为涡轮叶片工厂奠定基础，以解决数据中心电力短缺问题","b":"Elon Musk intends to bypass the power supply chain for AI data centers in a way others assumed was impossible, by making highly complex components himself. It’s a move no one else has been bold enough to attempt. SpaceX has taken steps to develop a foundry in Bastrop, Texas, about 30 miles from Austin, to make vanes and blades for large gas turbines, according to job listings and other indicators. Update : After this story was published, Musk confirmed the reporting by tweeting that despite large investments in solar energy, “natural gas will still be needed to supplement and bootstrap solar for several years. By doing in-house casting [of blades and vanes] at SpaceX, we can accelerate nat gas turbines coming online by up to 18 months, which is a profound game-changer.” In recent months, SpaceX advertised that it is seeking a senior operations engineer “to serve as the extreme owner of the construction, buildout, and operational ramp-up of a new blades and vanes foundry.” It has sought a senior materials engineer, an automation engineer, a senior tooling engineer to design castings. SpaceX also says it is looking for a programmer to assist in the milling of parts in high-temperature superalloys at “SpaceX’s new industrial gas turbine (IGT) blades and vanes manufacturing line in Bastrop,” the Austin-area location. Morgan Stanley analyst Adam Jonas says his research also shows Musk is developing such a plant. Until now, a global oligopoly of four casting companies has tightly controlled production of these vanes and blades, engineered for ultrahigh heat of 3,000 to 3,600 degrees Fahrenheit, 800 degrees above their own melting point. The maxing out of their foundries is a key reason large turbine makers like GE Vernova are sold out until 2030 and why the AI building boom is short on power. ‘The Limiting Factor’ Musk previously stated in a February podcast that blades and vanes are “the limiting factor” to faster provisioning of turbines and ultimately to standing up data centers. (Blades are also known to crack under stress running volatile AI workloads, so having a few extras handy might be helpful.) At the current production rate, Musk said, “it’s not clear to me that there’s enough usable electricity to turn on all the AI chips that are being made.” His prognostication continues to prove accurate, as we have been chronicling in this column week after week . If he succeeds in making the parts and using them to build or refurbish more turbines, Musk could potentially build some of the 10 gigawatts or more of terrestrial data centers he has told SpaceX investors he could put up by the end of 2027. Musk said earlier this month that he had secured Nvidia chips for these future sites, and AI cloud providers I spoke with argued that he has the capital and gall to bootstrap his way to power. SpaceX shares plunged after the call on fears about what it would all cost. Debates continued to rage between traditional energy experts who asserted that powering hyperscale data centers off grid is far harder than it looks and AI bulls like Dylan Patel of research and investment firm SemiAnalysis, who stated his belief that Musk could pull it off. “This is because you have no idea how to build infrastructure,” Jigar Shah, a clean energy and power entrepreneur who ran President Biden’s energy loan office, shot back at Patel on X. Musk’s potential to unlock even more fossil fuel power for AI data centers would represent a setback to low-carbon energy advocates who had hoped the supply crunch for turbines would encourage renewables. BloombergNEF has estimated that if planned off-grid gas plants for data centers come to fruition, they would boost U.S. carbon dioxide emissions 20%. That figure wouldn’t include Musk’s latest efforts, but it would count 2 GW of off-grid gas deployments that SpaceX’s xAI unit has said will be running by the end of the year at its data centers in the Memphis, Tenn., area. Dual Use It couldn’t be learned where he is seeking to locate his new data centers, but Grace reported last month that Musk was laying the groundwork for a major facility in Texas, where he also has plans in various stages for a massive chip foundry and solar panel manufacturing complex. He has also said he would expand facilities in the Memphis area. Morgan Stanley’s Jonas believes SpaceX is standing up a Texas turbine-component foundry for both its data center needs and its Raptor turbopumps, vital internal components of the company’s rocket engines. “Raptor turbopump castings and data center turbine airfoils draw on the same alloys, furnaces and trained workforce, letting a single foundry spread fixed cost across the space and AI businesses,” Jonas said in a report this month. To be sure, nailing the casting process to replicate what leaders like Precision Castparts have done for decades isn’t easy and could take years. But it’s critical to SpaceX’s relatively recently adopted quest to become a cloud provider on par with today’s incumbents. Getting Turbines In the interim, Musk is working to access several gigawatts of bridge power in the also-scarce market for smaller turbines. Jonas said Musk could access about 3 to 4 GW of power by the end of 2027 through a mix of purchase agreements. In recent months, Musk has worked quietly to source turbines with Wall Street hedge fund Fortress Investment Group, which has invested in at least two separate suppliers. A SpaceX facility (in background) at Elon Musk's Snailbrook town in Bastrop, Texas. Photo by Brandon Bell/Getty Images Fortress sold a supplier of mobile industrial turbines, APR Energy, to Musk personally, according to a Federal Trade Commission filing in May. APR said in January it had about 1 GW of turbines in its fleet, suggesting they would become available to Musk. SpaceX may also be purchasing turbines from FTAI Aviation, which modifies and refurbishes the machines for commercial aircraft engines. FTAI, spun out from another Fortress portfolio company, announced a $1.465 billion turbine sale in July via its Chinese joint venture partner to “a leading international cloud services provider.” Jonas has identified FTAI as a possible supplier to SpaceX. The Bastrop foundry plans are relatively new. SpaceXAI already operates a factory there, related to its Starlink satellite business, but between March and June it bought about 830 nearby acres, according to Corey Trinetti, a due diligence specialist who publishes detailed reviews of AI infrastructure sites in his newsletter, Measured AI . Two newly developed buildings adjacent to the Starlink factory  that were not there a year earlier appeared in satellite imagery in July. Trinetti was unable to find foundry permits or construction filings in Texas environmental or building records, however, so it isn’t clear whether SpaceX has started a permitting process. Musk already stunned the data center industry once by completing the Colossus data center in Memphis in record time two years ago. It wasn’t the highest-quality facility , to be sure, but SpaceX is now making a lot of money from renting it out to Anthropic. He’s trying to do it again with power, and betting against him is usually a risky strategy. New From Our Reporters Exclusive Nvidia Agrees to Buy Open Source AI Platform Hugging Face For $12.9 Billion By Amir Efrati, Valida Pau and Phoebe Liu Exclusive SoftBank in Talks to Buy Majority Stake in Humanoid Maker 1X at $6 Billion Valuation By Rocket Drew, Valida Pau and Amir Efrati Exclusive Anthropic Considers Letting Shareholders Sell In IPO, Departing from SpaceX Playbook By Cory Weinberg and Valida Pau Exclusive Inside Cognition’s Booming Growth, High Cash Burn By Amir Efrati and Stephanie Palazzolo Upcoming Events Wednesday, September 23 — AI Agenda Live SF 2026 Join us to explore the technologies and strategies shaping AI’s next era, with insights from Google DeepMind, OpenAI, Atlassian, and more. Tickets are limited—reserve yours today. More details Tuesday, October 27 — The Information’s 2026 WTF Summit The Information’s WTF Summit returns to Napa Valley October 27–28, bringing together the women shaping what’s next across tech, media and finance. Expect two days of candid conversations, unexpected connections and a room built for meaningful exchange. Tickets are selling quickly, with the next price increase coming soon. More details","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://www.theinformation.com/newsletters/ai-infrastructure/exclusive-spacex-lays-groundwork-turbine-blade-factory-solve-data-center-power-crunch","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/数据中心","a":"the information","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"产业进展","tp":"SpaceX涡轮厂","sc":7.5,"scd":{"b":6.0,"i":5.0,"r":9.0,"d":6.0,"t":9.0},"aip":1,"as":"马斯克计划通过自主制造高复杂度组件来绕过AI数据中心的电力供应链。SpaceX已在得克萨斯州巴斯特罗普（距奥斯汀约30英里）筹建铸造厂，用于制造大型燃气轮机的叶片和导叶，相关信息来自职位招聘等迹象。马斯克在报道发布后发推确认：尽管大量投资太阳能，未来数年仍需天然气作为补充；通过SpaceX内部铸造叶片和导叶，可使天然气轮机并网提速最多18个月，称其为'深刻的游戏规则改变者'。","kp":["[SpaceX涡轮叶片工厂]: 在得克萨斯州Bastrop自建铸造厂生产大型燃气涡轮叶片，以绕过AI数据中心电力供应链"]},{"t":"俄罗斯罗斯托夫核电站新工装将过滤器检修时间缩短至两天","b":"俄罗斯罗斯托夫核电站新工装将过滤器检修时间缩短至两天\n当地时间8月28日，俄罗斯罗斯托夫核电站发布消息称，该站工程技术人员开发并投入使用一套专用工装，用于汽轮机厂房球式清洗预过滤系统(SShO)过滤器检修，可显著缩短设备维护准备和检修时间。\n罗斯托夫核电站隶属于俄罗斯核电公司(Rosenergoatom)，后者为俄罗斯国家原子能公司(Rosatom)电力板块组成部分。此次改进针对的过滤器单台重量超过1吨，移动时需要起重设备配合，但现场固定吊车无法直接覆盖相关设备位置。为解决这一问题，检修准备与实施部门提出改进方案，并设计出可将SShO过滤器移至便于检修区域的工装。\n该改进方案作者之一、检修准备与实施部门首席工程师德米特里·巴祖廷(Dmitry Bazhutin)介绍，使用新工装后，设备移至检修区域前的准备时间由7天缩短至2小时，作业人员也由原来的6人减少至2人。由于前期准备大幅压缩，SShO过滤器检修周期由10天缩短至2天。\n该方案在年度行业改进建议和俄罗斯国家原子能公司生产体系项目竞赛第一阶段中，被评为“提高劳动安全水平”类别最佳方案。2026年以来，罗斯托夫核电站已实施690项改进建议和26个生产体系项目。其中，核电机组值长亚历山大·祖博夫(Alexander Zubov)提交111项改进建议，为该站最活跃的改进方案提出者。\n罗斯托夫核电站生产体系发展部门负责人谢尔盖·菲季(Sergey Fidiy)表示，今年第一阶段评选出的优秀改进建议主要聚焦资源利用效率、降低工序劳动强度和提升劳动安全水平;优秀生产体系项目则面向简化流程、提高劳动生产率和优化成本。各类别第一名人员将代表罗斯托夫核电站参加俄罗斯核电公司层面的下一阶段竞赛。\n俄罗斯国家原子能公司生产体系(PSR)是其精益生产和持续改进机制。自2009年在罗斯托夫核电站启动以来，该站已实施约450个生产体系项目。2019年起，罗斯托夫核电站获得“PSR领导者”称号，近两年又被列为“数字化PSR企业”。\n罗斯托夫核电站位于齐姆良斯克水库岸边，运行4台VVER-1000型核电机组。每台机组日发电量约2500万千瓦时。该站核电在罗斯托夫州电力生产结构中占比超过70%，在俄罗斯南部统一电力系统中占比约30%。","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://www.cinie.net/article/63356.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/核电","a":"中国核电信息网-国际","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"产业进展","tp":"核电检修工装","sc":5.8,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"as":"俄罗斯罗斯托夫核电站开发并投用一套专用工装，用于汽轮机厂房球式清洗预过滤器（SShO）检修。该过滤器单台重超1吨，需起重设备移动，而固定吊车无法覆盖相关位置。新工装可将过滤器移至便于检修的区域，使检修准备时间从7天缩短至2小时，作业人员由6人减至2人，整体检修周期由10天缩短至2天。该方案在俄罗斯国家原子能公司生产体系项目竞赛第一阶段被评为'提高劳动安全水平'类别最佳方案。罗斯托夫核电站2026年以来已实施690项改进建议和26个生产体系项目。","kp":["过滤器检修周期[SShO预过滤系统新工装]: 由10天缩短至2天","检修准备时间[新工装]: 由7天缩短至2小时","作业人员[新工装]: 由6人减少至2人","过滤器单台重量[SShO]: 超过1吨"]},{"t":"俄罗斯核能占本国能源结构约19%","b":"俄罗斯核能占本国能源结构约19%\n俄罗斯国家原子能集团公司(Rosatom)日前发布的公开报告显示，核能目前约占俄罗斯联邦能源结构的19%。\n报告称，Rosatom旗下企业生产的低碳电力总量已超过2200亿千瓦时，统计范围包括核能和风能。若将该集团旗下所有发电企业纳入计算，包括核电站、火电站和风电站，其总发电量约占俄罗斯全国发电量的20%。\n报告还提到，位于楚科奇半岛佩韦克的浮动核电站已运行五年，累计发电量达到10亿千瓦时。该设施是目前全球唯一在运的浮动核电站。","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://www.cinie.net/article/63317.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/核电","a":"中国核电信息网-国际","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察","tp":"俄核能占比","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":6.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"俄罗斯国家原子能公司（Rosatom）公开报告显示，核能目前约占俄罗斯能源结构的19%。Rosatom旗下企业生产的低碳电力总量（含核能和风能）已超过2200亿千瓦时；若将核电站、火电站和风电站全部纳入计算，其总发电量约占俄罗斯全国发电量的20%。此外，位于楚科奇半岛佩韦克的浮动核电站已运行五年，累计发电量达10亿千瓦时，是目前全球唯一在运的浮动核电站。","kp":["核能占比[俄罗斯能源结构]: 约19%","低碳电力总量[Rosatom旗下核能和风能]: 超过2200亿千瓦时","发电量占比[Rosatom全部发电企业]: 约占俄罗斯全国20%","累计发电量[佩韦克浮动核电站运行五年]: 10亿千瓦时"]},{"t":"日本核监管机构视察幌延高放射性废物地质处置研究设施","b":"日本核监管机构视察幌延高放射性废物地质处置研究设施\n8月28日，日本原子力规制委员会 (NRA) 成员长崎真也 (Shinya Nagasaki) 等人视察了位于日本幌延町的一处地下研究设施。该设施由日本原子能研究开发机构 (JAEA) 运营，主要开展高放射性废物深地层处置相关技术研究。\n高放射性废物地质处置，是指将相关废物封装后埋设在地下深处，通过工程屏障和天然地质屏障实现长期隔离。此次视察中，长崎真也一行查看了用于评估铁制容器耐腐蚀性能的试验设施。该试验模拟装有放射性废物热源的容器被埋入地下后的环境，以研究其长期变化情况。\n视察人员还进入了今年1月竣工的地下500米研究隧道。该隧道将用于开展更深层次的地下环境研究，为地质处置技术评估提供数据支撑。\n现场考察结束后，NRA成员与研究中心工作人员进行了意见交流，重点讨论了相关试验取得的数据及分析结果。长崎真也表示，实验室研究与地下现场研究可能得出不同结果，他对该设施后续研究成果表示期待。","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://www.cinie.net/article/63298.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/核电","a":"中国核电信息网-国际","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"政策监管","tp":"核废料处置","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"8月28日，日本原子力规制委员会（NRA）成员长崎真也等人视察了位于幌延町、由日本原子能研究开发机构（JAEA）运营的地下研究设施，该设施开展高放射性废物深地层处置技术研究。视察中查看了评估铁制容器耐腐蚀性能的试验设施，模拟装有放射性废物热源的容器埋入地下后的环境以研究其长期变化。视察人员还进入了今年1月竣工的地下500米研究隧道，该隧道将用于更深层地下环境研究。长崎真也表示实验室研究与地下现场研究可能得出不同结果，期待后续成果。","kp":["研究隧道深度[幌延地下研究设施]: 地下500米，2025年1月竣工","[高放废物地质处置研究]: 通过工程屏障和天然地质屏障实现长期隔离，评估铁制容器长期耐腐蚀性能"]},{"t":"俄罗斯2025年深化亚非核电站建设合作","b":"俄罗斯2025年深化亚非核电站建设合作\n俄罗斯国家原子能公司(Rosatom)近日发布报告称，2025年，公司在亚洲和非洲大型及小型核电站建设合作方面取得进展，并进一步巩固其作为全球技术合作伙伴的定位。\n报告指出，到2025年底，Rosatom面向合作伙伴国家提供的方案已不局限于能源领域，而是扩展至更综合的技术合作。相关成果包括推进中亚、非洲和东南亚地区大型核电站与小型核电站项目合作，以及扩大非能源产品出口。\n在非能源业务方面，报告提到，Rosatom已在白俄罗斯开设增材制造中心，并计划在乌兹别克斯坦启动利用辐射技术的相关项目。\nRosatom表示，上述合作体现了公司面向全球市场提供多行业技术解决方案的业务方向。","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://www.cinie.net/article/63329.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/核电","a":"中国核电信息网-国际","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"产业进展","tp":"俄核电合作","sc":4.4,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":"俄罗斯国家原子能公司（Rosatom）报告称，2025年在亚洲和非洲大型及小型核电站建设合作方面取得进展。到2025年底，Rosatom面向合作伙伴国家的方案已从能源领域扩展至更综合的技术合作，包括推进中亚、非洲和东南亚地区核电项目合作及扩大非能源产品出口。非能源业务方面，Rosatom已在白俄罗斯开设增材制造中心，并计划在乌兹别克斯坦启动利用辐射技术的相关项目，体现其提供多行业技术解决方案的业务方向。","kp":["[Rosatom亚非合作]: 2025年推进中亚、非洲、东南亚大型及小型核电站项目合作","[非能源业务]: 在白俄罗斯开设增材制造中心，计划在乌兹别克斯坦启动辐射技术项目"]},{"t":"英国民调显示核电成受访者首选未来电源","b":"英国民调显示核电成受访者首选未来电源\n受伊兰电缆公司 (Eland Cables) 委托开展的一项舆观调查公司 (YouGov) 最新调查显示，英国公众普遍支持可再生能源发展，但不少受访者对其单独承担低成本、稳定供电任务仍存疑。在未来电力来源优先选项中，核电以21%的支持率位居首位，高于太阳能的19%和海上风电的18%。\n调查结果显示，47%的英国受访者支持建设核电站。不过，当核电项目被设定在受访者本地建设时，支持率降至38%，反映出核电项目在全国层面与地方层面的接受度存在差异。\n可再生能源方面，64%的受访者对其持积极态度，仅12%持消极态度。44%的受访者认为英国向可再生能源转型的进展过慢，认为转型过快的比例为18%。\n尽管可再生能源获得较广泛支持，调查也显示，受访者对其长期保障能力仍有顾虑。51%的受访者不认为未来10年可再生能源能够带来可负担的能源成本;同样有51%的受访者怀疑可再生能源能否产生足够电力，以满足英国未来需求。\n调查表明，在英国未来能源结构讨论中，公众关注点正从单纯支持低碳能源，进一步转向供电可靠性、用能成本和能源安全等问题。核电因此被部分受访者视为英国未来电力系统的重要选项。","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://www.cinie.net/article/63348.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/核电","a":"中国核电信息网-国际","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察","tp":"英核电民调","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"as":"伊兰电缆公司委托舆观调查公司的最新调查显示，英国公众普遍支持可再生能源，但对其能否单独承担低成本稳定供电存疑。在未来电力来源优先选项中，核电以21%支持率居首，高于太阳能的19%和海上风电的18%。47%的受访者支持建设核电站，但若核电项目设在本地，支持率降至38%。64%的受访者对可再生能源持积极态度，44%认为英国能源转型进展过慢。51%的受访者不认为未来10年可再生能源能带来可负担的能源成本，同样有51%怀疑其能否产生足够电力满足英国未来需求。","kp":["核电支持率[英国未来电力来源首选]: 21%，高于太阳能19%和海上风电18%","核电站建设支持率[英国全国层面]: 47%","核电支持率[本地建设情景]: 降至38%","可再生能源积极态度[英国受访者]: 64%","成本怀疑率[未来10年可再生能源可负担性]: 51%"]},{"t":"日本将在福岛大熊町设立去污新基地","b":"日本将在福岛大熊町设立去污新基地\n日本环境省决定于下一财年在福岛县大熊町设立新的工作基地，用于统筹东京电力公司 (TEPCO) 福岛第一核电站事故后返还困难区域内的去污和房屋拆除工作，以加快相关区域环境恢复进度。\n福岛第一核电站周边7个市町村内，约309平方公里区域被划定为返还困难区域。该区域目前仍受到严格管控，居民居住和人员进入均受限制，并维持疏散指示。\n在返还困难区域内，日本政府已设立“特定返乡居住区域”，计划根据居民返乡意愿推进去污、房屋拆除等措施。此次拟在大熊町设立的新基地，将负责现场管理和项目协调，预计配置约30名工作人员。目前设在广野町的相关分支机构将迁至大熊町。\n日本政府计划在2020年代内解除特定返乡居住区域的疏散指示。日本环境省表示，新基地将作为相关项目的指挥中心，统筹推进特定返乡居住区域的去污和房屋拆除等工作。","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://www.cinie.net/article/63302.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/核电","a":"中国核电信息网-国际","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"政策监管","tp":"福岛去污基地","sc":4.2,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":6.0},"as":"日本环境省决定下一财年在福岛县大熊町设立新的工作基地，统筹东京电力公司福岛第一核电站事故后返还困难区域内的去污和房屋拆除工作。福岛第一核电站周边7个市町村约309平方公里被划定为返还困难区域，目前仍维持疏散指示。日本政府已在该区域内设立'特定返乡居住区域'，计划根据居民返乡意愿推进去污等措施。新基地将负责现场管理和项目协调，预计配置约30名工作人员，现设于广野町的分支机构将迁至大熊町。日本政府计划在2020年代内解除特定返乡居住区域的疏散指示。","kp":["返还困难区域面积[福岛第一核电站周边7市町村]: 约309平方公里","新基地人员配置[大熊町去污基地]: 约30名工作人员","[疏散指示解除时间表]: 计划在2020年代内解除特定返乡居住区域疏散指示"]},{"t":"俄罗斯动力机械公司计划2029年起每年交付两台核电汽轮机","b":"俄罗斯动力机械公司计划2029年起每年交付两台核电汽轮机\n俄罗斯动力机械公司 (Power Machines) 预计，自2029年起每年向客户交付两台用于核电站的汽轮机。该公司副总经理兼核能部门负责人安东·维克托罗夫 (Anton Viktorov) 透露，相关产能安排已纳入企业后续计划。\n维克托罗夫表示，公司计划在2026年签署三台套核电机组相关合同，并签订若干汽轮机和发电机设备维护合同;另有三台套机组合同正在洽谈中。他称，这一任务对企业产能组织和项目执行提出了较高要求。\n在制造能力方面，动力机械公司此前透露，企业计划在2026年生产7台燃气轮机和14台蒸汽轮机。随着后续追加投资和产能扩建推进，自2029年起，相关工厂每年将具备生产10台套设备的能力。\n动力机械公司主要生产用于火电、核电和水电领域的各类汽轮发电机组。目前，该公司已签约设备总装机容量为18.5吉瓦，其中64台计划交付俄罗斯能源企业，另有13台面向国际市场。\n2021年，动力机械公司推出俄罗斯首台低速蒸汽轮机，该设备适用于单机容量1255兆瓦的核电机组。","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://www.cinie.net/article/63315.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/核电","a":"中国核电信息网-国际","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"产业进展","tp":"核电汽轮机交付","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"俄罗斯动力机械公司副总经理兼核能部门负责人安东·维克托罗夫透露，公司预计自2029年起每年交付两台核电站用汽轮机，相关产能安排已纳入后续计划。公司计划2026年签署三台套核电机组相关合同及若干汽轮机和发电机维护合同，另有三台套机组合同在洽谈中。制造方面，公司计划2026年生产7台燃气轮机和14台蒸汽轮机，产能扩建后自2029年起每年具备生产10台套设备的能力。目前公司已签约设备总装机容量18.5吉瓦，其中64台面向俄罗斯能源企业，13台面向国际市场。2021年公司推出俄罗斯首台低速蒸汽轮机，适用于1255兆瓦核电机组。","kp":["核电汽轮机年交付量[俄罗斯动力机械公司2029年起]: 每年两台","机组合同[2026年计划签署]: 三台套","燃气轮机产量[2026年计划]: 7台","蒸汽轮机产量[2026年计划]: 14台","年产能[产能扩建后2029年起]: 10台套设备"]},{"t":"俄罗斯科拉核电站环境监测实验室通过比对试验","b":"俄罗斯科拉核电站环境监测实验室通过比对试验\n俄罗斯科拉核电站 (Kola NPP) 环境保护部门所属生产环境监测实验室日前完成实验室间比对试验，并获得相应证书和参加能力验证计划的结论文件。此次比对试验证明，该实验室化学分析结果符合要求，相关检测数据具备可靠性。\n2026年6月，科拉核电站生产环境监测实验室收到废水和天然水样品。实验室人员需在允许误差范围内，测定8项目标指标的浓度。试验结果显示，该实验室完成了规定项目，检测结果达到要求。\n科拉核电站生产环境监测实验室负责人纳塔利娅·斯米尔诺娃 (Natalya Smirnova) 表示，对纳入国家认可体系的实验室而言，参加实验室间比对试验是必要要求。实验室在5年周期内，应就认可范围内的所有方法参加相关比对。结果合格，意味着实验室能力和检测结果可信度得到确认;如结果不合格，实验室需查明原因，制定并实施纠正措施，并通过再次参加比对验证整改效果。\n科拉核电站方面表示，参加实验室间比对试验不仅用于确认实验室技术能力，也有助于提升监管机构对其测量报告的信任度。该站辐射防护副总工程师亚历山大·库钦 (Alexander Kuchin) 称，此次试验确认了环境保护部门生产环境监测实验室具备较高水平的化学分析能力。\n实验室间比对试验是指多家实验室在相同或预先约定的条件下，对同一样品进行测量或测试，并对结果进行比较评价。该类试验通常包括组织、测试实施和结果评估，主要用于确认实验室能力、保证检测结果可比性，并核查研究和测试结果的可靠性。\n科拉核电站位于俄罗斯摩尔曼斯克州波利亚尔内耶佐里市，是俄罗斯核能发电公司 (Rosenergoatom) 下属核电站，也是摩尔曼斯克州主要电力生产设施。该站位于摩尔曼斯克市以南约200公里、伊曼德拉湖畔，现有4台VVER-440型压水堆机组运行，单机容量440兆瓦，发电量约占当地电力平衡的60%。","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://www.cinie.net/article/63364.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/核电","a":"中国核电信息网-国际","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察","tp":"核电站环境监测","sc":3.2,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":4.0,"r":3.0,"d":4.0,"t":4.0},"as":"俄罗斯科拉核电站生产环境监测实验室完成实验室间比对试验并获得证书，证明其化学分析结果符合要求、数据可靠。2026年6月，实验室收到废水和天然水样品，需在允许误差范围内测定8项目标指标浓度，结果显示检测达到要求。实验室负责人斯米尔诺娃表示，国家认可体系实验室须在5年周期内就认可范围内所有方法参加比对。该站辐射防护副总工程师库钦称此次试验确认了实验室具备较高化学分析能力。科拉核电站位于摩尔曼斯克州，现有4台VVER-440型压水堆机组运行，发电量约占当地电力平衡的60%。","kp":["目标指标数[实验室间比对试验]: 8项","比对周期[国家认可体系实验室]: 5年内完成认可范围内所有方法的比对"]},{"t":"韩国调查显示八成受访者支持新建核电站纳入电力规划","b":"韩国调查显示八成受访者支持新建核电站纳入电力规划\n韩国能源信息文化财团 (Korea Energy Information Culture Foundation) 8月28日公布的一项能源公众认知调查显示，82.9%的受访者认为，为应对未来电力需求增长，有必要将新建核电站计划纳入正在制定的第十二次电力供需基本计划。\n此次调查由韩国能源信息文化财团委托韩国国际研究院 (Korea Research International) 开展，于6月12日至15日通过电话访问方式进行，调查对象为2000名18岁及以上成年人。调查回复率为10.0%，在95%置信水平下，抽样误差为±2.2个百分点。\n调查结果显示，79.2%的受访者认为有必要建设新的核电站。对于已达到设计寿命的核电站是否应继续运行，86.5%的受访者表示有必要。\n不过，受访者对核电项目的总体支持与对本地建设的接受度之间仍存在差距。约八成受访者支持新建核电站或继续运行现有核电站，但当被问及如果核电站建在居住地或工作场所附近是否赞成时，表示支持的比例降至56.3%。\n在小型模块化反应堆 (SMR) 方面，86.8%的受访者认为有必要推进其开发和利用。调查说明称，SMR属于下一代核电技术，单机功率较大型核电机组更小，可在工厂制造并在现场组装，应用场景包括发电、区域供热、海水淡化和制氢等，目前多个国家正在开展相关开发和示范。\n但公众对SMR的了解程度仍相对有限。在上述说明之后，只有39.7%的受访者表示了解小型模块化反应堆。\n韩国能源信息文化财团计划于今年第三季度继续开展以碳中和和电网为主题的能源公众认知调查，并在第四季度开展以能源政策为主题的调查。","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://www.cinie.net/article/63282.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能源测/发电技术/核电","a":"中国核电信息网-国际","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察","tp":"韩国核电民调","sc":4.6,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":2.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"as":"韩国能源信息文化财团8月28日公布的调查显示，82.9%的受访者认为有必要将新建核电站计划纳入第十二次电力供需基本计划。调查于6月12日至15日通过电话进行，对象为2000名成年人，抽样误差±2.2个百分点。79.2%的受访者认为有必要建设新核电站，86.5%支持已达设计寿命的核电站继续运行。但本地接受度较低：核电站建在居住或工作地附近时支持率降至56.3%。86.8%的受访者认为有必要推进小型模块化反应堆（SMR）开发利用，但经说明后仅39.7%表示了解SMR。","kp":["支持率[新建核电站纳入第十二次电力供需基本计划]: 82.9%","支持率[建设新核电站]: 79.2%","支持率[设计寿命到期核电站继续运行]: 86.5%","支持率[核电站建在居住地或工作场所附近]: 降至56.3%","支持率[推进小型模块化反应堆SMR]: 86.8%"]},{"t":"科学网-南华大学团队从稀土矿渣中直接提取癌症治疗核素","b":"南华大学团队从稀土矿渣中直接提取癌症治疗核素\n记者8月29日从南华大学获悉，该校核科学技术学院教授韦悦周团队，近期从稀土矿渣中直接分离得到高纯度的阿尔法核素铅-212及其前体核素钍-228，并成功实现了单批次从公斤级稀土矿渣中分离提取158微居里的铅-212/铋-212。\n铅-212半衰期为10.6小时，是目前全球最具应用前景的靶向阿尔法治疗核素之一，可用于乳腺癌、胰腺癌、前列腺癌等多种恶性肿瘤的精准治疗。但目前铅-212提取工艺复杂、产量低、价格高，其靶向药物很难推广应用。\n韦悦周团队独辟蹊径，通过向镭渣溶解液中引入一种特殊的阴离子，让铅-212形成“阴离子络合物”，利用独自研发的多孔二氧化硅负载型阴离子交换树脂，像磁铁吸铁钉一样将其从含20多种大量金属杂质的溶液中精准“识别”并“抓取”出来。\n经检测，团队提取的铅-212产品核素纯度高达99.9%，钡离子低于1ppm，其他约20种金属杂质离子均低于0.1ppm，单次回收率>90%，钍-228单次回收率≥85%，该工艺具备向中试放大推进的条件。\n据介绍，多年来，国内独居石加工产业积存了足量的镭渣，目前作为放射性固废封存管理。该研究表明，仅需约10吨镭渣即可提取1居里的铅-212，理论上可供66名癌症患者治疗使用。同时，镭渣料液放置衰变约4天后又可再次提取，可循环利用多次。若每年反复处理50吨的镭渣，即可制备365居里的铅-212，可供约24000名癌症患者使用。\n除了铅-212，上述团队还独立开发材料和技术亦能从镭渣中直接分离提取钍-228，钍-228半衰期为1.9年，经衰变生成铅-212，因其半衰期较长，适合于远距离输送，可为国内外铅-212核药制备提供充足的原料保障。\n韦悦周（中）带领团队成员开展实验。南华大学 供图\n目前，该团队已申请6项发明专利，并计划在2至3年内实现大规模生产。韦悦周表示，这项技术成本低、原料充足、工艺成熟，完全自主可控，意味着我国医用阿尔法核素供应将不再受制于人，未来更多癌症患者有望用上平价、高效的精准治疗药物。","d":"2026-08-30","u":"http://news.sciencenet.cn/htmlnews/2026/8/570595.shtm","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/资源处理/资源回收","a":"科学网新闻","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"技术突破","tp":"矿渣提取核素","sc":8.2,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":5.0,"r":8.0,"d":8.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"as":"南华大学核科学技术学院韦悦周团队从稀土矿渣中直接分离得到高纯度阿尔法核素铅-212及其前体核素钍-228，单批次从公斤级稀土矿渣中提取158微居里铅-212/铋-212。铅-212半衰期10.6小时，是极具前景的靶向阿尔法治疗核素。团队通过引入特殊阴离子使铅-212形成络合物，用自主研发的多孔二氧化硅负载型阴离子交换树脂从含20多种金属杂质的溶液中精准提取。产品核素纯度达99.9%，铅-212单次回收率>90%。约10吨镭渣可提取1居里铅-212，供66名癌症患者治疗；每年处理50吨镭渣可制备365居里，供约24000名患者使用。团队已申请6项发明专利，计划2至3年内实现大规模生产。","kp":["铅-212产量[单批次公斤级稀土矿渣]: 158微居里铅-212/铋-212","铅-212半衰期: 10.6小时","核素纯度[提取的铅-212产品]: 99.9%","钡离子含量[产品杂质]: 低于1ppm","金属杂质离子含量[约20种]: 均低于0.1ppm"]},{"t":"科学网-爱招“外行”  一个“从零开始”的团队获重大突破","b":"爱招“外行” 一个“从零开始”的团队获重大突破\n4年多前加入新加坡国立大学时，毛献文就决定学习新事物，进入尚未被充分探索的方向，并招聘新方向的“外行”作为团队成员。此前，他先后在美国麻省理工学院攻读化学工程博士、在康奈尔大学开展超分辨荧光显微镜系统研究。\n毛献文如今是新加坡国立大学助理教授。回想入职第一天的第一次面试，他仍对当时的决定“有点不敢相信”——他招聘了与其研究方向几乎不相关、现为英国剑桥大学化学系玛丽·居里博士后研究员的张魏栋。两个对彼此领域都听不太懂的人，就此一起探索新事物。\n没想到，他们真做到了。在电池研究领域，人们早就知道离子的行为决定着电池性能，但长期以来，没有人真正“看见”过单个离子的反应过程。毛献文团队开发了一种名为“离子定位光学纳米成像”（ION）的新技术，使科学家能够在电池运行过程中，观察单个离子在电池内部的移动与反应。该成果近期发表于《自然-材料》。\n离子定位光学纳米成像原理示意图。受访者 供图\n一场面试，两个“外行”\n2021年12月，毛献文加入新加坡国立大学。这对他而言是真正意义上的从零开始。\n此前他从未去过新加坡，也从未和当地科研机构合作过。等着他的，是一个要靠自己从头搭起的新课题组。\n“新起点新作为，我想做点新东西。”毛献文没有走最熟悉、最稳妥的路径去搭团队，而是一直在找新方向。他有意识地找研究背景不同但能互补的人：“真正有创造力的问题，往往诞生于不同知识体系的碰撞，而非单一轨道上的重复推进。”\n毛献文（右）和团队成员开展研究。受访者 供图\n入职第一天，毛献文就急切地安排了课题组几个博士后线上面试。其中一场，正是与张魏栋的交流。这场看似普通的面试，成了日后ION方法最早的起点之一。\n当时，张魏栋主要从事锂金属电池界面反应研究，想找突破传统表征技术空间和时间分辨率限制的新方法；毛献文则长期从事单分子光学成像等研究，擅长用光学手段捕捉纳米尺度甚至单分子尺度的动态过程。\n“你不懂我的研究，我不熟你的方向，我们是两个‘外行’。”毛献文说，他们一个研究电池体系中的离子反应行为，一个研究如何让纳米世界变得可见，研究背景完全不同。\n面试中，双方都对彼此研究方向颇感兴趣。但张魏栋更多的是担忧：“研究方向差距相当大，能不能形成有效合作路径是个大问号。”\n毛献文反而不担心，他本来就想找这样的研究伙伴。“很多复杂的现实问题并不会按照学科边界来出现，解决问题的路径也不应该被单一学科框住。我和魏栋的研究本质上是可以衔接起来的，这种跨学科结合更能孕育出新的研究方法。”毛献文说。\n他还向张魏栋讲起自己的经历。在麻省理工学院时，毛献文曾辅修经济与金融。对于一位专注材料科学和光学成像的学者而言，这样的组合并不常见，这也因此常常成为别人看他简历时最先注意到也最常问起的一点。\n“这种跨学科兴趣并不是履历上的点缀，是我一直以来坚持的教学和科研理念。”在新加坡国立大学，除了教授自己最熟悉的材料科学相关课程外，毛献文还在商学院讲授EMBA课程，关注如何连接科学与商业，以更系统的方式应对可持续发展相关挑战。一番分析之后，张魏栋决定来试试。\n“能聊到一块去了”\n尽管双方都看到了合作潜力，但真做起来，挑战才显现出来。\n毛献文说，这是一次得从头建立共同语言的艰难探索。离子在哪里反应、反应是否均匀发生、不同区域之间是否存在协同行为……这些看似简单的问题，在电化学和光学成像两个领域的研究者听来，意味着完全不同的研究路径、实验设计和评判标准。很多讨论不得不从最基本的概念重新开始解释。\n张魏栋对一次长谈记忆犹新。那天，两人围绕研究的整体思路展开集中讨论，从上午9点一直持续到中午，不断推翻设想，提出新的路径。短暂休息后，他们决定接着聊，非要把关键问题厘清不可。下午讨论开始前，张魏栋特地买来了咖啡，希望帮助保持思路的连续性。那天下午的讨论异常顺利，分散的想法逐渐汇聚起来，ION方法最早的技术框架也在这次连续讨论中逐渐成形。\n“不过后来毛老师笑着提到，那杯咖啡让他当晚几乎没睡着。”张魏栋说，这种围绕一个问题反复推敲、持续数小时甚至一整天的讨论，是团队的工作常态。\n两个不同方向的人，该研究点啥？正是那次讨论，让一个原本看似难以实现的构想逐渐清晰起来：能不能真的让电池反应过程被“看见”？\n难点在于，在电池体系中，离子反应通常发生在固液界面，空间尺度极小、反应过程极快，而且往往被复杂的电解液环境所掩盖。传统电子显微技术虽然具有极高的空间分辨率，却通常需要在真空条件下工作，难以实现真实工作环境中的原位观测。科学家长期只能通过测量整体电流、电压等宏观信号，或对循环后的电池进行“解剖”分析，间接推测离子反应机制，而无法直接观察单离子反应过程。\n讨论逐渐集中到一个关键思路上，既然离子本身不可见，是否可以把离子反应转化为能够被光学记录的信号？\n团队据此把单分子定位显微方法引入电化学体系。其原理是构建能响应特定离子的荧光探针，把原本不可见的反应过程转化为可被精确定位的光信号。当电极表面发生离子溶出反应时，释放出的金属离子会与溶液中的荧光探针结合，从而产生瞬时的单分子荧光闪烁信号。这些离散出现的荧光事件，就像黑夜中逐渐亮起的一颗颗星星，虽然单个信号转瞬即逝，但通过成千上万个信号的叠加和精确定位，使得单离子反应过程拥有了可被直接记录的清晰轨迹。\n这最终成为ION方法的核心框架。通过ION技术，研究团队实现了约50纳米的空间分辨率和20毫秒的时间分辨率，使研究人员能在真实工作条件下实时记录电池界面反应在不同位置和不同时间的演化过程，将光学显微技术推进到单离子分辨水平。\n修改近百次的论文\n如果说ION技术是在反复讨论中“磨”出来的，那此次成果的论文，则是被“改”出来的。\n张魏栋说，毛献文的研究推进方式让他眼前一亮。以往做课题时，常见的路径是先完成一部分实验，出图表、补数据，再进入论文下一部分。毛献文却鼓励大家边做实验，边同步写作和重构框架，让实验推进和叙事建构彼此反馈、彼此推动。\n“论文并不是等到所有结果尘埃落定后再被‘整理出来’的，而是在研究尚未完成时，就开始不断被书写、被质疑、被推翻、被重建。”张魏栋说。有时，毛献文会把整篇稿件“从头到尾”大调一遍，整体改写逻辑、图表安排和论述方式。对团队成员而言，这种节奏绝不轻松。但也正因如此，论文一直在动态演化，而不是在一个固定框架里做局部修补。\n张魏栋认为，这体现出一种成长型思维。研究靠不断修正去逼近真正重要的问题，不按预设步骤机械推进。这篇论文前后改了近100版，花了约两年才完成。“主要是在逻辑主线、数据支撑、图文表达和语言细节上反复打磨。”张魏栋说。\n有一次，张魏栋忍不住抱怨修改太多、周期太长。毛献文举一个例子来回应：“我的一项发表于Nature Chemistry的成果，前后做了近10年才完成，我常常跟团队成员说，真正重要的工作，往往需要比预想更长的时间去打磨。这既是安慰，也是一种提醒。”\n张魏栋把毛献文的带人风格概括为“既hands-on（亲为）也hands-off（放手）”。hands-on，是指他会亲自参与很多关键训练，写代码、处理数据，做光学成像相关实验，他都会花时间带学生和博士后上手，帮他们真正理解方法背后的逻辑。这种直接参与，让团队成员能更快跨过不同学科间的门槛，也更有底气进入并不熟悉的技术领域。\nhands-off，则是指他不僵化管理，不要“打卡式”地签到签退，也不过度规定每个人必须以何种节奏工作。相反，他更强调给研究者足够的自由，让大家能够围绕真正有兴趣的问题展开探索，容纳不确定性，也容纳那些暂时看起来“不那么像主线”的新想法。\n“这种开放、包容又严谨的研究氛围，让跨学科和创新想法有了生长的土壤。”张魏栋说。\n“看见”的不止离子\n当单离子反应事件的空间分布图呈现在眼前时，一个令人惊讶的现象被揭示出来。\n长久以来，电池电极材料在宏观上被视为相对均匀的体系，研究者往往通过平均化的模型来描述其行为。但ION技术的观测结果展示了一幅截然不同的图景：在看似均匀的电极颗粒内部，不同区域之间的反应行为实际上存在天壤之别。\n一些区域像繁华的都市，离子反应极活跃，荧光信号密集地亮起与熄灭；而另一些区域则如同寂静的乡村，反应明显滞后，很长时间都捕捉不到几个信号。这表明，电极反应绝不是传统认识中的均一过程，而是具有显著空间异质性的动态过程。\n“这就像从只能听到乐团合奏的整体音响，到能够分辨出每一件乐器在何时、以何种方式发声。”毛献文说，传统表征技术给出的是整个乐团的“平均响应”，而ION方法则让我们听到了单个小提琴手、单个号手的独奏，从而对音乐的结构有了完全不同的理解。材料体系中，ION技术捕捉到的，正是单个局域事件如何发生、如何彼此影响又如何共同构成整体行为的微观图景。\n更为重要的是，研究团队还观察到不同区域之间存在有趣的协同行为：一个区域的反应活动增强，常带动邻近区域的反应节奏。他们通过进一步分析，能够在单颗粒内部直接测量并区分出由电子传输和表面原子扩散引起的两类界面反应耦合机制，并建立了描述界面反应均匀性的定量分析方法。\n这种局部区域之间的相互影响，为理解电极材料的退化过程提供了前所未有的直接证据。也就是说，随着电池的反复充放电，少数最初“活跃”的区域会率先发生结构损伤，而这种损伤会通过局部的协同作用，像病毒一样逐渐向其邻近区域扩散和蔓延，最终导致整个颗粒性能的下降，表现为电池容量的持续衰减和寿命的缩短。这些亚颗粒尺度上的反应不均匀性，被证明是导致电池性能衰减的关键微观来源之一。\n“我们不仅看到了离子，更看到了电池‘生病’和‘衰老’的动态过程。”毛献文说，ION技术的意义远不止于为电池研究打开了一扇窗，它使研究人员能够直接观察电池材料在真实工作条件下的反应行为，从而从微观机制层面理解材料性能演化过程。期待这一成果助力先进能源材料研究进入单离子尺度精准调控的新阶段。\nhttps://doi.org/10.1038/s41563-026-02567-w","d":"2026-08-30","u":"http://news.sciencenet.cn/htmlnews/2026/8/570594.shtm","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"科学网新闻","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"技术突破","tp":"离子纳米成像","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":9.0,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"新加坡国立大学助理教授毛献文团队开发了名为'离子定位光学纳米成像'（ION）的新技术，使科学家能在电池运行过程中观察单个离子在电池内部的移动与反应，成果发表于《自然-材料》。此前电池领域长期无法真正'看见'单个离子的反应过程。毛献文2021年12月加入新加坡国立大学后从零组建课题组，有意招聘跨领域'外行'成员，包括入职第一天面试的锂金属电池界面反应研究者张魏栋（现为剑桥大学玛丽·居里博士后研究员），两人结合单分子光学成像与电池界面研究背景，最终实现突破。","kp":["[新技术ION]: 离子定位光学纳米成像，可在电池运行中观察单个离子的移动与反应，成果发表于《自然-材料》"]},{"t":"科学网-2026生物质材料与能源国际会议长沙开幕","b":"2026生物质材料与能源国际会议长沙开幕\n8月29日，2026生物质材料与能源国际会议（ICBME 2026）在长沙召开，来自中国、加拿大、日本、芬兰、泰国、印度尼西亚等多个国家和地区的专家学者、企业代表及青年学子千余人，通过线上线下结合方式开展学术对话。\n会议深度对接国家“碳达峰、碳中和”战略目标，践行“绿水青山就是金山银山”绿色发展理念，围绕生物质先进功能材料、生物质能源转化、能源转换材料化学、生物质化学品催化转化等六大前沿方向，聚焦生物质领域关键科学难题、核心技术创新与产业化瓶颈，致力于搭建跨国界、跨学科的学术交流与产学研协同创新平台，助力低碳循环经济体系构建与能源结构优化升级。\n开幕式由中南林业科技大学副校长周子龙主持。中南林业科技大学校长刘守新致开幕辞，他对海内外嘉宾的到来表示热烈欢迎，系统介绍了学校林业工程学科、材料与能源学院的建设成效，并深入阐述发展生物质材料与能源对于践行“双碳”目标、发展循环绿色经济、赋能林业产业新质生产力、服务国家生态文明建设的重要意义，期待与会专家充分交流碰撞，产出新思路、新方案，共同推动生物质领域科技进步与产业发展。\n大会由中国工程院院士、中南林业科技大学党委书记吴义强，加拿大工程院院士颜宁、日本工程院院士椿范立共同担任主席。会议设6个平行分会场，涵盖主旨报告、邀请报告、口头报告以及海报展示等多种交流形式，汇聚国内外高校、科研院所骨干学者与青年科研人员，充分展示生物质材料与能源领域最新研究进展。\n吴义强作报告。图片均由主办方提供\n现场，吴义强、芬兰科学院院士 Orlando J. Rojas、德国哥廷根大学教授张凯、椿范立、东南大学首席教授马隆龙、芬兰奥博学术大学教授徐春林作大会报告，涵盖生物质代塑膜材料创制、负碳生物基材料开发、纤维素功能构筑、可持续生物航油等行业热点议题。\nENGINEERING Biomass\n期刊相关展板。李濯清 摄\n大会由中南林业科技大学、加拿大多伦多大学、日本富山大学、木本油料资源利用全国重点实验室联合主办，中南林业科技大学材料与能源学院承办，\nENGINEERING Biomass\n期刊提供学术支持。此次会议充分发挥\nENGINEERING Biomass\n国际期刊学术纽带作用，进一步打通基础研究、技术创新与产业应用链条，促进海内外科研团队深化务实合作，为我国生物质绿色产业高质量发展注入新动能。","d":"2026-08-30","u":"http://news.sciencenet.cn/htmlnews/2026/8/570593.shtm","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"科学网新闻","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察","tp":"生物质材料会议","sc":3.1,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":2.0,"r":3.0,"d":3.0,"t":5.0},"as":"8月29日，2026生物质材料与能源国际会议（ICBME 2026）在长沙召开，来自中国、加拿大、日本、芬兰、泰国、印度尼西亚等国家和地区的千余名专家学者、企业代表及青年学子以线上线下结合方式参会。会议对接国家'双碳'战略，围绕生物质先进功能材料、生物质能源转化、能源转换材料化学、生物质化学品催化转化等六大前沿方向展开。大会由中国工程院院士吴义强、加拿大工程院院士颜宁、日本工程院院士椿范立共同担任主席，设6个平行分会场。吴义强、芬兰科学院院士Rojas等作大会报告，涵盖生物质代塑膜材料、负碳生物基材料、可持续生物航油等热点议题。","kp":["[会议规模]: 千余人线上线下参加","[六大前沿方向]: 生物质先进功能材料、生物质能源转化、能源转换材料化学、生物质化学品催化转化等"]},{"t":"科学网-中山大学与华为签署深化战略合作协议","b":"中山大学与华为签署深化战略合作协议\n8月24日，中山大学党委书记刘承功、校长唐洪武率队赴深圳华为坂田基地，与华为创始人、首席执行官任正非会谈交流，并共同见证双方深化战略合作协议签署。双方围绕未来科技趋势、基础研究、人才培养及校企合作方向深入交换意见。\n签约现场。中山大学供图，下同\n刘承功、唐洪武介绍了中山大学学科布局、科研平台建设及服务粤港澳大湾区创新发展情况，表示希望发挥高校科研积淀与企业技术优势，做实战略合作，联合破解关键难题，培育拔尖创新人才。\n根据协议，双方将在三大领域全面合作：一是依托产教融合协同育人基地，深化课程共建、学科竞赛、师资培养，共建“学科+AI”实践实验室，推进“未来学习中心”建设和卓越工程师培养；二是聚焦新一代信息技术，通过难题揭榜等机制联合技术攻关；三是共同打造数智技术在教育、医疗领域的深度应用标杆，助力中山大学建设中国特色世界一流大学。\n当日下午，校企合作交流会举行。中山大学校领导及相关院系、职能部门代表30人参会。华为董事、2012实验室总裁查钧表示，期待双方在科研、技术生态、人才培育等方面持续拓展合作广度与深度，推动校企合作迈上新台阶。\n会上，中山大学副校长郑跃回顾前期合作成果并展望未来方向。同期举行华为“难题揭榜”火花奖颁奖仪式，查钧与唐洪武为近一年来获奖的智能工程学院教授梁小丹、电子与通信工程学院教授张月、网络空间安全学院副教授沈力等3位教师颁奖。该奖项自2021年设立，旨在面向产业难题征集科学解决方案，目前中大已有5名教师累计获奖6项。\n记者获悉，中山大学与华为合作渊源深厚，已形成“战略引领、平台支撑、项目牵引、人才共育”的格局，合作覆盖人工智能、电子通信、超级计算、半导体材料、智慧医疗等前沿领域，贯通基础研究到应用攻关。联合人才培养方面，共建“智能基座”产教融合协同育人基地，并设立青年学者项目支持基础研究。\n据不完全统计，2021年至今，中大已向华为输送毕业生逾千人。","d":"2026-08-30","u":"http://news.sciencenet.cn/htmlnews/2026/8/570592.shtm","c":"未分类","a":"科学网新闻","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察","tp":"华为中大合作","as":"8月24日，中山大学党委书记刘承功、校长唐洪武率队赴深圳华为坂田基地，与华为创始人任正非会谈，并见证双方深化战略合作协议签署。根据协议，双方将在三大领域合作：一是依托产教融合协同育人基地，共建'学科+AI'实践实验室，推进'未来学习中心'建设和卓越工程师培养；二是聚焦新一代信息技术，通过难题揭榜机制联合技术攻关；三是共同打造数智技术在教育、医疗领域的深度应用标杆。会上还举行华为'难题揭榜'火花奖颁奖仪式，中大3位教师获奖。该奖自2021年设立，中大已有5名教师累计获奖6项。双方合作已覆盖人工智能、电子通信、超级计算、半导体材料、智慧医疗等领域。"},{"t":"科学网-齐炜炜斩获第八届全国高校青年教师教学竞赛一等奖","b":"齐炜炜斩获第八届全国高校青年教师教学竞赛一等奖\n8月28日，第八届全国高校青年教师教学竞赛决赛在山东大学落下帷幕。中山大学中山医学院副教授齐炜炜凭借出色的教学设计和课堂表现，荣获医科组一等奖，成为广东省唯一获一等奖的选手。\n本届竞赛由中华全国总工会、教育部联合主办，分为文科、理科、工科、医科、思政五个组别，竞赛共发动全国1967所高校的26.33万名青年教师参与各层级选拔。总决赛共有来自全国31个省（区、市）和新疆生产建设兵团的153所高校的160名优秀青年教师同台竞技。\n齐炜炜。中山大学供图\n据悉，齐炜炜代表广东省参加医科组比赛，其主讲课程《生物化学与分子生物学》的参赛节段“胆红素的代谢与黄疸”，以逻辑清晰的教学架构、生动创新的互动设计和深厚的医学人文底蕴，获得评委高度认可，荣获一等奖。\n齐炜炜本硕博均毕业于中山大学，2015年7月留校工作，主要承担本科生与研究生的生物化学与分子生物学等相关课程的教学工作。此次备赛期间，中山大学校工会、教务部和中山医学院多方联动，从教学设计优化、课堂呈现技巧、教学创新点提炼等方面开展多轮磨课指导，以赛促教。\n“讲台之下坐着的不仅是学生，更是未来的医者，每一堂课都值得用心以待。”齐炜炜表示，赛场有终，讲台无尽，她将把竞赛的收获种进日常的课堂，继续扎根教学一线，以学生为中心，以立德树人为志，不负“师者”的责任。","d":"2026-08-30","u":"http://news.sciencenet.cn/htmlnews/2026/8/570591.shtm","c":"不相关","a":"科学网新闻","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"科学网-广东省生殖医院推出百万公益援助","b":"广东省生殖医院推出百万公益援助\n为庆祝建院50周年，切实减轻无精子症患者的就医负担，广东省生殖医院近日宣布，联合广东省宋庆龄基金会启动“睾丸显微取精同步试管婴儿援助项目”。该项目面向全省征集100名符合条件的患者，每人最高可减免手术费用1万元，总资助额度达百万元。\n广东省生殖医院外貌。医院供图\n根据活动安排，从2026年9月1日起至12月31日，凡经明确诊断为无精子症、符合睾丸显微取精手术指征且需同步进行试管婴儿助孕的已婚男性，若夫妇至少一方为广东省户籍或持有广东省居住证，均可申请该项援助。符合条件的患者将直接减免睾丸显微取精手术费，名额有限，先到先得，用完即止。\n作为省内唯一省级公立三级生殖专科医院，广东省生殖医院在无精子症诊疗领域处于华南一流、国内领先水平。该院男科中心开设了全省首个无精子症诊疗门诊，并在华南地区率先开展睾丸显微取精术治疗非梗阻性无精子症，迄今累计手术量超4000台，年手术量居华南首位。2026年，医院牵头成立粤港澳大湾区无精子症联盟，首批已有50多家医疗机构加入，有力推动了该领域诊疗的标准化与精准化。\n广东省生殖医院院长安庚表示，尽管技术成熟，但部分患者因经济压力不得不暂缓或放弃生育计划。此次公益项目正是为了帮助这类家庭尽快进入试管周期、早日实现生育愿望，也是医院践行公立医院社会责任、助力生育友好型社会建设的实际行动。未来，医院将继续发挥技术优势与公益担当，为更多不孕不育家庭提供优质可及的生殖健康服务。","d":"2026-08-30","u":"http://news.sciencenet.cn/htmlnews/2026/8/570590.shtm","c":"不相关","a":"科学网新闻","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"科学网-三甲医院开到家门口，瑞金医院金山院区正式启用","b":"三甲医院开到家门口，瑞金医院金山院区正式启用\n8月28日，上海交通大学医学院附属瑞金医院（以下简称瑞金医院）金山院区正式启用。截至当日15时，院区挂号就诊超过4000人次，完成29台手术，其中包括机器人辅助胰腺癌手术、机器人辅助关节置换手术等。\n瑞金医院金山院区。瑞金医院供图，下同\n长期以来，金山及周边居民如遇疑难病症或需要专科诊疗，常需前往中心城区就医。“以前看专家要跑市区，来回要花大半天。现在三甲医院开到家门口，方便多了。”开诊首日前来就诊的市民王女士说。\n金山院区位于上海市金山区亭林镇大亭公路6868号，总建筑面积9.8万平方米，一期开放床位400张，远期规划达到1200张。院区将服务上海南部地区，并辐射奉贤、松江以及浙江平湖、嘉善等长三角毗邻区域。\n作为瑞金医院直属院区，金山院区是实行垂直化管理、同质化医疗、一体化运行。医护人员由瑞金医院统一派驻，采取长期派驻和定期轮换相结合的方式，诊疗规范、质量控制和服务流程与总院执行统一标准。\n院区门诊覆盖瑞金医院全部48个学科及亚专科，住院服务涵盖28个国家重点学科，每日开设近50个不同专业的专家门诊。院区还与总院打通床位联动绿色通道，患者可在金山院区直接开具总院住院凭证。急诊服务预计于2027年上半年投入使用。\n依托总院优势学科，院区规划建设疑难重症诊治、烧创伤急救、消化道肿瘤、胸腔疾病等重点专病诊疗中心，并补强内分泌、血液等区域相对薄弱学科。院区还将围绕糖尿病共病、消化道肿瘤全程管理、卒中后康复等病种，探索中西医协同诊疗。\n此外，金山院区建设了直升机停机坪，并将依托毗邻高速公路的区位优势，进一步提升重大突发事件中的快速响应和转运救治能力。根据当天签署的医联体框架协议，金山院区将与亭林医院打通双向转诊通道，推动检查检验结果互认。瑞金医院专家将下沉坐诊带教，亭林医院骨干也将到瑞金医院进修。院区还将结合金山产业基础，推进医疗器械、药物、疫苗研发及肿瘤细胞治疗等领域合作。\n当天前来就诊的附近市民。\n启用活动现场，中国工程院院士、瑞金医院院长宁光宣布，针对西藏日喀则市吉隆县吉隆口岸泥石流灾情，医院紧急医疗队已整装待命，并发起自愿爱心捐款。医院将在“广聚善爱”慈善基金下设专项，用于受灾地区群众医疗救治。当天，金山院区还启动公益体检项目，向困难群众及城市建设者等一线劳动者送出首批公益体检卡。","d":"2026-08-30","u":"http://news.sciencenet.cn/htmlnews/2026/8/570589.shtm","c":"不相关","a":"科学网新闻","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"科学网-界面化学驱动纳米颗粒晶内自分类","b":"界面化学驱动纳米颗粒晶内自分类\n近日，暨南大学化学与材料学院教授宁印团队联合英国谢菲尔德大学教授Steven P. Armes、华中农业大学副教授张文君等，成功揭示了界面化学调控纳米颗粒自分类行为的新机制。相关成果发表于《自然-通讯》。\n自然界中的生物矿物（如骨骼、牙齿、贝壳）并非单纯的无机晶体，而是由无机矿物与有机生物分子协同构筑的高度有序复合材料。生物体系通过精准调控有机组分与矿物晶体的相互作用及其空间分布，实现结构优化与功能协同。然而，如何在人工合成体系中实现类似生命系统的多组分精准组织，构筑具有复杂内部结构的仿生复合晶体，仍是材料科学领域的重要挑战。\n该研究提出“纳米颗粒自分类内嵌”新概念，首次发现不同纳米组分可依据其胶体稳定性与界面化学特征，在晶体生长过程中自主分类，在同一晶体内部形成空间分区的组织结构。研究进一步揭示了界面化学决定纳米颗粒空间定位的内在机制，建立了“界面化学-晶体生长-空间组织”之间的关联，将晶体内部结构调控从传统的成分调节拓展为基于界面化学的空间编程策略。\n该工作不仅为理解天然生物矿化中有机-无机组分间的分子相互作用提供了新视角，也为构筑具有层级结构和功能分区的人工仿生复合晶体提供了理论基础与设计原则。更重要的是，该策略突破了传统材料设计中“均匀掺杂”和“随机复合”的局限，为开发具有空间梯度功能的新型复合材料提供了普适方法，有望推动智能响应材料、程序化释放载体等先进功能材料的发展，促进晶体工程从“调控晶体组成”向“编程晶体内部结构”的研究转变。\n相关论文信息：https://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-026-75685-3","d":"2026-08-30","u":"http://news.sciencenet.cn/htmlnews/2026/8/570588.shtm","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"科学网新闻","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"技术突破","tp":"纳米自分类","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":9.0,"i":2.0,"r":7.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"暨南大学宁印团队联合英国谢菲尔德大学Steven P. Armes、华中农业大学张文君等，揭示界面化学调控纳米颗粒自分类行为的新机制，成果发表于《自然-通讯》。研究提出'纳米颗粒自分类内嵌'新概念，发现不同纳米组分可依据胶体稳定性与界面化学特征，在晶体生长过程中自主分类，形成空间分区结构。研究建立了'界面化学-晶体生长-空间组织'关联，将晶体内部结构调控拓展为基于界面化学的空间编程策略，突破了传统均匀掺杂和随机复合的局限，为构筑层级结构和功能分区的仿生复合晶体及空间梯度功能材料提供理论基础。","kp":["[新机制]: 纳米颗粒依据胶体稳定性与界面化学特征在晶体生长过程中自主分类，形成晶内空间分区结构，发表于《自然-通讯》"]},{"t":"科学网-长期干旱下，树木水力安全边际显著收窄","b":"全球40个森林减雨实验颠覆传统认知——\n长期干旱下，树木水力安全边际显著收窄\n全球气候变化导致干旱事件愈发频繁和强烈。树木能否通过生理调整来适应水分亏缺，直接关系到未来森林生态系统的存续。以往相关观点多基于盆栽实验或自然降水梯度研究，认为树木能主动调节水力、光合等性状以应对干旱。然而，这些结论能否反映真实森林中树木对长期干旱的响应，始终缺乏全球尺度的直接证据。\n如今，一项由中国科学院华南植物园恢复生态学团队领衔、联合国内外多家科研机构完成的大规模研究，给出了一份横跨全球三大气候区、涵盖40个大型森林减雨实验的综合评估报告。8月24日，相关成果以“直接提交”（Direct Submission）形式发表于美国《国家科学院院刊》（\n论文通讯作者、中国科学院华南植物园研究员叶清告诉《中国科学报》，研究结论表明：长期干旱下，树木并未表现出更强韧的抗旱本领；其看似稳定的水分运输与光合能力，实则对应着水力安全边际的显著收窄——森林正站在比预期更接近功能受损阈值的边缘。\n海南甘什岭热带森林减雨平台。栾军伟 摄\n从“主动适应”到“惯性危机”\n全球约31%的陆地由森林覆盖，承载着大部分陆地生物多样性，并在碳循环与气候调节中发挥着关键作用。然而，当持续数年的干旱悄然侵袭，那些矗立数十乃至上百年的树木，究竟是在调整自身以适应环境，还是在累积走向衰退的风险？这一问题亟待科学回答。\n长期以来，科学界持有一种相对乐观的看法：面对干旱，树木并非被动承受，而是能通过调整水分运输安全来主动适应。这种能力被称为“表型可塑性”，即树木在生命周期内根据环境变化做出的生理调整。许多学者据此认为，森林具备一定的干旱缓冲能力。\n然而，这一看法的实证基础存在局限。早期实验多在温室盆栽中进行，或依赖自然降水梯度观测。盆栽幼苗受限于根系空间和发育阶段，难以代表野外成年大树的真实响应；而降水梯度研究则较难区分长期遗传适应（代际演化）与短期生理调整（个体可塑性），结论存在不确定性。\n换句话说，科学界长期缺乏一项关键证据：在真实、成熟的森林中，面对人为控制的长期干旱，树木究竟会作何反应？这一全球尺度的直接数据，此前始终缺少。\n为填补这一空白，在国家重点研发计划、国家自然科学基金、广东省杰出青年基金等项目资助下，恢复生态学团队联合中国林业科学研究院、国际竹藤中心、中国科学院西双版纳热带植物园、东北林业大学、美国太平洋西北国家实验室等多家国内外研究机构，基于全球40个大型森林减雨实验，系统评估了野外森林树木生理对干旱的响应机制。\n广东鹤山亚热带森林减雨平台。谭向平 摄\n“要探明树木在真实环境下的抗旱极限，最直接的方式是在森林里制造一场可控干旱，并实地采样与观测。”论文第一作者、中国科学院华南植物园副研究员梁星云指出，这正是“森林减雨实验”的核心设计思路。\n把人工干旱搬进原始森林\n研究团队在全球筛选整合了40个大型野外减雨实验站点，其中中国占14个。实验方法看似简单，操作却很严谨：在林冠层下方架设透明遮雨棚，将部分降雨拦截并导流至样地外，从而人为降低土壤水分供应。树木仍处于完整的根系网络、天然群落结构和真实微气候中，唯一改变的是水分供给量。这种设计既保留了生态系统的完整性，又实现了干旱胁迫的精准控制。\n从2023年初启动，到2025年秋完成全部野外实测，团队足迹遍布广东鹤山、广西凭祥、云南哀牢山、西双版纳、海南甘什岭，以及河南宝天曼、浙江天童山、黑龙江帽儿山等地。这些减雨平台大多位于深山，有的距最近乡镇需驱车两小时以上。\n团队成员、参与采样和部分实验的中国科学院华南植物园博士后杨丞表示，研究过程中，团队成员需要携带大量精密仪器和氮气瓶在山间辗转；测定树木“水力脆弱性曲线”——对树木的输水系统进行逐步水分胁迫测试并监测导水功能崩溃临界点——尤为耗时，一条完整曲线常常需要数天连续观测。\n团队成员杨丞在采集林冠枝条。研究团队供图\n团队最终系统分析了24项与水分运输和光合作用相关的生理性状，涵盖叶片与茎干木质部导水效率、抗栓塞能力、光合能力、气孔导度、叶片养分含量、非结构性碳水化合物含量（树木的能量储备）等多个方面。\n结果显示，水力效率、抗栓塞能力、叶片养分和光合能力等关键指标，在长期土壤干旱下均未发生统计学上的显著变化。也就是说，树木并没有像预期那样增强输水系统的抗性来适应缺水环境，而是表现出一种保守的生理“惯性”。\n但这种惯性并不等于安全。进一步分析表明，长期减雨显著降低了树木体内的水势（即水分状态），而抵抗栓塞的能力阈值并未相应提高。两者叠加导致关键安全指标——水力安全边际（即树木实际水势与致死水势之间的缓冲区间）被大幅压缩。树木距离水力失效的临界点更近了，而自身防御能力没有增强，因此失效风险明显上升。\n同时，虽然叶片净光合速率有所下降，但根、茎、叶中非结构性碳水化合物的总量保持稳定。这表明，树木并非因“碳饥饿”而接近死亡，而是水力安全性被系统性削弱——这是该研究与传统“碳饥饿假说”不同的重要结论：长期干旱的首要威胁，是水力失效风险的显著升高，而非能量储备的耗竭。\n森林管理须主动求变\n“这项研究的价值不仅在于修正科学假设，为植被模型提供机理参考，更在于为现实森林管理提供依据。”叶清指出，这是首次在真实森林生态系统尺度上，系统评估树木水分运输与光合作用的生理可塑性。\n河南宝天曼暖温带森林减雨平台。陈志成 摄\n该研究揭示的“生理惯性”意味着：不能指望树木通过自身生理调整来有效应对日益加剧的气候干旱。即便树木仍维持一定的水分运输与光合能力，其内部水力安全系统可能已接近阈值。一旦遭遇极端高温或持续少雨，森林大面积衰退的风险将明显增加。\n这一发现为全球变化背景下的森林经营提供了明确的科学参考。未来造林、生态恢复及森林抚育，应优先选择那些天生具有较宽水力安全边际的树种——相当于为人工林构建更安全的水力缓冲。对于现有天然林和人工林，则需要加强水分动态监测，并在干旱期采取有针对性的抚育措施，增强在脆弱期应对胁迫的能力。\n研究人员指出，该成果也体现了长期野外监测平台不可替代的科学价值。从中国南方热带雨林到东北温带森林，从北美到欧洲，40个站点联合研究凝聚了全球生态学家的协作努力。\n研究也提出了一些有待回答的问题：现有减雨实验大多持续3至5年，若干旱延续十年甚至更久，树木是否会启动迟滞的适应机制？不同树种、不同年龄个体对水力安全边际缩窄的敏感程度有何差异？当前大多实验数据是针对活立木的一次性测定，而受干旱胁迫致死的树木发生了哪些持续的生理学变化？这些是团队下一步计划探索的方向。\n但无论后续研究如何深入，这份全球森林综合评估已经传递出清晰的信号：在气候变化持续加剧的背景下，森林的脆弱性可能被低估。每棵树木体内都维系着一套水力安全系统，当干旱频率和强度不断增加，单纯依靠树木的自然适应性已不足以保障森林的长期稳定。\n“科学认知的更新，最终要落实到造林规划、森林经营与生态恢复的具体行动中。”梁星云强调，森林的未来，既取决于自然系统的内在规律，也取决于人类基于科学证据的理性选择与及时行动。\n相关论文信息：https://doi.org/10.1073/pnas.2622754123","d":"2026-08-30","u":"http://news.sciencenet.cn/htmlnews/2026/8/570587.shtm","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"科学网新闻","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察","tp":"森林抗旱","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":2.0,"r":7.0,"d":8.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"中国科学院华南植物园恢复生态学团队领衔，联合国内外多家机构完成横跨全球三大气候区、涵盖40个大型森林减雨实验的综合评估，成果以直接提交形式发表于美国《国家科学院院刊》。研究颠覆了以往基于盆栽实验认为树木能主动调节性状适应干旱的传统认知，表明长期干旱下树木并未表现出更强的抗旱能力；其看似稳定的水分运输与光合能力，实则对应着水力安全边际的显著收窄，森林正站在比预期更接近功能受损阈值的边缘。早期盆栽实验受限于根系空间和发育阶段，难以代表野外成年大树的真实响应。","kp":["森林减雨实验[全球三大气候区]: 涵盖40个大型森林减雨实验的综合评估","树木水力安全边际[长期干旱]: 显著收窄，更接近功能受损阈值","森林覆盖[全球陆地]: 约31%"]},{"t":"科学网-香蕉的千万年“族谱”被揭开了！","b":"香蕉的千万年“族谱”被揭开了！\n你每天吃到的香蕉（\nspp.），可能正站在一场无声危机的十字路口。\n作为全球超过4亿人的重要食物来源，香蕉是热带与亚热带地区最具经济价值的水果之一。但你可能不知道，超市货架上超过一半的香蕉，几乎都是同一个无性繁殖品种——“卡文迪什”（Cavendish AAA）的后代。它依赖营养繁殖，每一株都是母体的复制品，遗传基础高度一致，多样性极为匮乏。\n这个庞大的“克隆军团”一旦遭遇香蕉枯萎病热带4号生理小种（\nTR4）等毁灭性病害，就可能面临灭顶之灾。这种被称为“香蕉癌症”的土传真菌，可在土壤中存活数十年，正从东南亚向全球主产区蔓延，而卡文迪什品种对其几乎毫无抵抗力。\n如何破局？答案可能藏在香蕉的野生“亲戚”里。芭蕉科（Musaceae）现存约80个物种，它们长期适应严苛的自然环境，蕴藏着抗病、抗逆等宝贵遗传资源。然而，这些野生近缘种的演化关系长期模糊不清：不同类群的染色体基数各异（\n= 11、10或9），这些数目如何形成？染色体结构变化与苞片颜色多样化之间是否有关联？这些问题一直缺乏基因组层面的直接证据。\nMusa exotica\n的苞片艳丽多彩。付宁 摄\n8月24日，中国科学院华南植物园副研究员王新风、黄慧润团队联合四川大学副研究员孙朋川等科研人员在《当代生物学》（\nCurrent Biology\n）上发表了一项重要研究。他们首次重建了芭蕉科的祖先核型，从染色体层面系统揭示了该类群的演化轨迹，并发现染色体结构变异与苞片颜色表型分化之间存在密切关联。\n一本“无缺页”的基因天书\n这项研究的基石，是一项基因组学的前沿技术——端粒到端粒（T2T）基因组组装。\n“如果将基因组比作一本记录生命全部遗传指令的百科全书，过去的技术如同老式扫描仪，总会在染色体末端（端粒）和复杂重复区域留下模糊甚至空白的页面。”论文共同通讯作者王新风告诉《中国科学报》，而T2T基因组组装实现了从头到尾的完整读取，没有任何缺失。\n研究团队选取了一个关键物种——\nMusa exotica\n（一种早期分化的野生观赏蕉，分布在我国广西南部及越南北部），完成了其T2T基因组的组装，contig N50达到47.41 Mb。这一指标意味着基因组片段高度连续、完整，好比以往只能拼接出几米长的碎片，如今拼出了几十公里长的连续路段，整条“基因长城”的每一处都清晰可辨。\n“高质量T2T基因组是本研究的重要基础。”论文共同通讯作者黄慧润告诉《中国科学报》，该基因组为芭蕉科不同物种之间的染色体结构比较提供了可靠的参考，也支撑了后续祖先核型重建和系统比较分析。\n有了这把“高清标尺”，团队着手进行更具挑战性的工作——重建整个芭蕉科的祖先核型。\n一部染色体的“缩编史”\n“挖掘和利用香蕉野生近缘种的优异遗传资源，是拓展香蕉遗传基础、推动品种改良的重要途径。”论文共同第一作者、中国科学院华南植物园已毕业博士生付宁表示，要充分利用这些资源，首先需要厘清芭蕉科的染色体“族谱”——祖先的染色体是什么样，又经历了怎样的演化。\n核型，即一个物种染色体组的完整“合影”——数量、大小、形态一目了然。祖先核型则相当于所有现代物种共同祖先的染色体“全家福”。\n芭蕉科现存物种的染色体数目差异显著：有的含11对，有的10对，有的仅9对。这些数字差异是随机演变，还是遵循某种演化规律？\n研究团队通过比较\nMusa exotica\n与多个已有基因组的精细结构，像拼合一幅巨型演化拼图，逐步还原出芭蕉科祖先的面貌。结果令人意外：芭蕉科祖先的单倍体染色体数应为\n=17。也就是说，今天所有染色体数目各异的芭蕉科物种，均源自同一个拥有17对染色体的共同祖先。\n从17到11、10、9，这一过程如何发生？研究揭示了一条逐步“缩编”的清晰路径——并非一次性骤减，而是经由多种染色体重排事件有序推进：端到端连接（两条染色体末端融合）、嵌套染色体融合（一条染色体整体插入另一条内部）和相互易位（染色体片段交换）等。这些事件不断重塑染色体结构，使不同演化支系的染色体数目逐步减少。\n值得关注的是，这一基于染色体结构推演的演化路径，与基于DNA序列构建的分子系统发育关系高度一致。两种独立证据指向同一棵“家族树”，为芭蕉科各类群间的演化关系提供了可靠的细胞生物学证据。\n“祖先核型为比较不同物种的染色体结构、推断演化轨迹提供了客观依据，也让我们看清了野生近缘种所保留的遗传信息及其利用价值。”论文共同第一作者孙朋川表示。\n染色体“拆迁”与苞片颜色“装修”\n染色体数目演化的谜底揭开后，团队进一步追问：染色体重排是否影响了苞片颜色的多样性？\n芭蕉科植物的苞片色彩极为丰富——从鲜艳的红色、橙红色、粉红色到暗淡的颜色，差异显著。\nMusa exotica\n本身即以亮（橙）红色苞片著称。这些颜色差异不仅关乎观赏价值，也是分类和育种的重要依据。\n研究团队在染色体“断裂-融合”的边界区域发现了重要线索：这些区域显著富集花青素生物合成相关基因。花青素是赋予苞片红、紫、蓝色泽的天然色素。在这些“断裂热点”上，不仅分布着查尔酮合成酶（\n）、黄烷酮3-羟化酶（\n）等结构基因，还聚集了MYB、bHLH等转录调控因子。\n进一步通过对不同颜色花苞的转录组比较分析发现：花青素合成通路中\nCHS、CHI、F3′5′H、ANS\n等关键基因的表达差异，主要源于转录调控水平的强弱，而非基因拷贝数的多寡。也就是说，不同颜色苞片的差异不在于“生产工厂”的数量，而在于“调度员”下达指令的强度。\n染色体“车厢重组”恰好重新排布了“调度员”与“工厂”的相对位置——有些被搬到了新“街区”，有些换了“邻居”。这种基因“居住环境”的改变，可能重塑了整个调控网络，为苞片颜色的表型分化提供了遗传基础。\n该研究揭示了染色体结构变异与苞片颜色表型分化之间的联系，为理解观赏蕉花部性状的遗传基础提供了新视角，也为利用基因组信息开展性状改良提供了新线索。\n从“祖先密码”走向“育种密码”\n“这项基础研究的意义远不止厘清香蕉的家族历史，它为育种应用开辟了实实在在的路径。”\n王新风对《中国科学报》说。\n首先，它为全球香蕉抗病育种提供了一张“导航图”。有了祖先核型作为参照，科学家可以精准比较各野生种与卡文迪什之间的染色体结构差异，为进一步挖掘抗\nTR4等病害的优异遗传资源提供线索，也为后续杂交育种或基因编辑指明方向。\n其次，它为观赏蕉分子育种打开了新窗口。苞片颜色是观赏蕉的核心商业性状，理解染色体结构变化如何影响花色调控网络，生物学家便能更有针对性地开展性状改良。\n最后，从演化生物学视角看，它提供了一个系统的案例——植物如何通过染色体的断裂、融合与重排，在数千万年间“化繁为简”，从17对逐步缩减至9对，同时衍生出丰富多样的表型。这是自然选择在基因组尺度上的精妙雕琢。\n记者了解到，今年3月，研究团队在《自然-通讯》发表了从野生资源中筛选出高抗\nMusa cheesmanii\n，并成功与栽培种杂交获得兼具抗病性和优良果实品质的新种质‘Haijiao No. 1’。这进一步印证了，对野生近缘种基因组资源的系统解析，不仅能揭示演化历史，也能直接服务于优异种质挖掘和育种利用。\n从解锁芭蕉科的“祖先密码”，到挖掘野生近缘种中的“育种密码”，这些研究不仅为理解芭蕉科基因组演化历史与重要性状形成机制提供了全新视角，也为野生资源的保护利用与香蕉遗传改良开辟了新路径。\n下一次当你剥开一根香蕉，不妨想一想：这根甜美的果实背后，埋藏着一部跨越千万年的染色体“缩编史诗”，一场人类与植物病害的紧迫竞速，以及科研人员在复杂、重复的基因组“天书”中破译出的又一批关键密码。而这份解读，才刚刚开始。\n相关论文信息：https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cub.2026.07.071\nhttps://doi.org/10.1038/s41467-026-70186-9","d":"2026-08-30","u":"http://news.sciencenet.cn/htmlnews/2026/8/570586.shtm","c":"零碳产业/物质循环/有机物（碳循环）/有机工业/生物过程/农林","a":"科学网新闻","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"技术突破","tp":"香蕉基因组","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":7.5,"i":2.0,"r":7.0,"d":6.0,"t":6.0},"as":"超市货架上超过一半的香蕉是无性繁殖品种'卡文迪什'的后代，遗传基础高度一致，面临香蕉枯萎病热带4号生理小种（TR4）这一'香蕉癌症'的灭顶之灾。8月24日，中国科学院华南植物园王新风、黄慧润团队联合四川大学孙朋川等在《当代生物学》发表研究，首次重建芭蕉科祖先核型，从染色体层面系统揭示该类群演化轨迹，并发现染色体结构变异与苞片颜色表型分化密切相关。研究采用端粒到端粒（T2T）基因组组装技术，解决了不同类群染色体基数（x=11、10或9）如何形成等长期悬而未决的问题，为挖掘野生近缘种的抗病遗传资源提供依据。","kp":["香蕉枯萎病TR4[土壤存活]: 可在土壤中存活数十年","卡文迪什香蕉[市场份额]: 超市货架上超过一半","芭蕉科[物种数量]: 现存约80个物种","香蕉[染色体基数]: x=11、10或9"]},{"t":"科学网-研究揭示偶极导向芘类J-聚集体的多功能光催化","b":"研究揭示偶极导向芘类J-聚集体的多功能光催化\n近日，广东石油化工学院化学工程学院教授刘诗咏团队在有机光催化剂设计领域取得重要进展。团队成功构建了从“分子结构-超分子组装-内建电场-载流子动力学-多路径催化”的完整因果链，揭示了偶极导向\n-聚集体在提升光催化性能中的核心机制。相关成果发表于《应用催化B：环境与能源》（\nApplied Catalysis B: Environment and Energy\n聚集与多功能光催化及芘类系列分子合成示意图。研究团队供图\n研究团队设计合成了三种结构精确的芘基小分子（Py-B、Py-B-CN、Py-Pr-CN），通过引入氰基和吡啶氮基团，系统增强了分子极性与分子内电荷转移能力。高分辨透射电镜首次直接观察到Py-Pr-CN中0.33 nm的π-π堆积晶格条纹，结合粉末X射线衍射、紫外可见光谱及密度泛函理论计算，证实了有序滑移型\n?聚集体的形成。\n在可见光（λ>420 nm）照射且无需铂助催化剂的条件下，Py-Pr-CN展现出优异的多功能光催化活性：析氢速率达95.23 mmol·g\n，析氧速率5.36 mmol·g\n，过氧化氢生成速率416.67 μmol·g\n；其在450 nm处的表观量子效率高达11.41%。该综合性能居于同类有机小分子、超分子及共价有机框架光催化体系的前列。\n该工作提出的分子级精确调控策略，为开发高效、稳定、多功能且无需贵金属的有机光催化材料开辟了新路径，对太阳能燃料制备和绿色氧化合成领域具有重要的科学价值与应用前景。\n相关论文信息：https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcatb.2026.127368","d":"2026-08-30","u":"http://news.sciencenet.cn/htmlnews/2026/8/570585.shtm","c":"通用技术/催化剂","a":"科学网新闻","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"技术突破","tp":"光催化聚集","sc":6.1,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":8.0,"t":6.0},"as":"广东石油化工学院刘诗咏团队在有机光催化剂设计领域取得进展，构建了从'分子结构-超分子组装-内建电场-载流子动力学-多路径催化'的完整因果链，成果发表于《应用催化B：环境与能源》。团队设计合成三种芘基小分子（Py-B、Py-B-CN、Py-Pr-CN），通过引入氰基和吡啶氮基团增强分子极性与电荷转移能力，高分辨透射电镜首次直接观察到0.33 nm的π-π堆积晶格条纹，证实有序滑移型J-聚集体的形成。在可见光照射且无需铂助催化剂条件下，Py-Pr-CN析氢速率达95.23 mmol·g⁻¹，析氧速率5.36 mmol·g⁻¹，过氧化氢生成速率416.67 μmol·g⁻¹，450 nm处表观量子效率达11.41%，性能居同类体系前列。","kp":["π-π堆积晶格条纹[Py-Pr-CN高分辨透射电镜]: 0.33 nm","析氢速率[可见光λ>420nm无铂助催化剂，Py-Pr-CN]: 95.23 mmol·g⁻¹","析氧速率[同条件]: 5.36 mmol·g⁻¹","过氧化氢生成速率[同条件]: 416.67 μmol·g⁻¹（量级）","催化剂[偶极导向芘类J-聚集体]: Py-B、Py-B-CN、Py-Pr-CN三种芘基小分子，引入氰基和吡啶氮基团增强极性与分子内电荷转移"]},{"t":"科学网-海洋中尺度涡结构与输运特征方面取得新进展","b":"海洋中尺度涡结构与输运特征方面取得新进展\n近日，中国科学院南海海洋研究所研究员蔡树群团队联合自然资源部第二海洋研究所副研究员刘统亚、英国东安格里亚大学副教授Zhai Xiaoming、中国科学院大气物理研究所研究员林鹏飞等科研人员，在海洋中尺度涡结构与输运特征方面取得新进展。相关成果发表于《海洋学进展》（\nProgress in Oceanography\n东南印度洋(a)气旋涡和(b)反气旋涡三维结构空间分布。阴影和等值线表示涡旋内密度异常。研究团队供图，下同\n论文第一作者、中国科学院南海海洋研究所副研究员何映晖介绍，中尺度涡旋是海洋中广泛存在的海水旋转运动，水平尺度通常为数十至数百千米，生命周期可达数十至数百天，承载着海洋中大部分动能，在海洋水团、热盐输运以及海洋生态环境调节中发挥着重要作用。卫星观测表明，东南印度洋是全球中尺度涡活动较为活跃的区域之一，不同区域涡旋的振幅、生命周期等表层特征存在显著差异。然而，这些涡旋在海表以下具有怎样的三维结构？其垂向结构是否也存在类似的空间差异？不同涡旋生命周期为何存在显著差别？\n针对这些问题，研究团队\n在国家自然科学基金、国家重点研发计划等项目资助下，\n综合卫星高度计和Argo浮标观测，系统研究了东南印度洋中尺度涡垂向结构和体积分能量的空间分布特征、涡旋垂向结构、能量耗散与生命周期之间的关系。结果表明，东南印度洋气旋涡的垂向结构具有显著的区域差异，而反气旋涡的区域变化相对较弱。根据垂向结构特征，中尺度涡可分为表层强化型和次表层强化型两类。其中，次表层强化型涡旋以气旋涡为主，其密度异常核心位于约750米深度，最大流速则出现在约250-300米深度，主要分布于利文海流系统及30°S以南的开阔海域。\n相比之下，反气旋涡总体以表层强化型结构为主。研究表明，中尺度涡的垂向结构不仅受到海洋层结控制，还与背景平均流系密切相关。进一步分析发现，涡旋生命周期与其体积分能量具有更为密切的联系。其中，生命周期与体积分涡动能的相关系数达到0.84，明显高于其与涡旋振幅、半径和垂向尺度等特征参数的相关程度。涡旋总能量的空间差异主要由涡旋振幅和垂向结构共同控制，而涡旋半径和科氏参数的影响相对较弱。这表明仅依赖卫星能够观测到的海表特征难以完整刻画涡旋的总能量及其生命周期。\n东南印度洋典型涡旋结构及能量耗散系数。\n研究还发现，次表层强化型涡旋由垂向混合引起的能量耗散明显弱于表层强化型涡旋；同时，垂向混合对涡旋有效位能的耗散快于对涡动能的耗散，而水平混合则表现出相反的特征。以利文海流系统为例，该区域的气旋涡以次表层强化型结构为主，不仅具有更高的体积分能量，且垂向混合耗散更弱，因此能够维持更长的生命周期。研究由此建立了“涡旋垂向结构-总能量-能量耗散-生命周期”之间的联系，为理解不同类型中尺度涡寿命差异提供了新的动力学视角。论文结果表明，涡旋三维结构和能量是调控其生命周期的重要因素，不能仅依据海表性质判断涡旋的演变和持续时间。\n该研究从观测角度系统揭示了东南印度洋气旋涡和反气旋涡垂向结构的空间差异，从能量学角度定量解释了表层强化型与次表层强化型涡旋在能量耗散和生命周期方面的差异，并指出传统上将气旋涡和反气旋涡假定为具有相似垂向结构，可能会给涡致物质输运和能量耗散估算带来偏差。\n相关论文信息：https://doi.org/10.1016/j.pocean.2026.103809","d":"2026-08-30","u":"http://news.sciencenet.cn/htmlnews/2026/8/570584.shtm","c":"未分类","a":"科学网新闻","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察","tp":"中尺度涡结构","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":6.5,"i":2.0,"r":6.0,"d":6.0,"t":5.0},"as":"中国科学院南海海洋研究所蔡树群团队联合多家机构，在海洋中尺度涡结构与输运特征方面取得新进展，成果发表于《海洋学进展》。研究综合卫星高度计和Argo浮标观测，系统研究东南印度洋中尺度涡垂向结构和体积分能量。结果表明，东南印度洋气旋涡垂向结构具有显著区域差异，反气旋涡区域变化较弱。按垂向结构可分为表层强化型和次表层强化型两类，次表层强化型以气旋涡为主，密度异常核心位于约750米深度，最大流速出现在约250-300米深度，主要分布于利文海流系统及30°S以南海域。反气旋涡总体以表层强化型为主，涡旋垂向结构受海洋层结和背景平均流系共同控制。"},{"t":"科学网-微信方言活动：靠“最笨办法”长出方言识别能力","b":"微信方言活动：靠“最笨办法”长出方言识别能力\n语音输入流行之后，因方言识别和口音问题，闹出不少笑话。\n一老人有口音，在家庭群里发语音“我的护工死了”，惊出子女一身冷汗。问清楚了才知道，原来是老人养的宠物蜈蚣死了。\n微信语音转文字对四川话识别率很低，常误判为英语，如“鞋”识别为Hi、“街识别出Gap、“恩桃儿”识别为Enter……\n为提升方言识别算法的技术能力，近期微信在小程序推出方言活动，希望通过用户以方言语音形式参与，一方面推动方言语音识别技术迭代，同时也记录方言语料、服务文化保护。\n“AI能听懂英语法语日语， 听不懂自己国家群众的方言，这事说不过去。”近日，微信产品团队向《中国科学报》说，微信方言活动正是在这样的目标下开展的。\n用户反馈：“早该优化了”\n微信推出方言活动，直接起因是用户反馈。尤其是方言使用者在使用语音输入、语音转文字、智能客服等功能时，长期存在识别不准的问题。\n“潮汕话闽南话温州话这些，用语音输入基本等于‘废’的。”有用户反馈说，语音输入这么多年了，服务的一直是普通话说得标准的那批人，“早该优化了”。还有用户提出，微信里不会说普通话的老人那么多，“应该多照顾照顾他们”。\n这不是一个小众需求。中国有七大方言区——官话、吴、湘、赣、客家、闽、粤，往下还可细分为几十个次方言片，部分地区一县之内就有十几种口音差异。语音输入普及这么多年，服务的主要是普通话标准度较高的人群；口音一重，识别质量就明显下降。\n“受影响最大的是不会说普通话的老年人。”微信产品团队对记者表示，老人们打字困难，语音又转不出准确文字，家人往往需要反复听完整条语音才能理解。在医院挂号、政务办事等场景中，“请清楚说出您的需求”常对他们构成实际障碍。\n具体来说，“微信方言活动”是一个小程序。小程序邀请用户用家乡话朗读一些日常句子，并互相判断彼此的发音是否地道。采集到的方言语音，用于训练和优化微信的方言语音识别能力。\n记者注意到，该活动覆盖面广、涉及用户群体大，因此也引发广泛关注。\n微信举措：“最笨的办法”\n微信方言活动推出以来，有人额手称庆，有人则充满困惑：为什么必须采集真人语音？短视频平台上有大量方言内容，不能直接采用吗？\n对此，微信产品团队回应称，采集真人语音是语音识别的基本工作方式。模型的识别能力直接来源于它“见过”的语音样本；没有真实口音数据，模型对该口音就没有识别能力。\n“这不是工程偷懒，是这类模型的根本约束——它无法对从未见过的发音模式做出可靠推断。”微信产品团队对《中国科学报》说，文本与语音的严格对应关系，是训练语音识别模型的核心要求。而训练方言模型的问题在于，方言语料几乎不存在现成资源——互联网上可获取的中文语料绝大部分是普通话，而诸如短视频平台上的方言内容，也因缺少文本与语音的严格对应关系，模型不能建立音频与文字之间的一一映射，也无法直接使用。\n记者了解到，目前英语、法语等语言有成熟的公开语音数据集，中文方言基本是空白。想做，只能自己攒。\n与想要借用短视频方言素材“走捷径”相比，微信方言活动的做法恰恰是相反的：先给定文本，再请用户用方言念出来。这样每一条录音都有确定的正确答案。微信产品团队告诉记者，这也是为什么活动中要让用户互相评判发音是否地道：“那一步是在给数据打标签，是训练流程中绕不过去的环节。”\n如前所述，方言的地理颗粒度极细。同一个县，不同村镇的口音可能就有明显差别。这也是微信方言活动希望覆盖到大量人群的原因。微信产品团队表示，不到县一级的采集密度，模型在实际使用中仍会失效。此外，样本还需覆盖不同年龄、性别的发音特征，“否则模型只能识别特定人群”。\n这无疑是一项巨大的工程。同时，让用户一句句朗读固定文本，也是最慢、最贵、最容易被注意到的路径。\n“为什么微信要用这个最笨的办法？因为我们要的不是‘方言长什么样’，而是‘这句话用这个地方的话怎么说、说得标不标准’。”微信产品团队回应说，你得知道正确答案是什么，模型才能学。刷来的短视频没有这个对应关系，再多也用不上。\n收集方言是“破解密码”？微信回应\n用“一文一句”的笨办法去攻克非典型发音识别，并非微信独创。市面上一些拥有方言能力的模型，也都采用过类似做法。记者了解到，谷歌还曾专门收集帕金森病、渐冻症患者的发音样本，目的就是让语音助手能够识别这些特定对象的发音。\n“没有哪个模型的方言能力是凭空产生的。”北京邮电大学人机交互与认知工程实验室一位AI专家告诉记者，诸如微信方言活动的语料收集方式，是语音识别行业的通行做法。\n在微信方言活动开展过程中，有人担心，方言在“二战”期间曾被当做密码使用，收集方言是否也存在类似“密码破解”的问题？\n对此前述AI专家回答说：“‘二战’期间美军曾使用纳瓦霍语通讯员传递战场信息，抗战时期我军也使用过方言传令。但这类做法成立有一个特定前提：当时的加密手段有限，语言本身的稀缺性构成了安全屏障。但现代密码学早已不这样工作了——现代加密通信的安全性来自数学，不来自‘对方听不懂’。”\n“历史上的方言通信之所以有效，很大程度上依赖对手不具备相应的语言接触条件；而今这个条件在今天已不存在。”该AI专家继续解释说，依赖“语言稀缺性”的做法，在今天属于典型的隐晦式安全——把安全性寄托在“对方不知道”上。而这在现代信息安全领域已被明确视为不合格的设计范式，是“教科书中的反面案例”。原因很简单：这类保护一旦被识破就完全失效，且无法评估强度。\n具体到采集到的方言语料怎么用、怎么管？微信产品团队表示，他们将严格遵循“合法、正当、必要”原则，通过专属授权条款取得用户单独同意；语料仅用于提升方言相关服务质量，例如方言识别模型优化，不用于与此无关的用途。","d":"2026-08-30","u":"http://news.sciencenet.cn/htmlnews/2026/8/570583.shtm","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/多模态模型","a":"科学网新闻","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察","tp":"方言识别","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":5.0,"r":6.0,"d":4.0,"t":7.0},"as":"针对方言语音识别准确率低的问题，微信近期在小程序推出方言活动，邀请用户用家乡话朗读日常句子并互相判断发音是否地道，采集方言语料用于训练和优化微信方言识别技术，同时记录方言语料、服务文化保护。中国有七大方言区，可细分为几十个次方言片，部分地区一县内有十几种口音差异，现有语音输入主要服务普通话标准人群，口音一重识别质量明显下降。受影响最大的是不会说普通话的老年人，在医院挂号、政务办事等场景面临实际障碍。微信产品团队表示'AI能听懂英语法语日语，听不懂自己国家群众的方言，这事说不过去'。","kp":["方言语音识别[微信小程序方言活动]: 通过用户方言语音参与推动识别技术迭代并记录方言语料"]},{"t":"科学网-向新向智求变，打印工业巨头谋求更确定的十年","b":"向新向智求变，打印工业巨头谋求更确定的十年\n打印工业巨头爱普生，最近干了一件不那么“工业”的事儿。\n通过与美妆公司合作，爱普生推出了一款“美甲机器人”。只需商场一角，它就能为顾客从数万种指甲油颜色中精准配色，调出独一无二的美甲。目前，这个机器人已经在沃尔玛商场“上岗”。\n爱普生超过80%的营收来自打印业务和工业制造领域，“美甲机器人方案”是爱普生机器人业务的一个“非典型”场景。但就是这款方案的实现，浓缩了体现爱普生的技术底蕴：紧凑小巧的机器人运动控制、高精度的力学与视觉传感、精确的色彩识别，以及24小时不间断运行的工程化可靠性。\n“如今大家所见爱普生的核心业务，涵盖工业机器人、喷墨打印、视觉解决方案等，均依托爱普生的‘省、小、精’核心技术基因延伸发展而来。”在近期的一场媒体走访活动中，爱普生公司董事、先进机器人解决方案事业部首席运营官吉野泰德告诉《中国科学报》，这也正是爱普生希望看到的——作为一家技术型公司，如何让拥有的技术进一步地迭代、进化，并且让其在社会上真正地发挥作用，是爱普生寻求未来增长的新叙事。\n向新向智，爱普生筹谋未来10年\n在很多人印象里，爱普生最大的标签是“打印巨头”。84年前，爱普生从组装机械手表起家，不断蓄势，后来靠打印机业务名扬天下——其英文名EPSON里的“EP”就是电子打印机的首字母缩写。\n但打印机并不是爱普生的全部，它现在还拥有投影机、工业机器人、半导体元器件、打印头等多条业务线，这些布局全球的业务每年带来超过14,133亿日元的营收（参考2025财年数据）。\n然而，时代向前，一边是传统业务越来越逼近市场容量的瓶颈；另一边，人工智能、大模型、人形机器人等新技术浪潮迭起，不断涌现出新的创富神话。\n数十年来“修炼”了一身软硬件技术“功夫”的爱普生，当然不会作壁上观。2026年4月，爱普生发布了一个展望2035年的“十年愿景”计划：ENGINEERED FUTURE 2035（简称Epson35）。在这一愿景中，爱普生希望把自己从人们印象中的“一家打印机公司”，向“技术革新x工程制造”全面升级。\n爱普生2035愿景。爱普生供图，下同\n为此，爱普生将业务重组为四大领域：精密技术创新、行业与机器人、办公与家庭打印、视觉与生活方式。其中，精密技术创新涵盖喷墨解决方案、电子元器件、高性能材料等业务，定位为“增长引擎”；行业与机器人涵盖商业与工业打印、机器人业务，是“发力重点”。\n吉野泰德透露，爱普生希望到2035年，两类增长型产业在销售额中占比达到50%，利润贡献达到70%。\n“打印业务、视觉解决方案业务，我们认为已比较成熟，它们将会贡献更多的盈利和现金流。而成熟业务所提供的盈利和资源，会被投入到‘增长’领域，以保证对今后有望取得大幅增长的板块的培育。”吉野泰德说。\n爱普生对2035财年展望。\n记者了解到，提出这样的愿景，更在于爱普生在展望未来时，发现目前经济社会中还存在许多问题。吉野泰德说，在对所有问题进行分类后，他们决心着眼于“更好地保护、节约使用能源和资源”和“要让人的力量得到最大程度的发挥”这两方面展开行动。\n“针对这两类问题，爱普生能够提供什么价值？我们认为应该将我们的先进技术进一步打磨、提升，使其真正落地应用、开花结果。”吉野泰德说：“也就是希望将所拥有技术作具体的落地，通过Engineering（工程化）的手段，来实现工程‘智’造。”\n向新向智，这便是爱普生对未来10年的筹谋。\n为机器人业务大爆发做准备\n爱普生的“十年愿景”将未来增长押注在精密技术和机器人领域，尤其是机器人业务。在迎接媒体来访时，爱普生丰科事业所一口气展示了SCARA机器人（一种圆柱坐标型的特殊工业机器人）、六轴机器人、力觉传感器、分光相机以及面向精密装配的多种解决方案。\n从现场演示来看，爱普生机器人的技术实力已足够强悍。比如机器人方案演示中，机器人仅凭力觉传感器就能准确寻找孔位、调整角度，完成细小螺丝和线缆接口的装配；拥有折叠臂的六轴机器人不仅能在狭小空间内完成复杂轨迹作业，还能通过多角度灵活运动完成涂胶等动作及应用。\n爱普生系列机器人。\n然而即便如此，爱普生并没有停下对机器人研发的投入。\n“我们主要进行了两方面较大额度的投资，一是针对工业机器人硬件的投资，如LA-A系列、LA-C系列以及全新研发的N系列，进一步充实我们的产品线，加快产品更新换代的速度——很多客户对此感到惊喜。另一方面是软件方面的投入，主要包括更好地发挥AI的作用、更好地和云端进行连接等。”吉野泰德在回答《中国科学报》提问时说，对于工业机器人而言，软件以及AI的应用非常重要，尤其是在“如何让硬件和软件之间有更好的匹配”方面。\n“爱普生机器人从组装手表起步，能够适应高精度、高密度、难组装的场景。因此，强大AI的出现将让爱普生如虎添翼。”爱普生表示，“借助AI的力量，今后爱普生的机器人有望在物流、服务等更多的领域大显身手。”\n爱普生的“省、小、精”哲学，让其有望在具身智能大潮下走出更务实的路。\n“当今人形机器人大行其道，貌似取得了很大进展，但实际上让机器人做一些大动作并不难，真正的难点在细节之处，也就是最后一寸、一厘米、一毫米的精细动作上。”吉野泰德以爱普生的GYROPLUS技术（其自主研发的一项振动抑制技术）为例说道，它让机器臂不仅能精准定位以及保持稳定，还拥有非常精准的控制能力。他告诉记者，这种对“精度、力量、控制”恰到好处的拿捏，“是爱普生机器人技术的灵魂所在”。\n“未来机器人要走进千家万户，我们认为这种微细、精准的传感与控制应成为它的底层技术，这也是我们的优势和持续不断努力的方向。”吉野泰德说，这些都不是通过AI发一个指令就能很容易做到的。\n爱普生从自身优势出发，不断迭代进化，让那些底层不易取代的技术发挥更大作用、创造更多社会价值和经济收益。从这个视角来看，Epson35十年战略，清醒且有很强的实操性。它留给人的期待，或许不是一个AI化、具身化的爱普生，而是一个更加“强壮”的爱普生。\n爱普生“智”造，妙在“精微”\n爱普生的全称是“精工爱普生公司”，其中“精工”二字与闻名世界的精工（Seiko）手表同根同源——1985年，从事精工手表装配业务的“诹访精工社”与负责打印机等业务的“爱普生”合并，并成就了今天的精工爱普生。\n爱普生将未来增长押注在精密技术和机器人领域，可以解读为再创“新精工”。然而，考虑到AI、具身智能与机器人结合给人带来的巨大想象力空间，再结合该计划布局未来10年的时间尺度，爱普生的“十年愿景”似乎没有“惊心动魄的宏大叙事”。\n但真正让人惊心动魄的，往往藏在细节处。\n以喷墨解决方案为例。在爱普生广丘事业所，负责喷墨解决方案的爱普生首席执行官福田俊也向记者系统介绍了爱普生的喷墨技术及解决方案：喷墨早已不是“打印”的代名词，而是一种“智造”能力：一种数字化的、非接触式的材料沉积工艺，它通过“省、小、精”理念，实现高效、低成本的制造。\n比如，在钙钛矿太阳能电池的生产中，爱普生通过其PrecisionCore打印头，能将钙钛矿材料形成的“墨水”，以极高的精度喷射在基板上，形成一层均匀的薄膜。用这种方式生产的钙钛矿电池组件，光电转换效率更高。\n这一技术更令人期待的应用，是半导体制造。传统半导体的刻蚀工艺，需先大面积涂布昂贵材料（如贵金属），再去除不需要的部分，而喷墨可以按需沉积，用精准的“加法”制造，替代高成本的“减法”光刻工艺。福田俊也说，这项技术在半导体领域已进入了使用之前的验证示范阶段，前景广阔。\n值得一提的是，爱普生生产打印头所需的薄膜压电技术、MEMS制造技术、超高精度组装技术全都是自有专利，这些技术所构筑的“更高精度、更高可靠性及小巧紧凑”的优势令友商难以匹敌。\n也正因此，爱普生在其十年大计的第一个阶段——2026到2028财年所进行的投入，非常看中喷墨解决方案发挥的增长引擎价值。从钙钛矿光伏到半导体制造验证，这项源于打印场景的精密材料沉积技术，正在跳出传统打印的边界，诠释“省、小、精”技术跨行业迁移的巨大潜能。\n技术的终极意义，不在于概念有多炫目，而在于能否解决真实产业难题。这家源自手表制造的老牌科技企业，正以工程智造为抓手，把“省、小、精”的内核转化为面向产业、面向社会的实在价值。面向2035，所谓变得更“强壮”，并非追求规模的简单扩张，而是依托底层技术，在更多新兴赛道开辟新的增长曲线，在资源节约、生产力提升两大时代命题下，探寻一家制造企业穿越周期的长久生存之道。","d":"2026-08-30","u":"http://news.sciencenet.cn/htmlnews/2026/8/570582.shtm","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"科学网新闻","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察","tp":"机器人技术","sc":4.8,"scd":{"b":3.5,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":"打印工业巨头爱普生通过与美妆公司合作推出'美甲机器人'，已在沃尔玛商场投入使用，可为顾客从数万种指甲油颜色中精准配色。该方案浓缩了爱普生在紧凑机器人运动控制、高精度力学与视觉传感、精确色彩识别及24小时工程化可靠性方面的技术底蕴。爱普生超过80%营收来自打印业务和工业制造领域，核心业务涵盖工业机器人、喷墨打印、视觉解决方案等，均依托'省、小、精'核心技术基因延伸发展，2025财年营收超过14133亿日元。面对传统业务逼近市场容量瓶颈和AI等新技术浪潮，爱普生于2026年4月发布了展望2035年的'十年愿景'计划。","kp":["营收结构[爱普生打印与工业制造]: 超过80%","美甲机器人[沃尔玛商场应用]: 从数万种指甲油颜色中精准配色，24小时不间断运行"]},{"t":"科学网-岭南大学校长秦泗钊：AI时代，为什么更需要博雅教育？","b":"岭南大学校长秦泗钊：AI时代，为什么更需要博雅教育？\n担任香港岭南大学校长的第三年，秦泗钊的日程愈发繁忙，他频繁往返各大高校，关于AI时代下博雅教育的探索与思考，是他密集行程中贯穿始终的交流主线之一。\n“博雅教育旨在培养学生的批判性思维、沟通能力以及解决复杂问题的能力。”作为一名工程及数据科学专家，他对博雅教育有着自己的见解，“数字时代的博雅教育需要人文素养、科学素养、AI素养，三者缺一不可。”\n带着这些思考，他烧出了上任的“第一把火”,提出“四个融合”：加强文理融合、传统与数字化融合、与学校的历史融合、与大湾区、内地及全球的融合。后来，率先于2023年8月决定：购买ChatGPT许可证，供全校师生免费使用。在他的带领之下，岭南大学发展迅速，国际声誉日隆，“优质教育”连续两年在泰晤士教育世界大学影响力排名中位列全球第一。\n在一位理工科校长的眼中，AI时代的博雅教育有哪些全新特质？又能为当前高等教育提供哪些借鉴？围绕这些问题，《中国科学报》近日独家专访了秦泗钊。\n秦泗钊。受访者供图\n数字时代，博雅教育何去何从？\n：什么是博雅教育？在人工智能（AI）时代，博雅教育有什么重要性？\n：博雅教育是一种强调广泛知识和文化素养的教育模式，旨在培养学生的批判性思维、沟通能力以及解决复杂问题的能力。\n博雅教育的模式有着悠久历史。19世纪下半叶，大批美國公立大学陆续成立，核心目标是为工业发展培养具备职业技能的专业人才。但20世纪初，哈佛大学、芝加哥大学等顶尖学府就已意识到专业化教育的弊端：只传授职业技能、忽视人的培养，背离了教育的本质。\n当时学界掀起了关于教育本质的讨论，并形成共识：学生毕业后就遗忘的公式、定理、知识点并非教育的核心，真正留存的价值判断、是非观念、思维哲理、人文素养才是教育的本质。\n此后美国博雅教育高校出现分化：一部分文理学院专注本科博雅教育，不设立研究生院；另一部分常青藤院校则转型为研究型大学，在博雅教育基础上叠加科研与研究生培养体系。\n因此，博雅教育的本质其实是传授做人的道理、事物发展的规律，塑造学生的人生观和世界观，而不仅仅是教授技能、寻求工作，这一点在数字时代的重要性愈发突出。\n而随着AI技术的发展，博雅教育又面临了新的挑战。传统的博雅教育大多只重视人文素养，但只教人文素养，够不够？我认为，没有科学素养、AI素养，就谈不上全人教育。\n近年来，岭南大学积极探索新的博雅教育模式，也就是符合数字时代的博雅教育新模式，让博雅教育和科学技术、AI相结合。我们希望培养学生的批判性思维能力，并为其提供自主探索学习兴趣的空间，将推动文理融合与兼修，培养在数字时代具有足够竞争力的人才。\n因此，立足当下数字时代，我们确立了全新办学定位：数字时代文理融合研究型博雅教育。\n：什么是“数字时代文理融合研究型博雅教育”？\n：我们可以拆解其中的三个关键词：数字时代、文理融合、研究型。\n传统博雅教育重视人文素养，而随着科学技术的发展，科学素养的重要性愈发凸显，我们认识社会、作出决策，都需要建立在科学认知的基础上。同时，进入数字时代，AI逐渐渗透到每个人的生活当中，AI素养也成为新时代博雅教育不可或缺的重要部分。\n在AI时代，学科边界持续消融，不存在绝对的文科、理科壁垒。在我看来，在文科和理科的划分之上，还应该有一个更高层面的育人体系，人文素养、科学素养、AI素养都应该成为对人的教育的一部分，这也是我们推进文理融合、数字化博雅教育的核心原因。\n而研究型办学的意义则在于，当下我们所要面对的诸多现实问题都充满未知，这就要求学生能够自主汲取新知识、探寻解决路径。传统博雅教育更多聚焦本科教学，岭南大学则创新性叠加研究型办学特质，通过科研训练，培养学生发现、解决问题的能力，树立终身学习的意识。\n：学校通过哪些措施实现这一目标？\n：我们开展了全方位探索。岭南大学在传承文学院、商学院及社会科学院三所发展悠久学院的基础上，近年又先后成立数据科学学院、伍絜宜跨学科学院与研究生院作为三大重点发展板块。\n我们最核心的特色之一是全校学生必修AI课程、系统化规范AI使用。自三年前起，学校将《生成式人工智能》设立为全校本科生公共核心必修课，是中国高校中最早全面落地AI通识必修的院校之一。\n很多高校忌惮学生使用AI，担心学生过度依赖AI工具、敷衍学业，但我始终认为：不教学生规范使用AI，才是最大的风险。就像未经过正规驾考训练的人私自开车，极易出现问题。而学校通过系统化课程，教会学生AI工具的实操方法、使用边界、伦理规范，引导学生思辨AI的价值与弊端。\n同时，在科学素方面，我们全面迭代教学与作业模式，摒弃有标准答案的固化作业，设置开放性、思辨性、无固定答案的任务，倒逼学生自主思考、辨别信息真伪、判断价值对错。在当下虚假信息泛滥、AI内容混杂的环境中，重点培养学生的信息甄别能力、独立判断能力、终身学习能力。\n此外，我们尝试在实践中培育、提升学生的人文素养。我们开设了必修的服务式学习课程，学校设立专门的服务研习办公室，所有本科生需要走进社会基层，发现真实社会问题、自主探索解决方案，学校提供资源支持落地实践。\n例如，学校师生经过调研后发现香港特有的住宅-劏房空间狭小、通风采光条件较差后，自主研发了低能耗、便携小型电池驱动空气净化器，充一次电可续航六七天，过滤效能行业领先。这一成果斩获14项国际设计大奖，切实解决了基层民生难题，这也是学生人文素养、实践能力、创新能力融合培养的典型成果。\n“AI时代契机催促中国高等教育变革”\n：当下大多高校普遍推进学科交叉、专业融合。岭南大学的博雅教育则积极探索人文素养、科学素养、AI素养的结合，这对其他高校有怎样的借鉴意义？\n：首先要区分两个核心概念：常规高校的学科交叉，是为了完善学科布局、填补学科空白；而岭南大学跨学科融合的目的而非单纯完善学科体系，核心是服务人文素养、科学素养、AI素养的全人培养目标。\n经过探索，我们发现，研究型博雅教育其实对教师提出了更高要求。如果老师将过去的课程内容年复一年地教给学生，而学生学了这些内容无从就业，那老师是否还应该教这些东西？因此，学生创新能力的培养至关重要。\n要培养学生的创新能力和批判性思维，首先要给教师“松绑”，我们既不考核课堂抬头率等形式化指标，也不干预教师的教学探索与内容更新，充分释放教师的教学与研究积极性。三年前，岭南大学就为全体师生免费开放各类AI工具，开展常态化的AI培训，让教师先接触、先学习，让教师们在真实体验中反思、创新教学内容和模式。\n此外，学校建立动态学科迭代机制，香港高校每三年需淘汰4%的老旧专业、新增4%的前沿交叉专业。我们近两年新增的AI+人文、AI+社科等交叉专业，均由一线教师基于行业趋势、育人需求自主提出，自下而上推进学科创新，完全贴合数字时代人才需求。\n同时，我认为交叉融合不局限于学科之间，而要努力实现“四个融合”，即文理融合、传统与数字化融合、与学校历史融合、与大湾区、内地及全球的融合。\n作为离深圳最近的香港本地大学和通往香港北部都会区的重要窗口，岭南大学将充分利用地理优势，深度对接大湾区发展，学校已在深圳设立研究院，开展科研与学术交流、人才培养、企业孵化，以及科研成果转化等工作。\n：随着AI技术的快速普及，每个人都可以自主获取各类知识，当前推行博雅教育有哪些困难和挑战？\n：中国高等教育近五十年的发展，核心目标是快速培养顶尖科技人才，解决科技人才断层问题，因此形成了重专业、重技能、高效率的培养模式。而这套适配过去的模式，需要补充多样化教育模式以满足多元化的社会与人才需求。\n事实上，即便没有AI的冲击，中国高等教育也亟需变革。当前全国每年超千万高校毕业生，但培养模式高度同质化，人才目标、学习内容、发展路径高度统一，这是教育内卷的核心根源。\n人才天赋、社会需求本就是多元的，单一的专业化技能教育体系，无法全面支撑社会创新发展。但目前国内教育多样化仅局限于技能培养层面，本质仍是围绕专业技能培养。\n因此，教育多样化是破局关键，也是创新的核心前提，这也是当前博雅教育重要性愈发凸显的重要原因。\n然而，当前博雅教育仍然面临诸多挑战。尽管目前已有多所院校开始了博雅教育探索，例如北京大学的元培学院、清华大学的新雅书院，但真正落地通识博雅教育的学生占比不足千分之一，多数高校的“博雅课程”只是简单增设通识选修课，并非真正的博雅教育。\n我们认为，真正的博雅教育是培养三大核心能力：独立思考能力、终身学习能力、健全的道德价值体系。这是AI无法替代的，也是新时代大学不可动摇的育人核心。\n岭南大学有着悠久的博雅教育历史，近年来也在积极与多所高校合作，例如2024年与北京大学元培学院合办“岭南-元培STEM暑期学苑”，通过跨校合作、创新与创业实践，将理论知识与实际应用结合，让创意想法转化为具体的创新创业项目或可市场化的产品及服务，培养更多具有全球视野和创新能力的优秀人才。\n一个理工科校长眼中的博雅教育\n：您本身是数据科学出身，而岭南大学是百年人文博雅教育重镇，外界评价您是“理科校长接管文科重镇”，您如何看待这一评价？\n：岭南大学百年历任校长多为人文、经管背景，我是学校近百年来首位理工科背景校长，这既是偶然，也是时代必然。\n但首先要厘清一个核心认知。岭南大学的博雅教育，是将人文、科学、数学素养作为全人成长的底色，不是单一的职业谋生技能，也并非单纯的“文科重镇”。\n当下全球文科发展存在误区，过度细分冷门学科、脱离社会需求，导致部分文科专业被欧美高校精简。而国内文理分科的教育模式，让学生长期局限于单一学科视角，缺乏全局视野与跨学科能力。\n我始终坚持先体验、再评判的原则。学校不要求师生对AI、数字化变革盲目站队，而是先提供工具、搭建平台，让师生亲身实践、深度体验后，再形成自己的认知与思辨，杜绝脱离实践的空谈论断。\n：对于岭南大学的未来，您有着怎样的设想？\n：我观察到，美国有两三百所小型文理学院，其中不少院校办学处境艰难，在生存线上苦苦支撑。根源就在于缺少变革与创新，固守百年前的教学模式，认为过去怎么教，现在就应当怎么教。而我们不能走这样的老路。\n当下社会，一所博雅大学不可能脱离数字时代，无论是作为决策者还是执行者，只懂人文、完全不具备科学素养是远远不够的。与此同时，保留学生自身专业的根基传承，也是当代大学教育应当完成的功课。\n因此，未来岭南大学的发展规划十分清晰：其一，打造数字时代文理融合的研究型博雅教育，目前欧美的博雅教育大多仅覆盖人文、科学素养，尚未全面普及AI素养，我们要持续探索数字时代博雅教育新模式；其二，坚守“小而精”的办学传统，保留沉浸式、高互动的校园育人环境，不盲目扩招扩容；其三，稳步发展研究生、博士生教育，让研究型育人体系覆盖全学段，让博雅素养贯穿学生整个求学阶段。\n同时，我们将延续校园育人设计理念，依托学校回廊式步行校园设计，打造师生高频交流互动的场景，打破师生隔阂，让校园环境本身成为博雅教育的载体。\n把这整套办学实践落地，于我而言，才算是对香港岭南大学有一份交代。我刚入职时学校在校生大约4000多人，如今已经增长到8000多人，未来我希望能够达到一万人，后续扩容增量，优先发展研究生，争取逐步实现研究生与本科生规模接近1:1，甚至研究生占比更高。\n未来，AI、大数据会大量替代重复性、事务性的知识性工作，低层次的细节类劳动会被机器取代。因此，如何培养学生的高阶思维、自主学习能力，正是博雅教育格外看重的内核。","d":"2026-08-30","u":"http://news.sciencenet.cn/htmlnews/2026/8/570581.shtm","c":"未分类","a":"科学网新闻","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察","tp":"AI博雅教育","as":"香港岭南大学校长秦泗钊在接受《中国科学报》专访时阐述AI时代博雅教育的价值。他认为博雅教育旨在培养批判性思维、沟通能力及解决复杂问题的能力，数字时代的博雅教育需要人文素养、科学素养、AI素养三者缺一不可。他上任后提出'四个融合'：加强文理融合、传统与数字化融合、与学校历史融合、与大湾区内地及全球融合，并于2023年8月率先购买ChatGPT许可证供全校师生免费使用。在其带领下，岭南大学'优质教育'连续两年在泰晤士教育世界大学影响力排名中位列全球第一。"},{"t":"科学网-广东医生成功实施十二指肠降段早癌内镜微创治愈性切除","b":"广东医生成功实施十二指肠降段早癌内镜微创治愈性切除\n近日，中山大学孙逸仙纪念医院消化内科主任医师黄开红团队突破内镜手术高难度壁垒，成功完成一例十二指肠降段早癌内镜黏膜下剥离术（ESD），实现微创治愈性切除。该技术作为胃肠道早癌诊疗的微创“利器”，帮助患者避免了传统开腹大手术，以精准、安全、高效的优势，为消化道早癌患者提供了保器官、快康复的新选择。\n患者何先生（52岁）于常规胃镜体检中发现十二指肠降段浅表隆起型病变。该部位解剖结构复杂，毗邻血管、胆管、胰腺等重要脏器，操作空间狭窄、视野受限，被公认为内镜手术的“高风险禁区”。虽无明显症状，但因存在恶变风险，患者专程至该院消化内科就诊。\n黄开红团队为其完善精细胃镜复查，影像提示病变疑似腺瘤，符合内镜切除指征；入院后全套术前评估确认肿瘤局限于黏膜层，无浸润及转移，具备ESD治疗条件。\nESD是当前治疗胃肠道早癌及癌前病变的优选微创技术，通过消化内镜进入消化道，无需开腹或切除正常脏器，即可精准剥离黏膜及黏膜下层病变组织，完整切除病灶。相较传统外科手术，ESD具有创伤小、出血少、恢复快、住院时间短、费用低等优势，且最大程度保留胃肠道生理功能，提升患者术后生活质量。\n但十二指肠降段ESD难度极高，不仅要求术者操作精细、经验丰富，更考验团队对穿孔、大出血、毗邻脏器损伤等风险的预判与应急处理能力，目前仅少数顶尖医院能成熟开展。为保障安全，医院打破单一科室局限，由消化内科牵头，联合普外科、麻醉科、影像科组建多学科诊疗团队，制定个体化“双保障”方案：优先行内镜微创切除，全程严密监测，若出现严重并发症，外科团队即刻介入。\n据介绍，手术由练国达主任医师、陈少杰副主任医师操作，陈茵婷主任医师现场指导。团队凭借娴熟技巧，历时约1小时，完整剥离全部病变，术中无穿孔、大出血，手术过程顺利。术后患者恢复良好，短期内康复出院。术后病理回报：病灶为管状-绒毛状腺瘤，局部腺上皮中-重度不典型增生，切缘阴性，达治愈性切除标准，实现“根除病灶、保留器官、快速康复”目标。\n目前，该院消化内科已常规开展消化内镜“3E”技术（EUS、ERCP、ESD及相关衍生术式）等四级手术，以及双气囊小肠镜、胶囊内镜（含磁控胶囊胃镜）等诊疗项目，可为全消化道良恶性病变提供精准、微创、优质的个体化服务。","d":"2026-08-30","u":"http://news.sciencenet.cn/htmlnews/2026/8/570580.shtm","c":"未分类","a":"科学网新闻","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察","tp":"内镜微创切癌","as":"中山大学孙逸仙纪念医院消化内科黄开红团队成功完成一例十二指肠降段早癌内镜黏膜下剥离术（ESD）。患者为52岁男性，胃镜体检发现十二指肠降段浅表隆起型病变，该部位解剖结构复杂，毗邻血管、胆管、胰腺等重要脏器，被公认为内镜手术'高风险禁区'。术前评估确认肿瘤局限于黏膜层、无浸润转移后，医院组建消化内科、普外科、麻醉科、影像科多学科团队，制定'双保障'方案。手术由练国达、陈少杰操作，历时约1小时完整剥离病变，术中无穿孔、大出血，患者术后恢复良好短期出院，病理回报为管状-绒毛状腺瘤。ESD相较传统开腹手术具有创伤小、恢复快、保留器官功能等优势。"},{"t":"科学网-山东成立重点实验室 聚焦科研成果在极地验证应用","b":"山东成立重点实验室 聚焦科研成果在极地验证应用\n8月25日，山东省北极海洋环境智能立体感知与动态预报重点实验室组建启动会暨第一次学术委员会会议在青岛召开。会上宣布，该实验室建设正式启动，将在极地领域加快形成具有自主创新能力和业务应用价值的技术、装备及产品。\n据介绍，该实验室由自然资源部北海局保障中心牵头，联合山东科技大学、自然资源部北海预报减灾中心共同组建。实验室依托“极地”号破冰调查船、“星海互联”示范工程及海洋行业数据枢纽等基础支撑，重点围绕北极冰海环境立体感知通信与服务技术、北极“空—天—气—冰—海”跨介质智能协同平台关键技术、北极海洋环境智能动态预报技术三个方向开展科技攻关。\n据悉，下一步，该实验室将进一步完善开放共享、协同攻关和成果转化机制，统筹用好科研平台、极地科考航次、观测数据和人才资源，围绕三大研究方向组织关键核心技术攻关，加快科研成果在极地科考、海洋观测、航道服务和环境预报等场景验证应用，努力建设特色鲜明、开放协同、支撑有力的海洋科技创新平台，为国家极地事业提供科技支撑。","d":"2026-08-30","u":"http://news.sciencenet.cn/htmlnews/2026/8/570579.shtm","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/水路运输","a":"科学网新闻","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察","tp":"极地感知技术","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":5.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":7.0},"as":"8月25日，山东省北极海洋环境智能立体感知与动态预报重点实验室组建启动会在青岛召开，宣布实验室建设正式启动。该实验室由自然资源部北海局保障中心牵头，联合山东科技大学、自然资源部北海预报减灾中心共同组建，依托'极地'号破冰调查船、'星海互联'示范工程及海洋行业数据枢纽等基础支撑，重点围绕北极冰海环境立体感知通信与服务技术、北极'空—天—气—冰—海'跨介质智能协同平台关键技术、北极海洋环境智能动态预报技术三个方向开展攻关，推动科研成果在极地科考、海洋观测、航道服务和环境预报等场景验证应用。","kp":["研究方向[山东省北极海洋环境智能立体感知与动态预报重点实验室]: 北极冰海环境立体感知通信与服务、跨介质智能协同平台、海洋环境智能动态预报三大方向","支撑平台[实验室]: 依托'极地'号破冰调查船、'星海互联'示范工程及海洋行业数据枢纽"]},{"t":"科学网-低成本、可规模化固态复合电解质研究获重要进展","b":"低成本、可规模化固态复合电解质研究获重要进展\n近日，中国科学院东莞材料科学与技术研究所/松山湖材料实验室研究员刘利峰团队联合华南师范大学教授舒东团队、南京信息工程大学教授张磊团队，选用商用高碱玻璃纤维（GF）隔膜作为多功能骨架，通过原位聚合构筑玻纤支撑固态复合电解质（GF-SCE），利用高碱硅酸盐玻璃自身的表面化学特性与多级孔结构，使传统以机械支撑为主的纤维骨架兼具锂盐解离、离子输运和界面调控功能。相关成果发表于学术期刊《先进功能材料》（\nAdvanced Functional Materials\n高碱玻璃纤维支撑固态复合电解质的制备、结构及功能设计。研究团队供图\n固态锂电池在提升安全性和能量密度方面具有潜力，但其进一步发展不仅取决于电解质的电化学性能，也受制于材料成本、制造工艺和规模化适配能力。现有固态复合电解质（SCE）常采用多孔纤维作为支撑骨架，但聚丙烯、纤维素等常用纤维骨架自身化学活性有限，主要起结构支撑作用。如何在不过多增加材料和工艺复杂度的前提下，使骨架同时参与离子输运与界面调控，是该类电解质性能进一步优化的关键问题。\n针对这一难题，研究团队重新发掘成熟工业高碱玻璃纤维的功能价值。该类玻璃纤维由多组分硅酸盐网络构成，其中Na\nO总含量为14.53 wt%。碱金属调节形成的极性表面环境，结合GF高孔隙率、低曲折度的纤维网络，可改善电解质前驱液浸润，促进锂盐解离和Li\n迁移。基于此，团队将PEGDA/LiTFSI/FEC前驱体系原位固化于GF骨架内部，形成兼具结构支撑、离子调控和界面稳定作用的GF-SCE。\n系统表征与理论计算进一步揭示了“活性骨架”的作用机制。GF-SCE在25 ℃下的离子电导率达5.89×10\n迁移数为0.44。拉曼光谱、密度泛函理论计算及低碱玻纤对照实验共同表明，高碱硅酸盐表面的化学环境可增强LiTFSI与骨架的相互作用，促进锂盐解离；同时，多级孔结构提供低曲折度的连续传输路径。GF骨架还赋予复合膜良好的热机械稳定性，实现离子传输与结构稳定的协同改善。\n在电池验证中，采用GF-SCE的Li||Li对称电池可稳定运行超过1000小时，并形成以LiF为主的稳定界面。该电解质可适配LFP、NCM811及超高镍NCM96正极，其中NCM96||GF-SCE||Li电池的工作上限可拓展至5.0 V；在50 ℃、0.05 C条件下，放电比容量达253.6 mAh g\n。研究团队进一步完成NCM96||GF-SCE||Li软包电池验证，显示出该体系向大尺寸电池延伸的可行性。\n除性能优势外，该工作还从制造和成本角度评估了GF-SCE的应用潜力。基于材料成本估算，其膜材料成本约为每平方米8.98至17.15美元；制备过程可在较低温度下完成，具备无溶剂、卷对卷加工的潜力，无需氧化物固态电解质常见的高温烧结，也避免了部分硫化物和卤化物体系所需的空气敏感加工条件。\n该研究将固态复合电解质中纤维骨架的功能由“被动支撑”拓展至“主动调控”，通过高碱硅酸盐表面化学与多级孔结构的协同作用，在较低材料成本和相对温和的工艺条件下兼顾离子输运、界面稳定与高电压适配性，为利用成熟工业纤维材料构筑可规模化固态复合电解质提供了新的设计思路。\n相关论文信息：https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.77793","d":"2026-08-30","u":"http://news.sciencenet.cn/htmlnews/2026/8/570578.shtm","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"科学网新闻","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"技术突破","tp":"固态电解质进展","sc":6.5,"scd":{"b":7.0,"i":4.0,"r":6.0,"d":7.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"中国科学院东莞材料科学与技术研究所/松山湖材料实验室刘利峰团队联合华南师范大学舒东团队、南京信息工程大学张磊团队，选用商用高碱玻璃纤维隔膜作为多功能骨架，通过原位聚合构筑玻纤支撑固态复合电解质（GF-SCE），成果发表于《先进功能材料》。该玻璃纤维Na₂O总含量为14.53 wt%，碱金属调节形成的极性表面环境结合高孔隙率、低曲折度纤维网络，可促进锂盐解离和Li⁺迁移。团队将PEGDA/LiTFSI/FEC前驱体系原位固化于GF骨架内部。GF-SCE在25℃下离子电导率达5.89×10⁻⁴S/cm，Li⁺迁移数为0.44。拉曼光谱和理论计算表明高碱硅酸盐表面化学环境可增强LiTFSI与骨架相互作用，使传统机械支撑骨架兼具离子输运和界面调控功能。","kp":["固态复合电解质骨架[GF-SCE]: 商用高碱玻璃纤维隔膜经原位聚合构筑，兼具锂盐解离、离子输运和界面调控功能"]},{"t":"科学网-中外科学家联手 破解南极冰盖短暂 “增重” 之谜","b":"中外科学家联手 破解南极冰盖短暂 “增重” 之谜\n近日，中国科学院海洋研究所联合美国加州大学圣巴巴拉分校等机构，在南极冰盖近期质量变化的气候驱动机制研究方面取得重要进展。研究发现，2021-2023年热带暖池持续增暖激发向南极传播的罗斯贝波列，形成东南极南北向偶极环流，重组水汽输送并增强区域降雪，从而暂时减缓南极冰盖质量损失。相关成果发表在国际学术期刊《自然》。\n热带暖池增暖驱动南极冰盖质量阶段性增加的遥相关机制示意图 海洋研究所供图\n南极冰盖是未来全球海平面上升的主要不确定性来源之一。过去二十年，南极冰盖总体以每年约1405亿吨的速率持续损失；2021-2023年质量却回升6950 亿吨，是GRACE卫星观测记录以来最大质量增幅事件。为揭示成因，研究团队综合利用重力卫星观测、冰芯积雪记录和大气环流模式模拟等，分析了该事件的大气环流成因与水汽来源。\n结果发现，2021-2023年，位于热带西太平洋和东印度洋交汇区域的热带暖池持续增暖，激发了向南半球高纬度传播的罗斯贝波列，在澳大利亚以南和东南极沿岸分别形成低压环流异常和高压环流异常。两者组成南北向“偶极环流”，重塑了风向和水汽运输路线，增强了从印度洋中纬度地区向东南极的大气河活动（狭长的水汽输送带）。水汽追踪模拟显示，在偶极环流作用下，来自中纬度印度洋的湿润空气被输送至东南极，更多“大气河”也随之抵达，导致玛丽皇后地-威尔克斯地区域持续强降雪，导致冰盖质量增加。\n东南极托滕冰架航拍图  论文合作作者Yoshihiro Nakayama教授摄于2019年末\n大气环流模式试验证实，热带暖池增暖是这一环流和降雪响应的直接驱动。人为强迫导致的区域降雪增加仅相当于观测降雪异常的9%，说明全球变暖引起的大气增湿并非此次事件的主要原因。观测和模拟表明，类似的热带暖池持续增暖事件大约每十年发生一次，热带暖池就像一个远程“调节器”，影响着东南极多年尺度降雪和冰量变化。不过，短暂放缓并不能扭转南极冰盖质量损失的长期趋势。西南极冰盖仍在持续失冰，东南极部分出口冰川也受到海洋暖水导致的冰架底部融化和冰流加速威胁。\n该研究不仅揭示了热带暖池持续增暖驱动南极冰盖质量回升的机制，还表明东南极南北向偶极环流在连接热带与冰盖质量变化过程中发挥关键作用，揭示了一条此前认识不足的“热带暖池-东南极冰盖”遥相关路径，为理解南极冰盖质量变化及未来东南极气候研究提供了理论参考。\n论文第一作者为中国科学院海洋研究所副研究员王云鹤，通讯作者为美国加州大学圣巴巴拉分校教授丁庆华和中国科学院海洋研究所研究员李晓峰。\nhttps://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-026-10912-x","d":"2026-08-30","u":"http://news.sciencenet.cn/htmlnews/2026/8/570577.shtm","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"科学网新闻","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察","tp":"南极冰盖变化","sc":6.8,"scd":{"b":8.0,"i":2.0,"r":7.0,"d":8.0,"t":6.0},"aip":1,"as":"中国科学院海洋研究所联合美国加州大学圣巴巴拉分校等机构研究揭示南极冰盖近期质量变化机制，成果发表于《自然》。过去二十年南极冰盖以每年约1405亿吨速率持续损失，但2021-2023年质量回升6950亿吨，是GRACE卫星观测以来最大增幅事件。研究发现热带西太平洋和东印度洋交汇区域的热带暖池持续增暖，激发向南半球高纬度传播的罗斯贝波列，在澳大利亚以南和东南极沿岸形成南北向'偶极环流'，重塑风向和水汽运输路线，增强向东南极的大气河活动，导致玛丽皇后地-威尔克斯地区域持续强降雪。人为强迫导致的降雪增加仅相当于观测异常的9%，类似热带暖池增暖事件约每十年发生一次。","kp":["南极冰盖质量损失[过去二十年]: 每年约1405亿吨","南极冰盖质量回升[2021-2023年]: 6950亿吨，GRACE观测记录以来最大增幅","驱动机制[2021-2023冰盖增重]: 热带暖池持续增暖激发罗斯贝波列，形成东南极南北向偶极环流，增强区域降雪"]},{"t":"古尔曼：苹果 AirPods 5 耳机最早 9 月发布，OLED 版 iPad mini 平板预计 10 月推出","b":"iPhone之家\niPhone新闻\n8 月 30 日消息，彭博社记者马克 · 古尔曼今天在最新一期《Power On》通讯中重申，\n苹果 AirPods 5 耳机最早将在今年 9 月发布\n据介绍，苹果 AirPods 5 将与\n18 Pro / Pro Max、折叠屏 iPhone、Apple Watch Series 12、Apple Watch Ultra 4 一同亮相。\n苹果预计将在 10 月底之前推出新款\niPad mini\n。这款产品将配备 OLED 面板，并加入各种新功能。\n古尔曼曾在此前透露，AirPods 5 将提供普通版和主动降噪版两个型号。\nIT之家了解到，苹果将于北京时间 9 月 10 日凌晨 1 点召开秋季新品发布会，主题为“惊喜闪耀”，这将是约翰 · 特努斯（John Ternus）正式接任苹果首席执行官后，主持的第一场发布会。","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/996/252.htm","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/半导体","a":"IT之家","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"产业进展","tp":"苹果新品发布","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":3.0,"t":8.0},"as":"彭博社记者马克·古尔曼在《Power On》通讯中重申，苹果AirPods 5耳机最早将于今年9月发布，与iPhone 18 Pro/Pro Max、折叠屏iPhone、Apple Watch Series 12、Apple Watch Ultra 4一同亮相。AirPods 5将提供普通版和主动降噪版两个型号。苹果预计在10月底前推出配备OLED面板并新增多项功能的iPad mini。苹果将于北京时间9月10日凌晨1点召开主题为'惊喜闪耀'的秋季新品发布会，这是约翰·特努斯正式接任苹果CEO后主持的首场发布会。","kp":["AirPods 5[发布时间]: 最早2025年9月","iPad mini[新版配置]: OLED面板，预计10月推出"]},{"t":"粉丝自制高清材质包“转正”，CDPR 就《巫师 3：狂猎 — 重制版》与 Halk Hogan 合作","b":"IT之家 8 月 30 日消息，《巫师 3》高清材质包项目 HD Reworked Project 开发者 Halk Hogan 本周确认和 CD Projekt RED 达成合作，他制作的高清模型和纹理将在《巫师 3：狂猎 — 重制版》游戏中出现。\nHalk Hogan 在 Nexus Mods 平台确认了此次合作。他透露自己的项目已在《巫师 3：狂猎 — 重制版》“转正”。未来玩家游玩重制版时，不再需要单独安装 Mod，就能体验高清纹理。\n据悉，这名粉丝为《巫师 3：狂猎 — 重制版》重做了角色、动物的模型，并修改了数千种纹理、模型和材质。而 CDPR 官方不仅没有反对，更是将他的作品纳入正式游戏，这无疑是对粉丝的高度认可。\nIT之家了解到，《巫师 3：狂猎 — 重制版》将于 9 月 29 日发售，登陆 PC、PS5 和 Xbox Series X|S 平台，现有《巫师 3》玩家可免费升级。","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/996/251.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"上海电信突发大范围断网，官方称经紧急处置服务已陆续恢复","b":"IT之家 8 月 30 日消息，今日晚间多位网友反映上海电信突发大范围断网，有用户反馈宽带、手机信号全面中断。#上海电信断网#登上热搜。\n针对此事，@中国电信上海客服 官微服刚刚发文回应称，“2026 年 8 月 30 日 20 时 30 分，上海电信嘉定部分城区发生网络故障，造成宽带业务用户受影响。经紧急处置，服务于 21 时 20 分起陆续恢复。“对于本次故障造成的不便，我们致以诚挚歉意，感谢大家的理解与支持。”\nIT之家注意到，这并非上海电信首次发生类似事件。2024 年 8 月 26 日 17:30 左右，上海电信曾发生部分云宽带用户业务异常，经抢修于当日 18:05 全面恢复；2026 年 3 月 31 日凌晨也曾出现全城级断网，波及浦东、宝山、杨浦、金山等多区，持续约 20 分钟至 1 小时。","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/996/250.htm","c":"AI与智能科技/AI硬件层/数据中心","a":"IT之家","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察","tp":"电信断网","sc":5.3,"scd":{"b":1.0,"i":3.0,"r":6.0,"d":5.0,"t":9.0},"as":"8月30日晚多位网友反映上海电信突发大范围断网，宽带、手机信号受影响，相关话题登上热搜。中国电信上海客服官微回应称，2026年8月30日20时30分，上海电信嘉定部分城区发生网络故障，造成宽带业务用户受影响，经紧急处置，服务于21时20分起陆续恢复。这不是上海电信首次发生类似事件：2024年8月26日曾发生部分云宽带用户业务异常，约35分钟后恢复；2026年3月31日凌晨也曾出现波及浦东、宝山、杨浦、金山等多区的全城级断网，持续约20分钟至1小时。"},{"t":"苹果与康宁在美国肯塔基州开设创新中心：探索全新玻璃材料，新增数百个岗位","b":"IT之家 8 月 30 日消息，据科技媒体 MacObserver 今天报道，苹果将与康宁在美国肯塔基州中部开设创新中心，为未来硬件产品探索全新玻璃材料。\n据报道，该项目是苹果推动制造业回流美国的重要一步，康宁正在将肯塔基哈罗兹堡（Harrodsburg）工厂改造成全球最大智能手机玻璃生产线。该厂投产后，将为全球新款 iPhone 生产盖板玻璃。\n该项目扩建后将至少新增 200 个长期小时工岗位，康宁还将招聘正式工程师，使目前 350 人员工阵容增加一半以上。\nIT之家注意到，未来的 Apple Watch 将使用该工厂生产的玻璃，该创新中心还计划为当地带来约 100 个临时建筑岗位。","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/996/249.htm","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"IT之家","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"产业进展","tp":"玻璃材料创新","sc":5.4,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":5.0,"r":5.0,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"as":"据MacObserver报道，苹果将与康宁在美国肯塔基州中部开设创新中心，为未来硬件产品探索全新玻璃材料。该项目是苹果推动制造业回流美国的重要一步，康宁正在将肯塔基哈罗兹堡工厂改造成全球最大智能手机玻璃生产线，投产后将为全球新款iPhone生产盖板玻璃。项目扩建后将至少新增200个长期小时工岗位，康宁还将招聘正式工程师，使目前350人的员工阵容增加一半以上。未来的Apple Watch将使用该工厂生产的玻璃，创新中心还计划为当地带来约100个临时建筑岗位。","kp":["岗位新增[康宁肯塔基创新中心]: 至少200个长期小时工岗位及约100个临时建筑岗位","玻璃生产线[肯塔基哈罗兹堡工厂]: 改造为全球最大智能手机玻璃生产线，员工350人基础上扩招一半以上"]},{"t":"R 星谈《GTA6》游戏驾驶手感：保留《GTA4》最优秀部分，兼顾 5 代易上手","b":"IT之家 8 月 30 日消息，R 星近日放出《GTA6》游戏加长实机预告，展示游戏的枪战、开车等玩法。X 平台博主 TGG 今日发文称，本作的驾驶手感将迎来升级。\n据悉，TGG 此前曾与 Rockstar 员工罗伯 · 尼尔森（Rob Nelson）对话，询问《GTA6》的驾驶手感是否会和《GTA4》一样有分量感。\n罗伯对此回答称，他们只会以最好的方式体现“分量感”。团队一直在努力保留《GTA4》开车手感最优秀的部分，同时兼顾《GTA5》的易上手性。\n同时，《GTA6》的驾驶系统完全是从零打造的，适配当代主机。R 星团队为车辆动力系统、轮胎、悬架和转向进行更多调校，并将其纳入物理模型之中。\nIT之家了解到，《侠盗猎车手 VI》将于 11 月 19 日发售，登陆 PlayStation 5 和 Xbox Series X|S 平台。","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/996/248.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"古尔曼：苹果 Apple Watch Series 12/Ultra 4 将支持全天候心率监测","b":"感谢IT之家网友\n8 月 30 日消息，据彭博社记者马克 · 古尔曼（Mark Gurman）透露，苹果正在为 Apple Watch Series 12 和 Apple Watch Ultra 4 准备几项新功能，有望进一步提升产品对注重健康用户的吸引力。此外，苹果还在为传闻中的陶瓷版 Apple Watch 测试两种配色。\n如果你对 Apple Watch 目前作为健身追踪器的表现并不满意，那么即将推出的两项健康功能可能会让你感兴趣。它们分别是全天候心率监测以及全新设计的健康应用，后者将让用户更轻松地从健康数据中获取有价值的信息。\n古尔曼这样描述苹果正在开发的新应用：\n苹果还在重新设计其健身和健康应用软件，计划以类似 Whoop 和 Oura 等越来越受欢迎的健康应用的方式，展示更多与健康状态相关的数据指标。\n要让 Apple Watch 真正成为一个数据更加丰富的健康设备，首先就需要获取更多数据。据报道，苹果正在测试让 Apple Watch 的心率传感器全天候持续记录数据，而不再仅仅是在用户运动期间或随机时间点进行测量。\nIT之家注意到，此前已有消息称，苹果正在考虑为 Apple Watch Series 12 推出陶瓷材质版本。古尔曼现在进一步透露，该版本将提供两种配色，分别是传统的白色以及深灰色。\n此外，苹果还将推出“多种全新的表带颜色和款式组合”。\n目前 Apple Watch 的设计语言于 2024 年随着 Apple Watch Series 10 推出，当时的变化幅度相对有限，苹果主要通过进一步减薄机身来调整外观，却牺牲了边框的尺寸。\n据彭博社报道，苹果最快可能会在明年推出重新设计的 Apple Watch，也就是 Apple Watch Series 13，但这一计划也可能推迟到再下一代产品，也就是 Series 14。\n苹果正努力在明年之前完成 Apple Watch 的一次重大重新设计，不过最终也可能推迟到后年。\n现有这种圆润的设计语言似乎已经接近苹果能够发挥的极限，因此下一代 Apple Watch 或许会采用一种全新的外形设计。","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/996/247.htm","c":"通用技术/检测和表征/先进科学仪器","a":"IT之家","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"产业进展","tp":"手表健康监测","sc":4.7,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":4.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":7.0},"as":"据彭博社记者马克·古尔曼透露，苹果正为Apple Watch Series 12和Ultra 4准备多项新功能，包括全天候心率监测（心率传感器全天候持续记录而非仅运动期间或随机测量）以及重新设计的健康应用，后者将以类似Whoop和Oura的方式展示更多健康状态相关数据。苹果还在为传闻中的陶瓷版Apple Watch测试白色和深灰色两种配色，并将推出多种全新表带颜色和款式组合。据报道，苹果最快明年推出重新设计的Apple Watch（Series 13），也可能推迟至Series 14。","kp":["心率监测[Apple Watch Series 12/Ultra 4]: 全天候持续记录，不再仅限运动期间或随机时间点","健康应用[Apple Watch新设计]: 类似Whoop和Oura方式展示更多健康状态数据指标","配色测试[陶瓷版Apple Watch]: 测试两种配色"]},{"t":"消息称苹果曾为折叠屏 iPhone 测试触控笔：可磁吸在手机侧面，但量产机可能无缘","b":"感谢IT之家网友 風見暉一 的线索投递！\nIT之家 8 月 30 日消息，据彭博社记者马克 · 古尔曼今日爆料，苹果曾为折叠屏 iPhone 手机测试过 Apple Pencil 触控笔，但最终的市售产品不太可能支持。\n古尔曼透露，苹果至少探索过一款更短的 Apple Pencil 原型，它可以通过磁吸方式吸附在手机侧面。但公司在测试过程中发现，磁吸笔和折叠屏手机形态并不是很协调。\n如果这款 Apple Pencil 在屏幕折叠时吸附，会和机身较长的一侧对齐。这时用户如果想再次展开手机，就必须把笔拿下来。\n同时，折叠屏本身的结构并不是非常硬，因此苹果担心 Apple Pencil 会给内屏留下不雅观的痕迹。\n虽然苹果可能在未来推出支持 Apple Pencil 的折叠屏手机。但从目前进度来看，第一代折叠屏 iPhone 不会配备手写笔。\nIT之家注意到，苹果创始人、前首席执行官史蒂夫 · 乔布斯曾在第一代 iPhone 发布时公开嘲讽触控笔，并留下名言：“谁想要触控笔啊？你还得拿出来、收起来，而且还容易弄丢。呸！根本没人想要触控笔。”","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/996/246.htm","c":"通用技术/材料工程/其它先进材料","a":"IT之家","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察","tp":"折叠屏触控笔","sc":5.1,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":3.0,"r":5.0,"d":4.0,"t":8.0},"as":"据彭博社记者马克·古尔曼爆料，苹果曾为折叠屏iPhone测试Apple Pencil触控笔，但市售产品不太可能支持。苹果至少探索过一款更短的Apple Pencil原型，可通过磁吸方式吸附在手机侧面，但测试发现磁吸笔和折叠屏手机形态并不协调：屏幕折叠时吸附的笔与机身较长一侧对齐，展开手机时须先取下笔。此外折叠屏结构不够坚硬，苹果担心触控笔会给内屏留下痕迹。第一代折叠屏iPhone不会配备手写笔。乔布斯曾在第一代iPhone发布时公开嘲讽触控笔，称'根本没人想要触控笔'。","kp":["Apple Pencil适配[折叠屏iPhone]: 曾测试磁吸吸附手机侧面的短款原型，但量产机不支持","磁吸笔问题[折叠形态]: 屏幕折叠时与机身长侧对齐，展开需取下笔，且可能在柔性内屏留下痕迹"]},{"t":"创 25 年来最强暑期档纪录：IMAX 中国暑期档票房突破 7.23 亿元，同比增长 39%","b":"IT之家 8 月 30 日消息，IMAX，简单来说就是“巨幕电影”，以超大银幕、高分辨率影像和定制化沉浸式音响著称。\n据央视财经报道，今年暑期档，优质大片供给充足，消费者对高品质观影体验的需求集中释放，带动高端放映市场强势增长。其中 IMAX 票房同比增长近四成，创下进入中国 25 年来的最强暑期档纪录。\n数据显示，截至 8 月 29 日，IMAX 中国暑期档票房突破 7.23 亿元人民币，同比增长 39%。\n其中进口片《奥德赛》以 3.1 亿元 IMAX 票房登顶暑期档冠军，IMAX 票房占影片全国总票房比例高达 54.6%。电影《蜘蛛侠：崭新之日》首周末 IMAX 票房突破 1.3 亿元，创下 2019 年以来好莱坞影片在内地的最佳 IMAX 开画日成绩。\n截至目前，IMAX 在中国内地的影院网络已覆盖 784 家影院，另有近 200 个签约待开业的项目正在推进中。\nIT之家小伙伴记得用最会买购买电影票，享受折扣价的同时还可以获得返利，预计每张票可以节省 5~15 元！\n广告声明：文内含有的对外跳转链接（包括不限于超链接、二维码、口令等形式），用于传递更多信息，节省甄选时间，结果仅供参考，IT之家包含外链的文章均包含本声明。","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/996/245.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"顺丰董事长王卫加入极兔董事会，任非执行董事","b":"8 月 30 日消息，极兔速递发布公告，\n王卫已获委任为公司非执行董事\n，任期自 2026 年 8 月 20 日起至 2028 年 12 月 31 日止。\n王卫，55 岁，为顺丰控股创始人及实际控制人，并担任顺丰控股董事长、执行董事、总经理及首席执行官。\n据IT之家此前报道，今年 1 月，\n顺丰与极兔达成相互持股协议\n，将互为对方增发新股，涉资近 83 亿港元\n（IT之家注：现汇率约合 71.43 亿元人民币）\n双方相互认购股份交易已顺利完成交割\n极兔还宣布与顺丰控股及丰巢订立综合物流服务框架协议\n。根据协议，极兔速递将向顺丰控股集团及丰巢集团提供干线运输、国际货运代理、海外仓储解决方案、海外干线运输、海外末端派送、快递、海关清关、报关服务、退换货服务及若干综合服务。\n顺丰控股 2026 上半年归母净利润 55.02 亿元，同比下降 4.11%\n极兔速递 2026 财年半年报归母净利润 2.5 亿美元，同比增长 189.49%","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/996/244.htm","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"IT之家","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"资本运作","tp":"物流企业合作","sc":5.9,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":7.0,"r":5.0,"d":6.0,"t":7.0},"as":"极兔速递发布公告，顺丰控股创始人兼董事长王卫获委任为极兔非执行董事，任期自2026年8月20日至2028年12月31日。今年1月顺丰与极兔达成相互持股协议，互为对方增发新股，涉资近83亿港元（约合71.43亿元人民币），交易已完成交割。极兔还与顺丰控股及丰巢订立综合物流服务框架协议，向后者提供干线运输、国际货代、海外仓储、末端派送、清关报关及退换货等服务。财务方面，顺丰控股2026上半年归母净利润55.02亿元，同比下降4.11%；极兔同期归母净利润2.5亿美元，同比增长189.49%。","kp":["委任职务[王卫/极兔速递]: 非执行董事，任期2026年8月20日至2028年12月31日","相互持股协议[顺丰与极兔]: 互为对方增发新股，涉资近83亿港元（约合71.43亿元人民币）","归母净利润[顺丰控股2026上半年]: 55.02亿元，同比下降4.11%","归母净利润[极兔速递2026财年上半年]: 2.5亿美元，同比增长189.49%"]},{"t":"微软为 SwiftKey 输入法 iOS 版新增液态玻璃效果，用户并不买账","b":"IT之家 8 月 30 日消息，据科技媒体 neowin 前天报道，微软已开始为 iOS 版 SwiftKey 输入法更新 4.3.5 版本，新增 Liquid Glass（液态玻璃）设计，匹配 iOS 26 系统视觉风格。但一些用户反馈称，输入法更新后出现了崩溃、按键缺失等问题。\nIT之家注意到，微软已在几个月前为 SwiftKey 主应用添加 Liquid Glass 风格，但键盘本身仍沿用旧版设计，此次更新则是将键盘本身加上玻璃风味，贴近系统视觉风格。\n但是有用户表示，本次更新后键盘出现了按键间距异常、部分按键消失的问题。还有用户表示，这款应用偶尔会崩溃，并自动切换回 iOS 原系统键盘。","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/996/243.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"追觅起诉小红书，案由名誉权纠纷","b":"IT之家 8 月 30 日消息，法院开庭信息显示，追觅科技（苏州）有限公司因名誉权纠纷，起诉行吟信息科技（上海）有限公司（IT之家注：小红书国内核心运营主体公司），该案将于 9 月 8 日在上海市黄浦区人民法院开庭。\n2026 年 4 月底，追觅科技创始人兼 CEO 俞浩连发多条微博，公开痛批小红书是“非常非常烂的平台”，称其价值观和盈利模式“有毒”，并质疑其算法有意推荐恶意内容和假消息。\nIT之家 8 月 30 日消息，法院开庭信息显示，追觅科技（苏州）有限公司因名誉权纠纷，起诉行吟信息科技（上海）有限公司（IT之家注：小红书国内核心运营主体公司），该案将于 9 月 8 日在上海市黄浦区人民法院开庭。\n2026 年 4 月底，追觅科技创始人兼 CEO 俞浩连发多条微博，公开痛批小红书是“非常非常烂的平台”，称其价值观和盈利模式“有毒”，并质疑其算法有意推荐恶意内容和假消息。","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/996/242.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"V社 12TB 游戏开发数据泄露详情：含《传送门 2》早期版本，《半衰期 2：第三章》线索出现","b":"IT之家 8 月 30 日消息，据游戏媒体 EuroGamer 今天报道，V社 12TB 游戏开发数据近日泄露。这些文件时间跨度从 2003 年至 2013 年，不少玩家希望从中找到早已被砍的《半衰期 2：第三章》。\nX 平台用户 Gabe Follower 周五表示，这份文件中包含《传送门 2》《求生之路》及《CSGO》的早期版本。\n详细来说，这份泄露文件中包含 2009 年左右的《传送门 2》Beta 版，以及“Weaponizer”武器模型。该武器曾被认为与《半衰期 2：第三章》有关，但并未得到正式确认。\nIT之家从原报道获悉，玩家们还发现了《求生之路 2》Beta 版本，构建时间为 2008 年，包含早期 HUD、大厅界面，以及一些被删减的语音。\n此外，这批资料来自 Valve 过去使用的 Steam2 内容分发基础设施。Valve 在 2010 年代初逐步淘汰了这套系统，转为使用 SteamPipe。","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/996/241.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"特斯拉在中国香港、中国澳门推出更平价版 Model 3：售价下调、配置精简，续航达 572 公里","b":"IT之家 8 月 30 日消息，财联社 8 月 30 日电，特斯拉已正式在中国香港、中国澳门市场推出配置简化、售价更低的 Model 3 轿车版本（后轮驱动版），官方页面描述其定位为“最经济实惠、长期拥有成本最低的车辆”。\n根据特斯拉官网信息，这款新车型在中国香港的起售价为 20.5 万港元（IT之家注：现汇率约合 17.6 万元人民币），比此前在售的基础版车型售价降低 8.5%；在中国澳门的起售价为 25.2 万澳门元（现汇率约合 209,790 元）。\n标准版 Model 3 为单电机后驱，0-100 公里 / 小时加速 6.2 秒，超充上限仅 175 kW，明显低于高配的 250 kW，但 15 分钟补能里程（286 公里）反而最高，同时官方标称的单次充电最大续航里程提升至 572 公里。该版本对部分内外饰配置进行了删减或降级，采用织布座椅 + 暖感（加热）座椅和方向盘、7 扬声器标准音响、15.4 吋中央触控屏。","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/996/240.htm","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"IT之家","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"产业进展","tp":"电动车降价","sc":6.4,"scd":{"b":3.0,"i":8.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"as":"特斯拉在中国香港、中国澳门推出配置精简、售价更低的Model 3后轮驱动版。香港起售价20.5万港元（约合17.6万元人民币），比此前基础版低8.5%；澳门起售价25.2万澳门元。新车为单电机后驱，0-100公里/小时加速6.2秒，超充上限175千瓦（低于高配的250千瓦），15分钟补能里程286公里，单次充电最大续航提升至572公里。配置方面采用织布加热座椅和方向盘、7扬声器音响、15.4英寸中控屏，部分内外饰配置被删减或降级。","kp":["起售价[Model 3后驱版中国香港]: 20.5万港元（约合17.6万元人民币），比基础版降低8.5%","起售价[Model 3后驱版中国澳门]: 25.2万澳门元（约合209,790元人民币）","加速性能[Model 3标准版]: 0-100公里/小时6.2秒","超充上限[Model 3标准版]: 175 kW（低于高配250 kW）","补能里程[Model 3标准版]: 15分钟补能286公里"]},{"t":"消息称字节跳动豆包大模型 2.2 将推迟发布，原计划 8 月推出","b":"感谢IT之家网友\nSkyraver\n8 月 30 日消息，据白鲸实验室消息，字节跳动原计划于 8 月推出的豆包大模型 2.2 将推迟面世。\n多位接近字节的人士称，延期的原因是，字节内部希望通过更充分的预训练和后训练，把编程、工具调用和 Agent 能力拉上去。\n用更长的研发周期换一次更明显的能力提升\nSeed 现在同时面对两件事，一边要推进下一代超大模型，一边又不能停止现有模型的正常迭代。所以，\n2.2 更像是夹在两代模型之间的一次关键补强\n。它既不能等到下一代超大模型完成再解决 Coding，也不能再用过去的方式简单迭代一次。\nCoding 能力跻身第一梯队，是 Seed 团队在 2026 年的主要目标之一。报道称字节希望 Seed 模型的 Coding 能力在年底之前能产生类似智谱 GLM-5.2 和 Kimi-K3 的行业冲击力。\n据 The Information 8 月 5 日报道，字节跳动创始人张一鸣在上个月的 Seed 团队全体会议上明确表示，即使意味着暂时落后于竞争对手，\n不会依赖 AI 蒸馏技术\nIT之家注意到，8 月 6 日，字节跳动 CEO 梁汝波在 2026 年度年中全员会上表示，在大语言模型上，\n接下来字节跳动还是会\n接受短期落后，坚持优化长期\n为 5 万亿参数超大模型“铺路”？消息称字节跳动调整 Seed 基模团队组织架构\n国内已知最大规模！消息称字节跳动正讨论训练超 5 万亿参数模型\n字节豆包 Seed 2.1 Pro 和 Turbo 深度思考模型发布，三大能力比肩 GPT-5.5\n字节跳动豆包大模型 2.0 发布：专家模式上线，多数基准达 SOTA 水平","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/996/239.htm","c":"AI与智能科技/AI软件层/底座大模型/文本模型","a":"IT之家","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"产业进展","tp":"大模型延期","sc":6.6,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":6.0,"r":7.0,"d":5.0,"t":8.0},"aip":1,"as":"据白鲸实验室消息，字节跳动原计划8月推出的豆包大模型2.2将推迟发布。多位接近字节人士称延期原因是希望通过更充分的预训练和后训练，提升编程、工具调用和Agent能力。Seed团队同时推进下一代超大模型与现有模型迭代，2.2被视为两代模型间的关键补强。Coding能力跻身第一梯队是Seed团队2026年主要目标之一，希望在年底前产生类似智谱GLM-5.2和Kimi-K3的行业冲击力。张一鸣在Seed全体会上表示不依赖AI蒸馏技术；CEO梁汝波称字节接受大模型短期落后、坚持长期优化。","kp":["发布计划[豆包大模型2.2]: 原计划8月推出，将推迟发布","延期原因[豆包2.2]: 通过更充分的预训练和后训练提升编程、工具调用和Agent能力","技术路线[字节Seed团队/张一鸣]: 不依赖AI蒸馏技术","研发目标[Seed模型Coding能力]: 年底前达到类似智谱GLM-5.2和Kimi-K3的行业冲击力"]},{"t":"《神鬼寓言》游戏 PC 版配置要求公布：最低 RTX 2060，推荐 RTX 5060","b":"IT之家 8 月 30 日消息，《神鬼寓言》游戏 PC 版配置要求现已公布。本作最低配置要求为英特尔酷睿 i7-6850K、英伟达 RTX 2060 显卡，推荐使用英特尔酷睿 i5-11600KF、英伟达 RTX 5060/RTX 3060 TI 显卡。\nIT之家附本作配置要求详情如下：\n| 项目 | 低画质 | 中画质（推荐） | 高画质 | 极致画质 |\n| 目标分辨率 | 1080P 30FPS | 1440P 30FPS/1200P 60FPS | 1440P 60FPS | 4K 60FPS |\n| 处理器 | AMD 锐龙 5 2600 / 英特尔酷睿 i7-6850K | AMD 锐龙 5 5600 / 英特尔酷睿 i5-11600KF | AMD 锐龙 7 7700X / 英特尔酷睿 i7-12700K | AMD 锐龙 9 7900X / 英特尔酷睿 i9-13900K |\n| 显卡 | 英伟达 RTX 5050/RTX 2060 AMD RX 6600 / 英特尔 A580 | 英伟达 RTX 5060/RTX 3060 TI AMD RX 9060XT/RX 6700XT | 英伟达 RTX 5070/RTX 3080TI AMD RX 9070/RX7900XT | 英伟达 RTX 5080/RTX 4080 |\n| 显存 | 6GB | 8GB | 12GB | 16GB |\n| 内存 | 12GB | 16GB | ||\n| 硬盘 | 固态硬盘 | |||","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/996/237.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"网友反馈上海电信发生大面积断网故障，宽带及手机信号均受影响","b":"感谢IT之家网友\n8 月 30 日消息，据网友反馈，今日晚间，上海电信再次出现大范围断网故障，宽带与手机信号均受影响，用户反映客服热线完全无法接通。\n网友反馈显示，嘉定、浦东、宝山、杨浦等多个区域受影响，宽带及手机信号同时中断，影响范围较广。大量用户反映 10000 号客服热线无法接通、电信 App 和小程序报障通道瘫痪，导致用户求助渠道受阻，只能上网确认故障。多个用户表示在断网后自行重启光猫和路由器无效，误以为自家设备或话费问题，最终才发现是运营商大面积故障。\nIT之家注意到，这并非上海电信首次发生类似事件。2024 年 8 月 26 日 17:30 左右，上海电信曾发生部分云宽带用户业务异常，经抢修于当日 18:05 全面恢复；2026 年 3 月 31 日凌晨也曾出现全城级断网，波及浦东、宝山、杨浦、金山等多区，持续约 20 分钟至 1 小时。两次事件的故障原因官方均未明确披露。\n截至发稿，上海电信官方尚未就本次断网发布故障说明。","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/996/235.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"比亚迪大六座 SUV 腾势 N8L 纯电版将于 9 月份上市，拥有 208L 智能电动前备箱","b":"感谢IT之家网友 棒槌 的线索投递！\nIT之家 8 月 30 日消息，比亚迪集团腾势汽车总经理李慧昨日透露，大六座安全豪华 SUV 腾势 N8L 纯电版将于 9 月份正式上市。\n海报显示，腾势 N8L 纯电版拥有 208L 智能电动前备箱。\n目前官方暂未公布更多新车信息，据IT之家此前报道，比亚迪腾势 N8L 于 2025 年 10 月 28 日上市，官方指导价 29.98 万元起。\n今年 6 月 23 日，比亚迪腾势 N8L 闪充版上市，配备第二代刀片电池，定价 31.98 万元起：\n- 尊荣型闪充版：31.98 万元\n- 旗舰型闪充版：34.98 万元\n作为参考，比亚迪腾势 N8L 长宽高为 5200x1999x1820mm，轴距为 3075mm。","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/996/234.htm","c":"AI与智能科技/具身智能/硬件和控制","a":"IT之家","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"产业进展","tp":"纯电SUV上市","sc":5.0,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":6.0,"r":4.0,"d":5.0,"t":7.0},"as":"比亚迪集团腾势汽车总经理李慧透露，大六座安全豪华SUV腾势N8L纯电版将于9月正式上市，拥有208L智能电动前备箱，官方暂未公布更多信息。作为参考，腾势N8L于2025年10月28日上市，指导价29.98万元起；2026年6月23日上市的N8L闪充版配备第二代刀片电池，尊荣型31.98万元、旗舰型34.98万元。车身尺寸方面，腾势N8L长宽高为5200×1999×1820mm，轴距3075mm。","kp":["上市时间[腾势N8L纯电版]: 2026年9月","前备箱[腾势N8L纯电版]: 208L智能电动前备箱","售价[腾势N8L闪充版]: 31.98万元起（尊荣型31.98万/旗舰型34.98万）","车身尺寸[腾势N8L]: 长宽高5200x1999x1820mm，轴距3075mm","电池[腾势N8L闪充版]: 第二代刀片电池"]},{"t":"卡普空《鬼武者：剑之道》游戏全新预告片公布，9 月 4 日发售","b":"感谢IT之家网友 华南吴彦祖 的线索投递！\nIT之家 8 月 30 日消息，卡普空现已公布《鬼武者：剑之道》游戏全新预告片。本作将于 9 月 4 日发售，登陆 PlayStation 5、Xbox Series、Switch 2 和 PC 平台，支持中文字幕、音频。\nIT之家附本作官方简介如下：\n本作是刀光血影、以牙还牙的极致动作游戏。在面目全非的“京都”，一位佩戴“鬼之笼手”的武士正四处奔波，斩杀猖獗肆虐的幻魔。在激烈的刀光剑影之中沐浴鲜血，不断寻求战斗的意义。前行的道路，终将通往何处？\n本作并非开放世界，而是采用关卡推进，玩家将在不同场景中不断击败敌人、破解机关谜题，体验紧凑的节奏和丰富变化。开发团队透露，主线流程约 20 小时，还包含大量可选支线和隐藏内容，满足探索型玩家的需求。\n虽然游戏强调动作爽快，但难度设定不会达到“魂系列”那样的高门槛。卡普空希望通过有挑战但不过分苛刻的战斗，让更多玩家都能享受“劈砍妖魔”的快感，突出剑戟对决的爽快打击感，塑造独特的《鬼武者》体验。\n配置需求见下图：\n广告声明：文内含有的对外跳转链接（包括不限于超链接、二维码、口令等形式），用于传递更多信息，节省甄选时间，结果仅供参考，IT之家包含外链的文章均包含本声明。","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/996/233.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"消息称索尼 State of Play 游戏发布会即将到来，9 月可能性极大","b":"IT之家 8 月 30 日消息，一位非常可靠的游戏业内人士称，PlayStation 很可能会在今年 9 月举办 State of Play 游戏发布会，而且活动可能“很快”就会到来。\nIT之家注意到，过去一周的游戏新闻可谓相当密集，既有科隆游戏展开幕之夜直播活动，又有玩家期待已久的《GTA 6》实机演示公布。原本以为接下来会稍微平静一些，但从目前的情况来看，今年短期内恐怕还不会迎来“游戏新闻淡季”。\n未来几周仍有多款重磅游戏即将推出，例如《黎明行者之血》（The Blood of Dawnwalker）、《金刚狼》（Wolverine）以及《鬼武者》（Onimusha）。与此同时，游戏厂商预计还会陆续举办更多发布会，公布新消息。\n在 X 平台上，有网友询问 9 月是否会举办 State of Play。对此，目前业内较为可靠的爆料者 NateTheHate 回复称，他目前仍在尝试确认具体日期，但目前看来“可能性极大”，而且应该“很快”就会到来。\n这一消息其实并不令人意外，毕竟 PlayStation 往年通常都会在 9 月举办 State of Play。不过，考虑到目前 PlayStation 的游戏阵容，这场发布会还是颇有看点。\n除了已经确定发售日期的《战神：劳菲》（God of War Laufey）之外，目前还有一些已经有一段时间没有公开新消息的游戏可能亮相，例如《星际：异端先知》（Intergalactic）、此前传闻中的《毒液》（Venom）游戏，甚至还有可能出现《蜘蛛侠 3》。\n不过，《金刚狼》将在 9 月发售，因此预计 Insomniac 更希望玩家把注意力集中在金刚狼洛根身上，而不是过早关注工作室未来的项目。\n此外，索尼也存在借此次 State of Play 回应近期实体版游戏发行争议的可能性。\n虽然索尼此前已经在投资者电话会议等场合透露过一些信息，但玩家针对实体版发行策略的反弹声浪一直非常强烈，而索尼目前的具体安排仍然相当模糊。","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/996/232.htm","c":"不相关","a":"IT之家","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察"},{"t":"铁路部门回应“复兴号变和谐号致二等座变无座”：动车组突发故障，备用车体席位不对等导致部分旅客未能安排席位","b":"感谢IT之家网友\n8 月 30 日消息，近日有乘客反映，其购买复兴号列车二等座车票后，因列车临时更换为和谐号，导致座位不足、二等座变无座的情况。\n今天下午，中国铁路哈尔滨局集团有限公司官方发布情况说明，IT之家附原文如下：\n8 月 28 日 G116 次列车临时更换动车组情况说明\n8 月 28 日，因图定担当哈尔滨西至北京朝阳站 G116 次列车乘务前行交路的动车组在哈尔滨西站突发故障，为确保列车及时开出，\n铁路部门采取了临时启用备用动车组的紧急措施\n在处置过程中，因图定的复兴号车体与备用的和谐号车体席位不对等、信息沟通不到位，\n造成长春西站上车的部分旅客未能安排席位\n。期间，车站和列车工作人员联动采取免费发放应急餐和提供折叠椅等措施，努力减少对旅客出行的影响。\n铁路部门对动车组临时调整、应急组织环节存在不足，\n给旅客出行带来的不便深表歉意\n。下一步将认真汲取教训，不断改进工作，努力确保旅客顺利出行。\n复兴号变和谐号致二等座变无座，12306 客服称系临时调整无赔偿政策","d":"2026-08-30","u":"https://www.ithome.com/0/996/230.htm","c":"通用技术/通信和运输/陆路运输","a":"IT之家","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"行业观察","tp":"动车组故障","sc":4.3,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":7.0},"as":"针对\"复兴号变和谐号致二等座变无座\"的乘客反映，中国铁路哈尔滨局集团发布情况说明：8月28日，G116次列车（哈尔滨西至北京朝阳）图定动车组在哈尔滨西站突发故障，铁路部门临时启用备用动车组。因图定复兴号车体与备用和谐号车体席位不对等、信息沟通不到位，造成长春西站上车的部分旅客未能安排席位。期间车站和列车工作人员联动发放免费应急餐并提供折叠椅。铁路部门对动车组临时调整、应急组织环节的不足致歉，表示将汲取教训改进工作。"},{"t":"超11亿！甘肃天水这一电网侧独立储能项目进入核心设备安装阶段","b":"优美能源清水电网侧独立储能项目是2026年甘肃省列重大建设项目，项目总投资11.1亿元，规划安装60套磷酸铁锂电池储能单元，项目建成后将为陇东南电网提供重要的储能支撑。\n图片来源：中铁七局电务公司\n据“中铁七局电务公司”消息，8月27日，随着优美能源清水电网侧独立储能项目首台电池舱精准吊装就位，标志着该项目正式进入核心设备安装阶段。\n据了解，优美能源清水电网侧独立储能项目总投资11.1亿元，涵盖储能电站和330千伏汇集站两大部分。该项目是2026年甘肃省列重大建设项目，也是天水市首个落地的新型储能项目。储能电站采用户外预制舱型式，规划安装60套磷酸铁锂电池储能单元，总占地约92.07亩。项目建成后将为陇东南电网提供重要的储能支撑，被誉为服务区域电网的“超级充电宝”。\n电池舱是储能电站最核心的设备，单舱重达数十吨，吊装精度要求极高，且涉及大型起重设备作业，施工组织难度大、安全风险高。为确保吊装一次成功，项目团队超前谋划、科学组织，多次踏勘现场，反复论证吊装方案。吊装当日，现场指挥员与起重司机密切配合，从起吊、转向到精准就位，全过程平稳有序，各项技术参数均符合设计要求。\n项目建成投运后预计年收益约7400万元，年税收700余万元，项目将重点服务陇东南电网调峰调频，有效提升区域电网稳定性，助力新能源高效接入与就地消纳，推动区域能源结构转型升级。\n更多行业价值资讯浏览、分享，欢迎扫描下方二维码关注我爱电车网官方微信（xevcar）！","d":"2026-08-30","u":"http://www.xevcar.com/gongsi/0S015K952026.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"我爱电车网","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"产业进展","tp":"储能项目安装","sc":6.2,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":6.0,"r":5.0,"d":7.0,"t":7.0},"as":"优美能源清水电网侧独立储能项目为2026年甘肃省列重大建设项目，也是天水市首个落地的新型储能项目，总投资11.1亿元，涵盖储能电站和330千伏汇集站两部分。8月27日首台电池舱精准吊装就位，项目正式进入核心设备安装阶段。储能电站采用户外预制舱型式，规划安装60套磷酸铁锂电池储能单元，总占地约92.07亩。电池舱单重达数十吨，吊装精度要求极高。项目建成投运后预计年收益约7400万元，年税收700余万元，将服务陇东南电网调峰调频，助力新能源接入与消纳。","kp":["总投资[优美能源清水电网侧独立储能项目]: 11.1亿元","储能单元[优美能源清水储能项目]: 60套磷酸铁锂电池储能单元","占地面积[优美能源清水储能项目]: 约92.07亩","项目构成[优美能源清水储能项目]: 储能电站+330千伏汇集站，户外预制舱型式","电池舱[储能电站核心设备]: 单舱重达数十吨，吊装精度要求极高"]},{"t":"立足山东省域市场！两地国资联手开发储能项目","b":"双方重点围绕省内电网侧独立储能、新型储能及双方共同认可的其他储能项目开展战略合作，协同推进项目各项开发建设工作。\n图/青岛铁投能源科技有限公司\n据青岛铁投能源科技有限公司消息，近日，公司与深能北方能源控股有限公司项目合作开发框架协议签约仪式顺利举行。\n根据协议，双方将正式建立长期稳定的战略合作伙伴关系，立足山东省域市场，联合开发储能项目，抢抓新型储能产业发展机遇，助力山东新型电力系统建设，赋能区域能源绿色低碳高质量发展。\n其中，双方重点围绕省内电网侧独立储能、新型储能及双方共同认可的其他储能项目开展战略合作，协同推进项目各项开发建设工作。\n资料显示，深能北方能源控股有限公司是深圳市属国企深圳能源（000027）全资子公司，2008年在北京注册成立，资本实力雄厚，长期专注全国范围内新能源项目投资、开发、建设及运营业务，业务版图覆盖东北、西北、华北等区域，设立40余家全资及控股子公司，积累了大量新能源、储能项目实操经验，具备完整的项目研判、投资建设与运营管理体系，是国内新能源行业重要的专业化投资运营主体。公司将发挥在储能项目投资研判、技术方案设计、工程建设实施等方面的专业优势，主导合作项目整体开发工作，依据自身投资标准完成项目技术经济论证、投资测算及内部投资决策流程。\n作为国有控股能源企业，青岛铁投能源科技有限公司将充分发挥属地资源协调优势，全力开展场址资源排查筛选、土地选址、储能建设指标争取、并网接入条件协调等工作，协助推进项目备案、审批、许可等手续办理，及时向合作方同步地方产业政策更新、项目推进中的关键信息，协调落实项目开发所需各类支持文件，保障项目前期工作高效有序推进。\n更多行业价值资讯浏览、分享，欢迎扫描下方二维码关注我爱电车网官方微信（xevcar）！","d":"2026-08-30","u":"http://www.xevcar.com/gongsi/0S015KW2026.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/其它储能技术","a":"我爱电车网","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"资本运作","tp":"储能项目合作","sc":3.6,"scd":{"b":2.0,"i":3.0,"r":4.0,"d":4.0,"t":5.0},"as":"青岛铁投能源科技有限公司与深能北方能源控股有限公司近日签署项目合作开发框架协议，正式建立战略合作伙伴关系，立足山东省域市场联合开发储能项目。双方重点围绕省内电网侧独立储能、新型储能及其他储能项目开展合作。深能北方是深圳市属国企深圳能源全资子公司，2008年在北京注册成立，设有40余家子公司，将主导项目投资研判、技术方案设计和工程建设实施；青岛铁投将发挥属地优势，负责场址资源排查、土地选址、储能建设指标争取、并网接入协调及项目备案审批等前期工作。","kp":["合作范围[青岛铁投与深能北方]: 省内电网侧独立储能、新型储能项目战略合作"]},{"t":"小米项目开启量产配套！中创新航上半年动力电池收入超165亿元","b":"上半年，中创新航动力电池收入165.06亿元，同比增长54.8%，营收占比60.9%；储能系统产品及其他收入105.79亿元，同比增长83.8%，营收占比39.1%。\n图片来源：中创新航\n8月28日晚间，中创新航（03931.hk）公告，2026年上半年收入270.84亿元，同比增长65.0%；期内利润15.23亿元，同比增长102.2%；归属于本公司拥有人利润9.35亿元，2025年同期为4.66亿元；基本每股收益0.5276元，同比增长100.7%。\n分产品来看，上半年，中创新航动力电池收入165.06亿元，同比增长54.8%，营收占比60.9%；储能系统产品及其他收入105.79亿元，同比增长83.8%，营收占比39.1%。\n按产品交付地来看，上半年，中创新航中国内地收入259亿元，同比增长60.9%，营收占比95.6%；境外地区收入11.85亿元，同比增长262.9%，营收占比4.4%。\n2026年上半年，中创新航新客户、新应用场景持续拓展，新产品在乘用、商用、储能等领域持续上量，业务规模持续增长，同时，集团持续开发绿色低碳产品及解决方案，构建高效运行的碳管理体系。\n2026年上半年装机量稳步增长。小鹏、华为鸿蒙智行、丰田项目稳步交付，小米项目开启量产配套；乘用车海外市场装机量同比增长84%，海外业务拓展进入新阶段。\n2026年上半年出货量同比增长225%，快速布局新车型，实现新公告206款，各领域车型全面覆盖。\n2026年上半年出货量持续稳步增长，海外装机量持续提升。\n稳步拓展，深度合作湖北港口集团「千帆计划」，支持电化长江建设；推进广东省首个5,000吨级纯电动散货船项目，助力粤港澳大湾区绿色航运升级；完成国内首艘CCS认证碳纤维电动公务船、香港首艘商业运营纯电动货船、美国首批电动拖轮、中东批量混合动力海洋工程船等项目顺利投运，「零碳航运」产品解决方案收获国际船舶市场广泛关注和认可。\n持续深化与小鹏汇天、广汽高域、沃兰特、易飞航空等国内主流eVTOL企业的战略合作，新增头部客户定点，获得客户主力机型动力电池产品的独家定点资格，并通过多种开发模式与商业模式创新，有效推动低空业务持续拓展。\n产品也将开启批量交付。\n更多行业价值资讯浏览、分享，欢迎扫描下方二维码关注我爱电车网官方微信（xevcar）！","d":"2026-08-30","u":"http://www.xevcar.com/gongsi/0S015KY2026.html","c":"零碳产业/能量循环/能量存储/电化学储能/二次电池/锂电池","a":"我爱电车网","i":"n","source":"articles-2026-08-31.csv","sr":"news/articles-2026-08-31.csv","tg":"产业进展","tp":"动力电池营收","sc":7.2,"scd":{"b":4.0,"i":8.0,"r":6.0,"d":8.0,"t":7.0},"aip":1,"as":"中创新航2026年上半年收入270.84亿元，同比增长65.0%；期内利润15.23亿元，同比增长102.2%；归母净利润9.35亿元（2025年同期4.66亿元）。分产品看，动力电池收入165.06亿元，同比增长54.8%，占比60.9%；储能系统产品及其他收入105.79亿元，同比增长83.8%，占比39.1%。中国内地收入259亿元，占比95.6%；境外收入11.85亿元，同比增长262.9%。上半年小鹏、华为鸿蒙智行、丰田项目稳步交付，小米项目开启量产配套；乘用车海外装机量同比增长84%，出货量同比增长225%，实现新公告车型206款。","kp":["动力电池收入[中创新航2026上半年]: 165.06亿元，同比增长54.8%，营收占比60.9%","储能系统收入[中创新航2026上半年]: 105.79亿元，同比增长83.8%，营收占比39.1%","总收入[中创新航2026上半年]: 270.84亿元，同比增长65.0%","期内利润[中创新航2026上半年]: 15.23亿元，同比增长102.2%","基本每股收益[中创新航2026上半年]: 0.5276元，同比增长100.7%"]}]);